ntegração com ferramentas de linha de comando","Suporte à inteligência artificial e aprendizado de máquina","Código conciso e eficiente","Facilidade de uso e implementação"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных решений на Elixir","Интеграция с инструментами командной строки","Поддержка искусственного интеллекта и машинного обучения","Краткий и эффективный код","Легкость использования и реализации"],"ar":["تنمية حلول مخصصة في إليكسير","التكامل مع أدوات سطر الأوامر","دعم الذكاء الاصطناعي والتعلم الآلي","كود متكامل وفعال","سهولة الاستخدام والتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Elixir AI 代理","elixir-cyclic-deps 教程","AI 代理开发","Elixir 编码","elixir-cyclic-deps 安装","AI 工具比较","elixir-cyclic-deps 文档"],"ja":["Elixir AI エージェント","elixir-cyclic-deps チュートリアル","AI エージェント開発","Elixir コーディング","elixir-cyclic-deps インストール","AI ツール比較","elixir-cyclic-deps ドキュメント"],"ko":["Elixir AI 에이전트","elixir-cyclic-deps 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 개발","Elixir 코딩","elixir-cyclic-deps 설치","AI 툴 비교","elixir-cyclic-deps 문서"],"es":["cómo usar elixir-cyclic-deps","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a elixir-cyclic-deps","elixir-cyclic-deps vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de elixir-cyclic-deps","guía de configuración de elixir-cyclic-deps","desarrollo de aplicaciones en Elixir","herramientas de desarrollo de Elixir"],"fr":["comment utiliser elixir-cyclic-deps","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à elixir-cyclic-deps","elixir-cyclic-deps vs d''autres agents IA","installation d''elixir-cyclic-deps","guide de configuration d''elixir-cyclic-deps","développement d''applications en Elixir","outils de développement Elixir"],"de":["wie man elixir-cyclic-deps verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu elixir-cyclic-deps","elixir-cyclic-deps vs andere KI-Agenten","Installation von elixir-cyclic-deps","Konfigurationshandbuch für elixir-cyclic-deps","Anwendungsentwicklung in Elixir","Elixir-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["elixir-cyclic-deps","agente de ia","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","elixir","inteligência artificial","aprendizado de máquina","desenvolvimento de software","programação em elixir","elixir vs erlang"],"ru":["elixir-cyclic-deps","ИИ Агент","инструменты разработки","elixir","искусственный интеллект","машинное обучение","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на elixir","elixir vs erlang"],"ar":["elixir-cyclic-deps","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير","إليكسير","الذكاء الاصطناعي","التعلم الآلي","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة إليكسير","إليكسير مقابل إيرلانج"]}},"owner":"matteing","repo":"opal","repoPath":"matteing/opal","stars":18,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T08:11:08Z","topics":["agents","ai","ai-agents","cli","elixir","llm"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"elixir-cyclic-deps","description":"Detects and removes cyclic compile-time dependencies in Elixir codebases using mix xref, with minimal code changes. Use when the user explicitly asks to check for cycles, remove cyclic dependencies, or fix xref cycle failures. Requires Elixir 1.19 or higher for accurate results.","bodyPreview":"# Elixir Cyclic Dependencies\n\n## When to Use\n\nApply this skill only when the user **explicitly asks** to check or remove cyclic dependencies (e.g. \"check for cycles\", \"remove cyclic dependencies\", \"fix xref cycles\").\n\n## Prerequisite: Elixir Version\n\nCycle detection is correct only on **Elixir 1.19 or higher**. Before running any cycle checks:\n\n1. Verify version: `elixir -v` or inside the project run `mix run -e ''IO.inspect(System.version())''`.\n2. If the version is below 1.19, stop and inform th","body":"# Elixir Cyclic Dependencies\n\n## When to Use\n\nApply this skill only when the user **explicitly asks** to check or remove cyclic dependencies (e.g. \"check for cycles\", \"remove cyclic dependencies\", \"fix xref cycles\").\n\n## Prerequisite: Elixir Version\n\nCycle detection is correct only on **Elixir 1.19 or higher**. Before running any cycle checks:\n\n1. Verify version: `elixir -v` or inside the project run `mix run -e ''IO.inspect(System.version())''`.\n2. If the version is below 1.19, stop and inform the user that upgrading to Elixir 1.19+ is required for reliable cycle detection.\n\n## Detecting Cycles\n\nRun both commands from the project root. Start with a relaxed threshold, then tighten:\n\n```bash\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile-connected --fail-above 3\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile --fail-above 3\n```\n\n- **compile-connected**: cycles in the compile-time dependency graph (modules that compile in a cycle).\n- **compile**: same graph, different label; both should be run.\n- **--fail-above N**: exit code fails when cycle count is above N. Use `3` initially, goal is **0**.\n\nTo list cycles without failing (for inspection), omit `--fail-above` or set it high:\n\n```bash\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile-connected\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile\n```\n\n**Goal**: reach `--fail-above 0` for both commands (no cycles).\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Check Elixir version** (must be ≥ 1.19).\n2. **Establish baseline**: run both xref commands with `--fail-above 3` (or current project setting). Note cycle count and which modules appear in cycles.\n3. **Inspect cycles**: run without `--fail-above` to see full cycle output; identify the smallest set of edges (module A → module B) that, if removed, break cycles.\n4. **Plan minimal changeset**:\n   - Prefer breaking a single dependency (e.g. move shared code to a new module both can depend on) over large refactors.\n   - **Helper modules** are allowed if they yield the smallest change: extract shared logic into a new module that the cycle participants depend on, so the cycle is broken.\n   - Avoid duplication; follow existing repository guidelines (e.g. AGENTS.md, .cursor rules) and prior patterns in the codebase.\n5. **Implement**: make the chosen change, then re-run both xref commands with `--fail-above 0` (or gradually lower from 3 → 0).\n6. **Verify**: `mix compile --warnings-as-errors`, tests, and any project lint (e.g. `mix lint` or `mix cyclecheck` if defined).\n\n## Minimal-Change Strategies\n\n| Strategy                  | When to use                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Extract helper module** | Two or more modules in a cycle need the same logic; extract it to a new module that has no dependency back on the cycle.           |\n| **Move code down**        | Move a function from module A to module B so that A no longer depends on B (or vice versa), breaking the cycle.                    |\n| **Invert dependency**     | If A uses B and B uses A, see if one usage can be replaced by a callback, option, or data structure so only one direction remains. |\n| **Split module**          | One module has two distinct responsibilities and participates in two cycles; split into two modules to break cycles.               |\n\nChoose the option that removes cycles with the **least** code churn and no new duplication.\n\n## Project Integration\n\nIf the project has a `cyclecheck` (or similar) task in `mix.exs`, use it after changes:\n\n```bash\nmix cyclecheck\n```\n\nEnsure it runs both xref commands with the target `--fail-above 0` once cycles are cleared.\n\n## Summary Checklist\n\n- [ ] Elixir version ≥ 1.19 confirmed\n- [ ] Both `compile-connected` and `compile` xref cycle commands run\n- [ ] Goal: `--fail-above 0` for both\n- [ ] Minimal changeset (helper modules OK)\n- [ ] No code duplication; follows repo guidelines\n- [ ] `mix compile`, tests, and lint pass after changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:32:49.623Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Elixir-focused Agents requiring cyclic dependency detection and removal capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要循环依赖检测和移除功能的Elixir专注代理。","ja":"Elixirに焦点を当てたエージェントがサイクル依存関係の検出と削除機能を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"사이클 종속성 감지 및 제거 기능이 필요한 엘릭서(Elixir) 중점 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en Elixir que requieren capacidades de detección y eliminación de dependencias cíclicas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur Elixir nécessitant des capacités de détection et de suppression de dépendances cycliques.","de":"Ideal für auf Elixir ausgerichtete Agenten, die Funktionen zur Erkennung und Entfernung von zyklischen Abhängigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em Elixir que requerem detecção e remoção de dependências cíclicas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на Elixir, требующих обнаружения и удаления циклических зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على Elixir ويتطلبون能力 الكشف عن الإعتماد الدوري وإزالته."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify and fix cyclic dependencies in Elixir projects, ensuring compatibility with Elixir 1.19 or higher, and providing accurate cycle detection using mix run and System.version() checks.","zh":"赋予代理识别和修复Elixir项目中的循环依赖关系，确保与Elixir 1.19或更高版本兼容，并使用mix run和System.version()检查提供准确的循环检测。","ja":"Elixirプロジェクトでサイクル依存関係を識別および修復するエージェントを可能にし、Elixir 1.19以上との互換性を確保し、mix runおよびSystem.version()チェックを使用した正確なサイクル検出を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 엘릭서 프로젝트에서 사이클 종속성을 식별하고 수정할 수 있도록 하며 엘릭서 1.19 이상과 호환되며 mix run 및 System.version() 확인을 사용하여 정확한 사이클 감지를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar y solucionar dependencias cíclicas en proyectos de Elixir, garantizando la compatibilidad con Elixir 1.19 o superior, y proporcionando una detección de ciclo precisa mediante mix run y System.version() checks.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier et de corriger les dépendances cycliques dans les projets Elixir, en garantissant la compatibilité avec Elixir 1.19 ou supérieur, et en fournissant une détection de cycle précise à l''aide de mix run et System.version() checks.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zyklische Abhängigkeiten in Elixir-Projekten zu erkennen und zu beheben, indem sie die Kompatibilität mit Elixir 1.19 oder höher gewährleisten und eine genaue Zyklus-Erkennung mithilfe von mix run und System.version() checks bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar e corrigir dependências cíclicas em projetos Elixir, garantindo compatibilidade com Elixir 1.19 ou superior, e fornecendo detecção de ciclo precisa usando mix run e System.version() checks.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и исправлять циклические зависимости в проектах Elixir, обеспечивая совместимость с Elixir 1.19 или более поздней версией, и предоставляя точное обнаружение циклов с помощью mix run и System.version() checks.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد وإصلاح الإعتماد الدوري في مشاريع Elixir، مما يضمن التوافق مع Elixir 1.19 أو أعلى، وتوفير الكشف الدقيق عن الدورة باستخدام mix run و System.version() checks."},"useCases":{"en":["Checking for cycles in Elixir dependencies","Removing cyclic dependencies for improved project stability","Verifying Elixir version compatibility for cycle detection"],"zh":["检查Elixir依赖关系中的循环","为了提高项目稳定性而删除循环依赖关系","验证Elixir版本与循环检测的兼容性"],"ja":["Elixir依存関係のサイクルを確認する","プロジェクトの安定性を向上させるためにサイクル依存関係を削除する","サイクル検出のためのElixirバージョンの互換性を確認する"],"ko":["엘릭서 종속성에서 사이클을 확인하는こと","프로젝트 안정성을 개선하기 위해 사이클 종속성을 제거하는 것","사이클 감지를 위한 엘릭서 버전의 호환성을 확인하는 것"],"es":["Comprobación de ciclos en dependencias de Elixir","Eliminación de dependencias cíclicas para mejorar la estabilidad del proyecto","Verificación de la compatibilidad de la versión de Elixir para la detección de ciclos"],"fr":["Vérification des cycles dans les dépendances Elixir","Suppression des dépendances cycliques pour améliorer la stabilité du projet","Vérification de la compatibilité de la version Elixir pour la détection de cycles"],"de":["Überprüfung von Zyklen in Elixir-Abhängigkeiten","Entfernung von zyklischen Abhängigkeiten zur Verbesserung der Projekstabilität","Überprüfung der Elixir-Versionen-Kompatibilität für die Zyklus-Erkennung"],"pt":["Verificar ciclos em dependências Elixir","Remover dependências cíclicas para melhorar a estabilidade do projeto","Verificar a compatibilidade da versão Elixir para detecção de ciclo"],"ru":["Проверка циклов в зависимостях Elixir","Удаление циклических зависимостей для улучшения стабильности проекта","Проверка совместимости версии Elixir для обнаружения цикла"],"ar":["التحقق من الحلقات في الإعتماديات Elixir","إزالة الإعتماد الدوري لتحسين استقرار المشروع","التحقق من توافق إصدار Elixir للكشف عن الدورة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Elixir 1.19 or higher","Explicit user request required for cycle checks or removal"],"zh":["需要Elixir 1.19或更高版本","需要显式的用户请求来执行循环检查或移除"],"ja":["Elixir 1.19以上が必要","サイクルチェックまたは削除を実行するために明示的なユーザー要求が必要"],"ko":["엘릭서 1.19 이상이 필요합니다","사이클 체크 또는 제거를 실행하려면 명시적인 사용자 요청이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere Elixir 1.19 o superior","Se requiere una solicitud explícita del usuario para comprobaciones o eliminación de ciclos"],"fr":["Nécessite Elixir 1.19 ou supérieur","Une demande explicite de l''utilisateur est requise pour les vérifications ou la suppression de cycles"],"de":["Elixir 1.19 oder höher erforderlich","Eine explizite Benutzeraufforderung ist für Zyklus-Checks oder -Entfernung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer Elixir 1.19 ou superior","Solicitação explícita do usuário necessária para verificações ou remoção de ciclo"],"ru":["Требуется Elixir 1.19 или более поздняя версия","Необходимо явное запрос пользователя для проверок или удаления цикла"],"ar":["يتطلب Elixir 1.19 أو أعلى","يتطلب طلب مستخدم صريح للفحوصات أو إزالة الدورة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7dfa7784b5f0410e779d01655e7ba709178453bd124c7b905cd33d9831bbc9d8","qualityScore":49}');
