Analyse de données pour améliorer la conversion","Personnalisation de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme CLI"],"de":["Landingpage-Experimente A/B","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Datenanalyse zur Verbesserung der Konvertierung","Personalisierung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie CLI"],"pt":["Criação de experimentos de páginas de destino","Otimização de campanhas com ferramentas de IA","Análise de resultados com React e Node.js","Integração com CLI para automação","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de dados"],"ru":["Создание экспериментов по тестированию лендингов","Оптимизация кампаний с помощью инструментов ИИ","Анализ результатов с использованием React и Node.js","Интеграция с CLI для автоматизации","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных"],"ar":["إنشاء تجارب لصفحات الهبوط","تحسين الحملات باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل النتائج باستخدام React و Node.js","التكامل مع CLI للتحكم الآلي","دعم عدة صيغ للبيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Address-Review 教程","A/B 登陆页实验","开发效率优化","React 和 Python","CLI 接口","如何使用 Address-Review","Address-Review 安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Address-Review ガイド","A/B 登陆ページ実験","開発効率の最適化","React と Python","CLI インターフェース","Address-Review の使い方","Address-Review の設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Address-Review 사용법","A/B 登陆페이지 실험","개발 효율성 최적화","React 와 Python","CLI 인터페이스","Address-Review 설치","Address-Review 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para experimentos de landing page","cómo usar address-review","qué es address-review","alternativas a unbound.tools","unbound.tools vs competidores","instalación de address-review","guía de configuración de address-review"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les expériences de page de destination","comment utiliser address-review","qu''est-ce que address-review","alternatives à unbound.tools","unbound.tools vs concurrents","installation d''address-review","guide de configuration d''address-review"],"de":["KI-Tools für Landingpage-Experimente","wie man address-review verwendet","was ist address-review","Alternativen zu unbound.tools","unbound.tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von address-review","Konfigurationsanleitung für address-review"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","experimentação de páginas de destino","otimização de campanhas","react e node js","cli para automação","address-review alternative","address-review vs competitors"],"ru":["инструменты ии","тестирование лендингов","оптимизация кампаний","react и node js","cli для автоматизации","address-review альтернатива","address-review vs конкуренты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختبار صفحات الهبوط","تحسين الحملات","react و node js","cli للتحكم الآلي","address-review بديل","address-review مقابل المنافسين"]}},"owner":"unbound-tools","repo":"landing","repoPath":"unbound-tools/landing","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T17:55:34Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"address-review","description":"Address PR review feedback, verify independently, and re-request review","bodyPreview":"# Address Review Feedback\n\nAddress review comments on PR #$ARGUMENTS. Be adversarial about the feedback itself — verify that suggestions are correct before applying them.\n\n## PR Context\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n```\n!gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments --jq ''.[] | \"---\\n\\(.path):\\(.line // .original_line)\\n\\(.body)\\n\"''\n```\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS --comments\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Gather All Feedback\n\nRead every review comment above. Categorize each piece o","body":"# Address Review Feedback\n\nAddress review comments on PR #$ARGUMENTS. Be adversarial about the feedback itself — verify that suggestions are correct before applying them.\n\n## PR Context\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS\n```\n\n```\n!gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments --jq ''.[] | \"---\\n\\(.path):\\(.line // .original_line)\\n\\(.body)\\n\"''\n```\n\n```\n!gh pr view $ARGUMENTS --comments\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Gather All Feedback\n\nRead every review comment above. Categorize each piece of feedback:\n\n- **Action Required** — Reviewer flagged as blocking merge\n- **Recommended** — Reviewer suggested addressing before merge\n- **Minor** — Nits, style suggestions\n\n### Step 2: Independently Verify Each Finding\n\n**Do not blindly apply suggestions.** For each piece of feedback:\n\n1. **Read the file in question** — Use Glob/Grep/Read to find the relevant file and understand the full context, not just the diff snippet.\n2. **Assess whether the feedback is correct** — Reviewers (including agent reviewers) can be wrong. Check:\n   - Does the suggested change actually fix the issue identified?\n   - Could the suggestion introduce a new bug or visual regression?\n   - Is the reviewer missing context that makes the current code correct?\n   - Does the suggestion align with project conventions in `AGENTS.md`?\n3. **For visual feedback** — Check out the branch, run `npm run dev`, verify rendering at mobile and desktop widths, check both variants (`/start` and `/build`).\n4. **For security feedback** — Take it seriously by default. Security suggestions should be applied unless you can clearly demonstrate they''re wrong.\n\n### Step 3: Respond to Each Finding\n\nFor each piece of feedback, take one of these actions:\n\n**Apply** — The feedback is correct. Make the change.\n- Edit the file\n- Run `npm run dev` and verify both variants render correctly\n- Note what was changed\n\n**Partially apply** — The core insight is right but the suggested fix isn''t quite right.\n- Implement a better fix that addresses the underlying concern\n- Explain why you deviated from the exact suggestion\n\n**Reject with justification** — The feedback is incorrect or doesn''t apply.\n- Explain clearly why the current code is correct\n- Reference `AGENTS.md` or project conventions to support your reasoning\n- Never reject feedback without a concrete justification\n\n**Escalate** — You''re unsure whether the feedback is valid.\n- Flag it to the human with the evidence for and against\n- Do not guess or silently skip\n\n### Step 4: Run Full Verification\n\nAfter addressing all feedback:\n\n1. **Run `npm run dev`** and verify both variants render correctly at mobile and desktop widths\n2. **Check TypeScript compilation** — `npx wrangler types && npx tsc --noEmit` (Worker-side only)\n3. **Test form submission** if any API or form changes were made\n4. **Spot-check your changes** — Read through your own diff. Did you introduce any new issues while fixing the review feedback?\n5. **Check sizing** — If the fixes significantly expanded the PR, flag whether it should be split.\n\n### Step 5: Commit and Push\n\n- Commit fixes with clear messages linking to the review feedback: `fix: Address review — <description>`\n- Keep fix commits separate from each other when they address unrelated feedback (easier to review the re-review)\n- Push to the PR branch\n\n### Step 6: Post Summary and Re-request Review\n\nPost a comment on the PR summarizing how each finding was addressed, then re-request review:\n\n```\ngh pr comment $ARGUMENTS --body \"<summary>\"\ngh pr edit $ARGUMENTS --add-reviewer <reviewer>\n```\n\nUse this format for the summary:\n\n```markdown\n## Review Feedback Addressed\n\n| # | Finding | Action | Details |\n|---|---------|--------|---------|\n| 1 | <brief description> | Applied / Partially applied / Rejected | <what was done and why> |\n| 2 | ... | ... | ... |\n\n**Visual verification:** Both variants checked at mobile + desktop\n**New commits:** <list of fix commits>\n```\n\nFor any rejected findings, provide the full justification in the Details column so the reviewer can evaluate your reasoning.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T04:02:53.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced GitHub PR analysis and feedback verification capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub PR 分析和反馈验证功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"GitHub PR の高度な分析およびフィードバックの検証機能が必要なコードレビュー エージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 GitHub PR 분석 및 피드백 검증 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan un análisis avanzado de solicitudes de extracción de GitHub y capacidades de verificación de comentarios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une analyse avancée des demandes de tirage GitHub et des capacités de vérification de commentaires.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine erweiterte Analyse von GitHub-Pull-Requests und Kommentar-Überprüfungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de análise avançada de PRs do GitHub e capacidades de verificação de feedback.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа PR GitHub и проверки обратной связи.","ar":"เหมาะ لعميل المراجعة الكودية الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم لطلبات السحب على GitHub وقدرات التحقق من التعليقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify and apply address review comments on GitHub PRs using gh commands, ensuring accurate and adversarial feedback evaluation through APIs like !gh pr view and !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 gh 命令在 GitHub PR 上验证和应用地址审查评论的能力，通过 API 如 !gh pr view 和 !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments 确保准确和对抗性反馈评估。","ja":"エージェントが gh コマンドを使用して GitHub PR に対するアドレスレビューコメントを検証および適用できるようにし、!gh pr view および !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments などの API を使用して、正確で対抗的なフィードバック評価を実現。","ko":"에이전트가 gh 명령을 사용하여 GitHub PR에 대한 주소 리뷰评论을 검증 및 적용할 수 있도록 하여, !gh pr view 및 !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments와 같은 API를 통해 정확하고 적대적인 피드백 평가를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar y aplicar comentarios de revisión de direcciones en solicitudes de extracción de GitHub utilizando comandos gh, asegurando una evaluación de comentarios precisos y adversariales a través de API como !gh pr view y !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier et d''appliquer les commentaires de révision d''adresses sur les demandes de tirage GitHub en utilisant des commandes gh, garantissant une évaluation de commentaires précise et adverse via des API comme !gh pr view et !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Überprüfungen und Anwendungen von Review-Kommentaren auf GitHub-Pull-Requests mithilfe von gh-Befehlen zu überprüfen, um eine genaue und widersprüchliche Kommentarbewertung durch APIs wie !gh pr view und !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments sicherzustellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes verifiquem e apliquem comentários de revisão em PRs do GitHub usando comandos gh, garantindo uma avaliação de feedback precisa e adversarial por meio de APIs como !gh pr view e !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять и применять комментарии к ревью в PR GitHub с помощью команд gh, обеспечивая точную и противоречивую оценку обратной связи через API seperti !gh pr view и !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء التحقق من تعليقات المراجعة وتطبيقها على طلبات السحب على GitHub باستخدام أوامر gh، مما يضمن تقييمًا دقيقًا ومعاكسًا للتعليقات من خلال واجهات برمجة التطبيقات مثل !gh pr view و !gh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/$ARGUMENTS/comments"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub PR feedback analysis","Verifying review comments for accuracy","Applying validated suggestions to PRs"],"zh":["自动化 GitHub PR 反馈分析","验证审查评论的准确性","将验证后的建议应用于 PR"],"ja":["GitHub PR のフィードバック分析の自動化","レビューコメントの正確性の検証","検証された提案の PR への適用"],"ko":["GitHub PR 피드백 분석 자동화","검토 댓글의 정확성 검증","검증된 제안의 PR 적용"],"es":["Automatización del análisis de comentarios de solicitudes de extracción de GitHub","Verificación de comentarios de revisión para precisión","Aplicación de sugerencias validadas a solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''analyse de commentaires de demandes de tirage GitHub","Vérification de commentaires de révision pour l''exactitude","Application de suggestions validées aux demandes de tirage"],"de":["Automatisierung der Analyse von Pull-Request-Kommentaren auf GitHub","Überprüfung von Review-Kommentaren auf Genauigkeit","Anwendung von validierten Vorschlägen auf Pull-Requests"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de feedback de PRs do GitHub","Verificar comentários de revisão para precisão","Aplicar sugestões validadas em PRs"],"ru":["Автоматизация анализа обратной связи PR GitHub","Проверка комментариев к ревью на точность","Применение проверенных предложений к PR"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحليل تعليقات طلبات السحب على GitHub","التحقق من تعليقات المراجعة لضمان الدقة","تطبيق الاقتراحات المعتمدة على طلبات السحب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to GitHub PRs","Needs argument parsing for PR numbers"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 访问","仅限 GitHub PR","需要 PR 编号的参数解析"],"ja":["GitHub API アクセスが必要","GitHub PR 限定","PR 番号のパラメータ解析が必要"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요합니다","GitHub PR에만 적용","PR 번호에 대한 인수 구문 분석 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Limitado a solicitudes de extracción de GitHub","Necesita análisis de argumentos para números de solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité aux demandes de tirage GitHub","Nécessite un analyse d''arguments pour les numéros de demandes de tirage"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Pull-Requests","Benötigt Argumentparsen für Pull-Request-Nummern"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado a PRs do GitHub","Necessita de análise de argumentos para números de PR"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API GitHub","Ограничен до PR GitHub","Требуется разбор аргументов для номеров PR"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","محدود لطلبات السحب على GitHub","يحتاج إلى تحليل الحجج لأرقام طلبات السحب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"712176b2ede2a1805751c302527454ee4556e118566a17f4e39cb3997cdefd9f","qualityScore":49}');
