ide de configuration de memorystore-config"],"de":["wie man memorystore-config verwendet","was ist memorystore-config","alternativen zu memorystore-config","memorystore-config vs andere KI-Tools","installation von memorystore-config","konfigurationsanleitung für memorystore-config"],"pt":["como usar Memorystore","o que é Memorystore","alternativas ao Memorystore","Memorystore vs Redis","instalar Memorystore","guia de configuração do Memorystore"],"ru":["как использовать Memorystore","что такое Memorystore","альтернативы Memorystore","Memorystore vs Redis","установить Memorystore","руководство по настройке Memorystore"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Memorystore","ما هو Memorystore","بديلات Memorystore","Memorystore مقابل Redis","تثبيت Memorystore","دليل إعداد Memorystore"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.879Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"memorystore-config","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Memorystore Config\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for memorystore config tasks within the GCP Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"memorystore config\" in your request\n- Ask about memorystore config patterns or best practices\n- Need help with google cloud platform skills covering compute, storage, bigquery, vertex ai, and gcp-specific services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for memorystore config\n2.","body":"# Memorystore Config\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for memorystore config tasks within the GCP Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"memorystore config\" in your request\n- Ask about memorystore config patterns or best practices\n- Need help with google cloud platform skills covering compute, storage, bigquery, vertex ai, and gcp-specific services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for memorystore config\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with memorystore config\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of gcp skills concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **GCP Skills** skill category.\nTags: gcp, bigquery, vertex-ai, cloud-run, firebase\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:10.589Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents specializing in Google Cloud Platform services, particularly those requiring automated memorystore configuration and management.","zh":"适用于专门从事Google Cloud Platform服务的Cloud Agents，特别是那些需要自动化memorystore配置和管理的Agent。","ja":"Google Cloud Platformサービスを専門とするCloud Agentに適しています。特に、自動化されたmemorystoreの構成と管理が必要な場合に効果的です。","ko":"Google Cloud Platform 서비스를 전문으로 하는 Cloud Agent에게 적합하며, 자동화된 memorystore 구성 및 관리가 특히 필요할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Cloud especializados en servicios de Google Cloud Platform, particularmente aquellos que requieren configuración y administración de memorystore automatizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud spécialisés dans les services de Google Cloud Platform, en particulier ceux qui nécessitent une configuration et une gestion de memorystore automatisées.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die auf Google Cloud Platform-Dienste spezialisiert sind, insbesondere solche, die eine automatisierte Konfiguration und Verwaltung von memorystore erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem especializados em serviços da Google Cloud Platform, particularmente aqueles que exigem configuração e gerenciamento de memorystore automatizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачных вычислений, специализирующихся на сервисах Google Cloud Platform, особенно для тех, которые требуют автоматизированной настройки и управления memorystore.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيون الذين يختصون في خدمات منصة جوجل السحابية، ولا سيما تلك التي تتطلب تكوين وادارة memorystore آليين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate memorystore config tasks, providing step-by-step guidance and best practices for Google Cloud Platform skills, including compute, storage, BigQuery, Vertex AI, and GCP-specific services, utilizing the CCPI package manager and interactive tutorials.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化memorystore配置任务的能力，提供有关Google Cloud Platform技能的分步指南和最佳实践，包括计算、存储、BigQuery、Vertex AI和GCP特定服务，使用CCPI包管理器和交互式教程。","ja":"エージェントにmemorystore構成タスクの自動化を可能にし、Google Cloud Platformスキルのステップバイステップガイダンスとベストプラクティスを提供することを可能にします。计算、ストレージ、BigQuery、Vertex AI、およびGCP固有のサービスをカバーし、CCPIパッケージマネージャーとインタラクティブなチュートリアルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 memorystore 구성 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 하고, 컴퓨팅, 스토리지, BigQuery, Vertex AI 및 GCP 전용 서비스를 포함한 Google Cloud Platform 기술에 대한 단계별 지침 및 모범 사례를 제공합니다. CCPI 패키지 관리자 및 상호 작용형 자습서를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas de configuración de memorystore, proporcionando orientación paso a paso y mejores prácticas para habilidades de Google Cloud Platform, incluyendo computación, almacenamiento, BigQuery, Vertex AI y servicios específicos de GCP, 