T","es":"La serialización en .NET es crucial para el intercambio de datos entre sistemas. Aprende a implementarla de manera efectiva.","fr":"La sérialisation dans .NET est essentielle pour l''échange de données entre systèmes. Apprenez à la mettre en œuvre de manière efficace.","de":"Die Serialisierung in .NET ist entscheidend für den Datenaustausch zwischen Systemen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie sie effektiv implementieren.","pt":"Serialização em .NET é fundamental para APIs, mensagens e persistência. Aprenda a escolher o formato adequado e otimizar o desempenho","ru":"Сериализация в .NET является фундаментальной для API, сообщений и хранения. Узнайте, как выбрать подходящий формат и оптимизировать производительность","ar":"serialization في .NET هي أساسية لبروتوكولات الويب ورسائل وثبات البيانات. تعرف على كيفية اختيار تنسيق التدوين المناسب وتحسين الأداء","en":"Claude Code skills and sub-agents for .NET Developers"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code skills and sub-agents for .NET Developers"},"features":{"zh":["API","Newtonsoft.Json System.Text.Json","AOT","API","MessagePack"],"ja":["API","Newtonsoft.JsonSystem.Text.Json","AOT","API","MessagePack"],"ko":[".NET API","Newtonsoft.Json System.Text.Json","AOT","API","MessagePack"],"es":["Elección de formato de serialización para APIs y mensajería","Migración de Newtonsoft.Json a System.Text.Json","Implementación de serialización compatible con AOT","Diseño de formatos de cable para sistemas distribuidos","Optimización del rendimiento de serialización"],"fr":["Choix du format de sérialisation pour les API et la messagerie","Migration de Newtonsoft.Json à System.Text.Json","Mise en œuvre de la sérialisation compatible avec AOT","Conception de formats de fil pour les systèmes distribués","Optimisation des performances de sérialisation"],"de":["Auswahl des Serialisierungsformats für APIs und Messaging","Migration von Newtonsoft.Json zu System.Text.Json","Implementierung von AOT-kompatibler Serialisierung","Entwurf von Drahtformaten für verteilte Systeme","Optimierung der Serialisierungsleistung"],"pt":["Escolha do formato de serialização","Otimização do desempenho","Compatibilidade com AOT","Projeto de formatos de fio para sistemas distribuídos","Migração de Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json"],"ru":["Выбор формата сериализации","Оптимизация производительности","Совместимость с AOT","Проектирование форматов передачи для распределенных систем","Миграция с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json"],"ar":["اختيار تنسيق التدوين","تحسين الأداء","توافق مع AOT","تصميم تنسيقات الكابل لأنظمة موزعة","هجرة من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json"]},"keywords":{"zh":[".NET","Newtonsoft.Json","System.Text.Json","AOT","API","MessagePack",".NET "],"ja":["NET","Newtonsoft.Json","System.Text.Json","AOT","API","MessagePack","NET"],"ko":[".NET ","Newtonsoft.Json","System.Text.Json","AOT","API","MessagePack",".NET"],"es":["serialización en .NET","formatos de serialización","System.Text.Json","Newtonsoft.Json","AOT","rendimiento de serialización","sistemas distribuidos"],"fr":["sérialisation dans .NET","formats de sérialisation","System.Text.Json","Newtonsoft.Json","AOT","performances de sérialisation","systèmes distribués"],"de":["Serialisierung in .NET","Serialisierungsformate","System.Text.Json","Newtonsoft.Json","AOT","Serialisierungsleistung","verteilte Systeme"],"pt":["serialização em .NET","escolha do formato de serialização","otimização do desempenho","AOT","sistemas distribuídos","Newtonsoft.Json","System.Text.Json"],"ru":["Сериализация в .NET","Выбор формата сериализации","Оптимизация производительности","AOT","Распределенные системы","Newtonsoft.Json","System.Text.Json"],"ar":["serialization في .NET","اختيار تنسيق التدوين","تحسين الأداء","AOT","أنظمة موزعة","Newtonsoft.Json","System.Text.Json"]}},"owner":"Aaronontheweb","repo":"dotnet-skills","repoPath":"Aaronontheweb/dotnet-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"serialization","description":"Choose the right serialization format for .NET applications. Prefer schema-based formats (Protobuf, MessagePack) over reflection-based (Newtonsoft.Json). Use System.Text.Json with AOT source generators for JSON scenarios.","bodyPreview":"# Serialization in .NET\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Choosing a serialization format for APIs, messaging, or persistence\n- Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- Implementing AOT-compatible serialization\n- Designing wire formats for distributed systems\n- Optimizing serialization performance\n\n---\n\n## Schema-Based vs Reflection-Based\n\n| Aspect | Schema-Based | Reflection-Based |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| **Examples** | Protobuf, MessagePack,","body":"# Serialization in .NET\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Choosing a serialization format for APIs, messaging, or persistence\n- Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json\n- Implementing AOT-compatible serialization\n- Designing wire formats for distributed systems\n- Optimizing serialization performance\n\n---\n\n## Schema-Based vs Reflection-Based\n\n| Aspect | Schema-Based | Reflection-Based |\n|--------|--------------|------------------|\n| **Examples** | Protobuf, MessagePack, System.Text.Json (source gen) | Newtonsoft.Json, BinaryFormatter |\n| **Type info in payload** | No (external schema) | Yes (type names embedded) |\n| **Versioning** | Explicit field numbers/names | Implicit (type structure) |\n| **Performance** | Fast (no reflection) | Slower (runtime reflection) |\n| **AOT compatible** | Yes | No |\n| **Wire compatibility** | Excellent | Poor |\n\n**Recommendation**: Use schema-based serialization for anything that crosses process boundaries.\n\n---\n\n## Format Recommendations\n\n| Use Case | Recommended Format | Why |\n|----------|-------------------|-----|\n| **REST APIs** | System.Text.Json (source gen) | Standard, AOT-compatible |\n| **gRPC** | Protocol Buffers | Native format, excellent versioning |\n| **Actor messaging** | MessagePack or Protobuf | Compact, fast, version-safe |\n| **Event sourcing** | Protobuf or MessagePack | Must handle old events forever |\n| **Caching** | MessagePack | Compact, fast |\n| **Configuration** | JSON (System.Text.Json) | Human-readable |\n| **Logging** | JSON (System.Text.Json) | Structured, parseable |\n\n### Formats to Avoid\n\n| Format | Problem |\n|--------|---------|\n| **BinaryFormatter** | Security vulnerabilities, deprecated, never use |\n| **Newtonsoft.Json default** | Type names in payload break on rename |\n| **DataContractSerializer** | Complex, poor versioning |\n| **XML** | Verbose, slow, complex |\n\n---\n\n## System.Text.Json with Source Generators\n\nFor JSON serialization, use System.Text.Json with source generators for AOT compatibility and performance.\n\n### Setup\n\n```csharp\n// Define a JsonSerializerContext with all your types\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(OrderItem))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Customer))]\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(List<Order>))]\n[JsonSourceGenerationOptions(\n    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonKnownNamingPolicy.CamelCase,\n    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull)]\npublic partial class AppJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n```\n\n### Usage\n\n```csharp\n// Serialize with context\nvar json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(order, AppJsonContext.Default.Order);\n\n// Deserialize with context\nvar order = JsonSerializer.Deserialize(json, AppJsonContext.Default.Order);\n\n// Configure in ASP.NET Core\nbuilder.Services.ConfigureHttpJsonOptions(options =>\n{\n    options.SerializerOptions.TypeInfoResolverChain.Insert(0, AppJsonContext.Default);\n});\n```\n\n### Benefits\n\n- **No reflection at runtime** - All type info generated at compile time\n- **AOT compatible** - Works with Native AOT publishing\n- **Faster** - No runtime type analysis\n- **Trim-safe** - Linker knows exactly what''s needed\n\n---\n\n## Protocol Buffers (Protobuf)\n\nBest for: Actor systems, gRPC, event sourcing, any long-lived wire format.\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package Google.Protobuf\ndotnet add package Grpc.Tools\n```\n\n### Define Schema\n\n```protobuf\n// orders.proto\nsyntax = \"proto3\";\n\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    string customer_id = 2;\n    repeated OrderItem items = 3;\n    int64 created_at_ticks = 4;\n\n    // Adding new fields is always safe\n    string notes = 5;  // Added in v2 - old readers ignore it\n}\n\nmessage OrderItem {\n    string product_id = 1;\n    int32 quantity = 2;\n    int64 price_cents = 3;\n}\n```\n\n### Versioning Rules\n\n```protobuf\n// SAFE: Add new fields with new numbers\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    string customer_id = 2;\n    string shipping_address = 5;  // NEW - safe\n}\n\n// SAFE: Remove fields (old readers ignore unknown, new readers use default)\n// Just stop using the field, keep the number reserved\nmessage Order {\n    string id = 1;\n    // customer_id removed, but field 2 is reserved\n    reserved 2;\n}\n\n// UNSAFE: Change field types\nmessage Order {\n    int32 id = 1;  // Was: string - BREAKS!\n}\n\n// UNSAFE: Reuse field numbers\nmessage Order {\n    reserved 2;\n    string new_field = 2;  // Reusing 2 - BREAKS!\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## MessagePack\n\nBest for: High-performance scenarios, compact payloads, actor messaging.\n\n### Setup\n\n```bash\ndotnet add package MessagePack\ndotnet add package MessagePack.Annotations\n```\n\n### Usage with Contracts\n\n```csharp\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic sealed class Order\n{\n    [Key(0)]\n    public required string Id { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(1)]\n    public required string CustomerId { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(2)]\n    public required IReadOnlyList<OrderItem> Items { get; init; }\n\n    [Key(3)]\n    public required DateTimeOffset CreatedAt { get; init; }\n\n    // New field - old readers skip unknown keys\n    [Key(4)]\n    public string? Notes { get; init; }\n}\n\n// Serialize\nvar bytes = MessagePackSerializer.Serialize(order);\n\n// Deserialize\nvar order = MessagePackSerializer.Deserialize<Order>(bytes);\n```\n\n### AOT-Compatible Setup\n\n```csharp\n// Use source generator for AOT\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic partial class Order { }  // partial enables source gen\n\n// Configure resolver\nvar options = MessagePackSerializerOptions.Standard\n    .WithResolver(CompositeResolver.Create(\n        GeneratedResolver.Instance,  // Generated\n        StandardResolver.Instance));\n```\n\n---\n\n## Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json\n\n### Common Issues\n\n| Newtonsoft | System.Text.Json | Fix |\n|------------|------------------|-----|\n| `$type` in JSON | Not supported by default | Use discriminators or custom converters |\n| `JsonProperty` | `JsonPropertyName` | Different attribute |\n| `DefaultValueHandling` | `DefaultIgnoreCondition` | Different API |\n| `NullValueHandling` | `DefaultIgnoreCondition` | Different API |\n| Private setters | Requires `[JsonInclude]` | Explicit opt-in |\n| Polymorphism | `[JsonDerivedType]` (.NET 7+) | Explicit discriminators |\n\n### Migration Pattern\n\n```csharp\n// Newtonsoft (reflection-based)\npublic class Order\n{\n    [JsonProperty(\"order_id\")]\n    public string Id { get; set; }\n\n    [JsonProperty(NullValueHandling = NullValueHandling.Ignore)]\n    public string? Notes { get; set; }\n}\n\n// System.Text.Json (source-gen compatible)\npublic sealed record Order(\n    [property: JsonPropertyName(\"order_id\")]\n    string Id,\n\n    string? Notes  // Null handling via JsonSerializerOptions\n);\n\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\n[JsonSourceGenerationOptions(\n    PropertyNamingPolicy = JsonKnownNamingPolicy.SnakeCaseLower,\n    DefaultIgnoreCondition = JsonIgnoreCondition.WhenWritingNull)]\npublic partial class OrderJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n```\n\n### Polymorphism with Discriminators\n\n```csharp\n// .NET 7+ polymorphism\n[JsonDerivedType(typeof(CreditCardPayment), \"credit_card\")]\n[JsonDerivedType(typeof(BankTransferPayment), \"bank_transfer\")]\npublic abstract record Payment(decimal Amount);\n\npublic sealed record CreditCardPayment(decimal Amount, string Last4) : Payment(Amount);\npublic sealed record BankTransferPayment(decimal Amount, string AccountNumber) : Payment(Amount);\n\n// Serializes as:\n// { \"$type\": \"credit_card\", \"amount\": 100, \"last4\": \"1234\" }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Wire Compatibility Patterns\n\n### Tolerant Reader\n\nOld code must safely ignore unknown fields:\n\n```csharp\n// Protobuf/MessagePack: Automatic - unknown fields skipped\n// System.Text.Json: Configure to allow\nvar options = new JsonSerializerOptions\n{\n    UnmappedMemberHandling = JsonUnmappedMemberHandling.Skip\n};\n```\n\n### Introduce Read Before Write\n\nDeploy deserializers before serializers for new formats:\n\n```csharp\n// Phase 1: Add deserializer (deployed everywhere)\npublic Order Deserialize(byte[] data, string manifest) => manifest switch\n{\n    \"Order.V1\" => DeserializeV1(data),\n    \"Order.V2\" => DeserializeV2(data),  // NEW - can read V2\n    _ => throw new NotSupportedException()\n};\n\n// Phase 2: Enable serializer (next release, after V1 deployed everywhere)\npublic (byte[] data, string manifest) Serialize(Order order) =>\n    _useV2Format\n        ? (SerializeV2(order), \"Order.V2\")\n        : (SerializeV1(order), \"Order.V1\");\n```\n\n### Never Embed Type Names\n\n```csharp\n// BAD: Type name in payload - renaming class breaks wire format\n{\n    \"$type\": \"MyApp.Order, MyApp.Core\",\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n}\n\n// GOOD: Explicit discriminator - refactoring safe\n{\n    \"type\": \"order\",\n    \"id\": \"123\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Comparison\n\nApproximate throughput (higher is better):\n\n| Format | Serialize | Deserialize | Size |\n|--------|-----------|-------------|------|\n| MessagePack | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ |\n| Protobuf | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ | ★★★★★ |\n| System.Text.Json (source gen) | ★★★★☆ | ★★★★☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n| System.Text.Json (reflection) | ★★★☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n| Newtonsoft.Json | ★★☆☆☆ | ★★☆☆☆ | ★★★☆☆ |\n\nFor hot paths, prefer MessagePack or Protobuf.\n\n---\n\n## Akka.NET Serialization\n\nFor Akka.NET actor systems, use schema-based serialization:\n\n```hocon\nakka {\n  actor {\n    serializers {\n      messagepack = \"Akka.Serialization.MessagePackSerializer, Akka.Serialization.MessagePack\"\n    }\n    serialization-bindings {\n      \"MyApp.Messages.IMessage, MyApp\" = messagepack\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nSee [Akka.NET Serialization Docs](https://getakka.net/articles/networking/serialization.html).\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n\n```csharp\n// Use source generators for System.Text.Json\n[JsonSerializable(typeof(Order))]\npublic partial class AppJsonContext : JsonSerializerContext { }\n\n// Use explicit field numbers/keys\n[MessagePackObject]\npublic class Order\n{\n    [Key(0)] public string Id { get; init; }\n}\n\n// Use records for immutable message types\npublic sealed record OrderCreated(OrderId Id, CustomerId CustomerId);\n```\n\n### DON''T\n\n```csharp\n// Don''t use BinaryFormatter (ever)\nvar formatter = new BinaryFormatter();  // Security risk!\n\n// Don''t embed type names in wire format\nsettings.TypeNameHandling = TypeNameHandling.All;  // Breaks on rename!\n\n// Don''t use reflection serialization for hot paths\nJsonConvert.SerializeObject(order);  // Slow, not AOT-compatible\n```\n\n---\n\n## Resources\n\n- **System.Text.Json Source Generation**: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/serialization/system-text-json/source-generation\n- **Protocol Buffers**: https://protobuf.dev/\n- **MessagePack-CSharp**: https://github.com/MessagePack-CSharp/MessagePack-CSharp\n- **Akka.NET Serialization**: https://getakka.net/articles/networking/serialization.html\n- **Wire Compatibility**: https://getakka.net/community/contributing/wire-compatibility.html\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:11.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for .NET Developer Agents needing efficient data serialization and deserialization for APIs, messaging, or persistence","zh":"非常适合需要为API、消息传递或持久性实现高效数据序列化和反序列化的.NET开发者代理","ja":".NET DeveloperエージェントがAPI、メッセージング、または永続化のための効率的なデータのシリアル化とデシリアル化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"API, 메시지 전달 또는 지속성을 위한 효율적인 데이터 직렬화 및 역직렬화를 필요로 하는 .NET 개발자 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador .NET que necesitan una serialización y deserialización de datos eficientes para API, mensajería o persistencia","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement .NET nécessitant une sérialisation et une désérialisation de données efficaces pour les API, la messagerie ou la persistance","de":"Perfekt für .NET-Entwickler-Agenten, die eine effiziente Daten-Serialisierung und -Deserialisierung für APIs, Messaging oder Persistence benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores .NET que necessitam de serialização e desserialização de dados eficientes para APIs, mensagens ou persistência","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков .NET, которым необходима эффективная сериализация и десериализация данных для API, обмена сообщениями или сохранения","ar":"مثالي لعميل مطور .NET الذي يحتاج إلى تسلسلة بيانات فعالة وفك تسلسل للواجهات البرمجية، والرسائل، أو الاستمرار"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to choose optimal serialization formats like Protobuf and MessagePack, migrate from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json, and implement AOT-compatible serialization for distributed systems, optimizing performance and designing efficient wire formats","zh":"赋予代理选择最优的序列化格式，如Protobuf和MessagePack，迁移从Newtonsoft.Json到System.Text.Json，并为分布式系统实现AOT兼容的序列化，优化性能并设计高效的线路格式","ja":"エージェントが最適なシリアル化形式 seperti ProtobufとMessagePackを選択できるようにし、Newtonsoft.Json から System.Text.Json への移行を可能にし、分散システムのためのAOT互換シリアル化を実装し、パフォーマンスを最適化し、効率的なワイヤーフォーマットを設計","ko":"에이전트가 최적의 직렬화 형식 seperti Protobuf와 MessagePack를 선택할 수 있도록 하며, Newtonsoft.Json에서 System.Text.Json로의 마이그레이션을 가능하게 하고, 분산 시스템을 위한 AOT 호환 직렬화를 구현하여 성능을 최적화하고 효율적인 와이어 형식을 설계","es":"Habilita a los agentes a elegir formatos de serialización óptimos como Protobuf y MessagePack, migrar de Newtonsoft.Json a System.Text.Json y implementar una serialización compatible con AOT para sistemas distribuidos, optimizando el rendimiento y diseñando formatos de cable eficientes","fr":"Permet aux agents de choisir des formats de sérialisation optimaux comme Protobuf et MessagePack, de migrer de Newtonsoft.Json à System.Text.Json et de mettre en œuvre une sérialisation compatible AOT pour les systèmes distribués, en optimisant les performances et en concevant des formats de fil efficaces","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, optimale Serialisierungsformate wie Protobuf und MessagePack zu wählen, von Newtonsoft.Json zu System.Text.Json zu migrieren und eine AOT-kompatible Serialisierung für verteilte Systeme zu implementieren, wodurch die Leistung optimiert und effiziente Drahtformate entworfen werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escolher formatos de serialização ótimos como Protobuf e MessagePack, migrar do Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json e implementar serialização compatível com AOT para sistemas distribuídos, otimizando o desempenho e projetando formatos de fio eficientes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выбирать оптимальные форматы сериализации, такие как Protobuf и MessagePack, мигрировать с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json и реализовывать сериализацию, совместимую с AOT, для распределенных систем, оптимизируя производительность и проектируя эффективные форматы передачи данных","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من اختيار تنسيقات تسلسلة البيانات المثالية مثل Protobuf و MessagePack، والهجرة من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json، وتنفيذ تسلسلة متوافقة مع AOT لنظم موزعة، وضمان الأداء الأمثل وتصميم تنسيقات سلك فعالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json for improved performance","Implementing schema-based serialization with Protobuf for distributed systems","Optimizing serialization performance for large-scale .NET applications"],"zh":["将Newtonsoft.Json迁移到System.Text.Json以提高性能","使用Protobuf实现分布式系统的基于模式的序列化","优化大规模.NET应用程序的序列化性能"],"ja":["Newtonsoft.Json から System.Text.Json への移行によるパフォーマンスの向上","Protobuf を使用した分散システムのスキーマベースのシリアル化の実装","大規模な .NET アプリケーションのシリアル化パフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["Newtonsoft.Json에서 System.Text.Json로의 마이그레이션을 통해 성능 개선","Protobuf를 사용한 분산 시스템의 스키마 기반 직렬화 구현","대규모 .NET 애플리케이션의 직렬화 성능 최적화"],"es":["Migrar de Newtonsoft.Json a System.Text.Json para mejorar el rendimiento","Implementar una serialización basada en esquemas con Protobuf para sistemas distribuidos","Optimizar el rendimiento de serialización para aplicaciones .NET a gran escala"],"fr":["Migrer de Newtonsoft.Json à System.Text.Json pour améliorer les performances","Mettre en œuvre une sérialisation basée sur des schémas avec Protobuf pour les systèmes distribués","Optimiser les performances de sérialisation pour les applications .NET à grande échelle"],"de":["Von Newtonsoft.Json zu System.Text.Json migrieren, um die Leistung zu verbessern","Die Implementierung einer schemabasierten Serialisierung mit Protobuf für verteilte Systeme","Optimieren des Serialisierungsleistungsverhaltens für .NET-Anwendungen im großen Maßstab"],"pt":["Migrar do Newtonsoft.Json para System.Text.Json para melhorar o desempenho","Implementar serialização baseada em esquema com Protobuf para sistemas distribuídos","Otimizar o desempenho da serialização para aplicações .NET de grande escala"],"ru":["Мигрировать с Newtonsoft.Json на System.Text.Json для улучшения производительности","Реализовать сериализацию на основе схемы с Protobuf для распределенных систем","Оптимизировать производительность сериализации для крупномасштабных приложений .NET"],"ar":["الهجرة من Newtonsoft.Json إلى System.Text.Json لتحسين الأداء","تنفيذ تسلسلة البيانات القائمة على مخطط مع Protobuf لنظم موزعة","تحسين أداء تسلسلة البيانات لتطبيقات .NET على نطاق واسع"]},"limitations":{"en":[".NET ecosystem only","Requires understanding of serialization formats and their trade-offs"],"zh":[".NET生态系统仅限","需要了解序列化格式及其权衡"],"ja":[".NETエコシステムのみ","シリアル化形式及其のトレードオフを理解する必要"],"ko":[".NET 생태계만 해당","직렬화 형식及其의 트레이드 오프를 이해해야 함"],"es":[".NET-Ökosystem nur","Requiere comprensión de los formatos de serialización y sus compensaciones"],"fr":["Écosystème .NET uniquement","Nécessite une compréhension des formats de sérialisation et de leurs compromis"],"de":[".NET-Ökosystem nur","Benötigt Verständnis für Serialisierungsformate und deren Kompromisse"],"pt":[".NET apenas","Requer entendimento de formatos de serialização e suas compensações"],"ru":["Только экосистема .NET","Требуется понимание форматов сериализации и их компромиссов"],"ar":["نظام بيئي .NET فقط","يتطلب فهم تنسيقات تسلسلة البيانات ومزاياها وعيوبها"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0f1f254521079e26f086132d639c959b4ac7be6ad2ec8fe64be61724d9021779","qualityScore":49}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('onmax/nuxt-skills/motion', 'community', 'onmax', 'nuxt-skills', 'onmax/nuxt-skills', 'motion', 0, 0, 49, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:12.240Z', 'f0e7a7749a2eed534f115c551b6ff27c17c9f38c25689302b7032fe583e41a60', '{"id":"onmax/nuxt-skills/motion","name":"motion","description":{"zh":"Motion Vue 是一个为 Vue 3 和 Nuxt 提供的生产就绪、硬件加速的动画库，具有最小的包大小","ja":"Motion Vue は Vue 3 と Nuxt 用のプロダクションレディ、ハードウェアアクセラレーションのアニメーションライブラリです。バンドルサイズは最小限に抑えられています","ko":"모션 뷰는 Vue 3 및 Nuxt를 위한 생산 준비가 된 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션 라이브러리입니다. 번들 크기는 최소한으로 유지됩니다","es":"Motion Vue es una biblioteca de animación para Vue 3 y Nuxt que ofrece animaciones declarativas y gestuales con un tamaño de paquete mínimo.","fr":"Motion Vue est une bibliothèque d''animation pour Vue 3 et Nuxt qui propose des animations déclaratives et gestuelles avec une taille de paquet minimal.","de":"Motion Vue ist eine Animationsbibliothek für Vue 3 und Nuxt, die deklarative und gestische Animationen mit minimalem Paketgröße bietet.","pt":"Motion Vue é uma biblioteca de animação para Vue 3 e Nuxt que oferece animações declarativas e interações baseadas em gestos com facilidade.","ru":"Motion Vue — это библиотека анимации для Vue 3 и Nuxt, которая обеспечивает декларативные анимации и жестовые взаимодействия с легкостью.","ar":"موشن فيو هي مكتبة تحريك لفيو 3 ونكست توفر تحريكات إعلانية وتفاعلات قائمة على الإيماءات بسهولة.","en":"Vue, Nuxt, and NuxtHub skills for AI coding assistants."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Motion Vue 动画库","ja":"Motion Vue アニメーションライブラリ","ko":"모션 뷰 애니메이션 라이브러리","es":"Motion Vue: biblioteca de animación para Vue 3 y Nuxt","fr":"Motion Vue : bibliothèque d''animation pour Vue 3 et Nuxt","de":"Motion Vue: Animationsbibliothek für Vue 3 und Nuxt","pt":"Motion Vue: Biblioteca de Animação para Vue 3 e Nuxt","ru":"Motion Vue: Библиотека анимации для Vue 3 и Nuxt","ar":"موشن فيو: مكتبة تحريك لفيو 3 ونكست","en":"motion"},"description":{"zh":"Motion Vue 是一个为 Vue 3 和 Nuxt 提供的生产就绪、硬件加速的动画库，具有最小的包大小","ja":"Motion Vue は Vue 3 と Nuxt 用のプロダクションレディ、ハードウェアアクセラレーションのアニメーションライブラリです。バンドルサイズは最小限に抑えられています","ko":"모션 뷰는 Vue 3 및 Nuxt를 위한 생산 준비가 된 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션 라이브러리입니다. 번들 크기는 최소한으로 유지됩니다","es":"Motion Vue es una biblioteca de animación para Vue 3 y Nuxt que ofrece animaciones declarativas y gestuales con un tamaño de paquete mínimo.","fr":"Motion Vue est une bibliothèque d''animation pour Vue 3 et Nuxt qui propose des animations déclaratives et gestuelles avec une taille de paquet minimal.","de":"Motion Vue ist eine Animationsbibliothek für Vue 3 und Nuxt, die deklarative und gestische Animationen mit minimalem Paketgröße bietet.","pt":"Motion Vue é uma biblioteca de animação para Vue 3 e Nuxt que oferece animações declarativas e interações baseadas em gestos com facilidade.","ru":"Motion Vue — это библиотека анимации для Vue 3 и Nuxt, которая обеспечивает декларативные анимации и жестовые взаимодействия с легкостью.","ar":"موشن فيو هي مكتبة تحريك لفيو 3 ونكست توفر تحريكات إعلانية وتفاعلات قائمة على الإيماءات بسهولة.","en":"Vue, Nuxt, and NuxtHub skills for AI coding assistants."},"definition":{"en":"Vue, Nuxt, and NuxtHub skills for AI coding assistants."},"features":{"zh":["简单的声明式动画","手势交互支持","硬件加速","最小的包大小","生产就绪","兼容 Vue 3 和 Nuxt"],"ja":["シンプルな宣言的アニメーション","ジェスチャーインタラクションのサポート","ハードウェアアクセラレーション","最小のバンドルサイズ","プロダクションレディ","Vue 3 と Nuxt との互換性"],"ko":["간단한 선언적 애니메이션","제스처 상호 작용 지원","하드웨어 가속","최소한의 번들 크기","생산 준비","Vue 3 및 Nuxt와의 호환성"],"es":["Animaciones declarativas","Interacciones gestuales","Tamaño de paquete mínimo","Compatible con Vue 3 y Nuxt","Animaciones hardware-aceleradas"],"fr":["Animations déclaratives","Interactions gestuelles","Taille de paquet minimal","Compatible avec Vue 3 et Nuxt","Animations accélérées par matériel"],"de":["Deklarative Animationen","Gestische Interaktionen","Minimale Paketgröße","Kompatibel mit Vue 3 und Nuxt","Hardware-beschleunigte Animationen"],"pt":["Animações declarativas","Interações baseadas em gestos","Tamanho de bundle mínimo","Aceleração por hardware","Compatibilidade com Vue 3 e Nuxt"],"ru":["Декларативные анимации","Жестовые взаимодействия","Минимальный размер бандла","Аппаратное ускорение","Совместимость с Vue 3 и Nuxt"],"ar":["التحريكات الإعلانية","التفاعلات القائمة على الإيماءات","الحجم الأدنى للباندل","التسريع بالعتاد","التوافق مع فيو 3 ونكست"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Motion Vue","Vue 3 动画","Nuxt 动画","声明式动画","手势交互","硬件加速","生产就绪","最小包大小"],"ja":["Motion Vue","Vue 3 アニメーション","Nuxt アニメーション","宣言的アニメーション","ジェスチャーインタラクション","ハードウェアアクセラレーション","プロダクションレディ","最小バンドルサイズ"],"ko":["모션 뷰","Vue 3 애니메이션","Nuxt 애니메이션","선언적 애니메이션","제스처 상호 작용","하드웨어 가속","생산 준비","최소 번들 크기"],"es":["Motion Vue","Animación en Vue 3","Nuxt animación","Biblioteca de animación","Animaciones declarativas","Interacciones gestuales","Desarrollo web"],"fr":["Motion Vue","Animation dans Vue 3","Nuxt animation","Bibliothèque d''animation","Animations déclaratives","Interactions gestuelles","Développement web"],"de":["Motion Vue","Animation in Vue 3","Nuxt Animation","Animationsbibliothek","Deklarative Animationen","Gestische Interaktionen","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Motion Vue","animação Vue 3","animação Nuxt","biblioteca de animação","animações declarativas","interações baseadas em gestos"],"ru":["Motion Vue","анимация Vue 3","анимация Nuxt","библиотека анимации","декларативные анимации","жестовые взаимодействия"],"ar":["موشن فيو","تحريك فيو 3","تحريك نكست","مكتبة تحريك","التحريكات الإعلانية","التفاعلات القائمة على الإيماءات"]}},"owner":"onmax","repo":"nuxt-skills","repoPath":"onmax/nuxt-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"motion","description":"Use when adding animations with Motion Vue (motion-v) - provides motion component API, gesture animations, scroll-linked effects, layout transitions, and composables for Vue 3/Nuxt","bodyPreview":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, ta","body":"# Motion Vue (motion-v)\n\nAnimation library for Vue 3 and Nuxt. Production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations with minimal bundle size.\n\n**Current stable:** motion-v 1.x - Vue port of Motion (formerly Framer Motion)\n\n## Overview\n\nProgressive reference for Motion Vue animations. Load only files relevant to current task (~200 tokens base, 500-1500 per sub-file).\n\n## When to Use\n\n**Use Motion Vue for:**\n\n- Simple declarative animations (fade, slide, scale)\n- Gesture-based interactions (hover, tap, drag)\n- Scroll-linked animations\n- Layout animations and shared element transitions\n- Spring physics animations\n\n**Consider alternatives:**\n\n- **GSAP** - Complex timelines, SVG morphing, scroll-triggered sequences\n- **@vueuse/motion** - Simpler API, less features, smaller bundle\n- **CSS animations** - Simple transitions without JS\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Vue 3\npnpm add motion-v\n\n# Nuxt 3\npnpm add motion-v @vueuse/nuxt\n```\n\n```ts\n// nuxt.config.ts - Nuxt 3 setup\nexport default defineNuxtConfig({\n  modules: [''motion-v/nuxt''],\n})\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Working on...                | Load file                 |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Motion component, gestures   | references/components.md  |\n| useMotionValue, useScroll    | references/composables.md |\n| Animation examples, patterns | references/examples.md    |\n\n## Loading Files\n\n**Consider loading these reference files based on your task:**\n\n- [ ] [references/components.md](references/components.md) - if using Motion component, gestures, or layout animations\n- [ ] [references/composables.md](references/composables.md) - if using useMotionValue, useScroll, useSpring, or animate()\n- [ ] [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) - if looking for animation patterns or inspiration\n\n**DO NOT load all files at once.** Load only what''s relevant to your current task.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Motion Component\n\nRender any HTML/SVG element with animation capabilities:\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { motion } from ''motion-v''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <motion.div\n    :initial=\"{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }\"\n    :animate=\"{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }\"\n    :exit=\"{ opacity: 0, y: -20 }\"\n    :transition=\"{ duration: 0.3 }\"\n  >\n    Animated content\n  </motion.div>\n</template>\n```\n\n### Gesture Animations\n\n```vue\n<motion.button\n  :whileHover=\"{ scale: 1.05 }\"\n  :whilePress=\"{ scale: 0.95 }\"\n  :transition=\"{ type: ''spring'', stiffness: 400 }\"\n>\n  Click me\n</motion.button>\n```\n\n### Scroll Animations\n\n```vue\n<motion.div\n  :initial=\"{ opacity: 0 }\"\n  :whileInView=\"{ opacity: 1 }\"\n  :viewport=\"{ once: true, margin: ''-100px'' }\"\n>\n  Appears on scroll\n</motion.div>\n```\n\n## Available Guidance\n\n**[references/components.md](references/components.md)** - Motion component variants, animation props, gesture props, layout animations, transition configuration\n\n**[references/composables.md](references/composables.md)** - useMotionValue, useSpring, useTransform, useScroll, useInView, animate()\n\n**[references/examples.md](references/examples.md)** - External resources, component libraries, animation patterns and inspiration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:12.240Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring production-ready, hardware-accelerated animations in Vue 3 and Nuxt applications.","zh":"适用于需要生产就绪、硬件加速动画的Vue 3和Nuxt应用程序的前端代理。","ja":"Vue 3およびNuxtアプリケーションで生産就緒のハードウェアアクセラレーションアニメーションを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"프로덕션 준비 및 하드웨어 가속 애니메이션을 필요한 Vue 3 및 Nuxt 애플리케이션을 위한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren animaciones con aceleración por hardware listas para producción en aplicaciones Vue 3 y Nuxt.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des animations prêtes pour la production avec accélération matérielle dans les applications Vue 3 et Nuxt.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die produktionsreife, hardwarebeschleunigte Animationen in Vue 3- und Nuxt-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem animações prontas para produção, aceleradas por hardware, em aplicações Vue 3 e Nuxt.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих анимаций, готовых к производству, ускоренных аппаратно, в приложениях Vue 3 и Nuxt.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين yêuاجون الرسوم المتحركة الجاهزة للإنتاج، والمسرعة بالأجهزة، في تطبيقات Vue 3 و Nuxt."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create simple declarative animations, such as fade, slide, and scale, and gesture-based interactions like hover and tap using Motion Vue''s minimal bundle size and hardware-accelerated capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建简单的声明式动画，例如渐入、滑动和缩放，并使用Motion Vue的最小包大小和硬件加速功能实现基于手势的交互，如悬停和点击。","ja":"エージェントに、Motion Vueの最小バンドルサイズとハードウェアアクセラレーション機能を使用して、フェード、スライド、スケールなどのシンプルな宣言型アニメーションを作成し、ホーバーとタップなどのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションを実現することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Motion Vue의 최소 번들 크기와 하드웨어 가속 기능을 사용하여 페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 간단한 선언적 애니메이션을 생성하고, 호버와 탭 등의 제스처 기반 상호 작용을 구현할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear animaciones declarativas simples, como desvanecimiento, deslizamiento y escala, y interacciones basadas en gestos como hover y tap utilizando el tamaño mínimo del paquete de Motion Vue y sus capacidades con aceleración por hardware.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations déclaratives simples, telles que le fondu, le défilement et la mise à l''échelle, et des interactions basées sur les gestes comme le survol et le tap en utilisant la taille minimale du paquet de Motion Vue et ses capacités d''accélération matérielle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, einfache deklarative Animationen wie Fade, Slide und Scale sowie gestenbasierte Interaktionen wie Hover und Tap unter Verwendung der minimalen Bundle-Größe von Motion Vue und seiner hardwarebeschleunigten Fähigkeiten zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações declarativas simples, como fade, slide e scale, e interações baseadas em gestos, como hover e toque, usando o tamanho mínimo do pacote do Motion Vue e as capacidades aceleradas por hardware.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать простые декларативные анимации, такие как затухание, скольжение и масштабирование, и жестовые взаимодействия, такие как наведение и касание, используя минимальный размер пакета Motion Vue и аппаратно ускоренные возможности.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة إعلانية بسيطة، مثل التلاشي والانزلاق والتكبير، وتفاعلات تعتمد على الإشارات مثل الحوفر والنقر، باستخدام الحزمة المصغرة من Motion Vue والقدرات المسرعة بالأجهزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating progressive reference for Motion Vue animations","Implementing gesture-based interactions for hover and tap events","Creating simple declarative animations for fade, slide, and scale effects"],"zh":["为Motion Vue动画生成进度参考","实现基于手势的交互，例如悬停和点击事件","创建简单的声明式动画，例如渐入、滑动和缩放效果"],"ja":["Motion Vueアニメーションの進度参照を生成する","ホーバーとタップイベントなどのジェスチャーベースのインタラクションを実装する","フェード、スライド、スケールなどのシンプルな宣言型アニメーションを作成する"],"ko":["Motion Vue 애니메이션을 위한 진행 참조를 생성하는 것","호버 및 탭 이벤트를 위한 제스처 기반 상호 작용을 구현하는 것","페이드, 슬라이드, 스케일 등의 간단한 선언적 애니메이션을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generar referencia progresiva para animaciones de Motion Vue","Implementar interacciones basadas en gestos para eventos de hover y tap","Crear animaciones declarativas simples para efectos de desvanecimiento, deslizamiento y escala"],"fr":["Générer une référence progressive pour les animations Motion Vue","Mettre en œuvre des interactions basées sur les gestes pour les événements de survol et de tap","Créer des animations déclaratives simples pour les effets de fondu, de défilement et de mise à l''échelle"],"de":["Erzeugen einer progressiven Referenz für Motion-Vue-Animationen","Implementieren von gestenbasierten Interaktionen für Hover- und Tap-Ereignisse","Erstellen einfacher deklarative Animationen für Fade-, Slide- und Scale-Effekte"],"pt":["Gerar referência progressiva para animações do Motion Vue","Implementar interações baseadas em gestos para eventos de hover e toque","Criar animações declarativas simples para efeitos de fade, slide e scale"],"ru":["Генерировать прогрессивную ссылку для анимаций Motion Vue","Реализовывать жестовые взаимодействия для событий наведения и касания","Создавать простые декларативные анимации для эффектов затухания, скольжения и масштабирования"],"ar":["إيجاد مرجع تقدمي لرسوم متحركة Motion Vue","تنفيذ التفاعلات المعتمدة على الإشارات للأحداث الحوفر والنقر","إنشاء رسوم متحركة إعلانية بسيطة لأffects التلاشي والانزلاق والتكبير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vue 3 or Nuxt","Limited to Motion Vue''s features and capabilities"],"zh":["需要Vue 3或Nuxt","仅限于Motion Vue的功能和能力"],"ja":["Vue 3またはNuxtが必要","Motion Vueの機能と能力に制限される"],"ko":["Vue 3 또는 Nuxt가 필요함","Motion Vue의 기능 및 능력에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere Vue 3 o Nuxt","Limitado a las características y capacidades de Motion Vue"],"fr":["Nécessite Vue 3 ou Nuxt","Limité aux fonctionnalités et capacités de Motion Vue"],"de":["Benötigt Vue 3 oder Nuxt","Begrenzt auf die Funktionen und Fähigkeiten von Motion Vue"],"pt":["Exige Vue 3 ou Nuxt","Limitado às funcionalidades e capacidades do Motion Vue"],"ru":["Требует Vue 3 или Nuxt","Ограничен функциональностью и возможностями Motion Vue"],"ar":["يتطلب Vue 3 أو Nuxt","محدود بالوظائف والقدرات المتوفرة في Motion Vue"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f0e7a7749a2eed534f115c551b6ff27c17c9f38c25689302b7032fe583e41a60","qualityScore":49}');
