"دعم عدة صيغ بيانات","تحليل البيانات الفعال","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","数据分析","机器学习","命令行工具","数据集"],"ja":["AIエージェント","データ分析","機器学習","コマンドラインツール","データセット"],"ko":["AI Agents","데이터 분석","기계 학습","명령줄 도구","데이터셋"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","cómo usar explore-dataset","alternativas a explore-dataset","instalación de explore-dataset","guía de configuración de explore-dataset","exploración de datos con Axiom","visualización de datos con AI","análisis de datos con herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","comment utiliser explore-dataset","alternatives à explore-dataset","installation d''explore-dataset","guide de configuration d''explore-dataset","exploration de données avec Axiom","visualisation de données avec l''IA","analyse de données avec des outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man explore-dataset verwendet","Alternativen zu explore-dataset","Installation von explore-dataset","Konfigurationsanleitung für explore-dataset","Erkundung von Daten mit Axiom","Visualisierung von Daten mit KI","Datenanalyse mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar o Axiom","o que é explore-dataset","ferramentas de IA para dados","alternativas ao Axiom","Axiom vs outras ferramentas","instalar o Axiom","configurar o Axiom","guias de desenvolvedores para o Axiom"],"ru":["как использовать Axiom","что такое исследование набора данных","инструменты ИИ для данных","альтернативы Axiom","Axiom vs другие инструменты","установить Axiom","настроить Axiom","руководства для разработчиков по Axiom"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Axiom","ما هو استكشاف مجموعة البيانات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبيانات","بديل Axiom","Axiom مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Axiom","تهيئة Axiom","دليل المطورين لأكسيوم"]}},"owner":"axiomhq","repo":"cli","repoPath":"axiomhq/cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.887Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"explore-dataset","description":"Explore an Axiom dataset to understand its schema, fields, volume, and patterns. Use when discovering a new dataset, investigating data structure, or understanding what data is available.","bodyPreview":"# Dataset Exploration\n\nSystematically explore an Axiom dataset to understand its structure, content, and potential use cases.\n\n## Arguments\n\nWhen invoked with a dataset name (e.g., `/explore-dataset logs`), the name is available as `$ARGUMENTS`.\n\n## Exploration Protocol\n\n### 1. List Available Datasets\n\nIf no dataset specified, list what''s available:\n\n```bash\naxiom dataset list -f json\n```\n\n### 2. Schema Discovery\n\n**Always start here.** Discover actual field names and types:\n\n```bash\naxiom query","body":"# Dataset Exploration\n\nSystematically explore an Axiom dataset to understand its structure, content, and potential use cases.\n\n## Arguments\n\nWhen invoked with a dataset name (e.g., `/explore-dataset logs`), the name is available as `$ARGUMENTS`.\n\n## Exploration Protocol\n\n### 1. List Available Datasets\n\nIf no dataset specified, list what''s available:\n\n```bash\naxiom dataset list -f json\n```\n\n### 2. Schema Discovery\n\n**Always start here.** Discover actual field names and types:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | getschema\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\nIdentify:\n- Field names and types\n- Dotted fields requiring bracket notation\n- Timestamp fields\n- Key dimensions (service, status, level)\n\n**OTel trace data:** If schema contains `trace_id`, `span_id`, `attributes.*`, note that:\n- Service fields are promoted: use `[''service.name'']` not `[''resource.service.name'']`\n- Custom attributes: `[''attributes.custom''][''field'']` with `tostring()` for aggregations\n- See `axiom-apl` skill''s [OTel reference](../axiom-apl/references/otel.md) for field mappings\n\n### 3. Sample Data\n\nExamine actual values:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | limit 10\" --start-time -1h -f json\n```\n\nLook for:\n- Data structure and relationships\n- Field value formats\n- Data quality issues\n\n### 4. Volume Analysis\n\nUnderstand data volume patterns:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | summarize count() by bin(_time, 1h) | sort by _time asc\" --start-time -24h\n```\n\nAnalyze:\n- Event volume over time\n- Data freshness\n- Collection gaps\n\n### 5. Categorical Field Analysis\n\nFor each key categorical field (status, level, service):\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | summarize count() by <field> | top 20 by count_\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\nIdentify:\n- Value distributions\n- Cardinality\n- Key dimensions for filtering\n\n### 6. Numerical Field Statistics\n\nFor numeric fields (duration, bytes, count):\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"[''<dataset>''] | summarize count(), min(<field>), max(<field>), avg(<field>), percentiles(<field>, 50, 95, 99)\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\n### 7. Error Pattern Detection\n\nSearch for error indicators:\n\n```bash\naxiom query \"search in ([''<dataset>'']) ''error'' or ''fail'' or ''exception'' | limit 20\" --start-time -1h\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide a summary including:\n\n```markdown\n## Dataset Summary: <name>\n\n### Purpose\n<What system generated this data, what it represents>\n\n### Key Fields\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| ... | ... | ... |\n\n### Volume\n- Events per hour: ~X\n- Data freshness: last event at X\n\n### Key Dimensions\n- `status`: 200, 400, 500, ...\n- `service.name`: api, web, worker, ...\n\n### Recommended Queries\n<Common queries for this dataset>\n\n### Monitoring Opportunities\n<What could be alerted on>\n```\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- **Known datasets**: If you already understand the schema, skip exploration and query directly\n- **Quick field check**: Use `getschema` directly for single field lookups\n- **Production queries**: Exploration uses expensive operations (`search`); extract patterns then optimize\n- **Repeated analysis**: Once explored, document findings and reuse—don''t re-explore\n\n## APL Reference\n\nFor query syntax, invoke the `axiom-apl` skill which provides comprehensive documentation on operators, functions, and patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:13.834Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced dataset exploration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据集探索功能的数据分析代理。","ja":"高度なデータセットの探索機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 데이터셋 탐색 기능이 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan capacidades de exploración de conjuntos de datos avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données nécessitant des capacités de découverte de jeux de données avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Dataset-Explorationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de exploração de conjuntos de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются продвинутые возможности изучения наборов данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لاستكشاف مجموعات البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically explore Axiom datasets, discovering their structure, content, and potential use cases through schema discovery and data analysis protocols.","zh":"赋予代理系统地探索Axiom数据集的能力，通过模式发现和数据分析协议发现其结构、内容和潜在的用例。","ja":"エージェントにAxiomデータセットを体系的に探索する能力を与え、スキーマの発見とデータ分析プロトコルを通じてその構造、コンテンツ、および潜在的なユースケースを発見する。","ko":"에이전트에게 Axiom 데이터셋을 체계적으로 탐색할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 스키마 발견 및 데이터 분석 프로토콜을 통해 구조, 내용 및 잠재적인 사용 사례를 발견합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a explorar sistemáticamente los conjuntos de datos de Axiom, descubriendo su estructura, contenido y posibles casos de uso a través de protocolos de descubrimiento de esquemas y análisis de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer systématiquement les jeux de données Axiom, en découvrant leur structure, leur contenu et leurs cas d''utilisation potentiels via des protocoles de découverte de schémas et d''analyse de données.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Axiom-Datensätze systematisch zu erkunden, ihre Struktur, ihren Inhalt und potenzielle Anwendungsfälle durch Schemen-Entdeckungs- und Datenanalyse-Protokolle zu entdecken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorar systematicamente os conjuntos de dados do Axiom, descobrindo sua estrutura, conteúdo e casos de uso potenciais por meio da descoberta de esquema e protocolos de análise de dados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически исследовать наборы данных Axiom, открывая их структуру, содержание и потенциальные случаи использования посредством открытия схемы и протоколов анализа данных.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استكشاف مجموعات بيانات Axiom بشكل منهجي، واكتشاف هيكلها ومحتواها والحالات الاستخدامية المحتملة من خلال اكتشاف مخطط والبروتوكولات لتحليل البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating dataset discovery","Generating schema documentation","Debugging data inconsistencies"],"zh":["自动化数据集发现","生成模式文档","调试数据不一致性"],"ja":["データセットの自動化された発見","スキーマ文書の生成","データの不一致のデバッグ"],"ko":["데이터셋 자동 발견","스키마 문서 생성","데이터 불일치 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la descubierta de conjuntos de datos","Generación de documentación de esquemas","Depuración de inconsistencias de datos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la découverte de jeux de données","Génération de documentation de schémas","Débogage des incohérences de données"],"de":["Automatisierung der Datensatz-Entdeckung","Generierung von Schemadokumentation","Fehlerbehebung von Dateninkonsistenzen"],"pt":["Automizar a descoberta de conjuntos de dados","Gerar documentação de esquema","Depurar inconsistências de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать открытие наборов данных","Генерировать документацию схемы","Отладить несоответствия данных"],"ar":["أتمتة اكتشاف مجموعات البيانات","توليد مستندات مخطط","تصحيح أخطاء البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Axiom dataset access","Limited to Axiom dataset exploration protocol"],"zh":["需要Axiom数据集访问","仅限Axiom数据集探索协议"],"ja":["Axiomデータセットへのアクセスが必要","Axiomデータセットの探索プロトコルに限定"],"ko":["Axiom 데이터셋 액세스가 필요함","Axiom 데이터셋 탐색 프로토콜로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al conjunto de datos de Axiom","Limitado al protocolo de exploración de conjuntos de datos de Axiom"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au jeu de données Axiom","Limité au protocole d''exploration de jeux de données Axiom"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Axiom-Datensatz","Begrenzt auf das Axiom-Datensatz-Explorationsprotokoll"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao conjunto de dados do Axiom","Limitado ao protocolo de exploração de conjuntos de dados do Axiom"],"ru":["Требует доступа к набору данных Axiom","Ограничен протоколом исследования наборов данных Axiom"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مجموعة بيانات Axiom","محدود ببروتوكول استكشاف مجموعة بيانات Axiom"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4eb974798cc51093529b441a992fc5bdc1bca12cd733a850ca899afe76d040e8","qualityScore":49}');
