 flux de travail de développement","Compatibilité avec différents formats de fichier"],"de":["Programmierung von Ballsaal-Tanz-Veranstaltungen","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Zeitplänen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Optimierung des Programmier-Workflows","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Dateiformaten"],"pt":["Agendamento de eventos de dança de salão","Gerenciamento de horários e datas","Integração com calendários de desenvolvedores","Notificações e lembretes personalizados","Relatórios e estatísticas de eventos"],"ru":["Расписание шоу бального танца","Управление датами и временем","Интеграция с календарями разработчиков","Настройка уведомлений и напоминаний","Отчеты и статистика мероприятий"],"ar":["جدولة فعاليات رقص الصالة","إدارة التواريخ والأوقات","التكامل مع تقويمات المطورين","إعدادات الإخطارات والتذكيرات المخصصة","التقارير والإحصائيات الفعالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用compare-erb-js","什么是AI智能工具","compare-erb-js替代品","compare-erb-js教程","舞蹈展示排程软件","AI智能工具安装","compare-erb-js设置指南"],"ja":["compare-erb-jsの使い方","AIエージェントとは","compare-erb-jsの代替","compare-erb-jsチュートリアル","バルルームダンスショーケーススケジューラー","AIエージェントのインストール","compare-erb-js設定ガイド"],"ko":["compare-erb-js 사용법","AI 에이전트란","compare-erb-js 대체","compare-erb-js 튜토리얼","볼룸 댄스 쇼케이스 스케줄러","AI 에이전트 설치","compare-erb-js 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de programación para desarrolladores","programación de baile de salón","creación de horarios","optimización del flujo de trabajo","compare-erb-js vs otros herramientas","cómo usar compare-erb-js","instalación de compare-erb-js","guía de configuración de compare-erb-js"],"fr":["outils de programmation pour les développeurs","programmation de danse de salon","création de calendriers","optimisation du flux de travail","compare-erb-js vs autres outils","comment utiliser compare-erb-js","installation de compare-erb-js","guide de configuration de compare-erb-js"],"de":["Programmier-Tools für Entwickler","Programmierung von Ballsaal-Tanz-Veranstaltungen","Erstellung von Zeitplänen","Optimierung des Programmier-Workflows","compare-erb-js vs andere Tools","wie man compare-erb-js verwendet","Installation von compare-erb-js","Konfigurationsanleitung für compare-erb-js"],"pt":["como usar agente de comparação erb js","o que é agente de comparação erb js","agente de comparação erb js alternativa","agente de comparação erb js vs outros","instalar agente de comparação erb js","guia de configuração do agente de comparação erb js"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент compare-erb-js","что такое ИИ Агент compare-erb-js","ИИ Агент compare-erb-js альтернатива","ИИ Агент compare-erb-js vs другие","установить ИИ Агент compare-erb-js","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента compare-erb-js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام عامل مقارنة إرب جافا سكريبت","ما هو عامل مقارنة إرب جافا سكريبت","عامل مقارنة إرب جافا سكريبت بديل","عامل مقارنة إرب جافا سكريبت مقابل أخر","تثبيت عامل مقارنة إرب جافا سكريبت","دليل إعداد عامل مقارنة إرب جافا سكريبت"]}},"owner":"rubys","repo":"showcase","repoPath":"rubys/showcase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"compare-erb-js","description":"Compare ERB and JavaScript template outputs for the offline scoring SPA. Use when working on ERB-to-JS conversion, debugging template parity issues, or verifying that changes to scoring views work correctly in both ERB and SPA modes.","bodyPreview":"# Compare ERB vs JavaScript Template Output\n\nUse `scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb` to verify that ERB templates and their JavaScript-converted equivalents produce matching output. This is essential for the offline scoring SPA which uses auto-converted ERB templates.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# Compare heat list\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83\n\n# Compare individual heat\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3","body":"# Compare ERB vs JavaScript Template Output\n\nUse `scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb` to verify that ERB templates and their JavaScript-converted equivalents produce matching output. This is essential for the offline scoring SPA which uses auto-converted ERB templates.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n```bash\n# Compare heat list\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83\n\n# Compare individual heat\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83 1\n\n# With style parameter\nbundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb db/2025-barcelona-november.sqlite3 83 1 radio\n```\n\nOr using environment variable:\n```bash\nRAILS_APP_DB=2025-barcelona-november bundle exec ruby scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb 83 1\n```\n\n## What It Does\n\n1. Renders the ERB template via Rails routing (extracts `<main>` content)\n2. Fetches converted JavaScript templates from `/templates/scoring.js`\n3. Fetches normalized data from `/scores/:judge/heats/data`\n4. Hydrates the data using `heat_hydrator.js` (for individual heats)\n5. Renders using the JavaScript template\n6. Compares row counts and saves both outputs for diff analysis\n\n## Output Files\n\nAll files are saved to `/tmp/` for analysis:\n\n- `/tmp/erb_rendered.html` - ERB template output (main content only)\n- `/tmp/js_rendered.html` - JavaScript template output\n- `/tmp/scoring_templates.js` - Converted templates from `/templates/scoring.js`\n- `/tmp/heats_data.json` - Raw normalized data from server\n- `/tmp/js_template_data.json` - Hydrated data passed to JS template\n\n## Analyzing Differences\n\n```bash\n# Quick diff\ndiff /tmp/erb_rendered.html /tmp/js_rendered.html\n\n# Side-by-side comparison\ndiff -y /tmp/erb_rendered.html /tmp/js_rendered.html | less\n\n# Compare specific attributes\ndiff <(grep -o ''href=\"[^\"]*\"'' /tmp/erb_rendered.html | sort) \\\n     <(grep -o ''href=\"[^\"]*\"'' /tmp/js_rendered.html | sort)\n```\n\n## Common Differences\n\nSome differences are expected due to ERB-to-JS conversion limitations:\n\n- **HTML entity encoding**: ERB uses `&quot;` while JS uses `\"`\n- **link_to blocks**: Block form of `link_to` may render differently\n- **Whitespace**: Minor whitespace differences are normal\n\n## Architecture\n\nThis tool supports the \"Server computes, hydration joins, templates filter\" principle:\n\n- **Server**: Computes derived values and paths (respects RAILS_APP_SCOPE)\n- **Hydration**: `heat_hydrator.js` joins normalized data by resolving IDs\n- **Templates**: ERB and JS templates filter/format data identically\n\n## Key Source Files\n\n### Server-side (Rails)\n\n- `app/controllers/scores_controller.rb`\n  - `heats_data` action: Returns normalized JSON data for SPA\n  - `heat` action: Sets instance variables for ERB templates\n  - Computes `paths:` hash with server-computed URLs\n\n- `app/controllers/templates_controller.rb`\n  - `scoring` action: Converts ERB templates to JavaScript on-the-fly\n  - Defines path helper stubs for JS templates\n  - Uses `ErbPrismConverter` for conversion\n\n- `lib/erb_prism_converter.rb`\n  - Converts ERB templates to JavaScript functions using Ruby''s Prism parser\n  - Handles Ruby-to-JS translation (loops, conditionals, method calls)\n\n### Client-side (JavaScript)\n\n- `app/javascript/lib/heat_hydrator.js`\n  - `buildLookupTables()`: Creates Maps for O(1) entity lookup\n  - `hydrateHeat()`: Resolves IDs to full objects\n  - `buildHeatTemplateData()`: Prepares complete data for templates\n\n- `app/javascript/controllers/heat_app_controller.js`\n  - Main Stimulus controller for the offline scoring SPA\n  - Loads templates and data, handles navigation\n  - Manages offline/online state transitions\n\n### ERB Templates (source of truth)\n\n- `app/views/scores/heat.html.erb` - Main heat view\n- `app/views/scores/heatlist.html.erb` - Heat list view\n- `app/views/scores/_heat_header.html.erb` - Heat header partial\n- `app/views/scores/_info_box.html.erb` - Info box with feedback errors\n- `app/views/scores/_navigation_footer.html.erb` - Prev/next navigation\n- `app/views/scores/_table_heat.html.erb` - Standard heat table\n- `app/views/scores/_rank_heat.html.erb` - Finals ranking view\n- `app/views/scores/_solo_heat.html.erb` - Solo heat view\n- `app/views/scores/_cards_heat.html.erb` - Card-based scoring view\n\n### Scripts\n\n- `scripts/render_erb_and_js.rb` - This comparison tool\n- `scripts/hydrate_heats.mjs` - Node.js script for hydrating data (used by comparison tool)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:36.973Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing to verify ERB and JavaScript template output consistency.","zh":"适用于需要验证ERB和JavaScript模板输出一致性的全栈代理。","ja":"ERBとJavaScriptテンプレートの出力の一貫性を確認する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"ERB와 JavaScript 템플릿의 출력 일관성을 확인해야 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan verificar la coherencia de la salida de plantillas ERB y JavaScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de vérifier la cohérence de la sortie des modèles ERB et JavaScript.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die die Konsistenz der Ausgabe von ERB- und JavaScript-Vorlagen überprüfen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam verificar a consistência da saída de modelos ERB e JavaScript.","ru":"Идеально для полнофункциональных агентов, которым необходимо проверять последовательность вывода шаблонов ERB и JavaScript.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الكامل التي تحتاج إلى التحقق من توافق الإخراج النموذجي ERB و JavaScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure matching output between ERB templates and their JavaScript-converted equivalents, leveraging Ruby scripts like render_erb_and_js.rb, and utilizing SQLite databases for data storage, facilitating offline scoring SPA development with auto-converted ERB templates.","zh":"赋予代理人确保ERB模板和其JavaScript转换等价物之间的输出匹配的能力，利用Ruby脚本（如render_erb_and_js.rb），并利用SQLite数据库进行数据存储，从而实现离线评分SPA开发与自动转换的ERB模板。","ja":"ERBテンプレートとそのJavaScriptに変換された等価物の間の出力のマッチングを保証する能力をエージェントに与え、Rubyスクリプト（例：render_erb_and_js.rb）を利用し、SQLiteデータベースを使用してデータを保存し、オフラインでのスコアリングSPA開発と自動変換されたERBテンプレートを容易にします。","ko":"ERB 템플릿과 해당 JavaScript로 변환된 동일한 항목 사이의 출력 일치성을 보장할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하며, Ruby 스크립트(예: render_erb_and_js.rb)를 활용하고 SQLite 데이터베이스를 사용하여 데이터를 저장하여 오프라인 스코어링 SPA 개발과 자동 변환된 ERB 템플릿을 쉽게 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para garantizar una salida coincidente entre plantillas ERB y sus equivalentes convertidos a JavaScript, aprovechando scripts de Ruby como render_erb_and_js.rb, y utilizando bases de datos SQLite para el almacenamiento de datos, facilitando el desarrollo de aplicaciones SPA de puntuación offline con plantillas ERB autoconvertidas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''assurer d''une sortie correspondante entre les modèles ERB et leurs équivalents convertis en JavaScript, en exploitant des scripts Ruby tels que render_erb_and_js.rb, et en utilisant des bases de données SQLite pour le stockage des données, facilitant ainsi le développement d''applications SPA de notation hors ligne avec des modèles ERB auto-convertis.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine übereinstimmende Ausgabe zwischen ERB-Vorlagen und ihren in JavaScript konvertierten Äquivalenten sicherzustellen, indem Ruby-Skripte wie render_erb_and_js.rb genutzt und SQLite-Datenbanken für die Datenspeicherung verwendet werden, wodurch die Entwicklung von Offline-Scoring-SPAs mit auto-konvertierten ERB-Vorlagen erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a saída correspondente entre os modelos ERB e seus equivalentes convertidos para JavaScript, utilizando scripts Ruby como render_erb_and_js.rb e utilizando bancos de dados SQLite para armazenamento de dados, facilitando o desenvolvimento de SPA offline com modelos ERB autoconvertidos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соответствующий вывод между шаблонами ERB и их эквивалентами, преобразованными в JavaScript, используя Ruby-скрипты, такие как render_erb_and_js.rb, и использует базы данных SQLite для хранения данных, что облегчает разработку автономных SPA с автоматически преобразованными шаблонами ERB.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ضمان الإخراج المطابق بين قوالب ERB والمعادلات المكافئة المحولة إلى JavaScript، باستخدام سكريبتات Ruby مثل render_erb_and_js.rb، واستخدام قواعد بيانات SQLite لتخزين البيانات، مما يسهل تطوير تطبيقات الويب الفرعية بدون اتصال مع قوالب ERB المحولة تلقائيًا."},"useCases":{"en":["Comparing heat lists for consistency","Verifying individual heat output accuracy","Debugging ERB to JavaScript template conversion issues"],"zh":["比较一致性热表列表","验证个别热输出准确性","调试ERB到JavaScript模板转换问题"],"ja":["一貫性のあるヒートリストを比較する","個々のヒート出力の精度を確認する","ERBからJavaScriptテンプレートへの変換の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["일관성 있는 히트 목록을 비교하는 것","개별 히트 출력의 정확성을 검증하는 것","ERB에서 JavaScript 템플릿으로의 변환 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Comparar listas de calor para la coherencia","Verificar la precisión de la salida de calor individual","Depurar problemas de conversión de plantillas ERB a JavaScript"],"fr":["Comparer des listes de chaleur pour la cohérence","Vérifier la précision de la sortie de chaleur individuelle","Déboguer les problèmes de conversion de modèles ERB en JavaScript"],"de":["Vergleichen von Hitzelisten für Konsistenz","Überprüfen der Genauigkeit der Ausgabe von einzelnen Heats","Fehlerbehebung bei der Konvertierung von ERB-Vorlagen in JavaScript"],"pt":["Comparar listas de calor para consistência","Verificar a precisão da saída de calor individual","Depurar problemas de conversão de modelos ERB para JavaScript"],"ru":["Сравнивание списков тепла для последовательности","Проверка точности отдельного теплового вывода","Отладка проблем преобразования шаблонов ERB в JavaScript"],"ar":["مقارنة قوائم الحرارة للتطابق","التحقق من دقة الإخراج الحراري الفردي","تصحيح أخطاء تحويل قوالب ERB إلى JavaScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby environment with bundle exec capabilities","SQLite database access needed","ERB and JavaScript template compatibility required"],"zh":["需要具有bundle exec能力的Ruby环境","需要SQLite数据库访问","需要ERB和JavaScript模板兼容性"],"ja":["バンドルexec能力を持つRuby環境が必要","SQLiteデータベースへのアクセスが必要","ERBとJavaScriptテンプレートの互換性が必要"],"ko":["번들 실행 기능을 갖춘 Ruby 환경이 필요합니다","SQLite 데이터베이스 액세스가 필요합니다","ERB 및 JavaScript 템플릿 호환성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno Ruby con capacidades de bundle exec","Se necesita acceso a la base de datos SQLite","Se requiere compatibilidad entre plantillas ERB y JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Ruby avec des capacités d''exécution de bundle","L''accès à la base de données SQLite est nécessaire","La compatibilité entre les modèles ERB et JavaScript est requise"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby-Umgebung mit Bundle-Exec-Fähigkeiten","Zugriff auf SQLite-Datenbank erforderlich","Kompatibilität zwischen ERB- und JavaScript-Vorlagen erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Ruby com capacidades de bundle exec","Acesso ao banco de dados SQLite necessário","Compatibilidade de modelos ERB e JavaScript necessária"],"ru":["Требуется среда Ruby с возможностями bundle exec","Необходим доступ к базе данных SQLite","Требуется совместимость шаблонов ERB и JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Ruby مع إمكانيات تشغيل حزمة","مطلوب الوصول إلى قاعدة بيانات SQLite","مطلوبة توافقية قوالب ERB و JavaScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c19b9eebb9f8e3dd2b1d7a23e404d1f7c4cdc0939c71b68961722c3ce0b940ce","qualityScore":49}');
