, una interfaz de usuario y documentación para desarrolladores","fr":"kagenti:deploy est un référentiel principal qui comprend un installateur, une interface utilisateur et une documentation pour les développeurs","de":"kagenti:deploy ist ein Hauptrepository, das einen Installer, eine Benutzeroberfläche und Dokumentation für Entwickler enthält","pt":"kagenti:deploy é uma ferramenta de IA que fornece instalação, interface do usuário e documentação","ru":"kagenti:deploy - это инструмент ИИ, обеспечивающий установку, интерфейс пользователя и документацию","ar":"kagenti:deploy هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي توفر التركيب وواجهة المستخدم والتوثيق","en":"Main Kagenti repo - installer, UI and docs"},"definition":{"en":"Main Kagenti repo - installer, UI and docs"},"features":{"zh":["支持AI代理的安装和管理","提供用户友好的UI","包含详细的文档","支持多种部署方式","提供实时监控和日志管理"],"ja":["AIエージェントのインストールと管理をサポート","ユーザーに優しいUIを提供","詳細なドキュメントを含む","複数のデプロイ方法をサポート","リアルタイム監視とログ管理を提供"],"ko":["AI 에이전트의 설치 및 관리를 지원","사용자 친화적인 UI를 제공","상세한 문서를 포함","다양한 배포 방법을 지원","실시간 모니터링 및 로그 관리를 제공"],"es":["Instalador automatizado","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva","Documentación completa","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Installateur automatique","Interface utilisateur intuitive","Documentation complète","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Automatischer Installer","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche","Umfassende Dokumentation","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Instalação automática","Interface do usuário intuitiva","Documentação detalhada","Suporte a React e Node.js","CLI para controle de versões"],"ru":["Автоматическая установка","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя","Детальная документация","Поддержка React и Node.js","CLI для контроля версий"],"ar":["تركيب آلي","واجهة مستخدم直观","توثيق مفصل","دعم ل React و Node.js","CLI للتحكم في الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kagenti安装","AI工具安装","AI代理管理","Kagenti教程","AI工具教程","Kagenti vs 其他AI工具","如何使用Kagenti","Kagenti文档","AI代理安装"],"ja":["Kagentiインストール","AIツールのインストール","AIエージェントの管理","Kagentiチュートリアル","AIツールチュートリアル","Kagenti vs 他のAIツール","Kagentiの使い方","Kagentiドキュメント","AIエージェントのインストール"],"ko":["Kagenti 설치","AI 도구 설치","AI 에이전트 관리","Kagenti 튜토리얼","AI 도구 튜토리얼","Kagenti vs 다른 AI 도구","Kagenti 사용법","Kagenti 문서","AI 에이전트 설치"],"es":["herramientas de AI","kagenti:deploy","instalador de aplicaciones","interfaz de usuario","documentación de desarrollo","cómo usar kagenti:deploy","alternativas a kagenti:deploy","kagenti:deploy vs otros herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","kagenti:deploy","installateur d''applications","interface utilisateur","documentation de développement","comment utiliser kagenti:deploy","alternatives à kagenti:deploy","kagenti:deploy vs autres outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","kagenti:deploy","Anwendungs-Installer","Benutzeroberfläche","Entwickler-Dokumentation","wie man kagenti:deploy verwendet","Alternativen zu kagenti:deploy","kagenti:deploy vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar kagenti:deploy","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","kagenti:deploy alternative","kagenti:deploy vs outros","guia de instalação kagenti:deploy","configuração kagenti:deploy"],"ru":["как использовать kagenti:deploy","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","kagenti:deploy альтернатива","kagenti:deploy vs другие","руководство по установке kagenti:deploy","настройка kagenti:deploy"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام kagenti:deploy","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل kagenti:deploy","kagenti:deploy مقابل غيره","دليل تركيب kagenti:deploy","إعداد kagenti:deploy"]}},"owner":"kagenti","repo":"kagenti","repoPath":"kagenti/kagenti","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.895Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kagenti:deploy","description":"Deploy or redeploy the Kagenti Kind cluster using the Python installer - quick redeploy, manual steps, and troubleshooting","bodyPreview":"# Deploy Cluster Skill\n\nThis skill guides you through deploying or redeploying the Kagenti Kind cluster using the Python installer.\n\n## Context-Safe Execution (MANDATORY)\n\n**Deploy scripts produce hundreds of lines.** Always redirect to files:\n\n```bash\nexport LOG_DIR=/tmp/kagenti/deploy/$(basename $(git rev-parse --show-toplevel))\nmkdir -p $LOG_DIR\n\n# Pattern: redirect deploy output\n./.github/scripts/local-setup/kind-full-test.sh ... > $LOG_DIR/deploy.log 2>&1; echo \"EXIT:$?\"\n# On failure: Task(","body":"# Deploy Cluster Skill\n\nThis skill guides you through deploying or redeploying the Kagenti Kind cluster using the Python installer.\n\n## Context-Safe Execution (MANDATORY)\n\n**Deploy scripts produce hundreds of lines.** Always redirect to files:\n\n```bash\nexport LOG_DIR=/tmp/kagenti/deploy/$(basename $(git rev-parse --show-toplevel))\nmkdir -p $LOG_DIR\n\n# Pattern: redirect deploy output\n./.github/scripts/local-setup/kind-full-test.sh ... > $LOG_DIR/deploy.log 2>&1; echo \"EXIT:$?\"\n# On failure: Task(subagent_type=''Explore'') with Grep to find errors\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Setting up new local development cluster\n- Full cluster redeploy after major changes\n- Cluster is corrupted or unstable\n- Testing clean deployment\n- Running E2E tests locally\n\n## Resource Requirements\n\n**Minimum** (from CLAUDE.md):\n- 12GB RAM\n- 4 CPU cores\n- Docker Desktop, Rancher Desktop, or Podman\n\n**Recommended for development**:\n- 16GB RAM\n- 6 CPU cores\n- 50GB free disk space\n\n## Multiple Clusters\n\nYou can run multiple Kind clusters:\n- **agent-platform** - Created by kagenti-installer (default)\n- **kagenti-demo** - Your existing cluster\n- Each cluster runs independently with its own name\n\nCheck existing clusters:\n```bash\nkind get clusters\n```\n\n## Quick Redeploy (Full Installation)\n\n```bash\n# 1. Setup environment (first time only)\ncp kagenti/installer/app/.env_template kagenti/installer/app/.env\n# Edit .env with:\n# - GITHUB_USER=<your-github-username>\n# - GITHUB_TOKEN=<ghcr.io-token>\n# - OPENAI_API_KEY=<openai-key>\n# - AGENT_NAMESPACES=team1,team2\n\n# 2. Full redeploy (creates new cluster + installs everything)\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer\n\n# What it does (15-25 minutes):\n# ✓ Creates Kind cluster \"agent-platform\"\n# ✓ Installs registry (optional)\n# ✓ Installs Tekton Pipelines\n# ✓ Installs Cert-Manager\n# ✓ Installs Platform Operator\n# ✓ Installs Istio Ambient\n# ✓ Installs Gateway API\n# ✓ Installs SPIRE\n# ✓ Installs MCP Gateway\n# ✓ Installs Keycloak + PostgreSQL\n# ✓ Installs Addons (Prometheus, Kiali, Phoenix)\n# ✓ Installs UI\n# ✓ Installs ToolHive\n# ✓ Creates agent namespaces (team1, team2)\n```\n\n## Use Existing Cluster\n\n```bash\n# Install on already running Kind cluster\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer --use-existing-cluster\n```\n\n## Cleanup and Fresh Install\n\n```bash\n# 1. Delete existing cluster\nkind delete cluster --name agent-platform\n\n# 2. Clean Docker images (optional)\ndocker system prune -a\n\n# 3. Fresh install\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer\n```\n\n## Selective Component Installation\n\nSkip components you don''t need for faster deployment:\n\n```bash\n# Minimal install (no UI, no observability, no auth)\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer \\\n  --skip-install ui \\\n  --skip-install addons \\\n  --skip-install keycloak \\\n  --skip-install spire\n\n# Skip specific components\nuv run kagenti-installer \\\n  --skip-install tekton \\\n  --skip-install operator \\\n  --skip-install gateway \\\n  --skip-install mcp_gateway\n\n# Install only core platform (for testing)\nuv run kagenti-installer \\\n  --skip-install addons \\\n  --skip-install ui \\\n  --skip-install keycloak \\\n  --skip-install agents\n```\n\n**Available components to skip**:\n- `registry` - Internal container registry\n- `tekton` - Tekton Pipelines (build system)\n- `cert_manager` - Certificate management\n- `operator` - Platform Operator (deprecated, being replaced by kagenti-operator)\n- `istio` - Service mesh\n- `gateway` - Kubernetes Gateway API\n- `spire` - Workload identity\n- `mcp_gateway` - MCP Gateway\n- `addons` - Observability (Prometheus, Kiali, Phoenix)\n- `ui` - Kagenti UI\n- `keycloak` - Authentication\n- `agents` - Demo agents\n- `metrics_server` - Metrics server\n- `inspector` - MCP inspector\n- `toolhive` - ToolHive operator\n\n## Deploy Weather Agents (Demo)\n\n```bash\n# After platform is installed\nkubectl apply -f kagenti/examples/components/\n```\n\nThis creates:\n- **weather-tool** in team1 namespace\n- **weather-service** in team1 namespace\n\n## Check Deployment Health\n\n### Quick Health Check\n\n```bash\n# Run the health check script (from CI)\nchmod +x .github/scripts/verify_deployment.sh\n.github/scripts/verify_deployment.sh\n\n# What it checks:\n# ✓ Resource usage (RAM, disk, CPU, containers)\n# ✓ Deployment status (weather-tool, weather-service, keycloak, operator)\n# ✓ Pod health summary (total, running, pending, failed, crashloop)\n# ✓ Failed pod details (events, error logs)\n```\n\n### Manual Health Checks\n\n```bash\n# All pods\nkubectl get pods -A\n\n# Failed pods only\nkubectl get pods -A --field-selector=status.phase!=Running,status.phase!=Succeeded\n\n# Specific namespace\nkubectl get pods -n team1\nkubectl get pods -n keycloak\nkubectl get pods -n kagenti-system\n\n# Deployments\nkubectl get deployments -A\n\n# Services\nkubectl get svc -A\n```\n\n## Run E2E Tests Locally\n\nAfter platform is deployed:\n\n```bash\ncd kagenti\n\n# Install test dependencies\nuv pip install -r tests/requirements.txt\n\n# Run all deployment health tests\nuv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py -v\n\n# Run only critical tests\nuv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py -v --only-critical\n\n# Run specific test\nuv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py::TestWeatherToolDeployment::test_weather_tool_deployment_ready -v\n\n# Exclude Keycloak tests\nuv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py -v --exclude-app=keycloak\n\n# Increase timeout\nuv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py -v --app-timeout=600\n```\n\n## Run Full CI Workflow Locally\n\nSimulate what runs in CI:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Install platform\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer --silent\n\n# 2. Deploy weather agents\ncd ../..\nkubectl apply -f kagenti/examples/components/\n\n# 3. Wait for deployments\nkubectl wait --for=condition=available --timeout=300s deployment/weather-tool -n team1\nkubectl wait --for=condition=available --timeout=300s deployment/weather-service -n team1\n\n# 4. Run health check\nchmod +x .github/scripts/verify_deployment.sh\n.github/scripts/verify_deployment.sh\n\n# 5. Run E2E tests\ncd kagenti\nuv pip install -r tests/requirements.txt\nuv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py -v \\\n  --timeout=300 \\\n  --tb=short\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting Deployment\n\n### Issue: Installer Timeout or Slow\n\n```bash\n# Check Docker resource allocation\ndocker info | grep -E \"CPUs|Total Memory\"\n\n# Increase timeout (images can be slow to pull)\n# The installer will retry - just re-run:\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer --use-existing-cluster\n```\n\n### Issue: \"Error loading config file\" or kubectl errors\n\n```bash\n# Check kubeconfig\nkubectl config current-context\n\n# Should show: kind-agent-platform\n\n# If not, set context\nkubectl config use-context kind-agent-platform\n```\n\n### Issue: Pods stuck in ImagePullBackOff\n\n```bash\n# Check if images are available in Kind\ndocker exec agent-platform-control-plane crictl images\n\n# Reload images (for custom builds)\nkind load docker-image <image-name> --name agent-platform\n\n# Check pod description for error\nkubectl describe pod <pod-name> -n <namespace>\n```\n\n### Issue: Keycloak Connection Issues\n\n```bash\n# Restart Keycloak\nkubectl delete -n keycloak -f kagenti/installer/app/resources/keycloak.yaml\nkubectl apply -n keycloak -f kagenti/installer/app/resources/keycloak.yaml\n\n# Restart Istio ztunnel\nkubectl rollout restart daemonset -n istio-system ztunnel\n\n# Restart Gateway\nkubectl rollout restart -n kagenti-system deployment http-istio\n```\n\n### Issue: Need to Update Secrets\n\n```bash\n# Update GitHub token\nkubectl -n <namespace> delete secret github-token-secret\n\n# Re-run installer to recreate secrets\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer --use-existing-cluster\n```\n\n### Issue: Blank UI on macOS\n\n```bash\n# Disable Screen Time Content & Privacy Restrictions\n# System Settings > Screen Time > Content & Privacy\n```\n\n### Issue: GitHub Token Errors\n\n```bash\n# Ensure token has correct scopes:\n# - repo:all\n# - write:packages\n# - read:packages\n\n# Clear cached credentials\ndocker logout ghcr.io\n```\n\n## Access Platform Services\n\nAfter deployment, access these services:\n\n```bash\n# Kagenti UI\nopen http://kagenti-ui.localtest.me:8080\n\n# Keycloak Admin Console\nopen http://keycloak.localtest.me:8080\n# Username: admin\n# Password: (from Keycloak secret)\nkubectl get secret -n keycloak keycloak-initial-admin -o jsonpath=''{.data.password}'' | base64 -d\n\n# Prometheus (if addons installed)\nkubectl port-forward -n observability svc/prometheus 9090:9090\nopen http://localhost:9090\n\n# Grafana (if addons installed)\nkubectl port-forward -n observability svc/grafana 3000:3000\nopen http://localhost:3000\n\n# Kiali (if addons installed)\nkubectl port-forward -n kiali svc/kiali 20001:20001\nopen http://localhost:20001\n```\n\n## Platform Configuration\n\n### Environment Variables (.env file)\n\nRequired in `kagenti/installer/app/.env`:\n\n```bash\n# GitHub access for ghcr.io\nGITHUB_USER=your-username\nGITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxx  # Classic token with repo:all, write:packages, read:packages\n\n# OpenAI API (for agents)\nOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxx\n\n# Agent namespaces\nAGENT_NAMESPACES=team1,team2\n\n# Optional: Slack (for Slack tool demo)\nSLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-xxx\n```\n\n### Cluster Configuration\n\nEdit `kagenti/installer/app/config.py`:\n\n```python\nCLUSTER_NAME = \"agent-platform\"  # Kind cluster name\nDOMAIN_NAME = \"localtest.me\"     # Domain for services\nCONTAINER_ENGINE = \"docker\"      # or \"podman\"\n```\n\n## Manual Step-by-Step Deployment (Advanced)\n\nFor debugging or understanding the installer:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create Kind cluster manually\ncat <<EOF | kind create cluster --name agent-platform --config=-\nkind: Cluster\napiVersion: kind.x-k8s.io/v1alpha4\nnodes:\n- role: control-plane\n  extraPortMappings:\n  - containerPort: 30080\n    hostPort: 8080\n  - containerPort: 30443\n    hostPort: 9443\nEOF\n\n# 2. Set kubeconfig context\nkubectl config use-context kind-agent-platform\n\n# 3. Install components one by one\ncd kagenti/installer\n\n# Install Tekton\nkubectl apply -f https://storage.googleapis.com/tekton-releases/pipeline/previous/v0.66.0/release.yaml\n\n# Install Cert-Manager\nkubectl apply -f https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager/releases/download/v1.16.2/cert-manager.yaml\n\n# ... (see installer code for full sequence)\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **k8s:health**: Check comprehensive platform health\n- **k8s:logs**: Query logs for debugging\n- **k8s:pods**: Debug pod issues\n\n## Pro Tips\n\n1. **Use --use-existing-cluster**: Faster reinstalls without recreating cluster\n2. **Skip components**: Use --skip-install for faster iteration\n3. **Multiple clusters**: Use different cluster names for parallel testing\n4. **Resource allocation**: Ensure Docker/Podman has enough RAM (16GB recommended)\n5. **Cache images**: Pulled images are cached - subsequent installs are faster\n6. **Silent mode**: Use --silent to skip interactive prompts\n7. **Check logs**: If installer fails, check pod logs in kagenti-system namespace\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Daily Development\n```bash\n# Use existing cluster, skip slow components\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer --use-existing-cluster \\\n  --skip-install addons \\\n  --skip-install keycloak\n```\n\n### Full Test Before PR\n```bash\n# Fresh cluster, all components, run tests\nkind delete cluster --name agent-platform\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer --silent\nkubectl apply -f kagenti/examples/components/\n.github/scripts/verify_deployment.sh\ncd kagenti && uv run pytest tests/e2e/test_deployment_health.py -v\n```\n\n### Quick Agent Testing\n```bash\n# Minimal platform, just enough for agents\ncd kagenti/installer\nuv run kagenti-installer \\\n  --skip-install addons \\\n  --skip-install ui \\\n  --skip-install keycloak\nkubectl apply -f kagenti/examples/components/\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:39.842Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cluster Management Agents needing automated Kind cluster deployment and management using Python installers.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python安装程序自动部署和管理Kind集群的集群管理代理。","ja":"Pythonインストーラーを使用してKindクラスターを自動的にデプロイおよび管理するクラスター管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 설치 프로그램을 사용하여 Kind 클러스터를 자동으로 배포 및 관리하는 클러스터 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de administración de clúster que necesitan despliegue y administración de clústeres Kind automatizados utilizando instaladores de Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de cluster nécessitant un déploiement et une gestion automatisés de cluster Kind à l''aide d''installateurs Python.","de":"Perfekt für Cluster-Management-Agents, die ein automatisiertes Kind-Cluster-Deployment und -Management mithilfe von Python-Installern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Cluster que necessitam de implantação e gerenciamento automatizados de clusters Kind usando instaladores Python.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления кластерами, требующих автоматического развертывания и управления кластерами Kind с помощью установщиков Python.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل إدارة المجموعة التي تحتاج إلى نشر وتشغيل تلقائي لمجموعات Kind باستخدام برامج تثبيت Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy or redeploy Kagenti Kind clusters using Python scripts, producing detailed logs in files for context-safe execution and debugging, leveraging bash scripting and Git version control.","zh":"赋予代理部署或重新部署Kagenti Kind集群的能力，使用Python脚本生成详细的日志文件，以确保上下文安全的执行和调试，同时利用bash脚本和Git版本控制。","ja":"エージェントにKagenti Kindクラスターをデプロイまたは再デプロイする能力を付与し、Pythonスクリプトを使用して詳細なログファイルを生成し、コンテキストセーフな実行とデバッグを行い、同時にbashスクリプトとGitバージョン管理を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Kagenti Kind 클러스터를 배포 또는 재배포 할 수있는 기능을 제공하고, Python 스크립트를 사용하여详细한 로그 파일을 생성하여 문脈 안전한 실행 및 디버깅을 수행하며,同時に bash 스크립트 및 Git 버전 관리를 利用합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar o reimplementar clústeres Kind de Kagenti mediante scripts de Python, produciendo registros detallados en archivos para una ejecución y depuración seguras, aprovechando la scripting de bash y el control de versiones de Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer ou de redeployer des clusters Kind de Kagenti à l''aide de scripts Python, produisant des journaux détaillés dans des fichiers pour une exécution et un débogage en toute sécurité, en exploitant la scripting bash et le contrôle de version Git.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Kagenti-Kind-Cluster mithilfe von Python-Skripten zu deployen oder redeployen, erzeugt detaillierte Protokolle in Dateien für kontextsichere Ausführung und Fehlersuche, nutzt bash-Skripting und Git-Versionierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantarem ou reimplantarem clusters Kind Kagenti usando scripts Python, produzindo logs detalhados em arquivos para execução e depuração seguras, aproveitando a criação de scripts bash e controle de versão Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать или повторно развертывать кластеры Kagenti Kind с помощью скриптов Python, производя подробные журналы в файлах для контекстно-безопасного выполнения и отладки, используя скриптинг bash и контроль версий Git.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على نشر أو إعادة نشر مجموعات Kagenti Kind باستخدام سكريبتات Python ، وإنتاج سجلات مفصلة في الملفات من أجل تنفيذ وتصحيح آمن ، مستفيدا من إنشاء سكريبتات bash ومراقبة الإصدارات Git."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Kagenti Kind clusters for testing environments","Redeploying clusters for updated configurations","Debugging deployment issues using log files"],"zh":["为测试环境部署Kagenti Kind集群","为更新的配置重新部署集群","使用日志文件调试部署问题"],"ja":["テスト環境用のKagenti Kindクラスターをデプロイする","更新された構成用のクラスターを再デプロイする","ログファイルを使用してデプロイの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["테스트 환경용 Kagenti Kind 클러스터 배포","업데이트된 구성용 클러스터 재배포","로그 파일을 사용하여 배포 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Implementación de clústeres Kind de Kagenti para entornos de prueba","Reimplementación de clústeres para configuraciones actualizadas","Depuración de problemas de implementación mediante archivos de registro"],"fr":["Déploiement de clusters Kind de Kagenti pour des environnements de test","Redéploiement de clusters pour des configurations mises à jour","Débogage des problèmes de déploiement à l''aide de fichiers de journal"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Kagenti-Kind-Clustern für Testumgebungen","Neubereitstellung von Clustern für aktualisierte Konfigurationen","Fehlersuche bei Bereitstellungsproblemen mithilfe von Protokolldateien"],"pt":["Implantação de clusters Kind Kagenti para ambientes de teste","Reimplantação de clusters para configurações atualizadas","Depuração de problemas de implantação usando arquivos de log"],"ru":["Развертывание кластеров Kagenti Kind для тестовых сред","Повторное развертывание кластеров для обновленных конфигураций","Отладка проблем развертывания с помощью файлов журнала"],"ar":["نشر مجموعات Kagenti Kind لبيئات الاختبار","إعادة نشر المجموعات لتكوينات محدثة","تصحيح مشاكل النشر باستخدام ملفات السجل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Python installer dependency","Redirecting deploy output to files is mandatory"],"zh":["需要Git仓库访问权限","依赖Python安装程序","将部署输出重定向到文件是必需的"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","Pythonインストーラーに依存","デプロイの出力をファイルにリダイレクトすることは必須"],"ko":["Git仓库 액세스 필요","Python 설치 프로그램 의존","배포 출력을 파일로 리디렉션하는 것은 필수"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Dependencia del instalador de Python","Es obligatorio redirigir la salida de implementación a archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Dépendance de l''installateur Python","La redirection de la sortie de déploiement vers des fichiers est obligatoire"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Git-Repository","Abhängigkeit vom Python-Installer","Umleiten der Deploy-Ausgabe in Dateien ist obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Git","Dependência do instalador Python","Redirecionar a saída do deploy para arquivos é obrigatório"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию Git","Зависимость от установщика Python","Перенаправление вывода развертывания в файлы является обязательным"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Git","اعتماد مجلد تثبيت Python","إعادة توجيه إخراج النشر إلى الملفات ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"23820e668229c7f84c366b7e47868bada2fa96ce199bb31fff66e17e30d62dc4","qualityScore":49}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('erichowens/some_claude_skills/product-appeal-analyzer', 'community', 'erichowens', 'some_claude_skills', 'erichowens/some_claude_skills', 'product-appeal-analyzer', 0, 0, 49, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z', '2026-03-02T02:10:42.953Z', '08eff215c38aac2277b569cadf5a704124d88a814cadba4e4d6a16b4548b91b3', '{"id":"erichowens/some_claude_skills/product-appeal-analyzer","name":"product-appeal-analyzer","description":{"zh":"产品吸引力分析器是一种AI智能工具，帮助开发者分析产品的市场吸引力，优化产品设计","ja":"製品アピール分析ツールは、開発者が製品の市場アピール力を分析し、製品設計を最適化するためのAIエージェントです","ko":"제품 매력 분석기는 개발자가 제품의 시장 매력力を 분석하고 제품 설계를 최적화하는 데 도움이 되는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El analizador de atractivo de producto es una habilidad de Claude que facilita la vida de los desarrolladores con análisis de IA","fr":"L''analyseur d''attrait de produit est une compétence de Claude qui facilite la vie des développeurs avec des analyses d''IA","de":"Der Produkt-Anziehungskraft-Analysator ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude, die das Leben von Entwicklern mit IA-Analysen erleichtert","pt":"O analisador de apelo de produto é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a desenvolver produtos mais atraentes, melhorando a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Анализатор привлекательности продукта - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает разработать более привлекательные продукты, улучшая пользовательский опыт.","ar":"محلل جاذبية المنتج هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في تطوير منتجات أكثر جاذبية، من خلال تحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：产品吸引力分析器","ja":"AIエージェント：製品アピール分析ツール","ko":"AI 에이전트: 제품 매력 분석기","es":"Analizador de atractivo de producto con Agentes de IA","fr":"Analyseur d''attrait de produit avec Outils d''IA","de":"Produkt-Anziehungskraft-Analysator mit KI-Tools","pt":"Analisador de Apelo de Produto - Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Анализатор привлекательности продукта - ИИ Агенты","ar":"محلل جاذبية المنتج - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"product-appeal-analyzer"},"description":{"zh":"产品吸引力分析器是一种AI智能工具，帮助开发者分析产品的市场吸引力，优化产品设计","ja":"製品アピール分析ツールは、開発者が製品の市場アピール力を分析し、製品設計を最適化するためのAIエージェントです","ko":"제품 매력 분석기는 개발자가 제품의 시장 매력力を 분석하고 제품 설계를 최적화하는 데 도움이 되는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"El analizador de atractivo de producto es una habilidad de Claude que facilita la vida de los desarrolladores con análisis de IA","fr":"L''analyseur d''attrait de produit est une compétence de Claude qui facilite la vie des développeurs avec des analyses d''IA","de":"Der Produkt-Anziehungskraft-Analysator ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude, die das Leben von Entwicklern mit IA-Analysen erleichtert","pt":"O analisador de apelo de produto é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a desenvolver produtos mais atraentes, melhorando a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Анализатор привлекательности продукта - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает разработать более привлекательные продукты, улучшая пользовательский опыт.","ar":"محلل جاذبية المنتج هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في تطوير منتجات أكثر جاذبية، من خلال تحسين تجربة المستخدم.","en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"definition":{"en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"features":{"zh":["产品市场分析","用户需求分析","产品设计优化","竞争对手分析","市场趋势预测"],"ja":["製品市場分析","ユーザーのニーズ分析","製品設計最適化","競合他社分析","市場動向予測"],"ko":["제품 시장 분석","사용자 요구 분석","제품 설계 최적화","경쟁사 분석","시장 동향 예측"],"es":["Análisis de atractivo de producto con IA","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Informes detallados y personalizables","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Implementación sencilla con CLI"],"fr":["Analyse d''attrait de produit avec IA","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Rapports détaillés et personnalisables","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Implémentation simple avec CLI"],"de":["Produkt-Anziehungskraft-Analyse mit KI","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Detaillierte und anpassbare Berichte","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Einfache Implementierung mit CLI"],"pt":["Análise de dados de mercado","Identificação de tendências de consumo","Otimização da experiência do usuário","Desenvolvimento de produtos personalizados","Integração com plataformas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Анализ рыночных данных","Определение тенденций потребления","Оптимизация пользовательского опыта","Разработка персонализированных продуктов","Интеграция с платформами разработки"],"ar":["تحليل بيانات السوق","تحديد اتجاهات الاستهلاك","تحسين تجربة المستخدم","تطوير منتجات مخصصة","التكامل مع منصات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI工具分析产品市场","什么是产品吸引力分析","产品吸引力分析器安装","产品设计优化技巧","竞争对手分析工具","市场趋势预测方法","AI智能工具","产品市场分析软件"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用して製品の市場を分析する方法","製品アピール分析とは","製品アピール分析ツールのインストール","製品設計最適化のテクニック","競合他社分析ツール","市場動向予測方法","AIエージェント","製品市場分析ソフトウェア"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용하여 제품의 시장 분석하는 방법","제품 매력 분석이란","제품 매력 분석기 설치","제품 설계 최적화 기술","경쟁사 분석 도구","시장 동향 예측 방법","AI 에이전트","제품 시장 분석 소프트웨어"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es el análisis de atractivo de producto","alternativas a Claude","Claude vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de Claude"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que l''analyse d''attrait de produit","alternatives à Claude","Claude vs autres outils d''IA","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration de Claude"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Produkt-Anziehungskraft-Analyse","Alternativen zu Claude","Claude vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude"],"pt":["como usar analisador de apelo de produto","o que é analisador de apelo de produto","analisador de apelo de produto vs concorrentes","instalar analisador de apelo de produto","guia de configuração do analisador de apelo de produto","desenvolvimento de produtos com ferramentas de IA","analisador de apelo de produto para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать анализатор привлекательности продукта","что такое анализатор привлекательности продукта","анализатор привлекательности продукта vs конкуренты","установить анализатор привлекательности продукта","руководство по настройке анализатора привлекательности продукта","разработка продуктов с помощью ИИ Агентов","анализатор привлекательности продукта для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام محلل جاذبية المنتج","ما هو محلل جاذبية المنتج","محلل جاذبية المنتج مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت محلل جاذبية المنتج","دليل إعداد محلل جاذبية المنتج","تطوير المنتجات باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","محلل جاذبية المنتج للمطورين"]}},"owner":"erichowens","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"erichowens/some_claude_skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-appeal-analyzer","description":"Evaluate product desirability, market positioning, and emotional resonance—the complement to friction analysis. Assess whether users will WANT a product (not just use it), identity fit, trust signals, and value proposition clarity. Activate on will they like it, market positioning, appeal analysis, product desirability, value proposition, why would someone choose this, landing page review, conversion optimization, messaging strategy. NOT for UX friction analysis (use ux-friction-analyzer), visual design implementation (use web-design-expert), or A/B test setup (use frontend-developer).","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Product Appeal Analyzer\n\nEvaluate whether users will *want* a product—not just use it. The complement to friction analysis.\n\n**Core insight**: Users don''t choose the best product—they choose the product that feels most like it was made for them.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Evaluating landing pages, product pages, app store listings\n- Positioning a product against alternatives\n- Crafting messaging, tone, visual identity direction\n- Assessing emotional resonance with target personas\n- Pre-","body":"# Product Appeal Analyzer\n\nEvaluate whether users will *want* a product—not just use it. The complement to friction analysis.\n\n**Core insight**: Users don''t choose the best product—they choose the product that feels most like it was made for them.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Evaluating landing pages, product pages, app store listings\n- Positioning a product against alternatives\n- Crafting messaging, tone, visual identity direction\n- Assessing emotional resonance with target personas\n- Pre-launch \"will this convert?\" analysis\n\n❌ **NOT for:**\n- UX friction audits (→ use ux-friction-analyzer)\n- Visual design execution (→ use web-design-expert)\n- A/B test implementation (→ use frontend-developer)\n- Market size estimation or financial forecasting\n- Feature comparison matrices\n\n---\n\n## The Desirability Triangle\n\n**All three must be present.** Missing any one kills conversion:\n\n```\n                    IDENTITY FIT\n                    \"This is for people like me\"\n                         /\\\n                        /  \\\n                       /    \\\n                      /  ★   \\\n                     / DESIRE \\\n                    /          \\\n                   /______________\\\n        PROBLEM               TRUST\n        URGENCY               SIGNALS\n   \"I need this now\"     \"This will actually work\"\n```\n\n| Missing Element | User Reaction |\n|-----------------|---------------|\n| Identity Fit | \"Seems useful, but not for me\" |\n| Problem Urgency | \"Cool, maybe someday\" |\n| Trust Signals | \"Looks sketchy / too good to be true\" |\n\n**Decision tree**: When analyzing, score each vertex 1-10. If any is &lt;5, that''s your priority fix.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Analysis: The 5-Second Test\n\nWithin 5 seconds of landing, a visitor should know:\n\n1. **What is this?** (Category recognition)\n2. **Who is it for?** (Identity signal)\n3. **What''s the core promise?** (Value proposition)\n4. **What do I do next?** (Clear CTA)\n\n**How to run it:**\n- Show landing page to someone unfamiliar for exactly 5 seconds\n- Hide it, then ask: \"What was that? Who''s it for? What would you do there?\"\n- Record verbatim—don''t coach or clarify\n\n**Scoring:**\n\n| Result | Score | Action |\n|--------|-------|--------|\n| All 4 clear in &lt;3 sec | 9-10 | Ship it |\n| All 4 clear in 3-5 sec | 7-8 | Minor polish |\n| 3 of 4 clear | 5-6 | Fix the gap |\n| 2 or fewer clear | 2-4 | Significant rework |\n| Confusing/unclear | 0-1 | Start over |\n\n---\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify Target Personas\n\nFor each persona, document:\n- **Who**: One-sentence description\n- **Problem**: What''s broken + how it feels\n- **Current workaround**: What they do today (and why it sucks)\n- **Identity**: How they see themselves, who they want to become\n\n### Step 2: Score the Desirability Triangle\n\nFor each persona:\n\n```\nPERSONA: [Name]\n\nIDENTITY FIT                    [/10]\n  Visual identity match         [/10]  \"Does this look like my kind of tool?\"\n  Language resonance            [/10]  \"Do they speak my language?\"\n  Implied user match            [/10]  \"Are people like me shown?\"\n\nPROBLEM URGENCY                 [/10]\n  Pain point acknowledged       [/10]  \"They understand my problem\"\n  Emotional resonance           [/10]  \"They get how frustrating it is\"\n  Solution clarity              [/10]  \"I see how this fixes it\"\n\nTRUST SIGNALS                   [/10]\n  Professional execution        [/10]  \"This looks legitimate\"\n  Social proof                  [/10]  \"Others like me use it\"\n  Risk reduction                [/10]  \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\nOVERALL APPEAL SCORE:           [/90]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Map Objections\n\n| Objection | Type | How Addressed? |\n|-----------|------|----------------|\n| \"Is this legit?\" | Trust | [Answer] |\n| \"I''ve tried things before\" | Skepticism | [Answer] |\n| \"Too expensive\" | Value | [Answer] |\n| \"Too complicated\" | Effort | [Answer] |\n| \"Not for people like me\" | Identity | [Answer] |\n| \"What if it doesn''t work?\" | Risk | [Answer] |\n| \"I''ll do it later\" | Urgency | [Answer] |\n\n### Step 4: Generate Recommendations\n\nUse priority formula: `Impact = (Users Affected × Severity) / Fix Difficulty`\n\nCategorize into:\n- **Immediate** (ship this week)\n- **Medium-term** (this sprint)\n- **Long-term** (roadmap)\n\n---\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n### Feature Soup Headline\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"List all capabilities to show value\"\n\n**Reality**: Visitors scan for 2-3 seconds. Feature lists feel generic.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n| Bad | Good |\n|-----|------|\n| \"AI-Powered Recovery Planning Tool with Analytics\" | \"Know exactly what to do next in your recovery\" |\n| \"Comprehensive Legal Document Platform\" | \"Find out in 2 minutes if your record can be expunged\" |\n\n**Detection**: Headline contains 3+ nouns or buzzwords like \"AI-powered\", \"comprehensive\", \"platform\"\n\n### Screenshot Hero\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Show the product interface so people know what they''re getting\"\n\n**Reality**: Strangers don''t understand your UI. They care about outcomes.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n- Person experiencing the benefit\n- The outcome/result they''ll get\n- Abstract visualization of the transformation\n\n**Detection**: Hero image is a product screenshot with no context\n\n### Trust Ladder Violation\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Get their email immediately, then convert them\"\n\n**Reality**: Trust builds in stages. Asking for too much too early kills conversion.\n\n**The Trust Ladder** (each rung requires more trust):\n1. Land on page → Professional design, no broken elements\n2. Click/explore → Clear navigation, fast load\n3. Spend &gt;2 min → Demonstrated value, clear progress\n4. Enter info → Why you need it explained, no dark patterns\n5. Create account → Privacy visible, minimal fields, clear benefit\n6. Pay money → Guarantee, testimonials, recognizable processor\n\n**Detection**: Asking for account creation before demonstrating value\n\n### Identity Mismatch\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Broad appeal = more users\"\n\n**Reality**: When everyone is the target, no one feels targeted.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n| Signal Type | How It Works |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| Visual identity | Dark mode = \"power user\"; Soft pastels = \"wellness\" |\n| Language/tone | \"Crush your goals\" vs \"Find your balance\" |\n| Social proof | Company logos vs individual testimonials |\n| Complexity | Minimal = simplicity-seeker; Feature-rich = power user |\n\n**Detection**: Homepage tries to appeal to 3+ different personas\n\n---\n\n## Self-Contained Tools\n\n### Analysis Workflow\n\n1. **Read** the landing page content and structure\n2. **WebFetch** the target URL to analyze live content\n3. **Write** analysis results to a markdown file\n4. **Edit** recommendations into actionable copy changes\n\n### Appeal Scorer Script\n\nRun: `python scripts/appeal_scorer.py <url>`\n\nProduces structured JSON output with scores and recommendations.\n\n### Reference Files (See for deep dives)\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| `references/scoring-templates.md` | Full scoring matrices and templates |\n| `references/trust-ladder.md` | Deep dive on trust building stages |\n| `references/identity-signals.md` | Visual/verbal identity signal catalog |\n| `references/objection-catalog.md` | Common objections by product type |\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen running this skill, produce:\n\n1. **Executive Summary** - 3 bullet key findings\n2. **Desirability Triangle Scores** - Per persona\n3. **5-Second Test Assessment** - What''s clear, what''s not\n4. **Top 3 Objections** - And how to address them\n5. **Priority Recommendations** - Immediate / Medium / Long-term\n\n---\n\n## Integration with ux-friction-analyzer\n\n**Appeal + Friction = Complete picture**\n\n| This Skill Answers | ux-friction-analyzer Answers |\n|--------------------|------------------------------|\n| \"Do they want it?\" | \"Can they use it?\" |\n| Will they choose this over alternatives? | Can they complete the task? |\n| Does it feel made for them? | Does the flow make sense? |\n| Is the promise compelling? | Is the experience smooth? |\n\n**Run both**: High appeal + high friction = frustrated users. Low friction + low appeal = abandoned product.\n\n---\n\n**Philosophy**: A product with low friction but low appeal gets abandoned. A product with high appeal but high friction gets frustrated users. You need both.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:42.953Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced product appeal analysis and user resonance evaluation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级产品吸引力分析和用户共鸣评估的营销代理","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度な製品アピール分析とユーザー共鳴評価を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 제품 매력 분석 및 사용자 공鳴 평가가 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan un análisis avanzado de atractivo de producto y evaluación de resonancia del usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin d''une analyse avancée de l''attrait du produit et d''une évaluation de la résonance de l''utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine fortschrittliche Produktattraktivitätsanalyse und Benutzerresonanzbewertung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de análise avançada de apelo de produto e avaliação de ressonância do usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для маркетинговых агентов, которым требуется продвинутый анализ привлекательности продукта и оценка резонанса пользователя.","ar":"مثالي لعمال التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل متقدم لجاذبية المنتج وتقييم共鸣 المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate product appeal through landing page analysis, competitor positioning, and emotional resonance assessment using natural language processing and machine learning protocols, generating actionable insights for product optimization and targeted messaging.","zh":"赋予代理评估产品吸引力通过着陆页分析、竞争对手定位和情感共鸣评估，使用自然语言处理和机器学习协议，生成可行的洞察力以优化产品和有针对性的信息传递","ja":"エージェントがランディングページ分析、競合他社の位置付け、感情の共鳴評価を使用して製品の魅力を評価できるようにし、自然言語処理と機械学習プロトコルを使用して、製品の最適化とターゲットメッセージングのための実行可能な洞察を生成する","ko":"에이전트가 랜딩 페이지 분석, 경쟁사 위치 지정 및 감정의 공鳴 평가를 사용하여 제품의 매력을 평가할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 처리 및 기계 학습 프로토콜을 사용하여 제품 최적화 및 타겟 메시지 전달을 위한 실질적인 통찰력을 생성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar el atractivo del producto a través del análisis de la página de destino, la posición de los competidores y la evaluación de la resonancia emocional utilizando protocolos de procesamiento de lenguaje natural y aprendizaje automático, generando conocimientos aprovechables para la optimización de productos y la mensajería dirigida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer l''attrait du produit grâce à l''analyse de la page de destination, au positionnement des concurrents et à l''évaluation de la résonance émotionnelle en utilisant des protocoles de traitement du langage naturel et des protocoles d''apprentissage automatique, générant des connaissances exploitables pour l''optimisation des produits et la messagerie ciblée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Produktattraktivität durch die Analyse der Landingpage, die Wettbewerberpositionierung und die emotionale Resonanzbewertung unter Verwendung von Natural Language Processing- und Machine Learning-Protokollen zu bewerten, wodurch handhabbare Erkenntnisse für die Produktoptimierung und die gezielte Messaging generiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar o apelo do produto por meio da análise de página de destino, posicionamento de concorrentes e avaliação de ressonância emocional usando protocolos de processamento de linguagem natural e aprendizado de máquina, gerando insights ação para otimização de produto e mensagens direcionadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить привлекательность продукта путем анализа страницы назначения, позиционирования конкурентов и оценки эмоциональной резонанса с использованием протоколов обработки естественного языка и машинного обучения, генерируя действенные идеи для оптимизации продукта и целевого сообщения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم جاذبية المنتج من خلال تحليل صفحة الوجهة وتركيب المنافسين وتقييم التأثير العاطفي باستخدام بروتوكولات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وبروتوكولات التعلم الآلي، مما يولد رؤى مفعمة بالفعل لتحسين المنتج والرسائل المستهدفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating product pages for user engagement","Crafting personalized messaging for target personas","Assessing emotional resonance with target audiences"],"zh":["评估产品页面的用户参与度","为目标人群量身定制信息传递","评估与目标受众的情感共鸣"],"ja":["ユーザー関与度のための製品ページの評価","ターゲットペルソナのためのパーソナライズドメッセージングの作成","ターゲットオーディエンスとの感情の共鳴の評価"],"ko":["사용자 참여도를 위한 제품 페이지 평가","타겟 페르소나를 위한 개인화된 메시지 생성","타겟 오디언스와의 감정의 공鳴 평가"],"es":["Evaluación de páginas de producto para la participación del usuario","Creación de mensajes personalizados para las personas objetivo","Evaluación de la resonancia emocional con las audiencias objetivo"],"fr":["Évaluation des pages de produit pour l''engagement de l''utilisateur","Création de messages personnalisés pour les personas cibles","Évaluation de la résonance émotionnelle avec les audiences cibles"],"de":["Bewertung von Produktseiten für die Benutzerbeteiligung","Erstellung personalisierter Nachrichten für Zielpersonen","Bewertung der emotionalen Resonanz mit den Zielgruppen"],"pt":["Avaliar páginas de produto para engajamento do usuário","Criar mensagens personalizadas para personas-alvo","Avaliar ressonância emocional com audiências-alvo"],"ru":["Оценка страниц продукта для вовлеченности пользователя","Создание персонализированных сообщений для целевых персон","Оценка эмоциональной резонанса с целевой аудиторией"],"ar":["تقييم صفحات المنتج لاستخدام المستخدم","إنشاء رسائل مخصصة لأشخاص المستهدفين","تقييم التأثير العاطفي على الجماهير المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive product and user data","Limited to digital products and services","Dependent on high-quality training data for accurate analysis"],"zh":["需要全面性的产品和用户数据","仅限于数字产品和服务","依赖于高质量的训练数据以进行准确的分析"],"ja":["包括的な製品とユーザーデータが必要","デジタル製品とサービスに限定","正確な分析のための高品質のトレーニングデータに依存"],"ko":["포괄적인 제품 및 사용자 데이터가 필요","디지털 제품 및 서비스에 한정","정확한 분석을 위한 고품질의 교육 데이터에 의존"],"es":["Requiere datos completos de productos y usuarios","Limitado a productos y servicios digitales","Dependiente de datos de entrenamiento de alta calidad para un análisis preciso"],"fr":["Nécessite des données complètes sur les produits et les utilisateurs","Limité aux produits et services numériques","Dépendant de données de formation de haute qualité pour une analyse précise"],"de":["Benötigt umfassende Produkt- und Benutzerdaten","Begrenzt auf digitale Produkte und Dienstleistungen","Abhängig von hochwertigen Trainingsdaten für eine genaue Analyse"],"pt":["Exige dados abrangentes de produto e usuário","Limitado a produtos e serviços digitais","Dependente de dados de treinamento de alta qualidade para análise precisa"],"ru":["Требует полных данных о продукте и пользователе","Ограничен цифровыми продуктами и услугами","Зависит от качественных данных для обучения для точного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات شاملة للمنتج والمستخدم","محدود بالمنتجات والخدمات الرقمية","يعتمد على بيانات تدريب عالية الجودة لتحليل دقيق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"08eff215c38aac2277b569cadf5a704124d88a814cadba4e4d6a16b4548b91b3","qualityScore":49}');
