-Docs는 AI 에이전트의 런타임 안전성 솔루션을 제공하여 에이전트가 실행 중에 문제를 일으키지 않도록 합니다","es":"Nuestra herramienta de seguridad en tiempo de ejecución para Agentes de IA garantiza la seguridad y previene daños","fr":"Notre outil de sécurité d''exécution pour les Agents IA assure la sécurité et prévient les dommages","de":"Unser Laufzeit-Sicherheitstool für KI-Agents gewährleistet Sicherheit und verhindert Schäden","pt":"O update-docs fornece segurança em tempo de execução para Ferramentas de IA, impedindo que elas causem danos","ru":"Update-docs обеспечивает безопасность во время выполнения для ИИ Агентов, предотвращая их повреждение","ar":"يوفر update-docs سلامة تشغيل لآلات الذكاء الاصطناعي، ويلغي إمكانية حدوث أضرار","en":"Runtime safety for AI agents. Stop agents before they break things."},"definition":{"en":"Runtime safety for AI agents. Stop agents before they break things."},"features":{"zh":["运行安全性","代理失控防止","自动更新","实时监控","多环境支持"],"ja":["ランタイム安全性","エージェントの失敗防止","自動更新","リアルタイム監視","マルチ環境対応"],"ko":["런타임 안전성","에이전트의 오작동 방지","자동 업데이트","실시간 모니터링","다중 환경 지원"],"es":["Seguridad en tiempo de ejecución para Agentes de IA","Prevención de daños y errores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Informes y alertas personalizables"],"fr":["Sécurité d''exécution pour les Agents IA","Prévention des dommages et des erreurs","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Rapports et alertes personnalisables"],"de":["Laufzeit-Sicherheit für KI-Agents","Verhinderung von Schäden und Fehlern","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Benutzerdefinierte Berichte und Warnungen"],"pt":["Segurança em tempo de execução","Prevenção de danos","Compatibilidade com Ferramentas de IA","Facilidade de uso","Integração com CLI"],"ru":["Безопасность во время выполнения","Предотвращение повреждений","Совместимость с ИИ Агентами","Легкость использования","Интеграция с CLI"],"ar":["سلامة تشغيل","منع الأضرار","التوافق مع آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","سهولة الاستخدام","التكامل مع واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","运行安全性","Update-Docs","代理失控防止","如何使用Update-Docs","Update-Docs安装","AI智能代理安全解决方案"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ランタイム安全性","Update-Docs","エージェントの失敗防止","Update-Docsの使い方","Update-Docsのインストール","AIエージェントの安全性ソリューション"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","런타임 안전성","Update-Docs","에이전트의 오작동 방지","Update-Docs 사용법","Update-Docs 설치","AI 에이전트의 안전성 솔루션"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Seguridad en tiempo de ejecución","Herramientas de desarrollo","Cómo usar Agentes de IA","Qué es la seguridad en tiempo de ejecución","Alternativas a Agentes de IA","Instalación de Agentes de IA","Guía de configuración de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["Agents IA","Sécurité d''exécution","Outils de développement","Comment utiliser les Agents IA","Qu''est-ce que la sécurité d''exécution","Alternatives aux Agents IA","Installation des Agents IA","Guide de configuration des Agents IA"],"de":["KI-Agents","Laufzeit-Sicherheit","Entwicklungstools","Wie man KI-Agents verwendet","Was ist Laufzeit-Sicherheit","Alternativen zu KI-Agents","Installation von KI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar update-docs","o que é update-docs","Ferramentas de IA seguras","update-docs vs alternativas","instalar update-docs","guia de configuração do update-docs"],"ru":["как использовать update-docs","что такое update-docs","Безопасные ИИ Агенты","update-docs vs альтернативы","установить update-docs","руководство по настройке update-docs"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام update-docs","ما هو update-docs","آلات ذكاء اصطناعي آمنة","update-docs مقابل البدائل","تثبيت update-docs","دليل إعداد update-docs"]}},"owner":"acartag7","repo":"edictum","repoPath":"acartag7/edictum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.898Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"update-docs","description":"Sync documentation with code changes. Use on every PR that touches library code to keep docs accurate and consistent.","bodyPreview":"# Update Docs\n\nEnsures documentation stays in sync with code changes. Run before or during every PR that touches library code.\n\n## Before anything else\n\n1. **Read CLAUDE.md** — understand boundaries (core vs server), dropped features, and session model\n2. **Read .docs-style-guide.md** — binding terminology reference\n\n## Step 1: Detect what changed\n\n```bash\ngit diff main...HEAD --name-only\n```\n\nMap changes to affected docs:\n\n| Source file | Affected doc pages |\n|---|---|\n| `src/edictum/pipeline.p","body":"# Update Docs\n\nEnsures documentation stays in sync with code changes. Run before or during every PR that touches library code.\n\n## Before anything else\n\n1. **Read CLAUDE.md** — understand boundaries (core vs server), dropped features, and session model\n2. **Read .docs-style-guide.md** — binding terminology reference\n\n## Step 1: Detect what changed\n\n```bash\ngit diff main...HEAD --name-only\n```\n\nMap changes to affected docs:\n\n| Source file | Affected doc pages |\n|---|---|\n| `src/edictum/pipeline.py`, `contracts.py` | concepts/how-it-works.md, architecture.md |\n| `src/edictum/yaml_engine/` | contracts/yaml-reference.md, contracts/operators.md |\n| `src/edictum/adapters/*.py` | corresponding adapters/*.md page |\n| `src/edictum/session.py`, `limits.py` | concepts/contracts.md, architecture.md |\n| `src/edictum/audit.py`, `telemetry.py` | audit/sinks.md, audit/telemetry.md |\n| `src/edictum/cli/` | cli.md |\n| `src/edictum/envelope.py` | concepts/principals.md, architecture.md |\n| `pyproject.toml` (version) | install commands across docs |\n| `src/edictum/__init__.py` (API) | quickstart.md, all adapter pages |\n\nIf no library code changed (docs-only PR), skip to Step 4.\n\n## Step 2: Read the changed code\n\nFor each changed file:\n1. Read the file and the diff (`git diff main...HEAD -- <file>`)\n2. Identify: new public APIs, changed signatures, new classes, removed exports, changed behavior\n\n## Step 3: Update affected docs\n\nFor each affected page:\n1. Read the current doc\n2. Skip if already correct\n3. Update code examples, descriptions, YAML examples\n4. **Verify \"When to use this\" section** exists (see .docs-style-guide.md page structure pattern step 3):\n   - Every page MUST have a `## When to use this` section after the opening/example and before the main content\n   - If missing, add one with: 2-4 concrete scenarios (real situations, not abstract descriptions), user personas who benefit, and how this feature relates to other Edictum features\n   - If new code adds a feature, update the scenarios to cover the new capability\n   - Read the ACTUAL SOURCE CODE for the feature before writing scenarios — reference real method names, real classes, real behavior\n5. **Verify terminology** against .docs-style-guide.md:\n   - \"contracts\" not \"policies\" or \"rules\"\n   - Use `denied` (see .docs-style-guide.md for banned alternatives)\n   - Use `enforces` (not \"governs\")\n   - Use `pipeline` (not \"engine\")\n   - Use `tool call` (not \"function call\")\n   - Use `adapter` (not \"integration\" or \"plugin\")\n   - Use `observe mode` (see .docs-style-guide.md for banned alternatives)\n   - Use `finding` / `findings` (not \"alert\")\n6. **Verify core vs server boundaries** against CLAUDE.md:\n   - All contract evaluation (pre, post, session, sandbox) is core\n   - StdoutAuditSink, FileAuditSink, OTel are core\n   - Production approval workflows (ServerApprovalBackend) require the server\n   - Centralized audit dashboards require the server\n   - Multi-process session tracking requires the server\n   - MemoryBackend is the only local StorageBackend (no Redis/DB)\n   - No references to dropped features or ee/ tier\n\n## Step 3.5: Update repo-level markdown files\n\nThese files live outside `docs/` but track code changes:\n\n1. **CHANGELOG.md** — if the PR introduces user-visible changes (fixes, features, breaking changes), add an entry under the current version heading. Use the existing entry format. Keep descriptions neutral (no exploit details for security fixes).\n2. **CLAUDE.md \"What''s Shipped\" section** — if this is a new version, add a one-line entry to the version history list matching the existing format.\n\n## Step 4: Update README if needed\n\nIf public API, install extras, framework support, or version changed:\n1. Read README.md\n2. Update affected sections\n3. Ensure README matches docs/index.md positioning\n\n## Step 5: Verify the build\n\n```bash\npython -m mkdocs build --strict 2>&1\n```\n\nFix any broken links, missing pages, or YAML errors.\n\n## Step 6: Report\n\nSummarize:\n- Which code files changed\n- Which doc pages were updated (and what changed)\n- Which doc pages were checked but needed no changes\n- Build verification result\n\n## Rules\n\n- **Don''t rewrite for the sake of rewriting.** Only update what the code change actually affects.\n- **Don''t add features that don''t exist.** If code was added but not released, note it as unreleased.\n- **Don''t reference dropped features.** No Redis/DB StorageBackend, no reset_session().\n- **Preserve the voice.** Match existing style — problem first, short paragraphs, code examples.\n- **Check cross-links.** Verify links in updated pages still work.\n- **README and homepage must stay aligned.** If you update one, check the other.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:11:55.616Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Maintenance Agents needing automated documentation updates and runtime safety checks.","zh":"非常适合需要自动更新文档和运行时安全检查的代码维护代理。","ja":"コードメンテナンスエージェントが自動ドキュメント更新とランタイムの安全性チェックを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 문서 업데이트 및 런타임 안전성 확인이 필요한 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Mantenimiento de Código que necesitan actualizaciones de documentación automatizadas y verificaciones de seguridad en tiempo de ejecución.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Maintenance de Code ayant besoin de mises à jour de documentation automatisées et de vérifications de sécurité à l''exécution.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Wartungsagenten, die automatisierte Dokumentenaktualisierungen und Laufzeitsicherheitsprüfungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que precisam de atualizações de documentação automatizadas e verificações de segurança em tempo de execução.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по обслуживанию кода, которым необходимы автоматические обновления документации и проверки безопасности во время выполнения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الصيانة البرمجية الذي يحتاج إلى تحديثات وثائق محوسبة وعمليات فحص أمان زمن التشغيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to keep documentation in sync with library code changes, ensuring accuracy and consistency through git diff analysis and adherence to .docs-style-guide.md terminology standards.","zh":"赋予代理保持文档与库代码更改同步的能力，通过git diff分析和遵守.docs-style-guide.md术语标准，确保准确性和一致性。","ja":"エージェントがライブラリコードの変更に合わせてドキュメントを同期させ、git diff分析と.dosc-style-guide.md用語標準の遵守を通じて、正確性と一貫性を確保する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 라이브러리 코드 변경에 따라 문서를 동기화하고 git diff 분석 및 .docs-style-guide.md 용어 표준을 준수하여 정확성과 일관성을 보장하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener la documentación sincronizada con los cambios en el código de la biblioteca, garantizando la precisión y la coherencia a través del análisis de git diff y la adhesión a los estándares de terminología de .docs-style-guide.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir la documentation à jour avec les modifications du code de la bibliothèque, en garantissant l''exactitude et la cohérence via l''analyse de git diff et le respect des normes de terminologie de .docs-style-guide.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Dokumentation mit den Änderungen im Bibliothekscodes synchron zu halten, indem sie die Genauigkeit und Konsistenz durch die Analyse von git diff und die Einhaltung der Terminologiestandards von .docs-style-guide.md gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a documentação sincronizada com as alterações no código da biblioteca, garantindo precisão e consistência por meio da análise do git diff e da adesão aos padrões de terminologia do .docs-style-guide.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать документацию в синхронизации с изменениями в коде библиотеки, обеспечивая точность и последовательность посредством анализа git diff и соблюдения стандартов терминологии .docs-style-guide.md.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إبقاء الوثائق متزامنة مع التغييرات في код المكتبة، مما يضمن الدقة والاتساق من خلال تحليل git diff والامتثال لمعايير المصطلحات .docs-style-guide.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating doc updates during pull requests","Detecting changes in source files to map affected documentation pages","Validating documentation consistency with CLAUDE.md guidelines"],"zh":["在拉取请求期间自动更新文档","检测源文件的更改以映射受影响的文档页面","验证文档的一致性与CLAUDE.md指南"],"ja":["プルリクエスト期间にドキュメントを自動更新する","ソースファイルの変更を検出して影響を受けるドキュメントページをマップする","ドキュメントの整合性をCLAUDE.mdガイドラインと検証する"],"ko":["풀 요청期间에 문서를 자동으로 업데이트함","소스 파일의 변경을 감지하여 영향을 받는 문서 페이지를 매핑함","문서의 일관성을 CLAUDE.md 가이드ライン과 검증함"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación durante las solicitudes de extracción","Detección de cambios en los archivos de origen para asignar las páginas de documentación afectadas","Validar la consistencia de la documentación con las directrices de CLAUDE.md"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de documentation lors des demandes d''extraction","Détection des modifications dans les fichiers source pour mapper les pages de documentation affectées","Valider la cohérence de la documentation avec les lignes directrices de CLAUDE.md"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumentenaktualisierungen während des Pull-Request-Prozesses","Erkennung von Änderungen in den Quelldateien, um die betroffenen Dokumentationsseiten zuzuordnen","Überprüfen der Konsistenz der Dokumentation mit den Richtlinien von CLAUDE.md"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentos durante solicitações de pull","Detectar alterações em arquivos de origem para mapear páginas de documentação afetadas","Validar a consistência da documentação com as diretrizes do CLAUDE.md"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документов во время запросов на включение","Обнаруживать изменения в исходных файлах для сопоставления затронутых страниц документации","Проверять последовательность документации с руководством CLAUDE.md"],"ar":["تحديث الوثائق تلقائيًا خلال طلبات السحب","اكتشاف التغييرات في الملفات المصدرية لتحديد صفحات الوثائق المتأثرة","التحقق من الاتساق في الوثائق مع إرشادات CLAUDE.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git repository access","Limited to library code changes","Needs adherence to specific documentation style guides"],"zh":["需要git仓库访问权限","仅限于库代码更改","需要遵守特定的文档样式指南"],"ja":["gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","ライブラリコードの変更のみに限定される","特定のドキュメントスタイルガイドへの準拠が必要"],"ko":["git 저장소 액세스 권한이 필요함","라이브러리 코드 변경에만 한정됨","특정 문서 스타일 가이드 준수를 필요로 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de git","Limitado a los cambios en el código de la biblioteca","Necesita adherirse a guías de estilo de documentación específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel git","Limité aux modifications du code de la bibliothèque","Nécessite de se conformer à des guides de style de documentation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf Änderungen im Bibliothekscodes","Benötigt die Einhaltung spezifischer Dokumentationsstilrichtlinien"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório git","Limitado a alterações no código da biblioteca","Necessita de adesão a guias de estilo de documentação específicas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию git","Ограничен изменением кода библиотеки","Требует соблюдения определенных руководств по стилю документации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع git","محدود بالتغيرات في 코드 المكتبة","يحتاج إلى الامتثال لدلائل نمطية محددة للوثائق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1729126bfca7be647201fb970f1da26b94a4e9ab9525dfda0b17a7e11bc46dc2","qualityScore":49}');
