bash","Assertions personnalisables pour valider les résultats","Intégration avec les outils de développement existants","Rapports de tests détaillés et faciles à lire","Compatibilité avec plusieurs systèmes d''exploitation"],"de":["Automatisierte Tests für Bash-Skripte","Anpassbare Aserionen zur Überprüfung von Ergebnissen","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools","Detaillierte und leicht lesbare Testberichte","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Betriebssystemen"],"pt":["Teste de scripts bash","Garantia de qualidade do código","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes","Documentação completa"],"ru":["Тестирование скриптов bash","Обеспечение качества кода","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких сред","Полная документация"],"ar":["اختبار سكريبتات bash","ضمان جودة الرمز","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم بيئات متعددة","توثيق كامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用add-assertion","add-assertion是什么","Bash脚本测试库","add-assertion安装","add-assertion教程","Bash脚本测试框架"],"ja":["add-assertionの使い方","add-assertionとは","Bashスクリプトテストライブラリ","add-assertionのインストール","add-assertionのチュートリアル","Bashスクリプトテストフレームワーク"],"ko":["add-assertion 사용법","add-assertion이란","Bash 스크립트 테스트 라이브러리","add-assertion 설치","add-assertion 튜토리얼","Bash 스크립트 테스트 프레임워크"],"es":["herramientas de pruebas AI","add-assertion","pruebas automatizadas","desarrollo de software","scripts de bash","cómo usar add-assertion","add-assertion vs otras herramientas de pruebas","instalación de add-assertion","guía de configuración de add-assertion"],"fr":["outils de tests d''IA","add-assertion","tests automatisés","développement de logiciels","scripts bash","comment utiliser add-assertion","add-assertion vs autres outils de tests","installation de add-assertion","guide de configuration de add-assertion"],"de":["KI-Testtools","add-assertion","automatisierte Tests","Software-Entwicklung","Bash-Skripte","wie man add-assertion verwendet","add-assertion im Vergleich zu anderen Testtools","Installation von add-assertion","Konfigurationsanleitung für add-assertion"],"pt":["como usar add-assertion","o que é add-assertion","add-assertion vs outros testes","instalar add-assertion","guia de configuração add-assertion","ferramentas de teste para bash","desenvolvimento de software com add-assertion","add-assertion para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать add-assertion","что такое add-assertion","add-assertion vs другие тесты","установить add-assertion","руководство по настройке add-assertion","инструменты тестирования для bash","разработка программного обеспечения с add-assertion","add-assertion для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام add-assertion","ما هي add-assertion","add-assertion مقابل اختبارات أخرى","تثبيت add-assertion","دليل إعداد add-assertion","أدوات اختبار لسكريبتات bash","تطوير البرمجيات مع add-assertion","add-assertion للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"TypedDevs","repo":"bashunit","repoPath":"TypedDevs/bashunit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.909Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-assertion","description":"Add new assertion function with comprehensive tests following TDD","bodyPreview":"# Add Assertion Skill\n\nAdd a new assertion function to bashunit following strict TDD methodology.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke with `/add-assertion` when:\n- Adding a new assertion to the framework\n- User requests a new `assert_*` function\n- Enhancing existing assertion capabilities\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. **Task file must exist** - Create `.tasks/YYYY-MM-DD-add-assertion-name.md`\n2. **Understand patterns** - Study `tests/unit/assert_test.sh`\n3. **Know the requirement** - What should the assertion do?","body":"# Add Assertion Skill\n\nAdd a new assertion function to bashunit following strict TDD methodology.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke with `/add-assertion` when:\n- Adding a new assertion to the framework\n- User requests a new `assert_*` function\n- Enhancing existing assertion capabilities\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. **Task file must exist** - Create `.tasks/YYYY-MM-DD-add-assertion-name.md`\n2. **Understand patterns** - Study `tests/unit/assert_test.sh`\n3. **Know the requirement** - What should the assertion do?\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Planning Phase\n\n**Ask user:**\n- What should the assertion check?\n- What should it be called? (e.g., `assert_json_contains`)\n- What parameters does it take?\n- What should success look like?\n- What should failure messages say?\n\n**Document in task file:**\n```markdown\n# Add assert_json_contains\n\n## Context\nNeed assertion to verify JSON contains a specific key-value pair.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Function validates JSON structure\n- [ ] Function checks for key existence\n- [ ] Function checks value matches\n- [ ] Clear error messages on failure\n- [ ] Works with nested JSON\n- [ ] Handles malformed JSON gracefully\n\n## Test Inventory\n### Unit Tests\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_pass_when_key_value_exists\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_when_key_missing\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_when_value_differs\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_handle_nested_keys\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_on_malformed_json\n```\n\n### 2. Study Existing Patterns\n\n**Read assertion patterns:**\n```bash\n# Study how other assertions work\nRead tests/unit/assert_test.sh\nRead src/assertions.sh\n```\n\n**Identify pattern:**\n- Parameter validation\n- Assertion logic\n- Error message format\n- Success/failure return codes\n- Testing approach (including failure tests)\n\n### 3. TDD Cycle 1: Basic Success Case\n\n#### RED\n```bash\n# tests/unit/assert_json_contains_test.sh\n\nfunction test_assert_json_contains_should_pass_when_key_value_exists() {\n  local json=''{\"name\": \"bashunit\", \"version\": \"0.32.0\"}''\n\n  assert_json_contains \"name\" \"bashunit\" \"$json\"\n}\n```\n\nRun test - **MUST FAIL** (function doesn''t exist):\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/unit/assert_json_contains_test.sh\n```\n\n#### GREEN\n\n```bash\n# src/assert_json.sh (or add to src/assertions.sh)\n\nfunction assert_json_contains() {\n  local key=\"$1\"\n  local expected_value=\"$2\"\n  local json=\"$3\"\n\n  # Minimal implementation\n  local actual_value\n  actual_value=$(echo \"$json\" | grep -o \"\\\"$key\\\": *\\\"[^\\\"]*\\\"\" | cut -d''\"'' -f4)\n\n  if [[ \"$actual_value\" == \"$expected_value\" ]]; then\n    return 0\n  fi\n\n  echo \"Expected key ''$key'' to have value ''$expected_value'', got ''$actual_value''\" >&2\n  return 1\n}\n```\n\nRun test - **MUST PASS**:\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/unit/assert_json_contains_test.sh\n```\n\n#### REFACTOR\n\nImprove implementation:\n- Better JSON parsing\n- Error handling\n- Documentation\n\n### 4. TDD Cycle 2: Failure Case\n\n#### RED\n```bash\nfunction test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_when_key_missing() {\n  local json=''{\"name\": \"bashunit\"}''\n\n  # Use assert_fails to test that the assertion fails\n  assert_fails \\\n    \"assert_json_contains ''version'' ''0.32.0'' ''$json''\"\n}\n```\n\n#### GREEN\n\nUpdate implementation to handle missing keys:\n```bash\nfunction assert_json_contains() {\n  local key=\"$1\"\n  local expected_value=\"$2\"\n  local json=\"$3\"\n\n  # Check if key exists\n  if ! echo \"$json\" | grep -q \"\\\"$key\\\"\"; then\n    echo \"Key ''$key'' not found in JSON\" >&2\n    return 1\n  fi\n\n  local actual_value\n  actual_value=$(echo \"$json\" | grep -o \"\\\"$key\\\": *\\\"[^\\\"]*\\\"\" | cut -d''\"'' -f4)\n\n  if [[ \"$actual_value\" == \"$expected_value\" ]]; then\n    return 0\n  fi\n\n  echo \"Expected key ''$key'' to have value ''$expected_value'', got ''$actual_value''\" >&2\n  return 1\n}\n```\n\n#### REFACTOR\n\nContinue improving.\n\n### 5. TDD Cycle 3-N: Additional Cases\n\nContinue RED-GREEN-REFACTOR for:\n- Different value types (numbers, booleans)\n- Nested JSON objects\n- Malformed JSON handling\n- Edge cases (empty values, null, etc.)\n\n### 6. Documentation\n\nAdd function documentation:\n\n```bash\n##\n# Asserts that a JSON string contains a specific key-value pair\n#\n# Arguments:\n#   $1 - Key to search for\n#   $2 - Expected value\n#   $3 - JSON string\n#\n# Returns:\n#   0 if key exists with expected value\n#   1 if key missing or value differs\n#\n# Example:\n#   local json=''{\"name\": \"bashunit\"}''\n#   assert_json_contains \"name\" \"bashunit\" \"$json\"\n##\nfunction assert_json_contains() {\n  # Implementation\n}\n```\n\n### 7. Integration\n\n**If new file created:**\n- Source it in main `bashunit.sh`\n- Add to build process if needed\n\n**Update exports:**\n```bash\n# In src/bashunit.sh or relevant file\nexport -f assert_json_contains\n```\n\n### 8. Comprehensive Testing\n\n**Run all assertion tests:**\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/unit/assert*.sh\n```\n\n**Run full test suite:**\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/\n```\n\n**Quality checks:**\n```bash\nmake sa\nmake lint\nshfmt -w .\n```\n\n### 9. Documentation Updates\n\n**Update user-facing docs:**\n- Add to `docs/assertions.md` (or equivalent)\n- Add examples\n- Add to API reference\n- Update CHANGELOG\n\n**Example docs:**\n```markdown\n## assert_json_contains\n\nAsserts that a JSON string contains a specific key-value pair.\n\n### Usage\n\nbash\nassert_json_contains \"key\" \"expected_value\" \"$json_string\"\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `key` - The JSON key to look for\n- `expected_value` - The expected value for the key\n- `json_string` - The JSON to search\n\n### Examples\n\nbash\n# Simple object\nlocal user=''{\"name\": \"John\", \"age\": 30}''\nassert_json_contains \"name\" \"John\" \"$user\"\n\n# Nested object\nlocal data=''{\"user\": {\"name\": \"John\"}}''\nassert_json_contains \"user.name\" \"John\" \"$data\"\n\n```\n\n### 10. Final Verification\n\n**Complete checklist:**\n- [ ] All tests passing (RED-GREEN-REFACTOR for each)\n- [ ] Test both success and failure cases\n- [ ] Test edge cases\n- [ ] Function documented\n- [ ] Exported/integrated properly\n- [ ] User documentation updated\n- [ ] CHANGELOG updated\n- [ ] Code review ready\n- [ ] Task file completed\n\n## Testing Patterns for Assertions\n\n### Test Success\n```bash\nfunction test_should_pass_when_condition_met() {\n  assert_new_assertion \"input\"\n}\n```\n\n### Test Failure\n```bash\nfunction test_should_fail_when_condition_not_met() {\n  assert_fails \\\n    \"assert_new_assertion ''bad_input''\"\n}\n```\n\n### Test Error Message\n```bash\nfunction test_should_show_helpful_error_message() {\n  local output\n  output=$(assert_new_assertion \"bad_input\" 2>&1) || true\n\n  assert_contains \"Expected\" \"$output\"\n  assert_contains \"Got\" \"$output\"\n}\n```\n\n### Test Edge Cases\n```bash\nfunction test_should_handle_empty_input() {\n  assert_fails \\\n    \"assert_new_assertion ''''\"\n}\n\nfunction test_should_handle_special_characters() {\n  assert_new_assertion \"special$chars\"\n}\n```\n\n## Common Assertion Patterns\n\n### Parameter Validation\n```bash\nif [[ $# -lt 2 ]]; then\n  echo \"assert_name requires at least 2 arguments\" >&2\n  return 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Clear Error Messages\n```bash\necho \"Expected <expected>, but got <actual>\" >&2\necho \"  Expected: $expected\" >&2\necho \"  Actual: $actual\" >&2\n```\n\n### Consistent Return Codes\n```bash\nreturn 0  # Success\nreturn 1  # Assertion failed\n```\n\n## Related Assertions to Study\n\n- `assert_equals` - Basic comparison\n- `assert_contains` - String searching\n- `assert_matches` - Regex matching\n- `assert_file_exists` - File operations\n- `assert_array_contains` - Array operations\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide progress updates:\n\n```\n📝 Planning: assert_json_contains function\n    - Parameters: key, expected_value, json_string\n    - Will validate JSON and check key-value\n\n🔴 RED: test_should_pass_when_key_value_exists\n    Test written and failing (function not found)\n\n🟢 GREEN: Minimal implementation added\n    Test now passing\n\n🔵 REFACTOR: Improved JSON parsing\n    All tests still passing\n\n✅ Completed: assert_json_contains\n    - 5 tests passing\n    - Documentation added\n    - Ready for review\n```\n\n## Quality Standards\n\n**All assertions must:**\n- Follow Bash 3.0+ compatibility (@.claude/rules/bash-style.md)\n- Have comprehensive tests (success, failure, edge cases)\n- Have clear, helpful error messages\n- Be documented with examples\n- Pass shellcheck and formatting\n- Work in parallel test execution\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Test patterns: @tests/unit/assert_test.sh\n- Assertion implementations: @src/assertions.sh\n- Testing rules: @.claude/rules/testing.md\n- TDD workflow: @.claude/rules/tdd-workflow.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:20:17.863Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Testing Agents needing to extend bash script assertion capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要扩展bash脚本断言功能的测试代理。","ja":"bashスクリプトのアサーション機能を拡張する必要があるテストエージェントに最適。","ko":"bash 스크립트의 assertion기능을 확장해야 하는 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba que necesitan ampliar las capacidades de aserción de los scripts de bash.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test ayant besoin d''étendre les capacités d''assertion des scripts bash.","de":"Perfekt für Testagenten, die die Assertionsfähigkeiten von Bash-Skripten erweitern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste que precisam estender as capacidades de afirmação de scripts bash.","ru":"Идеально для агентов тестирования, которым необходимо расширить возможности утверждения скриптов bash.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار بحاجة إلى توسيع قدرات التحقق من البرامج النصية bash."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom assertion functions using bashunit, following strict Test-Driven Development methodology, and leveraging bash script testing libraries to enhance existing assertion capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用bashunit的自定义断言函数的能力，遵循严格的测试驱动开发方法ology，并利用bash脚本测试库来增强现有的断言功能。","ja":"bashunitを使用したカスタムアサーション関数を作成するエージェントを可能にし、厳格なテスト駆動開発方法ologyに従い、bashスクリプトテストライブラリを利用して既存のアサーション機能を強化する。","ko":"에이전트가 bashunit를 사용하여 사용자 정의 assertion 함수를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 엄격한 테스트 주도 개발 방법론에 따라 bash 스크립트 테스트 라이브러리를 활용하여 기존의 assertion 기능을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear funciones de aserción personalizadas utilizando bashunit, siguiendo una metodología estricta de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas, y aprovechando las bibliotecas de prueba de scripts de bash para mejorar las capacidades de aserción existentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fonctions d''assertion personnalisées en utilisant bashunit, en suivant une méthodologie stricte de développement piloté par les tests, et en exploitant les bibliothèques de test de scripts bash pour améliorer les capacités d''assertion existantes.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Assertionsfunktionen mithilfe von bashunit zu erstellen, indem sie eine strenge Testgetriebene-Entwicklungsmethodik befolgen und die Testbibliotheken für Bash-Skripte nutzen, um die bestehenden Assertionsfähigkeiten zu erweitern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar funções de afirmação personalizadas usando bashunit, seguindo a metodologia rigorosa de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Testes, e aproveitando as bibliotecas de teste de scripts bash para melhorar as capacidades de afirmação existentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать пользовательские функции утверждения с помощью bashunit, следуя строгой методологии разработки, управляемой тестированием, и используя библиотеки тестирования скриптов bash для расширения существующих возможностей утверждения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء دوال التحقق المخصصة باستخدام bashunit، وتطبيق منهجية التطوير القائم على الاختبار بشكل صارم، واستخدام مكتبات اختبار البرامج النصية bash لتحسين قدرات التحقق الموجودة."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new assertion functions to bashunit","Enhancing existing assertion capabilities in bash scripts","Implementing custom assert_* functions for specific testing needs"],"zh":["向bashunit添加新的断言函数","增强bash脚本中的现有断言功能","为特定的测试需求实现自定义assert_*函数"],"ja":["bashunitに新しいアサーション関数を追加する","bashスクリプトにおける既存のアサーション機能を強化する","特定のテストニーズに対してカスタムassert_*関数を実装する"],"ko":["bashunit에 새로운 assertion 함수를 추가하는こと","bash 스크립트의 기존 assertion 기능을 강화하는 것","특정 테스트 요구 사항을 위한 사용자 정의 assert_* 함수를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Añadir nuevas funciones de aserción a bashunit","Mejorar las capacidades de aserción existentes en scripts de bash","Implementar funciones de aserción personalizadas para necesidades de prueba específicas"],"fr":["Ajouter de nouvelles fonctions d''assertion à bashunit","Améliorer les capacités d''assertion existantes dans les scripts bash","Mettre en œuvre des fonctions d''assertion personnalisées pour des besoins de test spécifiques"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer Assertionsfunktionen zu bashunit","Verbesserung der bestehenden Assertionsfähigkeiten in Bash-Skripten","Implementierung benutzerdefinierter Assert-Funktionen für spezifische Testanforderungen"],"pt":["Adicionar novas funções de afirmação ao bashunit","Melhorar as capacidades de afirmação existentes em scripts bash","Implementar funções de afirma_* personalizadas para necessidades de teste específicas"],"ru":["Добавление новых функций утверждения в bashunit","Улучшение существующих возможностей утверждения в скриптах bash","Реализация пользовательских функций assert_* для конкретных потребностей тестирования"],"ar":["إضافة دوال تحقق جديدة إلى bashunit","تحسين قدرات التحقق الحالية في البرامج النصية bash","تنفيذ دوال تحقق مخصصة assert_* لنواحي اختبار محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires task file to exist","Understanding of patterns in tests/unit/assert_test.sh is necessary","Knowledge of the specific requirement for the new assertion is needed"],"zh":["需要任务文件存在","需要了解tests/unit/assert_test.sh中的模式","需要了解新断言的具体需求"],"ja":["タスクファイルが存在する必要がある","tests/unit/assert_test.shのパターンを理解する必要がある","新しいアサーションの具体的な要件を理解する必要がある"],"ko":["작업 파일이 존재해야 하는 것","tests/unit/assert_test.sh의 패턴을 이해하는 것이 필요","새로운 assertion의 구체적인 요구 사항을 이해하는 것이 필요"],"es":["Requiere que el archivo de tarea exista","Es necesaria una comprensión de los patrones en tests/unit/assert_tes