terung von Spots nach Ort und Bedingungen","Integration mit Navigationswerkzeugen"],"pt":["Banco de dados de spots de kite","Previsão do tempo para kitesurfistas","Ferramenta de IA para kitesurf","Informações sobre condições climáticas","Spots de kite em todo o mundo","Previsão de ventos e ondas"],"ru":["База данных спотов для кайта","Прогноз погоды для кайтсёрферов","Инструмент ИИ для кайта","Информация о погодных условиях","Споты для кайта по всему миру","Прогноз ветров и волн"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات للسبوتات","توقعات الطقس للرايدرز","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للرايدرز","معلومات عن الظروف المناخية","السبوتات في جميع أنحاء العالم","توقعات الرياح والأمواج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用profile-blocking","什么是kite spots","profile-blocking安装","kitesurfing天气预报","AI智能工具","profile-blocking设置指南","kite spots数据库"],"ja":["profile-blockingの使い方","Kitesurfingスポットとは","profile-blockingのインストール","Kitesurfingの天気予報","AIエージェント","profile-blockingの設定ガイド","Kitesurfingスポットデータベース"],"ko":["profile-blocking 사용법","카이트 서핑 스포트란","profile-blocking 설치","카이트 서핑 날씨 예보","AI 에이전트","profile-blocking 설정 가이드","카이트 서핑 스포트 데이터베이스"],"es":["herramientas de kitesurf","spots de kitesurf","pronósticos del tiempo para kitesurfers","cómo usar herramientas de kitesurf","qué es el bloqueo de perfil","alternativas a herramientas de kitesurf","instalación de herramientas de kitesurf"],"fr":["outils de kitesurf","spots de kitesurf","prévisions météo pour les kitesurfers","comment utiliser les outils de kitesurf","qu''est-ce que le blocage de profil","alternatives aux outils de kitesurf","installation des outils de kitesurf"],"de":["Kitesurf-Tools","Kitesurf-Spots","Wettervorhersagen für Kitesurfer","wie man Kitesurf-Tools verwendet","was ist die Profil-Blockierung","Alternativen zu Kitesurf-Tools","Installation von Kitesurf-Tools"],"pt":["como usar profile-blocking","o que é profile-blocking","ferramentas de IA para kitesurf","profile-blocking alternativa","profile-blocking vs kite spot","instalar profile-blocking","guia de configuração do profile-blocking","kitesurf com profile-blocking","profile-blocking para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать profile-blocking","что такое profile-blocking","инструменты ИИ для кайта","альтернатива profile-blocking","profile-blocking vs kite spot","установить profile-blocking","руководство по настройке profile-blocking","кайтсёрфинг с profile-blocking","profile-blocking для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام profile-blocking","ما هو profile-blocking","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للرايدرز","بديل profile-blocking","profile-blocking مقابل سبوت كايت","تثبيت profile-blocking","دليل إعداد profile-blocking","رايدرز مع profile-blocking","profile-blocking للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"pwittchen","repo":"varun.surf","repoPath":"pwittchen/varun.surf","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.911Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"profile-blocking","description":"Find blocking calls in reactive WebFlux code that can cause performance issues and thread starvation","bodyPreview":"# Profile Blocking Skill\n\nIdentify blocking calls in the reactive codebase that can cause thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Search for Blocking Patterns\n\nUse `Grep` to search for these blocking call patterns:\n\n#### Direct Blocking Calls\n```java\n.block()           // Mono/Flux blocking subscription\n.blockFirst()      // Flux blocking first element\n.blockLast()       // Flux blocking last element\n.blockOptional()   //","body":"# Profile Blocking Skill\n\nIdentify blocking calls in the reactive codebase that can cause thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Search for Blocking Patterns\n\nUse `Grep` to search for these blocking call patterns:\n\n#### Direct Blocking Calls\n```java\n.block()           // Mono/Flux blocking subscription\n.blockFirst()      // Flux blocking first element\n.blockLast()       // Flux blocking last element\n.blockOptional()   // Mono blocking to Optional\n.toFuture().get()  // CompletableFuture blocking\n.get()             // Future.get() blocking\n.join()            // CompletableFuture.join()\n```\n\n#### Thread Blocking\n```java\nThread.sleep(      // Thread sleep\nObject.wait(       // Object monitor wait\n.await(            // CountDownLatch, CyclicBarrier await\n.acquire(          // Semaphore blocking acquire\nsynchronized       // Synchronized blocks (potential)\nReentrantLock.lock // Explicit locking\n```\n\n#### Blocking I/O\n```java\nInputStream        // Blocking input streams\nOutputStream       // Blocking output streams\nFileInputStream    // File I/O\nFileOutputStream   // File I/O\nBufferedReader     // Blocking readers\nScanner            // Blocking scanner\nnew URL(           // URL.openStream() is blocking\nHttpURLConnection  // Blocking HTTP\n```\n\n#### JDBC/Database (if present)\n```java\nJdbcTemplate       // Blocking JDBC\nEntityManager      // Blocking JPA\n.save(             // Repository blocking save\n.findBy            // Repository blocking find\nDataSource         // Direct datasource access\n```\n\n### 2. Context-Aware Analysis\n\nFor each finding, determine if it''s:\n\n**Acceptable blocking**:\n- Inside `StructuredTaskScope` (this project uses Java 24 virtual threads)\n- In `@Scheduled` methods running on separate thread pool\n- In test code\n- Wrapped in `Mono.fromCallable()` with `.subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())`\n- In startup/initialization code (non-request path)\n\n**Problematic blocking**:\n- In `@RestController` methods returning `Mono`/`Flux`\n- In reactive chain operators (map, flatMap, filter)\n- On Netty event loop threads\n- In `WebFilter` implementations\n- Inside `Mono.create()` or `Flux.create()` without scheduler\n\n### 3. Analyze Reactive Chains\n\nCheck for anti-patterns in reactive code:\n\n```java\n// BAD: Blocking in map\nmono.map(data -> {\n    blockingCall();  // Blocks event loop!\n    return result;\n})\n\n// BAD: Blocking in flatMap\nflux.flatMap(item -> {\n    var result = blockingService.call();  // Blocks!\n    return Mono.just(result);\n})\n\n// GOOD: Proper offloading\nmono.flatMap(data ->\n    Mono.fromCallable(() -> blockingCall())\n        .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())\n)\n```\n\n### 4. Check This Project''s Specific Patterns\n\n**Files to examine**:\n- `src/main/java/**/controller/*.java` - REST endpoints\n- `src/main/java/**/service/*.java` - Service layer\n- `src/main/java/**/strategy/*.java` - Strategy implementations\n- `src/main/java/**/config/*.java` - Configuration classes\n\n**Known acceptable patterns in this project**:\n- `StructuredTaskScope` usage in `AggregatorService` (virtual threads)\n- `.block()` inside virtual thread contexts\n- OkHttp calls (executed in separate thread pool)\n\n**Patterns to flag**:\n- `.block()` in controller methods\n- Blocking in `WebFilter` or `HandlerFilterFunction`\n- Synchronous HTTP calls without proper scheduling\n\n### 5. Virtual Thread Considerations\n\nThis project uses Java 24 with virtual threads. Check:\n\n```java\n// Virtual thread factory usage\nThread.ofVirtual().factory()\n\n// StructuredTaskScope usage (blocking is OK inside)\ntry (var scope = new StructuredTaskScope.ShutdownOnFailure()) {\n    scope.fork(() -> blockingCall());  // OK - virtual thread\n    scope.join();  // OK - virtual thread blocks, not platform thread\n}\n```\n\n### 6. HTTP Client Analysis\n\nCheck OkHttp usage patterns:\n\n```java\n// Synchronous call - check if on reactive thread\nResponse response = client.newCall(request).execute();\n\n// Better: Use async\nclient.newCall(request).enqueue(callback);\n\n// Or wrap properly\nMono.fromCallable(() -> client.newCall(request).execute())\n    .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Blocking Call Analysis Report\n\n### Summary\n| Category | Count | Severity |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Direct .block() calls | X | High/Medium |\n| Thread.sleep() | X | High |\n| Blocking I/O | X | Medium |\n| Synchronized blocks | X | Low |\n| **Total potential issues** | **Y** | |\n\n### Critical Issues (Event Loop Blocking)\n\n#### [Issue Title]\n**File**: `path/to/file.java:line`\n**Pattern**: `.block()` in reactive chain\n**Context**: Inside @RestController endpoint\n**Risk**: Thread starvation, request timeouts\n```java\n// Current code\n@GetMapping(\"/data\")\npublic Mono<Data> getData() {\n    return service.fetchData()\n        .map(d -> blockingTransform(d));  // BLOCKS!\n}\n```\n**Fix**:\n```java\n@GetMapping(\"/data\")\npublic Mono<Data> getData() {\n    return service.fetchData()\n        .flatMap(d -> Mono.fromCallable(() -> blockingTransform(d))\n            .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic()));\n}\n```\n\n### Medium Priority (Potential Issues)\n\n| File | Line | Pattern | Context | Verdict |\n|------|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| Service.java | 42 | .block() | Inside StructuredTaskScope | OK |\n| Handler.java | 78 | Thread.sleep | Test code | OK |\n\n### Acceptable Blocking (Verified Safe)\n\nThese blocking calls are in appropriate contexts:\n\n| File | Line | Pattern | Why It''s OK |\n|------|------|---------|-------------|\n| AggregatorService.java | 120 | .block() | Inside virtual thread scope |\n| ForecastService.java | 85 | OkHttp.execute() | Wrapped in fromCallable |\n\n### Patterns Found\n\n#### .block() Calls\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Service.java:42  - response.block()\nsrc/main/java/.../Service.java:87  - result.blockFirst()\n```\n\n#### Thread Blocking\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Worker.java:23   - Thread.sleep(1000)\n```\n\n#### Blocking I/O\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Reader.java:15   - new FileInputStream()\n```\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. **Immediate**: Move blocking call at `File.java:42` to bounded elastic scheduler\n2. **Review**: Verify StructuredTaskScope usage covers all blocking in AggregatorService\n3. **Consider**: Replace synchronous OkHttp with async calls or WebClient\n\n### Reactive Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] No .block() in @RestController methods\n- [ ] No .block() in WebFilter implementations\n- [ ] Blocking I/O wrapped with boundedElastic scheduler\n- [ ] Thread.sleep() only in tests or scheduled tasks\n- [ ] Synchronized blocks minimized and not in hot paths\n- [ ] HTTP clients properly configured for async or offloaded\n```\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n1. Use `Grep` to find all `.block()` calls\n2. Use `Grep` to find `Thread.sleep`, `.await(`, `synchronized`\n3. Use `Grep` to find blocking I/O patterns\n4. Read each file to determine context (controller vs service vs test)\n5. Check if blocking is inside StructuredTaskScope or virtual thread\n6. Categorize findings by severity\n7. Generate report with fix recommendations\n\n## Notes\n\n- Virtual threads (Java 21+) change the blocking calculus - blocking is OK on virtual threads\n- This project uses StructuredTaskScope, so verify scope boundaries\n- OkHttp is blocking by default but may be acceptable if not on event loop\n- Focus on request-handling paths; scheduled tasks are lower priority\n- Some `.block()` in tests is normal and acceptable\n- Spring WebFlux Netty uses limited event loop threads - blocking them is critical\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:33.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Reactive Java Agents needing to identify performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Spring WebFlux 应用程序中识别性能劣化的反应式 Java 代理。","ja":"Spring WebFlux アプリケーションでパフォーマンスの低下を識別する必要がある反応性 Java エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Spring WebFlux 애플리케이션에서 성능 저하를 식별해야 하는 반응형 Java 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Reactive Java Agents needing to identify performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.","fr":"Perfect for Reactive Java Agents needing to identify performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.","de":"Perfect for Reactive Java Agents needing to identify performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Java Reativos que precisam identificar degradação de desempenho em aplicações Spring WebFlux.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Реактивных Java-агентов, которым необходимо выявлять ухудшение производительности в приложениях Spring WebFlux.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Java التفاعليين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديد الانخفاض في أداء تطبيقات Spring WebFlux."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect blocking calls in reactive codebases using Grep, preventing thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation by identifying patterns like .block(), .blockFirst(), and .blockLast() in Mono/Flux subscriptions.","zh":"赋予代理检测反应式代码库中的阻塞调用，使用 Grep 防止线程饥饿、死锁和性能劣化，通过识别 Mono/Flux 订阅中的 .block()、.blockFirst() 和 .blockLast() 模式。","ja":"Grep を使用して反応性コードベース内のブロッキング呼び出しを検出することで、エージェントにスレッド枯渇、デッドロック、パフォーマンスの低下を防ぎ、Mono/Flux サブスクリプション内の .block()、.blockFirst()、.blockLast() パターンを識別することができます。","ko":"Grep를 사용하여 반응형 코드베이스 내의 블로킹 호출을 감지하여 에이전트가 쓰레기 기아, 데드락 및 성능 저하를 방지하고 Mono/Flux 구독 내의 .block(), .blockFirst() 및 .blockLast() 패턴을 식별할 수 있습니다.","es":"Empowers agents to detect blocking calls in reactive codebases using Grep, preventing thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation by identifying patterns like .block(), .blockFirst(), and .blockLast() in Mono/Flux subscriptions.","fr":"Empowers agents to detect blocking calls in reactive codebases using Grep, preventing thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation by identifying patterns like .block(), .blockFirst(), and .blockLast() in Mono/Flux subscriptions.","de":"Empowers agents to detect blocking calls in reactive codebases using Grep, preventing thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation by identifying patterns like .block(), .blockFirst(), and .blockLast() in Mono/Flux subscriptions.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar chamadas de bloqueio em código reativo usando Grep, prevenindo a fome de threads, deadlocks e degradação de desempenho, identificando padrões como .block(), .blockFirst() e .blockLast() em assinaturas Mono/Flux.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать блокирующие вызовы в реактивном коде с помощью Grep, предотвращая голодание потоков, взаимоблокировки и ухудшение производительности, выявляя шаблоны, такие как .block(), .blockFirst() и .blockLast() в подписках Mono/Flux.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من كشف المكالمات المحجوزة في قاعدة الرمز التفاعلي باستخدام Grep، ومنع جوع الخيوط وتعطيلها وانخفاض الأداء، من خلال تحديد أنماط مثل .block() و .blockFirst() و .blockLast() في الإشتراكات Mono/Flux."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging thread starvation issues in Spring WebFlux","Identifying performance bottlenecks caused by blocking calls","Optimizing reactive codebases for better concurrency and scalability"],"zh":["调试 Spring WebFlux 中的线程饥饿问题","识别阻塞调用引起的性能瓶颈","优化反应式代码库以获得更好的并发性和可扩展性"],"ja":["Spring WebFlux のスレッド枯渇問題をデバッグする","ブロッキング呼び出しによって引き起こされるパフォーマンスのボトルネックを識別する","反応性コードベースを並列性と拡張性の向上のために最適化する"],"ko":["Spring WebFlux의 쓰레기 기아 문제를 디버깅하는 것","블로킹 호출에 의한 성능 병목현상을 식별하는 것","반응형 코드베이스를 병렬성 및 확장성 향상을 위해 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Debugging thread starvation issues in Spring WebFlux","Identifying performance bottlenecks caused by blocking calls","Optimizing reactive codebases for better concurrency and scalability"],"fr":["Debugging thread starvation issues in Spring WebFlux","Identifying performance bottlenecks caused by blocking calls","Optimizing reactive codebases for better concurrency and scalability"],"de":["Debugging thread starvation issues in Spring WebFlux","Identifying performance bottlenecks caused by blocking calls","Optimizing reactive codebases for better concurrency and scalability"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de fome de threads em Spring WebFlux","Identificação de gargalos de desempenho causados por chamadas de bloqueio","Otimização de código reativo para melhor concorrência e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Отладка проблем с голоданием потоков в Spring WebFlux","Выявление узких мест производительности, вызванных блокирующими вызовами","Оптимизация реактивного кода для лучшей конкурентности и масштабируемости"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء نقص threads في Spring WebFlux","تحديد عُنق الزجاجة في الأداء الناجم عن المكالمات المحجوزة","تحسين قاعدة الرمز التفاعلي لتحسين التزامن وال قابليّة للتوسّع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the reactive codebase","Limited to Spring WebFlux applications","Dependent on Grep for pattern searching"],"zh":["需要访问反应式代码库","仅限 Spring WebFlux 应用程序","依赖 Grep 进行模式搜索"],"ja":["反応性コードベースへのアクセスが必要","Spring WebFlux アプリケーションに限定される","パターン検索に Grep への依存"],"ko":["반응형 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","Spring WebFlux 애플리케이션으로 제한","Grep에 대한 의존으로 패턴 검색"],"es":["Requires access to the reactive codebase","Limited to Spring WebFlux applications","Dependent on Grep for pattern searching"],"fr":["Requires access to the reactive codebase","Limited to Spring WebFlux applications","Dependent on Grep for pattern searching"],"de":["Requires access to the reactive codebase","Limited to Spring WebFlux applications","Dependent on Grep for pattern searching"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código reativo","Limitado a aplicações Spring WebFlux","Dependente de Grep para pesquisa de padrões"],"ru":["Требует доступа к реактивной базе кода","Ограничен приложениями Spring WebFlux","Зависит от Grep для поиска шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الرمز التفاعلي","محدود بتطبيقات Spring WebFlux","يعتمد على Grep للبحث عن الأنماط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fd7d8e18083bbf90058d1a469a74b86d2e8079196080861c0e1bfa6e17a84e8b","qualityScore":49}');
