":"Claude 是一个为 Drupal 开发提供支持的 AI 工具，帮助开发者遵循 Drupal 标准和最佳实践","ja":"Claude は、Drupal 開発をサポートする AI エージェントです。開発者が Drupal 標準とベストプラクティスに従うことを助けます","ko":"Claude 는 드루팔 개발을 지원하는 AI 에이전트입니다. 개발자가 드루팔 표준 및 최선의實踐을 따르도록 도와줍니다","es":"El desarrollo de Drupal con agentes de IA como Claude permite una mayor eficiencia y productividad","fr":"Le développement Drupal avec des agents d''IA comme Claude permet une plus grande efficacité et productivité","de":"Die Entwicklung von Drupal mit KI-Agents wie Claude ermöglicht eine höhere Effizienz und Produktivität","pt":"O skill de drupal-standards é uma ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores Drupal, proporcionando as melhores práticas para melhorar a eficiência e a qualidade ...","ru":"Навык drupal-standards - это инструмент ИИ для разработчиков Drupal, предоставляющий лучшие практики для улучшения эффективности и качества кода.","ar":"مهارة drupal-standards هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لمطوري دروبال، توفر أفضل الممارسات لتحسين الكفاءة وجودة الكود.","en":"SKILL Claude for Drupal development"},"definition":{"en":"SKILL Claude for Drupal development"},"features":{"zh":["遵循 Drupal 标准和最佳实践","提供代码审查和优化建议","支持 Drupal 模块和主题开发","集成 Drupal CLI 和其他开发工具","提供实时代码完成和提示"],"ja":["Drupal 標準とベストプラクティスに従った開発","コードレビューと最適化提案の提供","Drupal モジュールとテーマの開発サポート","Drupal CLI とその他の開発ツールとの統合","リアルタイムコード補完とヒントの提供"],"ko":["드루팔 표준 및 최선의實踐에 따른 개발","코드 리뷰 및 최적화 제안 제공","드루팔 모듈 및 테마 개발 지원","드루팔 CLI 및 기타 개발 도구와의 통합","실시간 코드 완성 및 힌트 제공"],"es":["Estándares de codificación para Drupal","Análisis de código automatizado","Mejora de la seguridad y rendimiento","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Automatización de tareas repetitivas"],"fr":["Normes de codage pour Drupal","Analyse de code automatisée","Amélioration de la sécurité et des performances","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Automatisation de tâches répétitives"],"de":["Codierungsstandards für Drupal","Automatisierte Code-Analyse","Sicherheits- und Leistungsverbesserung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung wiederkehrender Aufgaben"],"pt":["Melhorias de eficiência no desenvolvimento","Implementação de padrões de código","Análise de qualidade do código","Suporte a desenvolvedores iniciantes","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento existentes"],"ru":["Улучшение эффективности разработки","Реализация стандартов кода","Анализ качества кода","Поддержка начинающих разработчиков","Интеграция с существующими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تحسين الكفاءة في التطوير","تنفيذ معايير الكود","تحليل جودة الكود","دعم المطورين المبتدئين","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Drupal 开发工具","AI 工具","Drupal 标准","最佳实践","代码审查","代码优化","Drupal 模块开发","Drupal 主题开发"],"ja":["Drupal 開発ツール","AI エージェント","Drupal 標準","ベストプラクティス","コードレビュー","コード最適化","Drupal モジュール開発","Drupal テーマ開発"],"ko":["드루팔 개발 도구","AI 에이전트","드루팔 표준","최선의實踐","코드 리뷰","코드 최적화","드루팔 모듈 개발","드루팔 테마 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de Drupal con IA","herramientas de Drupal para agentes de IA","estándares de codificación para Drupal","cómo usar agentes de IA en Drupal","mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de Drupal","alternativas a Drupal","instalación de Drupal","guía de configuración de Drupal"],"fr":["développement Drupal avec IA","outils Drupal pour agents d''IA","normes de codage pour Drupal","comment utiliser des agents d''IA dans Drupal","meilleures pratiques pour le développement de Drupal","alternatives à Drupal","installation de Drupal","guide de configuration de Drupal"],"de":["Drupal-Entwicklung mit KI","Drupal-Tools für KI-Agents","Codierungsstandards für Drupal","wie man KI-Agents in Drupal verwendet","beste Praktiken für die Drupal-Entwicklung","Alternativen zu Drupal","Drupal-Installation","Konfigurationsanleitung für Drupal"],"pt":["desenvolvimento drupal","ferramentas de ia","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento","drupal-standards","como usar drupal-standards","o que é drupal-standards","drupal-standards vs drush","instalar drupal-standards","configurar drupal-standards"],"ru":["разработка drupal","инструменты ии","лучшие практики разработки","drupal-standards","как использовать drupal-standards","что такое drupal-standards","drupal-standards vs drush","установить drupal-standards","настроить drupal-standards"],"ar":["تطوير دروبال","أدوات آي أي","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير","drupal-standards","كيفية استخدام drupal-standards","ما هي drupal-standards","drupal-standards مقابل drush","تثبيت drupal-standards","إعداد drupal-standards"]}},"owner":"nonzod","repo":"drupaldev-claude-skill","repoPath":"nonzod/drupaldev-claude-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.911Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"drupal-standards","description":"Automatically applies Drupal coding standards when developing PHP modules, JavaScript, CSS, SQL queries, Twig templates, or YAML configs. Activates when creating/editing .php, .js, .css, .sql, .twig, .yml files or when user mentions module, query, template, form, or custom code.","bodyPreview":"# Drupal Coding Standards\n\nApply Drupal coding standards based on the development context.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nFrom `coding_standards/index.md`:\n- All code must follow Drupal coding standards (version-independent)\n- Use US English spelling in all comments and names\n- Standards are \"always-current\" and apply to all new code\n- Follow Boy Scout Rule: leave code better than you found it\n\n## Context Detection & Standard Loading\n\n### PHP Development (.php files, modules, services, plugins)\n\nWhen work","body":"# Drupal Coding Standards\n\nApply Drupal coding standards based on the development context.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nFrom `coding_standards/index.md`:\n- All code must follow Drupal coding standards (version-independent)\n- Use US English spelling in all comments and names\n- Standards are \"always-current\" and apply to all new code\n- Follow Boy Scout Rule: leave code better than you found it\n\n## Context Detection & Standard Loading\n\n### PHP Development (.php files, modules, services, plugins)\n\nWhen working with PHP code, **ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Core Standards**: Read `coding_standards/php/coding.md`\n2. **Documentation**: Read `coding_standards/php/documentation.md`\n3. **Namespaces**: Read `coding_standards/php/namespaces.md`\n4. **PSR-4**: Read `coding_standards/php/psr4.md`\n\nAdditionally, based on specific needs:\n- Creating services → Read `coding_standards/php/naming-services.md`\n- Exception handling → Read `coding_standards/php/exceptions.md`\n- Using placeholders → Read `coding_standards/php/placeholders-delimiters.md`\n- Error handling → Read `coding_standards/php/e_all.md`\n- Documentation examples → Read `coding_standards/php/documentation-examples.md`\n\n### JavaScript Development (.js files)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Core Standards**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/coding.md`\n2. **Documentation**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/documentation.md`\n3. **Best Practices**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/best-practice.md`\n4. **ESLint Config**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/eslint.md`\n\nIf using jQuery:\n- Read `coding_standards/javascript/jquery.md`\n\n### CSS Development (.css, .scss files, styling)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Core Standards**: Read `coding_standards/css/coding.md`\n2. **Formatting**: Read `coding_standards/css/format.md`\n3. **File Organization**: Read `coding_standards/css/file-organization.md`\n4. **Architecture**: Read `coding_standards/css/architecture.md`\n\nFor tool configuration:\n- Read `coding_standards/css/csscomb.md`\n- Read `coding_standards/css/review.md`\n\n### SQL Queries (database operations)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Conventions**: Read `coding_standards/sql/conventions.md`\n2. **Keywords**: Read `coding_standards/sql/keywords.md`\n3. **SELECT Queries**: Read `coding_standards/sql/select-from.md`\n\n### Twig Templates (.twig files)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards**:\n\n1. **Twig Standards**: Read `coding_standards/twig/coding.md`\n2. **Markup Standards**: Read `coding_standards/markup/style.md`\n\n### YAML Configuration (.yml, .yaml files)\n\n**ALWAYS read**:\n- Read `coding_standards/yaml/configuration-files.md`\n\n### Composer Packages (composer.json)\n\n**ALWAYS read**:\n- Read `coding_standards/composer/package-name.md`\n\n### Accessibility (forms, UI components, interactive elements)\n\n**ALWAYS read**:\n- Read `coding_standards/accessibility/accessibility.md`\n\n### Spelling & General\n\n**ALWAYS apply**:\n- Read `coding_standards/spelling/spelling.md` (US English required)\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\n1. User requests development task\n   ↓\n2. Identify file types/context (PHP, JS, CSS, SQL, etc.)\n   ↓\n3. Read ALL relevant standard files from coding_standards/\n   ↓\n4. Apply standards while writing code\n   ↓\n5. Validate code against standards\n   ↓\n6. Complete task with compliant code\n```\n\n## Multi-Context Tasks\n\nFor tasks involving multiple file types, load **ALL** relevant standards:\n\n**Example: Creating a custom module**\n- PHP standards (module code)\n- JavaScript standards (if includes JS)\n- CSS standards (if includes styling)\n- Twig standards (if includes templates)\n- YAML standards (for .info.yml and config files)\n- Accessibility standards (if includes UI)\n\n## Application Rules\n\n1. **Read First, Write Second**: Always read relevant standards before generating code\n2. **No Assumptions**: Never assume standards—always verify from files\n3. **Exact Compliance**: Follow standards exactly as written\n4. **US English Only**: All comments, variable names, and documentation\n5. **Complete Coverage**: If working with multiple file types, apply all relevant standards\n6. **Validation**: Before completing, verify code against loaded standards\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Creating a PHP Service\n\n```\nUser: \"Create a service to handle user notifications\"\n\nActions:\n1. Identify: PHP service development\n2. Read standards:\n   - coding_standards/php/coding.md\n   - coding_standards/php/documentation.md\n   - coding_standards/php/namespaces.md\n   - coding_standards/php/naming-services.md\n3. Generate code following all standards\n4. Include proper docblocks, namespaces, service naming\n```\n\n### Example 2: Writing Database Query\n\n```\nUser: \"Write a query to get active users with roles\"\n\nActions:\n1. Identify: SQL query\n2. Read standards:\n   - coding_standards/sql/conventions.md\n   - coding_standards/sql/keywords.md\n   - coding_standards/sql/select-from.md\n3. Write query with proper keyword capitalization and formatting\n```\n\n### Example 3: Building an Accessible Form\n\n```\nUser: \"Create a contact form with validation\"\n\nActions:\n1. Identify: Multi-context (PHP form API, JavaScript validation, accessibility)\n2. Read standards:\n   - coding_standards/php/coding.md\n   - coding_standards/php/documentation.md\n   - coding_standards/javascript/coding.md\n   - coding_standards/markup/style.md\n   - coding_standards/accessibility/accessibility.md\n3. Build form with all standards applied\n4. Ensure full accessibility compliance\n```\n\n## Critical Reminders\n\n- **Never skip reading standards** - always load them before coding\n- **Standards override preferences** - follow Drupal standards exactly\n- **When uncertain** - read additional related standard files\n- **Multi-file tasks** - load standards for ALL file types involved\n- **US English spelling** - non-negotiable requirement\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:37.195Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing adherence to Drupal coding standards and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要遵守Drupal编码标准和最佳实践的Web开发代理。","ja":"Drupalのコーディング規格とベストプラクティスに従う必要があるWeb開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Drupal 코딩 표준 및 최선의 관행을 준수해야 하는 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan adherirse a los estándares y mejores prácticas de codificación de Drupal.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant l''adhésion aux normes et aux meilleures pratiques de codage de Drupal.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die die Einhaltung der Drupal-Codierungsstandards und -bestpraktiken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam aderir aos padrões e melhores práticas de codificação do Drupal.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходимо соблюдать стандарты кодирования Drupal и лучшие практики.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى الامتثال لمعايير وتقاليد برمجة دروبال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce version-independent Drupal coding standards, ensuring consistent US English spelling in comments and names, and adhering to the Boy Scout Rule for improved code quality, all while utilizing PHP development standards for .php files, modules, services, and plugins.","zh":"赋予代理人执行版本无关的Drupal编码标准的能力，确保注释和名称中的一致的美式英语拼写，并遵循童军规则以提高代码质量，同时利用PHP开发标准用于.php文件、模块、服务和插件。","ja":"エージェントにバージョンに依存しないDrupalのコーディング規格を実施する能力を付与し、コメントや名前のスペルを一貫した米国英語にすることで、コードの品質を向上させるためのボーイスカウト規則に従い、.phpファイル、モジュール、サービス、プラグインのPHP開発規格を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 버전에 종속되지 않는 Drupal 코딩 표준을 시행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 주석 및 이름의 일관된 미국 영어拼写을 보장하고, 코드 품질을 향상시키기 위한 보이스카우트 규칙을 준수하며, .php 파일, 모듈, 서비스 및 플러그인의 PHP 개발 표준을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar estándares de codificación de Drupal independientes de la versión, garantizando la ortografía consistente en inglés estadounidense en comentarios y nombres, y adherirse a la Regla del Boy Scout para mejorar la calidad del código, todo mientras se utilizan los estándares de desarrollo de PHP para archivos .php, módulos, servicios y plugins.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des normes de codage de Drupal indépendantes de la version, garantissant l''orthographe cohérente en anglais américain dans les commentaires et les noms, et de se conformer à la Règle du Boy Scout pour améliorer la qualité du code, le tout en utilisant les normes de développement PHP pour les fichiers .php, les modules, les services et les plugins.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, version-unabhängige Drupal-Codierungsstandards durchzusetzen, eine konsistente US-englische Schreibweise in Kommentaren und Namen sicherzustellen und die Regeln des Boy Scout einzuhalten, um die Codequalität zu verbessern, während die PHP-Entwicklungsstandards für .php-Dateien, Module, Dienste und Plugins genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de codificação do Drupal independentes de versão, garantindo a ortografia consistente do inglês americano nos comentários e nomes, e aderindo à Regra do Escoteiro para melhorar a qualidade do código, tudo isso utilizando os padrões de desenvolvimento PHP para arquivos .php, módulos, serviços e plug-ins.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кодирования Drupal, независимых от версии, гарантируя последовательное использование американского английского языка в комментариях и именах, и следуя правилу «Скаута» для улучшения качества кода, все это при использовании стандартов разработки на PHP для файлов .php, модулей, сервисов и плагинов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فرض معايير برمجة دروبال المستقلة عن الإصدار، وضمان الإملاء المتماسك للغة الإنجليزية الأمريكية في التعليقات والأسماء، والامتثال لقاعدة الكشاف لتحسين جودة الشفرة، كل ذلك باستخدام معايير تطوير بي إتش بي لأي ملفات .php، وحدات، وخدمات، وأدوات إضافة"},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing Drupal coding standards in PHP development","Validating module and plugin code for compliance","Improving code quality through the Boy Scout Rule"],"zh":["强制执行PHP开发中的Drupal编码标准","验证模块和插件代码以确保遵守规定","通过童军规则提高代码质量"],"ja":["PHP開発におけるDrupalのコーディング規格を強制する","モジュールやプラグインのコードを検証して規格に準拠すること","ボーイスカウト規則を通じてコード品質を向上させる"],"ko":["PHP 개발에서 Drupal 코딩 표준 시행","모듈 및 플러그인 코드를 검증하여 준수","보이스카우트 규칙을 통해 코드 품질 향상"],"es":["Aplicar estándares de codificación de Drupal en el desarrollo de PHP","Validar el código de módulos y plugins para garantizar el cumplimiento","Mejorar la calidad del código a través de la Regla del Boy Scout"],"fr":["Appliquer les normes de codage de Drupal dans le développement PHP","Valider le code de modules et de plugins pour garantir la conformité","Améliorer la qualité du code via la Règle du Boy Scout"],"de":["Durchsetzen von Drupal-Codierungsstandards in der PHP-Entwicklung","Validieren von Modul- und Plugin-Code für die Einhaltung","Verbesserung der Codequalität durch die Regeln des Boy Scout"],"pt":["Impor padrões de codificação do Drupal no desenvolvimento PHP","Validar código de módulos e plug-ins para conformidade","Melhorar a qualidade do código por meio da Regra do Escoteiro"],"ru":["Обеспечение соблюдения стандартов кодирования Drupal при разработке на PHP","Проверка кода модулей и плагинов на соответствие","Улучшение качества кода с помощью правила «Скаута»"],"ar":["فرض معايير برمجة دروبال في تطوير بي إتش بي","تحقق من قانونية شفرة الوحدات وإضافات البرامج","تحسين جودة الشفرة من خلال قانون الكشاف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Drupal development context","Applies to new code only","Version-independent standards may require additional consideration for legacy code"],"zh":["需要了解Drupal开发背景","仅适用于新代码","版本无关的标准可能需要对遗留代码进行额外考虑"],"ja":["Drupal開発のコンテキストを理解する必要がある","新しいコードのみに適用される","バージョンに依存しない規格はレガシーコードには追加の考慮が必要となる"],"ko":["Drupal 개발 컨텍스트를 이해해야 함","새 코드에만 적용","버전에 종속되지 않는 표준은 레거시 코드에 대해 추가적인 고려가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del contexto de desarrollo de Drupal","Se aplica solo a nuevo código","Los estándares independientes de la versión pueden requerir consideraciones adicionales para el código heredado"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances du contexte de développement de Drupal","S''applique uniquement au nouveau code","Les normes indépendantes de la version peuvent nécessiter des considérations supplémentaires pour le code hérité"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Drupal-Entwicklungskontexts","Wird nur auf neuen Code angewendet","Version-unabhängige Standards können für Legacy-Code zusätzliche Überlegungen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do contexto de desenvolvimento do Drupal","Aplica-se apenas a novo código","Padrões independentes de versão podem exigir consideração adicional para código legado"],"ru":["Требует знания контекста разработки Drupal","Применяется только к новому коду","Стандарты, независимые от версии, могут потребовать дополнительного учета для устаревшего кода"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة سياق تطوير دروبال","ينطبق على الشفرة الجديدة فقط","المعايير المستقلة عن الإصدار قد تتطلب اعتبارًا إضافيًا للشفرة القديمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0aa609b0613a2dea56b6814692415992c728952de8da5ba041ba65c334d54bc3","qualityScore":49}');
