inrichtung von tuturuuu"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é especialista em Flutter","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para especialista em Flutter","especialista em Flutter vs outros ferramentas","instalar especialista em Flutter","guia de configuração do especialista em Flutter","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com Flutter","ferramentas de produtividade para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты для Flutter","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","альтернативы ИИ Агентам для Flutter","ИИ Агенты для Flutter vs другие инструменты","установить ИИ Агенты для Flutter","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов для Flutter","разработка приложений с помощью Flutter","инструменты повышения производительности для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو خبير Flutter","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل خبير Flutter","خبير Flutter مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت خبير Flutter","دليل إعداد خبير Flutter","تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام Flutter","أدوات الإنتاجية للمطورين"]}},"owner":"tutur3u","repo":"platform","repoPath":"tutur3u/platform","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.922Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-expert","description":"Use when building cross-platform applications with Flutter 3+ and Dart. Invoke for widget development, Riverpod/Bloc state management, GoRouter navigation, platform-specific implementations, performance optimization.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (R","body":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (Riverpod, Bloc)\n- Setting up navigation with GoRouter\n- Creating custom widgets and animations\n- Optimizing Flutter performance\n- Platform-specific implementations\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Setup** - Project structure, dependencies, routing\n2. **State** - Riverpod providers or Bloc setup\n3. **Widgets** - Reusable, const-optimized components\n4. **Test** - Widget tests, integration tests\n5. **Optimize** - Profile, reduce rebuilds\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Riverpod | `references/riverpod-state.md` | State management, providers, notifiers |\n| Bloc | `references/bloc-state.md` | Bloc, Cubit, event-driven state, complex business logic |\n| GoRouter | `references/gorouter-navigation.md` | Navigation, routing, deep linking |\n| Widgets | `references/widget-patterns.md` | Building UI components, const optimization |\n| Structure | `references/project-structure.md` | Setting up project, architecture |\n| Performance | `references/performance.md` | Optimization, profiling, jank fixes |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use const constructors wherever possible\n- Implement proper keys for lists\n- Use Consumer/ConsumerWidget for state (not StatefulWidget)\n- Follow Material/Cupertino design guidelines\n- Profile with DevTools, fix jank\n- Test widgets with flutter_test\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Perform heavy computation or side effects inside build()\n- Mutate state directly (always create new instances)\n- Use setState for app-wide state\n- Skip const on static widgets\n- Ignore platform-specific behavior\n- Block UI thread with heavy computation (use compute())\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Flutter features, provide:\n1. Widget code with proper const usage\n2. Provider/Bloc definitions\n3. Route configuration if needed\n4. Test file structure\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nFlutter 3.19+, Dart 3.3+, Riverpod 2.0, Bloc 8.x, GoRouter, freezed, json_serializable, Dio, flutter_hooks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:20.597Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cross-Platform Agents needing high-performance mobile application development with Flutter 3 and Dart.","zh":"适合需要高性能移动应用开发的跨平台代理，使用Flutter 3和Dart。","ja":"クロスプラットフォームエージェントが高性能なモバイルアプリケーション開発を必要とする場合に最適です。Flutter 3とDartを使用します。","ko":"고성능 모바일 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 크로스 플랫폼 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Flutter 3와 Dart를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de plataforma cruzada que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles de alto rendimiento con Flutter 3 y Dart.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de plateforme croisée nécessitant un développement d''applications mobiles haute performance avec Flutter 3 et Dart.","de":"Perfekt für Cross-Platform-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke mobile Anwendungsentwicklung mit Flutter 3 und Dart benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Cross-Platform que precisam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis de alto desempenho com Flutter 3 e Dart.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cross-Platform, которым требуется разработка мобильных приложений с высокими показателями производительности с использованием Flutter 3 и Dart.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتقاطعون الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول عالية الأداء مع Flutter 3 و Dart."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build performant, maintainable cross-platform applications using Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, and GoRouter, with proper state management and support for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能、可维护的跨平台应用的能力，使用Flutter 3.19+、Riverpod 2.0和GoRouter，具有适当的状态管理和对iOS、Android、Web和Desktop的支持。","ja":"エージェントに、Flutter 3.19+、Riverpod 2.0、GoRouterを使用して、高パフォーマンスでメンテナンスが可能なクロスプラットフォームアプリケーションを構築する能力を付与します。適切な状態管理と、iOS、Android、Web、Desktopのサポートを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 Flutter 3.19+、Riverpod 2.0 및 GoRouter를 사용하여 고성능이고 유지 보수 가능한 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 적절한 상태 관리 및 iOS, Android, Web, Desktop 지원을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones de plataforma cruzada performantes y mantenibles utilizando Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 y GoRouter, con una gestión de estado adecuada y soporte para iOS, Android, Web y Escritorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications de plateforme croisée performantes et maintenables en utilisant Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 et GoRouter, avec une gestion d''état appropriée et un support pour iOS, Android, Web et Bureau.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, performante und wartbare Cross-Platform-Anwendungen mit Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 und GoRouter zu erstellen, mit einer ordnungsgemäßen Zustandsverwaltung und Unterstützung für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações cross-platform performáticas e mantidas usando Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 e GoRouter, com gerenciamento de estado adequado e suporte para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать производительные и поддерживаемые кроссплатформенные приложения, используя Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0 и GoRouter, с правильным управлением состоянием и поддержкой для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات متقاطعة الأداء مع Flutter 3.19+ و Riverpod 2.0 و GoRouter، مع إدارة حالة مناسبة ودعم ل iOS و Android و Web و Desktop."},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable cross-platform Flutter applications","Implementing efficient state management with Riverpod 2.0","Developing high-performance apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop"],"zh":["构建可扩展的跨平台Flutter应用程序","使用Riverpod 2.0实现高效的状态管理","为iOS、Android、Web和Desktop开发高性能应用程序"],"ja":["拡張可能なクロスプラットフォームFlutterアプリケーションの構築","Riverpod 2.0を使用した効率的な状態管理の実装","iOS、Android、Web、Desktop向けの高パフォーマンスアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["확장 가능한 크로스 플랫폼 Flutter 애플리케이션 구축","Riverpod 2.0을 사용한 효율적인 상태 관리 구현","iOS, Android, Web, Desktop을 위한 고성능 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Construcción de aplicaciones de plataforma cruzada escalables con Flutter","Implementación de una gestión de estado eficiente con Riverpod 2.0","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de alto rendimiento para iOS, Android, Web y Escritorio"],"fr":["Création d''applications de plateforme croisée évolutives avec Flutter","Mise en œuvre d''une gestion d''état efficace avec Riverpod 2.0","Développement d''applications haute performance pour iOS, Android, Web et Bureau"],"de":["Erstellung von skalierbaren Cross-Platform-Anwendungen mit Flutter","Implementierung einer effizienten Zustandsverwaltung mit Riverpod 2.0","Entwicklung von Hochleistungs-Anwendungen für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop"],"pt":["Construir aplicações cross-platform Flutter escaláveis","Implementar gerenciamento de estado eficiente com Riverpod 2.0","Desenvolver aplicativos de alto desempenho para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop"],"ru":["Построение масштабируемых кроссплатформенных приложений Flutter","Реализация эффективного управления состоянием с Riverpod 2.0","Разработка высокопроизводительных приложений для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات متقاطعة مقتصة مع Flutter","تنفيذ إدارة حالة فعالة مع Riverpod 2.0","تطوير تطبيقات عالية الأداء ل iOS و Android و Web و Desktop"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dart programming knowledge","Flutter 3.19+ and Riverpod 2.0 compatibility needed"],"zh":["需要Dart编程知识","需要Flutter 3.19+和Riverpod 2.0兼容性"],"ja":["Dartプログラミングの知識が必要","Flutter 3.19+とRiverpod 2.0の互換性が必要"],"ko":["Dart 프로그래밍 지식이 필요합니다","Flutter 3.19+ 및 Riverpod 2.0 호환성 필요"],"es":["Se requiere conocimiento de programación Dart","Se necesitan compatibilidad con Flutter 3.19+ y Riverpod 2.0"],"fr":["Connaissances en programmation Dart requises","Compatibilité avec Flutter 3.19+ et Riverpod 2.0 nécessaire"],"de":["Dart-Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich","Kompatibilität mit Flutter 3.19+ und Riverpod 2.0 erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação em Dart","Compatibilidade necessária com Flutter 3.19+ e Riverpod 2.0"],"ru":["Требуется знание языка программирования Dart","Необходима совместимость с Flutter 3.19+ и Riverpod 2.0"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالبرمجة بلغة Dart","تحتاج إلى توافق مع Flutter 3.19+ و Riverpod 2.0"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"90aaa4d66ca184b017360a807b1b2d9aba62d037f7a37eb0fcf287acceccc2dd","qualityScore":49}');
