d''IA pour applications web","Fonctionnalités de jeu innovantes"],"de":["Mit React erstellt","Integration mit Cloudflare Workers","Entwicklung von Pokémon-Spielen","KI-Tools für Webanwendungen","Innovative Spielmerkmale"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de jogos com React","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Ferramenta de IA para jogos","Compatibilidade com Pokémon","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Разработка игр на React","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Инструмент ИИ для игр","Совместимость с Pokémon","Открытый и настраиваемый код"],"ar":["بناء ألعاب مع React","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للألعاب","التوافق مع بوكيمون","كود مفتوح وقابل للتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 base44-sdk","什么是 React","Cloudflare Workers 教程","base44-sdk 安装","base44-sdk 与其他游戏开发工具的比较","如何构建宝可梦游戏","AI 智能工具","游戏开发解决方案"],"ja":["base44-sdk の使い方","React とは","Cloudflare Workers チュートリアル","base44-sdk のインストール","base44-sdk と他のゲーム開発ツールの比較","ポケモンゲームの構築方法","AI エージェント","ゲーム開発ソリューション"],"ko":["base44-sdk 사용법","리액트란 무엇인가","클라우드플레어 워커 튜토리얼","base44-sdk 설치","base44-sdk와 다른 게임 개발 도구의 비교","포켓몬 게임 구축 방법","AI 에이전트","게임 개발 솔루션"],"es":["herramientas de AI","desarrollo de juegos","React","Cloudflare Workers","cómo usar base44-sdk","alternativas a base44-sdk","instalación de base44-sdk","guía de configuración de base44-sdk"],"fr":["outils d''IA","développement de jeux","React","Cloudflare Workers","comment utiliser base44-sdk","alternatives à base44-sdk","installation de base44-sdk","guide de configuration de base44-sdk"],"de":["KI-Tools","Spielentwicklung","React","Cloudflare Workers","wie man base44-sdk verwendet","Alternativen zu base44-sdk","Installation von base44-sdk","Konfigurationsanleitung für base44-sdk"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de jogos","react","cloudflare workers","jogos de pokémon","como usar base44-sdk","o que é base44-sdk","base44-sdk vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["инструменты ии","разработка игр","react","cloudflare workers","игры покемон","как использовать base44-sdk","что такое base44-sdk","base44-sdk против других инструментов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنمية الألعاب","react","cloudflare workers","ألعاب بوكيمون","كيفية استخدام base44-sdk","ما هي base44-sdk","base44-sdk مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"offloadmywork","repo":"pokemon-app","repoPath":"offloadmywork/pokemon-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.924Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"base44-sdk","description":"The base44 SDK is the library to communicate with base44 services. In projects, you use it to communicate with remote resources (entities, backend functions, ai agents) and to write backend functions. This skill is the place for learning about available modules and types. When you plan or implement a feature, you must learn this skill","bodyPreview":"# Base44 Coder\n\nBuild apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK.\n\n## ⚡ IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED - Read This First\n\nThis skill activates on ANY mention of \"base44\" or when a `base44/` folder exists. **DO NOT read documentation files or search the web before acting.**\n\n**Your first action MUST be:**\n1. Check if `base44/config.jsonc` exists in the current directory\n2. If **YES** (existing project scenario):\n   - This skill (base44-sdk) handles the request\n   - Implement features","body":"# Base44 Coder\n\nBuild apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK.\n\n## ⚡ IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED - Read This First\n\nThis skill activates on ANY mention of \"base44\" or when a `base44/` folder exists. **DO NOT read documentation files or search the web before acting.**\n\n**Your first action MUST be:**\n1. Check if `base44/config.jsonc` exists in the current directory\n2. If **YES** (existing project scenario):\n   - This skill (base44-sdk) handles the request\n   - Implement features using Base44 SDK\n   - Do NOT use base44-cli unless user explicitly requests CLI commands\n3. If **NO** (new project scenario):\n   - Transfer to base44-cli skill for project initialization\n   - This skill cannot help until project is initialized\n\n## When to Use This Skill vs base44-cli\n\n**Use base44-sdk when:**\n- Building features in an **EXISTING** Base44 project\n- `base44/config.jsonc` already exists in the project\n- Base44 SDK imports are present (`@base44/sdk`)\n- Writing JavaScript/TypeScript code using Base44 SDK modules\n- Implementing functionality, components, or features\n- User mentions: \"implement\", \"build a feature\", \"add functionality\", \"write code for\"\n- User says \"create a [type] app\" **and** a Base44 project already exists\n\n**DO NOT USE base44-sdk for:**\n- ❌ Initializing new Base44 projects (use `base44-cli` instead)\n- ❌ Empty directories without Base44 configuration\n- ❌ When user says \"create a new Base44 project/app/site\" and no project exists\n- ❌ CLI commands like `npx base44 create`, `npx base44 deploy`, `npx base44 login` (use `base44-cli`)\n\n**Skill Dependencies:**\n- `base44-sdk` assumes a Base44 project is **already initialized**\n- `base44-cli` is a **prerequisite** for `base44-sdk` in new projects\n- If user wants to \"create an app\" and no Base44 project exists, use `base44-cli` first\n\n**State Check Logic:**\nBefore selecting this skill, verify:\n- IF (user mentions \"create/build app\" OR \"make a project\"):\n  - IF (directory is empty OR no `base44/config.jsonc` exists):\n    → Use **base44-cli** (project initialization needed)\n  - ELSE:\n    → Use **base44-sdk** (project exists, build features)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\n// In Base44-generated apps, base44 client is pre-configured and available\n\n// CRUD operations\nconst task = await base44.entities.Task.create({ title: \"New task\", status: \"pending\" });\nconst tasks = await base44.entities.Task.list();\nawait base44.entities.Task.update(task.id, { status: \"done\" });\n\n// Get current user\nconst user = await base44.auth.me();\n```\n\n```javascript\n// External apps\nimport { createClient } from \"@base44/sdk\";\n\n// IMPORTANT: Use ''appId'' (NOT ''clientId'' or ''id'')\nconst base44 = createClient({ appId: \"your-app-id\" });\nawait base44.auth.loginViaEmailPassword(\"user@example.com\", \"password\");\n```\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: Do Not Hallucinate APIs\n\n**Before writing ANY Base44 code, verify method names against this table or [QUICK_REFERENCE.md](references/QUICK_REFERENCE.md).**\n\nBase44 SDK has unique method names. Do NOT assume patterns from Firebase, Supabase, or other SDKs.\n\n### Authentication - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `signInWithGoogle()` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `signInWithProvider(''google'')` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `auth.google()` | `loginWithProvider(''google'')` |\n| `signInWithEmailAndPassword(email, pw)` | `loginViaEmailPassword(email, pw)` |\n| `signIn(email, pw)` | `loginViaEmailPassword(email, pw)` |\n| `createUser()` / `signUp()` | `register({email, password})` |\n| `onAuthStateChanged()` | `me()` (no listener, call when needed) |\n| `currentUser` | `await auth.me()` |\n\n### Functions - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `functions.call(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `functions.run(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `callFunction(''name'', data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n| `httpsCallable(''name'')(data)` | `functions.invoke(''name'', data)` |\n\n### Integrations - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `ai.generate(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `openai.chat(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `llm(prompt)` | `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM({prompt})` |\n| `sendEmail(to, subject, body)` | `integrations.Core.SendEmail({to, subject, body})` |\n| `email.send()` | `integrations.Core.SendEmail({to, subject, body})` |\n| `uploadFile(file)` | `integrations.Core.UploadFile({file})` |\n| `storage.upload(file)` | `integrations.Core.UploadFile({file})` |\n\n### Entities - WRONG vs CORRECT\n\n| ❌ WRONG (hallucinated) | ✅ CORRECT |\n|------------------------|-----------|\n| `entities.Task.find({...})` | `entities.Task.filter({...})` |\n| `entities.Task.findOne(id)` | `entities.Task.get(id)` |\n| `entities.Task.insert(data)` | `entities.Task.create(data)` |\n| `entities.Task.remove(id)` | `entities.Task.delete(id)` |\n| `entities.Task.onChange(cb)` | `entities.Task.subscribe(cb)` |\n\n## SDK Modules\n\n| Module | Purpose | Reference |\n|--------|---------|-----------|\n| `entities` | CRUD operations on data models | [entities.md](references/entities.md) |\n| `auth` | Login, register, user management | [auth.md](references/auth.md) |\n| `agents` | AI conversations and messages | [base44-agents.md](references/base44-agents.md) |\n| `functions` | Backend function invocation | [functions.md](references/functions.md) |\n| `integrations` | AI, email, file uploads, custom APIs | [integrations.md](references/integrations.md) |\n| `connectors` | OAuth tokens (service role only) | [connectors.md](references/connectors.md) |\n| `analytics` | Track custom events and user activity | [analytics.md](references/analytics.md) |\n| `appLogs` | Log user activity in app | [app-logs.md](references/app-logs.md) |\n| `users` | Invite users to the app | [users.md](references/users.md) |\n\nFor client setup and authentication modes, see [client.md](references/client.md).\n\n**TypeScript Support:** Each reference file includes a \"Type Definitions\" section with TypeScript interfaces and types for the module''s methods, parameters, and return values.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall the Base44 SDK:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @base44/sdk\n```\n\n**Important:** Never assume or hardcode the `@base44/sdk` package version. Always install without a version specifier to get the latest version.\n\n## Creating a Client (External Apps)\n\nWhen creating a client in external apps, **ALWAYS use `appId` as the parameter name**:\n\n```javascript\nimport { createClient } from \"@base44/sdk\";\n\n// ✅ CORRECT\nconst base44 = createClient({ appId: \"your-app-id\" });\n\n// ❌ WRONG - Do NOT use these:\n// const base44 = createClient({ clientId: \"your-app-id\" });  // WRONG\n// const base44 = createClient({ id: \"your-app-id\" });        // WRONG\n```\n\n**Required parameter:** `appId` (string) - Your Base44 application ID\n\n**Optional parameters:**\n- `token` (string) - Pre-authenticated user token\n- `options` (object) - Configuration options\n  - `options.onError` (function) - Global error handler\n\n**Example with error handler:**\n```javascript\nconst base44 = createClient({\n  appId: \"your-app-id\",\n  options: {\n    onError: (error) => {\n      console.error(\"Base44 error:\", error);\n    }\n  }\n});\n```\n\n## Module Selection\n\n**Working with app data?**\n- Create/read/update/delete records → `entities`\n- Import data from file → `entities.importEntities()`\n- Realtime updates → `entities.EntityName.subscribe()`\n\n**User management?**\n- Login/register/logout → `auth`\n- Get current user → `auth.me()`\n- Update user profile → `auth.updateMe()`\n- Invite users → `users.inviteUser()`\n\n**AI features?**\n- Chat with AI agents → `agents` (requires logged-in user)\n- Create new conversation → `agents.createConversation()`\n- Manage conversations → `agents.getConversations()`\n- Generate text/JSON with AI → `integrations.Core.InvokeLLM()`\n- Generate images → `integrations.Core.GenerateImage()`\n\n**Custom backend logic?**\n- Run server-side code → `functions.invoke()`\n- Need admin access → `base44.asServiceRole.functions.invoke()`\n\n**External services?**\n- Send emails → `integrations.Core.SendEmail()`\n- Upload files → `integrations.Core.UploadFile()`\n- Custom APIs → `integrations.custom.call()`\n- OAuth tokens (Google, Slack) → `connectors` (backend only)\n\n**Tracking and analytics?**\n- Track custom events → `analytics.track()`\n- Log page views/activity → `appLogs.logUserInApp()`\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Filter and Sort Data\n\n```javascript\nconst pendingTasks = await base44.entities.Task.filter(\n  { status: \"pending\", assignedTo: userId },  // query\n  \"-created_date\",                             // sort (descending)\n  10,                                          // limit\n  0                                            // skip\n);\n```\n\n### Protected Routes (check auth)\n\n```javascript\nconst user = await base44.auth.me();\nif (!user) {\n  // Navigate to your custom login page\n  navigate(''/login'', { state: { returnTo: window.location.pathname } });\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n### Backend Function Call\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend\nconst result = await base44.functions.invoke(\"processOrder\", {\n  orderId: \"123\",\n  action: \"ship\"\n});\n\n// Backend function (Deno)\nimport { createClientFromRequest } from \"npm:@base44/sdk\";\n\nDeno.serve(async (req) => {\n  const base44 = createClientFromRequest(req);\n  const { orderId, action } = await req.json();\n  // Process with service role for admin access\n  const order = await base44.asServiceRole.entities.Orders.get(orderId);\n  return Response.json({ success: true });\n});\n```\n\n### Service Role Access\n\nUse `asServiceRole` in backend functions for admin-level operations:\n\n```javascript\n// User mode - respects permissions\nconst myTasks = await base44.entities.Task.list();\n\n// Service role - full access (backend only)\nconst allTasks = await base44.asServiceRole.entities.Task.list();\nconst token = await base44.asServiceRole.connectors.getAccessToken(\"slack\");\n```\n\n## Frontend vs Backend\n\n| Capability | Frontend | Backend |\n|------------|----------|---------|\n| `entities` (user''s data) | Yes | Yes |\n| `auth` | Yes | Yes |\n| `agents` | Yes | Yes |\n| `functions.invoke()` | Yes | Yes |\n| `integrations` | Yes | Yes |\n| `analytics` | Yes | Yes |\n| `appLogs` | Yes | Yes |\n| `users` | Yes | Yes |\n| `asServiceRole.*` | No | Yes |\n| `connectors` | No | Yes |\n\nBackend functions use `Deno.serve()` and `createClientFromRequest(req)` to get a properly authenticated client.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:48.907Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Workers Agents needing streamlined Base44 platform integration with React.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 Base44 平台与 React 集成的 Cloudflare Workers Agents。","ja":"React と Base44 プラットフォームの統合を簡素化する必要がある Cloudflare Workers エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React와 Base44 플랫폼 통합을 간소화해야 하는 Cloudflare Workers 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Cloudflare Workers que necesitan una integración de plataforma Base44 optimizada con React.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloudflare Workers nécessitant une intégration de plateforme Base44 simplifiée avec React.","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare Workers Agents, die eine optimierte Base44 Plattformintegration mit React benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cloudflare Workers que precisam de integração de plataforma Base44 simplificada com React.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Cloudflare Workers, которым требуется упрощенная интеграция с платформой Base44 и React.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Cloudflare Workers الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج منصة Base44 المُبسّط مع React."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build apps on the Base44 platform using the Base44 JavaScript SDK, handling requests and implementing features upon detecting ''base44/'' folders or mentions of ''base44'', while interacting with Cloudflare Workers and React.","zh":"赋予代理构建在 Base44 平台上使用 Base44 JavaScript SDK 的应用程序的能力，处理请求并在检测到 ''base44/'' 文件夹或提及 ''base44'' 时实现功能，同时与 Cloudflare Workers 和 React 交互。","ja":"Base44 JavaScript SDK を使用して Base44 プラットフォーム上でアプリケーションを構築するエージェントを可能にし、''base44/'' フォルダまたは ''base44'' の参照を検出すると要求を処理し、機能を実装し、Cloudflare Workers および React とやり取りします。","ko":"Base44 JavaScript SDK를 사용하여 Base44 플랫폼에서 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 ''base44/'' 폴더나 ''base44'' 언급을 감지하면 요청을 처리하고 기능을 구현하며 Cloudflare Workers와 React와 상호 작용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones en la plataforma Base44 utilizando el SDK de JavaScript de Base44, manejar solicitudes e implementar funciones al detectar carpetas ''base44/'' o menciones de ''base44'', mientras interactúa con Cloudflare Workers y React.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications sur la plateforme Base44 en utilisant le SDK JavaScript Base44, en gérant les requêtes et en mettant en œuvre des fonctionnalités lors de la détection de dossiers ''base44/'' ou de mentions de ''base44'', tout en interagissant avec Cloudflare Workers et React.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Apps auf der Base44-Plattform mit dem Base44 JavaScript SDK zu erstellen, Anfragen zu bearbeiten und Funktionen zu implementieren, wenn ''base44/''-Ordner oder Erwähnungen von ''base44'' erkannt werden, während sie mit Cloudflare Workers und React interagieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos na plataforma Base44 usando o SDK JavaScript Base44, lidando com solicitações e implementando recursos ao detectar pastas ''base44/'' ou menções de ''base44'', enquanto interage com Cloudflare Workers e React.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать приложения на платформе Base44, используя JavaScript SDK Base44, обрабатывать запросы и реализовывать функции при обнаружении папок ''base44/'' или упоминаниях ''base44'', а также взаимодействовать с Cloudflare Workers и React.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل من إنشاء تطبيقات على منصة Base44 باستخدام SDK JavaScript Base44، ومعالجة الطلبات وتنفيذ الميزات عند الكشف عن مجلدات ''base44/'' أو ذكر ''base44''، في حين التفاعل مع Cloudflare Workers و React."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Base44 features in existing projects","Handling requests upon ''base44/'' folder detection","Building new apps on the Base44 platform with React and Cloudflare Workers"],"zh":["在现有项目中实现 Base44 功能","检测到 ''base44/'' 文件夹时处理请求","使用 React 和 Cloudflare Workers 在 Base44 平台上构建新应用"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクトで Base44 機能を実装する","''base44/'' フォルダを検出時に要求を処理する","React および Cloudflare Workers を使用して Base44 プラットフォーム上で新しいアプリケーションを構築する"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트에서 Base44 기능을 구현하는 것","''base44/'' 폴더를 감지할 때 요청을 처리하는 것","React 및 Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 Base44 플랫폼에서 새로운 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Implementar características de Base44 en proyectos existentes","Manejar solicitudes al detectar la carpeta ''base44/''","Crear nuevas aplicaciones en la plataforma Base44 con React y Cloudflare Workers"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités Base44 dans les projets existants","Gérer les requêtes lors de la détection du dossier ''base44/''","Créer de nouvelles applications sur la plateforme Base44 avec React et Cloudflare Workers"],"de":["Base44-Features in bestehenden Projekten implementieren","Anfragen bearbeiten, wenn der Ordner ''base44/'' erkannt wird","Erstellen von neuen Apps auf der Base44-Plattform mit React und Cloudflare Workers"],"pt":["Implementar recursos Base44 em projetos existentes","Lidar com solicitações após detecção de pasta ''base44/''","Construir novos aplicativos na plataforma Base44 com React e Cloudflare Workers"],"ru":["Реализация функций Base44 в существующих проектах","Обработка запросов после обнаружения папки ''base44/''","Создание новых приложений на платформе Base44 с помощью React и Cloudflare Workers"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزات Base44 في المشاريع الحالية","معالجة الطلبات بعد الكشف عن مجلد ''base44/''","بناء تطبيقات جديدة على منصة Base44 باستخدام React و Cloudflare Workers"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ''base44/config.jsonc'' file in the current directory for existing project scenarios","Specific to Base44 platform and JavaScript SDK"],"zh":["需要在当前目录中具有 ''base44/config.jsonc'' 文件以适应现有项目场景","仅限 Base44 平台和 JavaScript SDK"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクト シナリオの場合、現在のディレクトリに ''base44/config.jsonc'' ファイルが必要です","Base44 プラットフォームおよび JavaScript SDK 専用"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트 시나리오의 경우 현재 디렉토리에 ''base44/config.jsonc'' 파일이 필요합니다.","Base44 플랫폼 및 JavaScript SDK 전용"],"es":["Requiere un archivo ''base44/config.jsonc'' en el directorio actual para escenarios de proyectos existentes","Específico de la plataforma Base44 y el SDK de JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier ''base44/config.jsonc'' dans le répertoire actuel pour les scénarios de projets existants","Spécifique à la plateforme Base44 et au SDK JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt eine Datei ''base44/config.jsonc'' im aktuellen Verzeichnis für Szenarien bestehender Projekte","Spezifisch für die Base44-Plattform und das JavaScript SDK"],"pt":["Requer arquivo ''base44/config.jsonc'' no diretório atual para cenários de projetos existentes","Específico para plataforma Base44 e JavaScript SDK"],"ru":["Требуется файл ''base44/config.jsonc'' в текущем каталоге для сценариев существующих проектов","Спецефичен для платформы Base44 и JavaScript SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف ''base44/config.jsonc'' في الدليل الحالي لمشاهد مشاريع موجودة","محدد لمنصة Base44 و SDK JavaScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"981c78c1075d71e505280d3ab8584b7e65314004408e701800698e28eecb1a6b","qualityScore":49}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('liauw-media/CodeAssist/gcp-architecture', 'community', 'liauw-media', 'CodeAssist', 'liauw-media/CodeAssist', 'gcp-architecture', 0, 0, 49, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.932Z', '2026-03-02T02:32:18.144Z', '837cef6e2d84dba312033d4c194ad1cac058035557ea9fcbb02c28d8274db79d', '{"id":"liauw-media/CodeAssist/gcp-architecture","name":"gcp-architecture","description":{"zh":"使用GCP架构AI智能代理，快速实现云原生应用开发","ja":"GCPアーキテクチャーAIエージェントを使用して、クラウドネイティブアプリケーションの開発を迅速に実現","ko":"GCP 아키텍처 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발을 빠르게 실현","es":"La arquitectura GCP es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear proyectos escalables y seguros. Conoce más sobre sus características","fr":"L''architecture GCP est un outil IA qui aide les développeurs à créer des projets évolutifs et sécurisés. En savoir plus sur ses caractéristiques","de":"Die GCP-Architektur ist ein KI-Tool, das Entwickler bei der Erstellung von skalierbaren und sicheren Projekten unterstützt. Erfahren Sie mehr über seine Funktionen","pt":"A habilidade gcp-architecture é um recurso de codificação para iniciar sessões de Vibe Code, ajudando desenvolvedores a criar soluções de nuvem mais eficientes","ru":"Навык gcp-architecture является функцией кодирования для запуска сессий Vibe Code, помогающей разработчикам создавать более эффективные облачные решения","ar":"المهارة gcp-architecture هي ميزة الترميز لبدء جلسات Vibe Code، لمساعدة المطورين على إنشاء حلول سحابية أكثر كفاءة","en":"Coding Prompt to kickstart a Vibe Code session"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - GCP架构设计","ja":"AIエージェント - GCPアーキテクチャー","ko":"AI 에이전트 - GCP 아키텍처","es":"Herramientas de AI: Arquitectura GCP para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils IA: Architecture GCP pour les Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: GCP-Architektur für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IAs: gcp-architecture para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: gcp-architecture для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: gcp-architecture لل مطورين","en":"gcp-architecture"},"description":{"zh":"使用GCP架构AI智能代理，快速实现云原生应用开发","ja":"GCPアーキテクチャーAIエージェントを使用して、クラウドネイティブアプリケーションの開発を迅速に実現","ko":"GCP 아키텍처 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발을 빠르게 실현","es":"La arquitectura GCP es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear proyectos escalables y seguros. Conoce más sobre sus características","fr":"L''architecture GCP est un outil IA qui aide les développeurs à créer des projets évolutifs et sécurisés. En savoir plus sur ses caractéristiques","de":"Die GCP-Architektur ist ein KI-Tool, das Entwickler bei der Erstellung von skalierbaren und sicheren Projekten unterstützt. Erfahren Sie mehr über seine Funk...","pt":"A habilidade gcp-architecture é um recurso de codificação para iniciar sessões de Vibe Code, ajudando desenvolvedores a criar soluções de nuvem mais eficientes","ru":"Навык gcp-architecture является функцией кодирования для запуска сессий Vibe Code, помогающей разработчикам создавать более эффективные облачные решения","ar":"المهارة gcp-architecture هي ميزة الترميز لبدء جلسات Vibe Code، لمساعدة المطورين على إنشاء حلول سحابية أكثر كفاءة","en":"Coding Prompt to kickstart a Vibe Code session"},"definition":{"en":"Coding Prompt to kickstart a Vibe Code session"},"features":{"zh":["支持GCP架构设计","自动化代码生成","云原生应用开发","提高开发效率","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["GCPアーキテクチャー設計をサポート","自動コード生成","クラウドネイティブアプリケーション開発","開発効率の向上","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["GCP 아키텍처 설계 지원","자동 코드 생성","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","개발 효율성 향상","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["Diseño de arquitecturas escalables","Implementación de seguridad y autenticación","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo de Google","Soporte para contenedores y servidores sin servidor","Análisis y monitoreo de rendimiento"],"fr":["Conception d''architectures évolutives","Mise en œuvre de la sécurité et de l''authentification","Intégration avec les outils de développement de Google","Prise en charge des conteneurs et des serveurs sans serveur","Analyse et surveillance des performances"],"de":["Entwurf von skalierbaren Architekturen","Implementierung von Sicherheit und Authentifizierung","Integration mit Google-Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für Container und serverlose Server","Analyse und Überwachung der Leistung"],"pt":["Criação de soluções de nuvem personalizadas","Integração com a plataforma Google Cloud","Melhoria da produtividade do desenvolvedor","Suporte a linguagens de programação como Python e Node.js","Ferramentas de codificação avançadas"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных облачных решений","Интеграция с платформой Google Cloud","Повышение производительности разработчика","Поддержка языков программирования seperti Python и Node.js","Расширенные инструменты кодирования"],"ar":["إنشاء حلول سحابية مخصصة","التكامل مع منصة جوجل سحابية","تحسين إنتاجية المطور","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل بايثون ونود.جس","أدوات ترميز متقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GCP架构设计","云原生应用开发","AI智能代理","自动化代码生成","提高开发效率","GCP vs AWS","GCP架构最佳实践","如何使用GCP"],"ja":["GCPアーキテクチャー設計","クラウドネイティブアプリケーション開発","AIエージェント","自動コード生成","開発効率の向上","GCP vs AWS","GCPアーキテクチャー-best-practice","GCPの使用方法"],"ko":["GCP 아키텍처 설계","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트","자동 코드 생성","개발 효율성 향상","GCP vs AWS","GCP 아키텍처最佳实践","GCP 사용법"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","arquitectura GCP para proyectos de desarrollo","cómo usar la arquitectura GCP","GCP vs AWS","instalación de GCP","guía de configuración de GCP","desarrollo de aplicaciones en la nube"],"fr":["outils IA pour les développeurs","architecture GCP pour les projets de développement","comment utiliser l''architecture GCP","GCP vs AWS","installation de GCP","guide de configuration de GCP","développement d''applications dans le cloud"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","GCP-Architektur für Entwicklungsprojekte","wie man die GCP-Architektur verwendet","GCP vs AWS","Installation von GCP","Konfigurationsanleitung für GCP","Entwicklung von Cloud-Anwendungen"],"pt":["gcp-architecture","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de nuvem","google cloud","python","node.js","como usar gcp-architecture","o que é gcp-architecture"],"ru":["gcp-architecture","ИИ агенты","облачное развитие","google cloud","python","node.js","как использовать gcp-architecture","что такое gcp-architecture"],"ar":["gcp-architecture","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التطوير السحابي","جوجل سحابية","بايثون","نود.جس","كيفية استخدام gcp-architecture","ما هي gcp-architecture"]}},"owner":"liauw-media","repo":"CodeAssist","repoPath":"liauw-media/CodeAssist","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.932Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gcp-architecture","description":"Google Cloud Platform architecture patterns and best practices. Use when designing, deploying, or reviewing GCP infrastructure including GKE, Cloud Run, Cloud Functions, BigQuery, and IAM.","bodyPreview":"# Google Cloud Platform Architecture\n\nComprehensive guide for building secure, scalable infrastructure on Google Cloud Platform.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Designing GCP architecture for new projects\n- Deploying applications to GCP services\n- Setting up networking (VPC, firewall rules)\n- Configuring IAM policies and service accounts\n- Working with GKE (Google Kubernetes Engine)\n- Optimizing costs and performance\n\n## Core Services Overview\n\n### Compute\n\n| Service | Use Case | Key Features |\n|---------|--","body":"# Google Cloud Platform Architecture\n\nComprehensive guide for building secure, scalable infrastructure on Google Cloud Platform.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Designing GCP architecture for new projects\n- Deploying applications to GCP services\n- Setting up networking (VPC, firewall rules)\n- Configuring IAM policies and service accounts\n- Working with GKE (Google Kubernetes Engine)\n- Optimizing costs and performance\n\n## Core Services Overview\n\n### Compute\n\n| Service | Use Case | Key Features |\n|---------|----------|--------------|\n| Compute Engine | Virtual machines | Full control, custom images |\n| GKE | Managed Kubernetes | Autopilot mode, node auto-provisioning |\n| Cloud Run | Serverless containers | Scale to zero, any container |\n| Cloud Functions | Serverless functions | Event-driven, 2nd gen |\n| App Engine | PaaS | Standard/Flexible environments |\n\n### Storage\n\n| Service | Use Case | Key Features |\n|---------|----------|--------------|\n| Cloud Storage | Object storage | Multi-regional, lifecycle |\n| Persistent Disk | Block storage (GCE) | SSD/HDD, snapshots |\n| Filestore | Managed NFS | High performance |\n| Cloud SQL | Managed SQL | MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQL Server |\n| Firestore | NoSQL document | Serverless, realtime |\n| BigQuery | Data warehouse | Serverless, petabyte-scale |\n| Cloud Spanner | Global SQL | Horizontal scaling |\n| Memorystore | Managed Redis | In-memory cache |\n\n### Networking\n\n| Service | Use Case | Key Features |\n|---------|----------|--------------|\n| VPC | Virtual network | Global, shared VPC |\n| Cloud Load Balancing | Global LB | Layer 4/7, anycast IPs |\n| Cloud CDN | Content delivery | Edge caching |\n| Cloud DNS | DNS management | 100% SLA |\n| Cloud NAT | Outbound NAT | No external IPs needed |\n\n## VPC Architecture\n\n### Shared VPC Pattern\n\n```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ Host Project (Shared VPC)                                        │\n│                                                                  │\n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\n│  │ VPC Network: shared-vpc                                    │  │\n│  │                                                            │  │\n│  │  ┌─────────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────────┐       │  │\n│  │  │ Subnet: prod-app    │    │ Subnet: prod-data   │       │  │\n│  │  │ 10.0.0.0/20         │    │ 10.0.16.0/20        │       │  │\n│  │  │ us-central1         │    │ us-central1         │       │  │\n│  │  └─────────────────────┘    └─────────────────────┘       │  │\n│  │                                                            │  │\n│  │  ┌─────────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────────┐       │  │\n│  │  │ Subnet: staging-app │    │ Subnet: staging-data│       │  │\n│  │  │ 10.1.0.0/20         │    │ 10.1.16.0/20        │       │  │\n│  │  │ us-central1         │    │ us-central1         │       │  │\n│  │  └─────────────────────┘    └─────────────────────┘       │  │\n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n         │                              │\n         ▼                              ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐      ┌─────────────────────┐\n│ Service Project A   │      │ Service Project B   │\n│ (Production)        │      │ (Staging)           │\n│                     │      │                     │\n│ GKE, Cloud Run      │      │ GKE, Cloud Run      │\n│ Cloud SQL           │      │ Cloud SQL           │\n└─────────────────────┘      └─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Terraform VPC\n\n```hcl\n# VPC Network\nresource \"google_compute_network\" \"main\" {\n  name                    = \"${var.project_id}-vpc\"\n  auto_create_subnetworks = false\n  routing_mode            = \"GLOBAL\"\n}\n\n# Subnets\nresource \"google_compute_subnetwork\" \"app\" {\n  name          = \"${var.project_id}-app-subnet\"\n  ip_cidr_range = \"10.0.0.0/20\"\n  region        = var.region\n  network       = google_compute_network.main.id\n\n  secondary_ip_range {\n    range_name    = \"pods\"\n    ip_cidr_range = \"10.100.0.0/16\"\n  }\n\n  secondary_ip_range {\n    range_name    = \"services\"\n    ip_cidr_range = \"10.200.0.0/20\"\n  }\n\n  private_ip_google_access = true\n\n  log_config {\n    aggregation_interval = \"INTERVAL_5_SEC\"\n    flow_sampling        = 0.5\n    metadata             = \"INCLUDE_ALL_METADATA\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Cloud NAT\nresource \"google_compute_router\" \"main\" {\n  name    = \"${var.project_id}-router\"\n  region  = var.region\n  network = google_compute_network.main.id\n}\n\nresource \"google_compute_router_nat\" \"main\" {\n  name                               = \"${var.project_id}-nat\"\n  router                             = google_compute_router.main.name\n  region                             = var.region\n  nat_ip_allocate_option             = \"AUTO_ONLY\"\n  source_subnetwork_ip_ranges_to_nat = \"ALL_SUBNETWORKS_ALL_IP_RANGES\"\n\n  log_config {\n    enable = true\n    filter = \"ERRORS_ONLY\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Firewall Rules\nresource \"google_compute_firewall\" \"allow_internal\" {\n  name    = \"${var.project_id}-allow-internal\"\n  network = google_compute_network.main.name\n\n  allow {\n    protocol = \"tcp\"\n  }\n  allow {\n    protocol = \"udp\"\n  }\n  allow {\n    protocol = \"icmp\"\n  }\n\n  source_ranges = [\"10.0.0.0/8\"]\n}\n\nresource \"google_compute_firewall\" \"allow_health_checks\" {\n  name    = \"${var.project_id}-allow-health-checks\"\n  network = google_compute_network.main.name\n\n  allow {\n    protocol = \"tcp\"\n  }\n\n  source_ranges = [\n    \"35.191.0.0/16\",   # GCP Health Checks\n    \"130.211.0.0/22\",  # GCP Health Checks\n  ]\n\n  target_tags = [\"allow-health-checks\"]\n}\n```\n\n## IAM & Service Accounts\n\n### Service Account Best Practices\n\n```hcl\n# Application Service Account\nresource \"google_service_account\" \"app\" {\n  account_id   = \"${var.project_id}-app-sa\"\n  display_name = \"Application Service Account\"\n}\n\n# Workload Identity for GKE\nresource \"google_service_account_iam_binding\" \"workload_identity\" {\n  service_account_id = google_service_account.app.name\n  role               = \"roles/iam.workloadIdentityUser\"\n  members = [\n    \"serviceAccount:${var.project_id}.svc.id.goog[${var.namespace}/${var.k8s_service_account}]\"\n  ]\n}\n\n# Grant specific permissions\nresource \"google_project_iam_member\" \"app_storage\" {\n  project = var.project_id\n  role    = \"roles/storage.objectUser\"\n  member  = \"serviceAccount:${google_service_account.app.email}\"\n\n  condition {\n    title      = \"Only app bucket\"\n    expression = \"resource.name.startsWith(''projects/_/buckets/${var.project_id}-app-data'')\"\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"google_project_iam_member\" \"app_secretmanager\" {\n  project = var.project_id\n  role    = \"roles/secretmanager.secretAccessor\"\n  member  = \"serviceAccount:${google_service_account.app.email}\"\n}\n\nresource \"google_project_iam_member\" \"app_cloudsql\" {\n  project = var.project_id\n  role    = \"roles/cloudsql.client\"\n  member  = \"serviceAccount:${google_service_account.app.email}\"\n}\n```\n\n### Custom IAM Role\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_project_iam_custom_role\" \"app_deployer\" {\n  role_id     = \"appDeployer\"\n  title       = \"Application Deployer\"\n  description = \"Can deploy applications to Cloud Run and GKE\"\n\n  permissions = [\n    \"run.services.create\",\n    \"run.services.update\",\n    \"run.services.delete\",\n    \"run.services.get\",\n    \"container.deployments.create\",\n    \"container.deployments.update\",\n    \"container.services.create\",\n    \"container.services.update\",\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## GKE (Google Kubernetes Engine)\n\n### GKE Autopilot Cluster\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_container_cluster\" \"main\" {\n  name     = \"${var.project_id}-gke\"\n  location = var.region\n\n  # Autopilot mode\n  enable_autopilot = true\n\n  network    = google_compute_network.main.name\n  subnetwork = google_compute_subnetwork.app.name\n\n  ip_allocation_policy {\n    cluster_secondary_range_name  = \"pods\"\n    services_secondary_range_name = \"services\"\n  }\n\n  private_cluster_config {\n    enable_private_nodes    = true\n    enable_private_endpoint = false\n    master_ipv4_cidr_block  = \"172.16.0.0/28\"\n  }\n\n  master_authorized_networks_config {\n    cidr_blocks {\n      cidr_block   = var.authorized_network\n      display_name = \"Authorized Network\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  release_channel {\n    channel = \"REGULAR\"\n  }\n\n  workload_identity_config {\n    workload_pool = \"${var.project_id}.svc.id.goog\"\n  }\n\n  # Security\n  binary_authorization {\n    evaluation_mode = \"PROJECT_SINGLETON_POLICY_ENFORCE\"\n  }\n\n  deletion_protection = var.environment == \"prod\"\n}\n```\n\n### GKE Standard Cluster\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_container_cluster\" \"standard\" {\n  name     = \"${var.project_id}-gke-standard\"\n  location = var.region\n\n  # Remove default node pool\n  remove_default_node_pool = true\n  initial_node_count       = 1\n\n  network    = google_compute_network.main.name\n  subnetwork = google_compute_subnetwork.app.name\n\n  ip_allocation_policy {\n    cluster_secondary_range_name  = \"pods\"\n    services_secondary_range_name = \"services\"\n  }\n\n  workload_identity_config {\n    workload_pool = \"${var.project_id}.svc.id.goog\"\n  }\n\n  addons_config {\n    http_load_balancing {\n      disabled = false\n    }\n    horizontal_pod_autoscaling {\n      disabled = false\n    }\n    gce_persistent_disk_csi_driver_config {\n      enabled = true\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"google_container_node_pool\" \"primary\" {\n  name       = \"primary-pool\"\n  cluster    = google_container_cluster.standard.name\n  location   = var.region\n\n  node_count = var.environment == \"prod\" ? 3 : 1\n\n  autoscaling {\n    min_node_count = var.environment == \"prod\" ? 3 : 1\n    max_node_count = 10\n  }\n\n  management {\n    auto_repair  = true\n    auto_upgrade = true\n  }\n\n  node_config {\n    machine_type = \"e2-standard-4\"\n    disk_size_gb = 100\n    disk_type    = \"pd-ssd\"\n\n    oauth_scopes = [\n      \"https://www.googleapis.com/auth/cloud-platform\"\n    ]\n\n    service_account = google_service_account.gke_nodes.email\n\n    workload_metadata_config {\n      mode = \"GKE_METADATA\"\n    }\n\n    shielded_instance_config {\n      enable_secure_boot          = true\n      enable_integrity_monitoring = true\n    }\n\n    labels = {\n      environment = var.environment\n    }\n\n    tags = [\"gke-node\", var.environment]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Cloud Run\n\n### Cloud Run Service\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_cloud_run_v2_service\" \"app\" {\n  name     = \"${var.project_id}-app\"\n  location = var.region\n  ingress  = \"INGRESS_TRAFFIC_INTERNAL_LOAD_BALANCER\"\n\n  template {\n    service_account = google_service_account.app.email\n\n    scaling {\n      min_instance_count = var.environment == \"prod\" ? 1 : 0\n      max_instance_count = 100\n    }\n\n    containers {\n      image = \"${var.region}-docker.pkg.dev/${var.project_id}/app/myapp:${var.image_tag}\"\n\n      ports {\n        container_port = 8080\n      }\n\n      resources {\n        limits = {\n          cpu    = \"2\"\n          memory = \"1Gi\"\n        }\n        cpu_idle = true  # Scale to zero\n      }\n\n      env {\n        name  = \"PROJECT_ID\"\n        value = var.project_id\n      }\n\n      env {\n        name = \"DATABASE_URL\"\n        value_source {\n          secret_key_ref {\n            secret  = google_secret_manager_secret.db_url.secret_id\n            version = \"latest\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      startup_probe {\n        http_get {\n          path = \"/health\"\n        }\n        initial_delay_seconds = 10\n        period_seconds        = 3\n        failure_threshold     = 3\n      }\n\n      liveness_probe {\n        http_get {\n          path = \"/health\"\n        }\n        period_seconds    = 30\n        failure_threshold = 3\n      }\n    }\n\n    vpc_access {\n      network_interfaces {\n        network    = google_compute_network.main.name\n        subnetwork = google_compute_subnetwork.app.name\n      }\n      egress = \"PRIVATE_RANGES_ONLY\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  traffic {\n    type    = \"TRAFFIC_TARGET_ALLOCATION_TYPE_LATEST\"\n    percent = 100\n  }\n}\n\n# IAM - Allow unauthenticated (public API)\nresource \"google_cloud_run_v2_service_iam_member\" \"public\" {\n  count    = var.public_access ? 1 : 0\n  location = google_cloud_run_v2_service.app.location\n  name     = google_cloud_run_v2_service.app.name\n  role     = \"roles/run.invoker\"\n  member   = \"allUsers\"\n}\n\n# Custom domain\nresource \"google_cloud_run_domain_mapping\" \"app\" {\n  location = var.region\n  name     = var.domain\n\n  metadata {\n    namespace = var.project_id\n  }\n\n  spec {\n    route_name = google_cloud_run_v2_service.app.name\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Cloud SQL\n\n### PostgreSQL Instance\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_sql_database_instance\" \"main\" {\n  name             = \"${var.project_id}-postgres\"\n  database_version = \"POSTGRES_15\"\n  region           = var.region\n\n  settings {\n    tier              = var.environment == \"prod\" ? \"db-custom-4-16384\" : \"db-f1-micro\"\n    availability_type = var.environment == \"prod\" ? \"REGIONAL\" : \"ZONAL\"\n    disk_size         = 100\n    disk_type         = \"PD_SSD\"\n    disk_autoresize   = true\n\n    backup_configuration {\n      enabled                        = true\n      start_time                     = \"03:00\"\n      point_in_time_recovery_enabled = var.environment == \"prod\"\n      transaction_log_retention_days = 7\n      backup_retention_settings {\n        retained_backups = var.environment == \"prod\" ? 30 : 7\n      }\n    }\n\n    ip_configuration {\n      ipv4_enabled    = false\n      private_network = google_compute_network.main.id\n      require_ssl     = true\n    }\n\n    database_flags {\n      name  = \"log_checkpoints\"\n      value = \"on\"\n    }\n    database_flags {\n      name  = \"log_connections\"\n      value = \"on\"\n    }\n    database_flags {\n      name  = \"log_disconnections\"\n      value = \"on\"\n    }\n\n    maintenance_window {\n      day          = 7  # Sunday\n      hour         = 3\n      update_track = \"stable\"\n    }\n\n    insights_config {\n      query_insights_enabled  = true\n      query_string_length     = 1024\n      record_application_tags = true\n      record_client_address   = true\n    }\n  }\n\n  deletion_protection = var.environment == \"prod\"\n}\n\nresource \"google_sql_database\" \"main\" {\n  name     = var.database_name\n  instance = google_sql_database_instance.main.name\n}\n\nresource \"google_sql_user\" \"app\" {\n  name     = \"app\"\n  instance = google_sql_database_instance.main.name\n  password = random_password.db.result\n}\n```\n\n## Cloud Storage\n\n### Secure Bucket\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_storage_bucket\" \"data\" {\n  name          = \"${var.project_id}-data\"\n  location      = var.region\n  force_destroy = var.environment != \"prod\"\n\n  uniform_bucket_level_access = true\n\n  versioning {\n    enabled = true\n  }\n\n  encryption {\n    default_kms_key_name = google_kms_crypto_key.storage.id\n  }\n\n  lifecycle_rule {\n    condition {\n      age = 90\n    }\n    action {\n      type          = \"SetStorageClass\"\n      storage_class = \"NEARLINE\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  lifecycle_rule {\n    condition {\n      age = 365\n    }\n    action {\n      type          = \"SetStorageClass\"\n      storage_class = \"COLDLINE\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  lifecycle_rule {\n    condition {\n      num_newer_versions = 3\n    }\n    action {\n      type = \"Delete\"\n    }\n  }\n\n  cors {\n    origin          = [\"https://${var.domain}\"]\n    method          = [\"GET\", \"PUT\", \"POST\"]\n    response_header = [\"*\"]\n    max_age_seconds = 3600\n  }\n\n  labels = local.common_labels\n}\n\n# Prevent public access\nresource \"google_storage_bucket_iam_binding\" \"prevent_public\" {\n  bucket = google_storage_bucket.data.name\n  role   = \"roles/storage.objectViewer\"\n  members = [\n    \"serviceAccount:${google_service_account.app.email}\",\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Cost Optimization\n\n### Committed Use Discounts\n\n| Commitment | Discount |\n|------------|----------|\n| 1-year CUD | 37% |\n| 3-year CUD | 55% |\n| Spot VMs | 60-91% |\n\n### Budget Alerts\n\n```hcl\nresource \"google_billing_budget\" \"main\" {\n  billing_account = var.billing_account_id\n  display_name    = \"${var.project_id} Budget\"\n\n  budget_filter {\n    projects = [\"projects/${var.project_id}\"]\n  }\n\n  amount {\n    specified_amount {\n      currency_code = \"USD\"\n      units         = var.monthly_budget\n    }\n  }\n\n  threshold_rules {\n    threshold_percent = 0.5\n    spend_basis       = \"CURRENT_SPEND\"\n  }\n\n  threshold_rules {\n    threshold_percent = 0.8\n    spend_basis       = \"CURRENT_SPEND\"\n  }\n\n  threshold_rules {\n    threshold_percent = 1.0\n    spend_basis       = \"FORECASTED_SPEND\"\n  }\n\n  all_updates_rule {\n    pubsub_topic = google_pubsub_topic.budget_alerts.id\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n```bash\n# Auth\ngcloud auth login\ngcloud auth application-default login\ngcloud config set project PROJECT_ID\n\n# Compute\ngcloud compute instances list\ngcloud compute instances start INSTANCE\ngcloud compute ssh INSTANCE --zone ZONE\n\n# GKE\ngcloud container clusters get-credentials CLUSTER --region REGION\ngcloud container clusters list\n\n# Cloud Run\ngcloud run services list\ngcloud run deploy SERVICE --image IMAGE --region REGION\ngcloud run services update-traffic SERVICE --to-latest\n\n# Cloud SQL\ngcloud sql instances list\ngcloud sql connect INSTANCE --user USER\n\n# Storage\ngsutil ls gs://BUCKET/\ngsutil cp FILE gs://BUCKET/\ngsutil rsync -r ./folder gs://BUCKET/folder\n\n# Secrets\ngcloud secrets list\ngcloud secrets versions access latest --secret SECRET_NAME\n\n# Logs\ngcloud logging read \"resource.type=cloud_run_revision\" --limit 100\n```\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n- [ ] VPC Service Controls enabled\n- [ ] Private Google Access enabled\n- [ ] Cloud NAT for outbound traffic\n- [ ] Workload Identity for GKE\n- [ ] Binary Authorization enabled\n- [ ] Cloud Armor for DDoS protection\n- [ ] Secret Manager for credentials\n- [ ] Cloud Audit Logs enabled\n- [ ] Security Command Center enabled\n\n## Integration\n\nWorks with:\n- `/terraform` - GCP provider configuration\n- `/k8s` - GKE deployments\n- `/devops` - GCP deployment pipelines\n- `/security` - GCP security review\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:32:18.144Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Infrastructure Agents needing expertise in designing secure and scalable Google Cloud Platform architectures.","zh":"非常适合需要在设计安全且可扩展的Google Cloud Platform架构方面具有专业知识的Cloud Infrastructure Agents。","ja":"Google Cloud Platformの安全でスケーラブルなアーキテクチャを設計する専門知識が必要なCloud Infrastructure Agentsに最適です。","ko":"안전하고 확장 가능한 Google Cloud Platform 아키텍처를 설계하는 전문 지식이 필요한 Cloud Infrastructure 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Infraestructura en la Nube que necesitan experiencia en el diseño de arquitecturas de Google Cloud Platform seguras y escalables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud ayant besoin d''expertise dans la conception d''architectures de Google Cloud Platform sécurisées et évolutives.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agents, die Expertenwissen im Entwurf sicherer und skalierbarer Google Cloud Platform-Architekturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Infraestrutura de Nuvem que necessitam de especialização em projetar arquiteturas seguras e escaláveis da Plataforma Google Cloud.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов облачной инфраструктуры, которым необходимы знания в области проектирования безопасных и масштабируемых архитектур платформы Google Cloud.","ar":"مثالي لعميل البنية التحتية السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في تصميم هندسة منصة جوجل سحابية آمنة وقابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to architect robust GCP infrastructures using services like Compute, VPC, IAM, and GKE, while optimizing costs and performance through strategic resource allocation and configuration of firewall rules and service accounts.","zh":"使得代理能够使用Compute、VPC、IAM和GKE等服务来构建强大的GCP基础设施，同时通过战略性的资源分配和防火墙规则、服务账户的配置来优化成本和性能。","ja":"エージェントがCompute、VPC、IAM、GKEなどのサービスを使用して堅牢なGCPインフラストラクチャを設計できるようにし、同時に戦略的なリソース割り当てとファイアウォールルール、サービスアカウントの構成を通じてコストとパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Compute, VPC, IAM 및 GKE와 같은 서비스를 사용하여 강력한 GCP 인프라를 설계할 수 있도록 하며,同時에 전략적인 리소스 할당 및 방화벽 규칙, 서비스 계정의 구성 등을 통해 비용 및 성능을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a arquitectar infraestructuras de GCP robustas utilizando servicios como Compute, VPC, IAM y GKE, al mismo tiempo que se optimizan los costos y el rendimiento a través de la asignación estratégica de recursos y la configuración de reglas de firewall y cuentas de servicio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des infrastructures GCP robustes en utilisant des services tels que Compute, VPC, IAM et GKE, tout en optimisant les coûts et les performances grâce à une allocation stratégique des ressources et à la configuration des règles de pare-feu et des comptes de service.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, robuste GCP-Infrastrukturen mithilfe von Diensten wie Compute, VPC, IAM und GKE zu entwerfen, während gleichzeitig Kosten und Leistung durch strategische Ressourcenzuweisung und Konfiguration von Firewall-Regeln und Dienstkonten optimiert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar infraestruturas de GCP robustas usando serviços como Compute, VPC, IAM e GKE, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza os custos e o desempenho por meio da alocação estratégica de recursos e configuração de regras de firewall e contas de serviço.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать прочные инфраструктуры GCP с использованием сервисов, таких как Compute, VPC, IAM и GKE, а также оптимизировать затраты и производительность за счет стратегического распределения ресурсов и настройки правил брандмауэра и учетных записей сервисов.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تصميم بنية تحتية قوية لجوجل سحابية باستخدام خدمات مثل كومبيوت، في بي سي، آي أيه إم، وجي كي إي، وفي الوقت نفسه تحسين التكاليف والأداء من خلال تخصيص الموارد الاستراتيجي وتكوين قواعد جدار الحماية و حسابات الخدمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing and deploying scalable applications to GCP services","Configuring secure networking setups with VPC and firewall rules","Optimizing GCP resource utilization for cost and performance efficiency"],"zh":["将可扩展的应用程序设计和部署到GCP服务","使用VPC和防火墙规则配置安全的网络设置","优化GCP资源利用以实现成本和性能效率"],"ja":["GCPサービスにスケーラブルなアプリケーションを設計してデプロイする","VPCとファイアウォールルールを使用してセキュアなネットワーク設定を構成する","GCPリソースの使用を最適化してコストとパフォーマンスの効率を実現する"],"ko":["GCP 서비스에 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 설계 및 배포하는 것","VPC 및 방화벽 규칙을 사용하여 보안 네트워크 설정을 구성하는 것","GCP 리소스 사용을 최적화하여 비용 및 성능 효율을 달성하는 것"],"es":["Diseñar e implementar aplicaciones escalables en los servicios de GCP","Configurar configuraciones de red seguras con VPC y reglas de firewall","Optimizar la utilización de recursos de GCP para la eficiencia de costos y rendimiento"],"fr":["Concevoir et déployer des applications évolutives sur les services GCP","Configurer des paramètres de réseau sécurisés avec VPC et règles de pare-feu","Optimiser l''utilisation des ressources GCP pour l''efficacité des coûts et des performances"],"de":["Entwerfen und Bereitstellen von skalierbaren Anwendungen für GCP-Dienste","Sichere Netzwerkkonfigurationen mit VPC und Firewall-Regeln konfigurieren","GCP-Ressourcennutzung für Kosteneffizienz und Leistung optimieren"],"pt":["Projetar e implantar aplicações escaláveis nos serviços do GCP","Configurar configurações de rede seguras com VPC e regras de firewall","Otimizar a utilização de recursos do GCP para eficiência de custo e desempenho"],"ru":["Проектировать и развертывать масштабируемые приложения в сервисах GCP","Настроить безопасные сетевые настройки с помощью VPC и правил брандмауэра","Оптимизировать использование ресурсов GCP для эффективности затрат и производительности"],"ar":["تصميم وتوزيع تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع على خدمات جوجل سحابية","تكوين إعدادات شبكة آمنة باستخدام في بي سي وقواعد جدار الحماية","تحسين استخدام موارده جوجل سحابية من أجل كفاءة التكلفة والأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Cloud Platform account and credentials","Specific to Google Cloud Platform, not compatible with other cloud providers"],"zh":["需要Google Cloud Platform账户和凭据","特定于Google Cloud Platform，不兼容其他云提供商"],"ja":["Google Cloud Platformアカウントと資格情報が必要","Google Cloud Platform専用で、他のクラウドプロバイダーと互換性がない"],"ko":["Google Cloud Platform 계정 및 자격 증명이 필요합니다.","Google Cloud Platform 전용으로, 다른 클라우드 제공 업체와 호환되지 않습니다."],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y credenciales de Google Cloud Platform","Específico de Google Cloud Platform, no compatible con otros proveedores de nube"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et des informations d''identification de Google Cloud Platform","Spécifique à Google Cloud Platform, non compatible avec d''autres fournisseurs de cloud"],"de":["Benötigt ein Google Cloud Platform-Konto und -Anmeldeinformationen","Spezifisch für Google Cloud Platform, nicht kompatibel mit anderen Cloud-Anbietern"],"pt":["Requer uma conta e credenciais da Plataforma Google Cloud","Específico para a Plataforma Google Cloud, não compatível com outros provedores de nuvem"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и учетных данных платформы Google Cloud","Специфичен для платформы Google Cloud, не совместим с другими облачными провайдерами"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى حساب وأرصدة لمنصة جوجل سحابية","محدد لمنصة جوجل سحابية، غير متوافق مع مزودي السحابة الآخرين"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"837cef6e2d84dba312033d4c194ad1cac058035557ea9fcbb02c28d8274db79d","qualityScore":49}');
