oderne APIs"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de APIs personalizadas","Revisão e redefinição de handlers","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Suporte ao CLI","Agent de desenvolvimento de APIs"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных API","Просмотр и переопределение обработчиков","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI","ИИ Агент для разработки API"],"ar":["تطوير المواقع المتقدمة المخصصة","مراجعة وإعادة تحديد المحتوى","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","دعم CLI","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير المواقع المتقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","现代API开发","开发效率","开发工具","编程语言","开发文档","开发团队","如何使用Reviewing Restate Handlers","Reviewing Restate Handlers安装","Reviewing Restate Handlers设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","モダンAPI開発","開発効率","開発ツール","プログラミング言語","開発ドキュメント","開発チーム","Reviewing Restate Handlersの使い方","Reviewing Restate Handlersのインストール","Reviewing Restate Handlersの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","현대적인 API 개발","개발 효율성","개발 도구","프로그래밍 언어","개발 문서","개발 팀","Reviewing Restate Handlers 사용법","Reviewing Restate Handlers 설치","Reviewing Restate Handlers 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar reviewing-restate-handlers","qué es reviewing-restate-handlers","reviewing-restate-handlers alternativa","reviewing-restate-handlers vs otros","instalación de reviewing-restate-handlers","guía de configuración de reviewing-restate-handlers","desarrollo de APIs con reviewing-restate-handlers"],"fr":["comment utiliser reviewing-restate-handlers","qu''est-ce que reviewing-restate-handlers","alternative à reviewing-restate-handlers","reviewing-restate-handlers vs autres","installation de reviewing-restate-handlers","guide de configuration de reviewing-restate-handlers","développement d''API avec reviewing-restate-handlers"],"de":["wie man reviewing-restate-handlers verwendet","was ist reviewing-restate-handlers","alternative zu reviewing-restate-handlers","reviewing-restate-handlers vs andere","installation von reviewing-restate-handlers","konfigurationsanleitung für reviewing-restate-handlers","entwicklung von APIs mit reviewing-restate-handlers"],"pt":["como usar Reviewing Restate Handlers","o que é Reviewing Restate Handlers","alternativas para Reviewing Restate Handlers","Reviewing Restate Handlers vs outros","instalar Reviewing Restate Handlers","guia de configuração do Reviewing Restate Handlers"],"ru":["как использовать Reviewing Restate Handlers","что такое Reviewing Restate Handlers","альтернативы для Reviewing Restate Handlers","Reviewing Restate Handlers vs другие","установка Reviewing Restate Handlers","руководство по настройке Reviewing Restate Handlers"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مراجعة إعادة تحديد المحتوى","ما هي مراجعة إعادة تحديد المحتوى","بديلات لمراجعة إعادة تحديد المحتوى","مراجعة إعادة تحديد المحتوى مقابل أخرى","تثبيت مراجعة إعادة تحديد المحتوى","دليل إعداد مراجعة إعادة تحديد المحتوى"]}},"owner":"unkeyed","repo":"unkey","repoPath":"unkeyed/unkey","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.951Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reviewing-restate-handlers","description":"Reviews restate handler code in svc/ctrl/worker to find restate client calls (service calls, state access, sleep, etc.) incorrectly placed inside restate.Run, restate.RunVoid, or restate.RunAsync closures. Use when reviewing restate handlers, checking restate.Run usage, or auditing worker service code.","bodyPreview":"# Reviewing Restate Handlers\n\nAudit restate handler code to ensure the outer restate context is never used inside `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid`, or `restate.RunAsync` closures.\n\n## Background\n\nRestate journals every interaction with its context for deterministic replay. The `restate.Run` / `restate.RunVoid` / `restate.RunAsync` functions wrap **non-deterministic side effects** (DB queries, HTTP calls, etc.) into a single journaled step. Inside these closures, the only context available is `re","body":"# Reviewing Restate Handlers\n\nAudit restate handler code to ensure the outer restate context is never used inside `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid`, or `restate.RunAsync` closures.\n\n## Background\n\nRestate journals every interaction with its context for deterministic replay. The `restate.Run` / `restate.RunVoid` / `restate.RunAsync` functions wrap **non-deterministic side effects** (DB queries, HTTP calls, etc.) into a single journaled step. Inside these closures, the only context available is `restate.RunContext`, which is a plain `context.Context` — it has no restate capabilities.\n\nIf the **outer** restate context (the handler''s `ctx` parameter, typed as `restate.Context`, `restate.ObjectContext`, `restate.WorkflowContext`, `restate.WorkflowSharedContext`, etc.) is used inside a `Run` closure, it can break replay determinism and cause subtle bugs that are very hard to diagnose.\n\n## What to check\n\nScan all `.go` files under `svc/ctrl/worker/` for closures passed to:\n- `restate.Run(ctx, func(rc restate.RunContext) ...)`\n- `restate.RunVoid(ctx, func(rc restate.RunContext) ...)`\n- `restate.RunAsync(ctx, func(rc restate.RunContext) ...)`\n\nInside each closure body, flag any reference to the **outer** restate context variable. The outer context is typically the handler function''s first parameter (often named `ctx`) whose type is one of:\n- `restate.Context`\n- `restate.ObjectContext`\n- `restate.ObjectSharedContext`\n- `restate.WorkflowContext`\n- `restate.WorkflowSharedContext`\n\n### Violations — using the outer `ctx` inside the closure\n\nThese are **forbidden** inside `restate.Run` / `restate.RunVoid` / `restate.RunAsync`:\n\n1. **Service calls via the restate context**: e.g., `hydrav1.NewVersioningServiceClient(ctx, ...)` — the first argument to generated service client constructors is the restate context\n2. **State access**: `restate.Get(ctx, ...)`, `restate.Set(ctx, ...)`\n3. **Sleep**: `restate.Sleep(ctx, ...)`\n4. **Nested Run**: `restate.Run(ctx, ...)` inside another `restate.Run`\n5. **Key access**: `restate.Key(ctx)`\n6. **Async operations**: `restate.RunAsync(ctx, ...)`, sending messages via `.Send()`\n7. **Any other method or function that takes the outer `ctx`** where `ctx` is a restate context type\n\n### Allowed — using the closure''s `RunContext`\n\nInside the closure, code should use the `restate.RunContext` parameter (often named `rc`, `runCtx`, or `stepCtx`) for:\n- Database queries: `db.Query.Something(runCtx, ...)`\n- Transactions: `db.TxRetry(runCtx, ...)`\n- External API calls: `s.vault.Encrypt(runCtx, ...)`\n- Any operation that needs a `context.Context`\n\n### Not a violation\n\n- Using the outer `ctx` **outside** of `restate.Run` closures is correct and expected\n- Passing plain values (not the context) captured from outer scope into the closure is fine\n- Using `restate.TerminalError(...)` inside a closure is fine (it doesn''t take a context)\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Use `Grep` to find all files containing `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid`, or `restate.RunAsync` under `svc/ctrl/worker/`\n2. Read each file\n3. For each closure passed to `Run`/`RunVoid`/`RunAsync`, identify:\n   - The outer restate context variable name and type (from the enclosing handler function signature)\n   - The closure''s `RunContext` parameter name\n4. Check if the outer context variable appears anywhere in the closure body\n5. Report each violation with file, line, and what the fix should be (either move the call outside the closure, or replace `ctx` with the closure''s `RunContext` if the call only needs a `context.Context`)\n\n## Output format\n\nFor each violation found, report:\n\n```\nFILE:LINE — `ctx` used inside restate.Run/RunVoid/RunAsync\n  Outer context: `ctx restate.ObjectContext` (from handler function signature)\n  Violation: `someFunction(ctx, ...)` should use `runCtx` or be moved outside the closure\n```\n\nIf no violations are found, report: \"No restate context violations found.\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:44:08.691Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced restate handler auditing capabilities for deterministic replay","zh":"非常适合需要高级重述处理程序审计功能以实现确定性重放的代码审查代理","ja":"決定的なリプレイに対する高度なリステートハンドラー監査機能を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適","ko":"결정적 재생을 위한 고급 리스테이트 처리기 감사 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de controladores de restate avanzadas para reproducción determinista","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code ayant besoin de capacités de vérification de gestionnaire de restate avancées pour une reproduction déterministe","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte Prüfmöglichkeiten für restate-Handler für deterministische Wiedergabe benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades de auditoria avançadas de manipuladores de restate para reprodução determinística","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимы расширенные возможности аудита обработчиков restate для детерминированной воспроизведения","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات مراجعة متقدمة لمعالجات إعادة التشغيل لاعادة التشغيل القطعية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure the outer restate context is never used inside `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid`, or `restate.RunAsync` closures, guaranteeing safe interaction with non-deterministic side effects like DB queries and HTTP calls using restate journals","zh":"赋予代理确保外部重述上下文永远不会在 `restate.Run`、`restate.RunVoid` 或 `restate.RunAsync` 闭包内使用，保证与非确定性副作用（如数据库查询和使用重述日志的HTTP调用）进行安全交互","ja":"エージェントが外部のリステートコンテキストが `restate.Run`、`restate.RunVoid`、または `restate.RunAsync` クロージャ内で使用されることがないことを保証することで、データベースクエリやリステートジャーナルを使用したHTTP呼び出しなどの非決定的な副作用との安全なやり取りを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 외부 리스테이트 컨텍스트가 `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid` 또는 `restate.RunAsync` 클로저 내에서 사용되지 않도록 보장하여 데이터베이스 쿼리 및 리스테이트 저널을 사용한 HTTP 호출과 같은 비결정적 부작용과 안전한 상호 작용을 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar que el contexto de restate externo nunca se utilice dentro de las cerraduras `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid` o `restate.RunAsync`, garantizando una interacción segura con efectos secundarios no deterministas como consultas de base de datos y llamadas HTTP utilizando revistas de restate","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''assurer que le contexte de restate externe n''est jamais utilisé à l''intérieur des fermetures `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid` ou `restate.RunAsync`, garantissant une interaction sécurisée avec des effets secondaires non déterministes tels que des requêtes de base de données et des appels HTTP en utilisant des journaux de restate","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sicherzustellen, dass der äußere restate-Kontext nie innerhalb der Schließungen `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid` oder `restate.RunAsync` verwendet wird, und gewährleistet somit eine sichere Interaktion mit nicht-deterministischen Nebeneffekten wie Datenbankabfragen und HTTP-Anrufen unter Verwendung von restate-Journalen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir que o contexto externo de restate nunca seja usado dentro das closures `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid` ou `restate.RunAsync`, garantindo interação segura com efeitos colaterais não determinísticos como consultas de banco de dados e chamadas HTTP usando jornais de restate","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью гарантировать, что внешний контекст restate никогда не используется внутри замыканий `restate.Run`, `restate.RunVoid` или `restate.RunAsync`, обеспечивая безопасное взаимодействие с неопределенными побочными эффектами, такими как запросы к базе данных и HTTP-запросы, используя журналы restate","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضمان عدم استخدام سياق إعادة التشغيل الخارجي أبدًا داخل الإغلاق `restate.Run` و `restate.RunVoid` و `restate.RunAsync` ، مما يضمن التفاعل الآمن مع الآثار الجانبية غير القطعية مثل استفسارات قاعدة البيانات والمكالمات HTTP باستخدام مجلات إعادة التشغيل"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing restate handler code for deterministic replay","Debugging non-deterministic side effects in restate journals","Validating restate context usage inside closures"],"zh":["审计重述处理程序代码以进行确定性重放","调试重述日志中的非确定性副作用","验证闭包内重述上下文的使用"],"ja":["リステートハンドラーコードの決定的なリプレイに対する監査","リステートジャーナルの非決定的な副作用のデバッグ","クロージャ内でのリステートコンテキストの使用の検証"],"ko":["결정적 재생을 위한 리스테이트 처리기 코드 감사","리스테이트 저널의 비결정적 부작용 디버깅","클로저 내에서 리스테이트 컨텍스트 사용의 유효성 확인"],"es":["Auditoría de código de controlador de restate para reproducción determinista","Depuración de efectos secundarios no deterministas en revistas de restate","Validación del uso del contexto de restate dentro de cerraduras"],"fr":["Vérification du code de gestionnaire de restate pour une reproduction déterministe","Débogage des effets secondaires non déterministes dans les journaux de restate","Validation de l''utilisation du contexte de restate à l''intérieur des fermetures"],"de":["Prüfung von restate-Handler-Code für deterministische Wiedergabe","Fehlersuche bei nicht-deterministischen Nebeneffekten in restate-Journalen","Validierung der Verwendung des restate-Kontexts innerhalb von Schließungen"],"pt":["Auditoria de código de manipulador de restate para reprodução determinística","Depuração de efeitos colaterais não determinísticos em jornais de restate","Validação do uso do contexto de restate dentro de closures"],"ru":["Аудит кода обработчика restate для детерминированной воспроизведения","Отладка неопределенных побочных эффектов в журналах restate","Проверка использования контекста restate внутри замыканий"],"ar":["مراجعة رمز معالج إعادة التشغيل للتشغيل القطعي","تصحيح الأخطاء في الآثار الجانبية غير القطعية في مجلات إعادة التشغيل","تحقق من استخدام سياق إعادة التشغيل داخل الإغلاق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to restate handler code","Limited to restate context and journals"],"zh":["需要访问重述处理程序代码","仅限重述上下文和日志"],"ja":["リステートハンドラーコードへのアクセスが必要","リステートコンテキストとジャーナルに限定"],"ko":["리스테이트 처리기 코드에 대한 액세스가 필요","리스테이트 컨텍스트 및 저널에 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código del controlador de restate","Limitado al contexto de restate y a las revistas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code du gestionnaire de restate","Limité au contexte de restate et aux journaux"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den restate-Handler-Code","Begrenzt auf den restate-Kontext und die Journalen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código do manipulador de restate","Limitado ao contexto de restate e jornais"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду обработчика restate","Ограничен контекстом restate и журналами"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى رمز معالج إعادة التشغيل","محدود بسياق إعادة التشغيل والمجلات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2b6fdbfc120e6a10fa3ff17ad6a4bd50d3ffa644f003f0f995f3695430e08a70","qualityScore":49}');
