s，qwen，wan とすべてのスキルを提供","ko":"AI 에이전트 - alicloud-ai-audio-tts，qwen，wan 및 모든 스킬을 제공합니다","es":"El agente de AI de audio TTS de Alicloud es una herramienta de síntesis de voz para desarrolladores que permite crear audio realista","fr":"L''agent AI audio TTS d''Alicloud est un outil de synthèse vocale pour les développeurs qui permet de créer de l''audio réaliste","de":"Der Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent ist ein Sprachsynthese-Tool für Entwickler, das die Erstellung von realistischem Audio ermöglicht","pt":"O alicloud-ai-audio-tts é uma ferramenta de IA da Alibaba Cloud para desenvolvedores, oferecendo recursos de áudio e TTS","ru":"ИИ Агент alicloud-ai-audio-tts от Alibaba Cloud для разработчиков предлагает функции аудио и TTS","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts من Alibaba Cloud للمطورين توفر ميزات صوتية و TTS","en":"alibaba cloud skills，qwen ，wan and all skills"},"definition":{"en":"alibaba cloud skills，qwen ，wan and all skills"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种语音合成","提供 qwen，wan 和所有技能","支持多种编程语言","提供简单易用的 API"],"ja":["多種語音合成をサポート","qwen，wan とすべてのスキルを提供","多種プログラミング言語をサポート","簡単かつ使いやすい API を提供"],"ko":["지원하는 여러 가지 언어","qwen，wan 및 모든 스킬을 제공","지원하는 여러 가지 프로그래밍 언어","제공하는 간단한 API"],"es":["Síntesis de voz realista","Compatibilidad con múltiples idiomas","Integración con aplicaciones de desarrollo","Personalización de voces y estilos","Soporte para formatos de audio comunes"],"fr":["Synthèse vocale réaliste","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langues","Intégration avec des applications de développement","Personnalisation des voix et des styles","Support pour les formats audio courants"],"de":["Realistische Sprachsynthese","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Sprachen","Integration mit Entwicklungsanwendungen","Anpassung von Stimmen und Stilen","Unterstützung für gängige Audioformate"],"pt":["Recursos de áudio avançados","TTS de alta qualidade","Integração com a Alibaba Cloud","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA"],"ru":["Расширенные аудио-функции","Высококачественный TTS","Интеграция с Alibaba Cloud","Поддержка нескольких языков","Разработка приложений ИИ"],"ar":["ميزات صوتية متقدمة","نظام TTS عالي الجودة","التكامل مع Alibaba Cloud","دعم اللغات المتعددة","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["阿里云 AI 语音合成","如何使用 AI 语音合成","什么是 AI 语音合成","AI 语音合成安装","AI 语音合成替代","AI 语音合成 vs other"],"ja":["AI エージェント - alicloud-ai-audio-tts","AI 语音合成の使い方","AI 语音合成とは何か","AI 语音合成のインストール","AI 语音合成の代替","AI 语音合成 vs other"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 - alicloud-ai-audio-tts","AI 语音합성의 사용법","AI 语音합성是什么","AI 语音합성의 설치","AI 语音합성의 대체","AI 语音합성 vs other"],"es":["cómo usar agente de AI de audio TTS","qué es agente de AI de audio TTS","alternativa a agente de AI de audio TTS","agente de AI de audio TTS vs Google Cloud Text-to-Speech","instalación de agente de AI de audio TTS","guía de configuración de agente de AI de audio TTS"],"fr":["comment utiliser l''agent AI audio TTS","qu''est-ce que l''agent AI audio TTS","alternative à l''agent AI audio TTS","agent AI audio TTS vs Google Cloud Text-to-Speech","installation de l''agent AI audio TTS","guide de configuration de l''agent AI audio TTS"],"de":["wie man Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent verwendet","was ist Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent","Alternative zu Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent","Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent vs Google Cloud Text-to-Speech","Installation von Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent","Konfigurationsanleitung für Alicloud AI Audio TTS Agent"],"pt":["como usar alicloud-ai-audio-tts","o que é alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alternativas para alicloud-ai-audio-tts","alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs google cloud","instalar alicloud-ai-audio-tts","guia de configuração do alicloud-ai-audio-tts","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA com alicloud-ai-audio-tts","tutorial de alicloud-ai-audio-tts para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент alicloud-ai-audio-tts","что такое ИИ Агент alicloud-ai-audio-tts","альтернативы ИИ Агенту alicloud-ai-audio-tts","ИИ Агент alicloud-ai-audio-tts vs google cloud","установить ИИ Агент alicloud-ai-audio-tts","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента alicloud-ai-audio-tts","разработка приложений ИИ с помощью ИИ Агента alicloud-ai-audio-tts","урок ИИ Агента alicloud-ai-audio-tts для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts","ما هي أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts","بديلات أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts مقابل جوجل كلود","تثبيت أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts","دليل إعداد أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts","دورة أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي alicloud-ai-audio-tts للمطورين"]}},"owner":"cinience","repo":"alicloud-skills","repoPath":"cinience/alicloud-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.975Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alicloud-ai-audio-tts","description":"Generate human-like speech audio with Model Studio DashScope Qwen TTS models (qwen3-tts-flash, qwen3-tts-instruct-flash). Use when converting text to speech, producing voice lines for short drama/news videos, or documenting TTS request/response fields for DashScope.","bodyPreview":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Critical model names\n\nUse one of the recommended models:\n- `qwen3-tts-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Install SDK (recommended in a venv to avoid PEP 668 limits):\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv .venv\n. .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install dashscope\n```\n- Set `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` in your environment, or add `dashscope_api_key` to `~/.alibabacloud/credentials` (env takes precedence).\n\n## N","body":"Category: provider\n\n# Model Studio Qwen TTS\n\n## Critical model names\n\nUse one of the recommended models:\n- `qwen3-tts-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash`\n- `qwen3-tts-instruct-flash-2026-01-26`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Install SDK (recommended in a venv to avoid PEP 668 limits):\n\n```bash\npython3 -m venv .venv\n. .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install dashscope\n```\n- Set `DASHSCOPE_API_KEY` in your environment, or add `dashscope_api_key` to `~/.alibabacloud/credentials` (env takes precedence).\n\n## Normalized interface (tts.generate)\n\n### Request\n- `text` (string, required)\n- `voice` (string, required)\n- `language_type` (string, optional; default `Auto`)\n- `instruction` (string, optional; recommended for instruct models)\n- `stream` (bool, optional; default false)\n\n### Response\n- `audio_url` (string, when stream=false)\n- `audio_base64_pcm` (string, when stream=true)\n- `sample_rate` (int, 24000)\n- `format` (string, wav or pcm depending on mode)\n\n## Quick start (Python + DashScope SDK)\n\n```python\nimport os\nimport dashscope\n\n# Prefer env var for auth: export DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=...\n# Or use ~/.alibabacloud/credentials with dashscope_api_key under [default].\n# Beijing region; for Singapore use: https://dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\ndashscope.base_http_api_url = \"https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/api/v1\"\n\ntext = \"Hello, this is a short voice line.\"\nresponse = dashscope.MultiModalConversation.call(\n    model=\"qwen3-tts-instruct-flash\",\n    api_key=os.getenv(\"DASHSCOPE_API_KEY\"),\n    text=text,\n    voice=\"Cherry\",\n    language_type=\"English\",\n    instruction=\"Warm and calm tone, slightly slower pace.\",\n    stream=False,\n)\n\naudio_url = response.output.audio.url\nprint(audio_url)\n```\n\n## Streaming notes\n\n- `stream=True` returns Base64-encoded PCM chunks at 24kHz.\n- Decode chunks and play or concatenate to a pcm buffer.\n- The response contains `finish_reason == \"stop\"` when the stream ends.\n\n## Operational guidance\n\n- Keep requests concise; split long text into multiple calls if you hit size or timeout errors.\n- Use `language_type` consistent with the text to improve pronunciation.\n- Use `instruction` only when you need explicit style/tone control.\n- Cache by `(text, voice, language_type)` to avoid repeat costs.\n\n## Output location\n\n- Default output: `output/ai-audio-tts/audio/`\n- Override base dir with `OUTPUT_DIR`.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/api_reference.md` for parameter mapping and streaming example.\n- Realtime mode is provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-realtime/`.\n- Voice cloning/design are provided by `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-clone/` and `skills/ai/audio/alicloud-ai-audio-tts-voice-design/`.\n\n- Source list: `references/sources.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:06.230Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Voice Assistants and AI Agents needing advanced text-to-speech capabilities with Alibaba Cloud''s AI services.","zh":"Perfect for Voice Assistants and AI Agents needing advanced text-to-speech capabilities with Alibaba Cloud''s AI services.","ja":"Perfect for Voice Assistants and AI Agents needing advanced text-to-speech capabilities with Alibaba Cloud''s AI services.","ko":"Perfect for Voice Assistants and AI Agents needing advanced text-to-speech capabilities with Alibaba Cloud''s AI services.","es":"Perfecto para asistentes de voz y agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de texto a voz con los servicios de IA de Alibaba Cloud.","fr":"Parfait pour les assistants vocaux et les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de texte à parole avancées avec les services IA d''Alibaba Cloud.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachassistenten und KI-Agents, die erweiterte Text-to-Speech-Fähigkeiten mit den KI-Diensten von Alibaba Cloud benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Assistentes de Voz e Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de texto-para-fala com os serviços de IA da Alibaba Cloud.","ru":"Идеально подходит для голосовых помощников и агентов ИИ, которым требуются передовые возможности текст-в-речь с помощью сервисов ИИ Alibaba Cloud.","ar":"مثالي لمرافقي الصوت ووكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى قابليات متقدمة للنص إلى الكلام مع خدمات الذكاء الاصطناعي من Alibaba Cloud."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to synthesize natural-sounding speech using the qwen3-tts-flash model, leveraging the dashscope SDK for seamless integration with Alibaba Cloud services, and supporting audio output through SDK installations in virtual environments.","zh":"Empowers agents to synthesize natural-sounding speech using the qwen3-tts-flash model, leveraging the dashscope SDK for seamless integration with Alibaba Cloud services, and supporting audio output through SDK installations in virtual environments.","ja":"Empowers agents to synthesize natural-sounding speech using the qwen3-tts-flash model, leveraging the dashscope SDK for seamless integration with Alibaba Cloud services, and supporting audio output through SDK installations in virtual environments.","ko":"Empowers agents to synthesize natural-sounding speech using the qwen3-tts-flash model, leveraging the dashscope SDK for seamless integration with Alibaba Cloud services, and supporting audio output through SDK installations in virtual environments.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sintetizar un habla de sonido natural utilizando el modelo qwen3-tts-flash, aprovechando el SDK dashscope para una integración sin problemas con los servicios de Alibaba Cloud y admitiendo la salida de audio a través de instalaciones de SDK en entornos virtuales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de synthétiser un discours sonore naturel en utilisant le modèle qwen3-tts-flash, en exploitant le SDK dashscope pour une intégration transparente avec les services d''Alibaba Cloud et en prenant en charge la sortie audio via des installations de SDK dans des environnements virtuels.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, eine natürliche Sprache zu synthetisieren, indem das qwen3-tts-flash-Modell verwendet wird, das dashscope-SDK für eine nahtlose Integration mit den Alibaba Cloud-Diensten nutzt und Audio-Ausgaben über SDK-Installationen in virtuellen Umgebungen unterstützt.","pt":"Hab