rmazenamento","melhoria de habilidades em armazenamento"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","как использовать xe-writing-style","что такое xe-writing-style","xe-writing-style vs конкуренты","xe-writing-style установка","xe-writing-style руководство по настройке","разработка хранилищ","улучшение навыков в области хранилищ"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام xe-writing-style","ما هي xe-writing-style","xe-writing-style مقابل المنافسين","xe-writing-style تثبيت","xe-writing-style دليل الإعداد","تنمية التخزين","تحسين المهارات في مجال التخزين"]}},"owner":"tigrisdata","repo":"tigris-blog","repoPath":"tigrisdata/tigris-blog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.008Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xe-writing-style","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Xe Iaso Blog Post Writer\n\nTransform messy notes into blog posts that sound like Xe Iaso. Read\n`references/voice-tone.md` for detailed voice characteristics. Read 2-3 random\nexample posts from `assets/` to calibrate tone. Then read the reference file\nthat matches the post''s emotional register:\n\n- `references/story-circle.md` — Narrative arc scaffold (essays, critiques,\n  journey posts)\n- `references/emotional-personal.md` — Identity, healing, vulnerability, coming\n  out, grief\n- `references/fic","body":"# Xe Iaso Blog Post Writer\n\nTransform messy notes into blog posts that sound like Xe Iaso. Read\n`references/voice-tone.md` for detailed voice characteristics. Read 2-3 random\nexample posts from `assets/` to calibrate tone. Then read the reference file\nthat matches the post''s emotional register:\n\n- `references/story-circle.md` — Narrative arc scaffold (essays, critiques,\n  journey posts)\n- `references/emotional-personal.md` — Identity, healing, vulnerability, coming\n  out, grief\n- `references/fiction-mythic.md` — Technical parables, second-person fiction,\n  supernatural framing\n- `references/humor-satire.md` — Cursed projects, deadpan humor, satirical\n  commentary\n- `references/spirituality.md` — Meditation, belief-as-tool,\n  programming-consciousness parallels\n\nMost posts blend 2-3 of these modes. Read whichever apply.\n\n## Hard Rules\n\nNon-negotiable constraints:\n\n1. **Successive paragraphs must not start with the same letter.** If paragraph N\n   starts with \"T\", paragraph N+1 must start with a different letter. Rewrite\n   sentence openings as needed. Character dialogue blocks (`<Conv>`) do not\n   count as paragraphs for this rule.\n2. **Write for peers, not beginners.** Assume professional-level technical\n   context.\n3. **No corporate or marketing tone.** No \"leverage\", \"synergy\", \"empower\",\n   \"streamline\", \"harness\", \"unlock\". Write like a human talking to another\n   human.\n4. **Admit uncertainty.** \"I think\", \"I suspect\", \"I''m not sure\" when genuinely\n   uncertain.\n5. **Show tradeoffs.** Never present a solution without its costs.\n6. **Context before implementation.** Explain why something matters before\n   showing how.\n\n## Voice in Brief\n\nXe writes like a senior engineer talking to a peer over drinks: confident but\nhonest, opinionated but fair, technical but human. The narrator is always\npresent as a real person with feelings, mistakes, and strong opinions.\n\nMarkers that distinguish this voice from generic technical writing:\n\n- Casual intensifiers: \"literally\", \"honestly\", \"kinda\", \"super\", \"really\"\n- Direct emotional statements: \"This is horrifying.\", \"I love this.\", \"I hate\n  that this makes sense.\"\n- Self-deprecation: \"I felt like a dunce.\", \"I literally have no idea what I am\n  doing wrong.\"\n- Em dashes and parenthetical asides for conversational cadence\n- Rhetorical questions for disbelief: \"You can see how this doesn''t scale,\n  right?\"\n- Sentence fragments for emphasis. Single-sentence paragraphs for pacing.\n- Xe-isms: \"cursed\", \"accursed abomination\", \"Just Works™\", \"napkin math\",\n  \"github hellthreads\"\n\nRead `references/voice-tone.md` for the full style guide including narrative\nmodes, vocabulary, and values.\n\n## Structure\n\nChoose the pattern that fits the material:\n\n| Pattern                                                                                   | Best for            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| Personal hook → journey → technical detail → lessons                                      | Experience posts    |\n| Problem statement → evidence → insight → pragmatic conclusion                             | Critiques, essays   |\n| Setup → walkthrough → results → reflection                                                | Tutorials, projects |\n| Current state → historical context → analysis → forward look                              | Industry commentary |\n| Satirical warning → dramatic stakes → technical walkthrough → \"it works\" horror → caveats | Cursed projects     |\n\nFor longer posts with a narrative journey (essays, critiques), read\n`references/story-circle.md` for the 8-beat story circle scaffold.\n\n## Openings\n\nLead with one of:\n\n- **Personal memory**: \"A while ago, I got really frustrated at my Samsung S7.\"\n- **Historical/cultural analogy**: \"Cloth is one of the most important goods a\n  society can produce.\"\n- **Direct tension**: \"Anubis has kind of exploded in popularity in the last\n  week.\"\n- **Pop culture/sci-fi hook**: \"In Blade Runner, Deckard hunts down\n  replicants...\"\n- **Satirical warning box** followed by dramatic stakes (for cursed content)\n\nNever open with a generic thesis or \"In this post, I will...\"\n\n## Closings\n\n- Tie back to the opening hook or tension\n- End with forward momentum, an open question, or a sober reality check\n- Often followed by `---` then supplementary material (related links, credits,\n  stream plugs)\n- Sometimes a final character dialogue as a coda\n\n## Character Dialogue System\n\nXe''s posts use character dialogue components to inject humor, stage internal\ndebate, provide asides, and pace long sections. This is one of the most\ndistinctive features.\n\n### Characters\n\n| Character | Role                                                            | Typical moods                                       |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Cadey     | Xe''s main voice for asides, emotional reactions, and commentary | coffee, aha, enby, percussive-maintenance, facepalm |\n| Aoi       | Asks clarifying questions, expresses confusion or surprise      | coffee, wut, sus, grin, facepalm                    |\n| Mara      | Provides helpful context, technical explanations, links         | hacker, happy                                       |\n| Numa      | Corrections, dark humor, \"well actually\" moments                | delet, happy, smug, neutral                         |\n\n### Dialogue Syntax\n\nSingle aside (standalone comment):\n\n```jsx\n<Conv name=\"Cadey\" mood=\"coffee\">\n  Is this how we end up losing the craft?\n</Conv>\n```\n\nMulti-character exchange (wrap in `<ConvP>`):\n\n```jsx\n<ConvP>\n  <Conv name=\"Aoi\" mood=\"wut\">\n    Wait, really?\n  </Conv>\n  <Conv name=\"Cadey\" mood=\"aha\">\n    Yep!\n  </Conv>\n</ConvP>\n```\n\n### When to Use Dialogue\n\n- Break up long technical sections with a reaction or joke\n- Ask the question the reader is thinking (usually Aoi)\n- Provide tangential-but-useful info without derailing the text (usually Mara)\n- Deliver a punchline or emotional beat (usually Cadey or Numa)\n- Stage a mini-debate that illuminates tradeoffs\n\n## Signature Devices\n\n- **Friend reaction lists**: Bullet-pointed quotes from friends reacting to\n  ideas\n- **Napkin math**: Explicit back-of-envelope calculations, step by step\n- **Satirical warning boxes**: Legal-warning-style disclaimers before cursed\n  content\n- **`<details>` folds**: Long code blocks in\n  `<details><summary>Longer code block</summary>...</details>`\n- **Blockquote citations**: External quotes in `<blockquote>` with\n  `\\-[Source](url)` attribution\n- **Pop culture anchoring**: Anime, games, sci-fi references woven into\n  technical arguments\n\n## MDX Format\n\nPosts are MDX (Markdown + JSX). Component imports vary by platform.\n\n### Personal Blog (xeiaso.net)\n\n```mdx\n---\ntitle: \"Post Title\"\ndesc: \"One-line description\"\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\nhero:\n  ai: \"Photo credit or AI model name\"\n  file: \"hero-image-slug\"\n  prompt: \"Image description\"\n  social: false\n---\n\nimport Conv from \"../../_components/XeblogConv.tsx\";\n\n;\n```\n\nImages: `<Picture path=\"blog/YYYY/post-slug/image-name\" desc=\"Alt text\"/>`\n\n### Company Blog (Tigris)\n\n```mdx\n---\nslug: post-slug\ntitle: \"Post Title\"\ndescription: |\n  Multi-line SEO description\nkeywords: [...]\nauthors: [xe]\ntags: [...]\n---\n\nimport Conv from \"@site/src/components/Conv\";\n\n;\n```\n\nImages: Standard `<img>` with imported files. Admonitions: `:::note ... :::`\n\n## Body Writing Checklist\n\n- Vary paragraph length (single-sentence emphasis vs. longer explanations)\n- Code blocks are complete and copy-pasteable with file path comments when\n  helpful\n- Inline code for commands and technical terms: `git push`, `HTTP/2`\n- Links are dense and inline (cite sources, reference prior art, link docs)\n- `<details>` for code blocks that would break reading flow\n- Use `---` horizontal rules for major thematic breaks\n\n## Process\n\n1. Accept the user''s brain dump without requiring organization\n2. Read `references/voice-tone.md`\n3. Read 2-3 random example posts from `assets/` for tone calibration\n4. Read the reference files that match the post''s mode:\n   - Narrative arc → `references/story-circle.md`\n   - Personal/vulnerable → `references/emotional-personal.md`\n   - Fiction/parable → `references/fiction-mythic.md`\n   - Humor/satire → `references/humor-satire.md`\n   - Spiritual themes → `references/spirituality.md`\n5. Choose a structure pattern and draft\n6. Review: successive-paragraph rule, no corporate tone, voice matches examples\n7. Show draft to user and iterate\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:07:56.130Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents needing to emulate the Xe Iaso writing style for blog posts and narratives.","zh":"适合需要模拟Xe Iaso写作风格的语言代理，用于博客文章和叙事内容。","ja":"Xe Iasoの文章スタイルを模倣する必要がある言語エージェントに適しています。ブログ記事や物語に最適です。","ko":"Xe Iaso의 글쓰기 스타일을 모방해야 하는 언어 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 블로그 게시물 및 내러티브에 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Lenguaje que necesitan emular el estilo de escritura de Xe Iaso para publicaciones de blog y narrativas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Langue ayant besoin d''émuler le style d''écriture de Xe Iaso pour les billets de blog et les récits.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die den Schreibstil von Xe Iaso für Blog-Beiträge und Erzählungen emulieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que precisam emular o estilo de escrita Xe Iaso para posts de blog e narrativas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, которым необходимо имитировать стиль письма Xe Iaso для блог-постов и повествований.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللغويين الذين يحتاجون إلى محاكاة نمط كتابة Xe Iaso للمشاركات في المدونة والروايات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform messy notes into coherent blog posts using narrative arc scaffolds and emotional register references, leveraging Markdown files like `references/voice-tone.md` and `references/story-circle.md` to calibrate tone and style.","zh":"赋予代理人使用叙事弧线脚手架和情感注册参考，利用Markdown文件（如`references/voice-tone.md`和`references/story-circle.md`）来校准语气和风格，将凌乱的笔记转化为连贯的博客文章的能力。","ja":"マークダウンファイル（例：`references/voice-tone.md`と`references/story-circle.md`）を利用して、物語のアークの脚手架や感情の登録リファレンスを使用して、整理されたブログ記事を作成する能力をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"_markdown 파일(예: `references/voice-tone.md` 및 `references/story-circle.md`)을 사용하여 내러티브 아크의 스캐폴딩과 감정 등록 참조를 활용하여 정리된 블로그 게시물 생성 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar notas desorganizadas en publicaciones de blog coherentes utilizando andamios de arco narrativo y referencias de registro emocional, aprovechando archivos Markdown como `references/voice-tone.md` y `references/story-circle.md` para calibrar el tono y el estilo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des notes désorganisées en billets de blog cohérents en utilisant des échafaudages d''arc narratif et des références de registre émotionnel, en exploitant des fichiers Markdown tels que `references/voice-tone.md` et `references/story-circle.md` pour calibrer le ton et le style.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, unordentliche Notizen in kohärente Blog-Beiträge umzuwandeln, indem sie narrative Bogen-Schienen und emotionale Register-Referenzen verwenden, wobei Markdown-Dateien wie `references/voice-tone.md` und `references/story-circle.md` zur Kalibrierung von Ton und Stil genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar notas desorganizadas em posts de blog coerentes usando estruturas de arco narrativo e referências de registro emocional, aproveitando arquivos Markdown como `references/voice-tone.md` e `references/story-circle.md` para calibrar o tom e o estilo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать неорганизованные заметки в связные блог-посты, используя нарративные арки и ссылки на эмоциональный регистр, используя файлы Markdown, такие как `references/voice-tone.md` и `references/story-circle.md`, для калибровки тона и стиля.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحويل الملاحظات المبعثرة إلى منشورات مدونة متسقة باستخدام هياكل القصة والمراجع التسجيلية العاطفية، واستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `references/voice-tone.md` و `references/story-circle.md` لتعديل النبرة والنمط."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating blog posts with a consistent Xe Iaso tone","Transforming notes into narrative essays using the story circle scaffold","Calibrating emotional register for personal and vulnerable blog posts"],"zh":["使用一致的Xe Iaso语气生成博客文章","使用故事圆圈脚手架将笔记转化为叙事散文","使用情感注册来校准个人和脆弱的博客文章的语气"],"ja":["一貫したXe Iasoのトーンでブログ記事を生成する","ストーリーサークルの脚手架を使用してノートを物語エッセイに変換する","感情の登録を使用して個人的で脆弱なブログ記事のトーンを調整する"],"ko":["일관된 Xe Iaso의 어조로 블로그 게시물을 생성하는 것","스토리 원의 스캐폴딩을 사용하여 메모를 내러티브 에세이로 전환하는 것","감정 등록을 사용하여 개인적이고 취약한 블로그 게시물의 어조를 조정하는 것"],"es":["Generación de publicaciones de blog con un tono Xe Iaso coherente","Transformación de notas en ensayos narrativos utilizando el andamio del círculo de la historia","Calibración del registro emocional para publicaciones de blog personales y vulnerables"],"fr":["Génération de billets de blog avec un ton Xe Iaso cohérent","Transformation de notes en essais narratifs en utilisant l''échafaudage du cercle de l''histoire","Calibration du registre émotionnel pour des billets de blog personnels et vulnérables"],"de":["Erzeugung von Blog-Beiträgen mit einem konsistenten Xe Iaso-Ton","Umwandlung von Notizen in narrative Essays unter Verwendung des Story-Circle-Schienens","Kalibrierung des emotionalen Registers für persönliche und verletzliche Blog-Beiträge"],"pt":["Geração de posts de blog com um tom Xe Iaso consistente","Transformação de notas em ensaios narrativos usando a estrutura do círculo da história","Calibração do registro emocional para posts de blog pessoais e vulneráveis"],"ru":["Генерация блог-постов с постоянным тоном Xe Iaso","Преобразование заметок в нарративные эссе, используя структуру круга истории","Калибровка эмоционального регистра для личных и уязвимых блог-постов"],"ar":["إنشاء منشورات مدونة بطريقة موحدة لنمط Xe Iaso","تحويل الملاحظات إلى مقالات روائية باستخدام هيكل دائرة القصة","تعديل التسجيل العاطفي لمنشورات المدونة الشخصية والحساسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to reference files like `references/voice-tone.md` and `assets/` example posts","Limited to generating content in the style of Xe Iaso","Needs manual calibration of tone through reading example posts"],"zh":["需要访问参考文件，如`references/voice-tone.md`和`assets/`示例帖子","仅限生成Xe Iaso风格的内容","需要通过阅读示例帖子手动校准语气"],"ja":["リファレンスファイル（例：`references/voice-tone.md`および`assets/`のサンプルポスト）へのアクセスが必要","Xe Iasoスタイルのコンテンツの生成のみ","サンプルポストを読むことで手動でトーンを調整する必要がある"],"ko":["참조 파일(예: `references/voice-tone.md` 및 `assets/` 샘플 게시물) 액세스가 필요합니다.","Xe Iaso 스타일의 콘텐츠 생성만 möglich","샘플 게시물을 읽어 수동으로 тон을 조정해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de referencia como `references/voice-tone.md` y `assets/` publicaciones de ejemplo","Limitado a la generación de contenido en el estilo de Xe Iaso","Necesita una calibración manual del tono a través de la lectura de publicaciones de ejemplo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des fichiers de référence tels que `references/voice-tone.md` et `assets/` publications d''exemple","Limité à la génération de contenu dans le style de Xe Iaso","Nécessite une calibration manuelle du ton via la lecture de publications d''exemple"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Referenzdateien wie `references/voice-tone.md` und `assets/` Beispiel-Beiträge","Begrenzt auf die Erzeugung von Inhalten im Stil von Xe Iaso","Benötigt eine manuelle Kalibrierung des Tons durch das Lesen von Beispiel-Beiträgen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de referência como `references/voice-tone.md` e `assets/` posts de exemplo","Limitado à geração de conteúdo no estilo de Xe Iaso","Necessita de calibração manual do tom por meio da leitura de posts de exemplo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к справочным файлам, таким как `references/voice-tone.md` и `assets/` примеры постов","Ограничен генерацией контента в стиле Xe Iaso","Требует ручной калибровки тона путем чтения примеров постов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات مرجعية مثل `references/voice-tone.md` و `assets/` منشورات مثال","محدود بالمحتوى المُولَّد بنمط Xe Iaso","يحتاج إلى تعديل يدوي للنبرة من خلال قراءة منشورات مثال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"978dfe2e2804884118e5ce49cf344478c326db34cf7195a45ae81b1a54e81dc9","qualityScore":49}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('madihg/oulipo/oulipo-brand', 'community', 'madihg', 'oulipo', 'madihg/oulipo', 'oulipo-brand', 0, 0, 49, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.008Z', '2026-03-02T03:07:57.804Z', '470a8298d07e143228dd2c2142f5a326017a30d320f95ba0408bffcd10be4b1c', '{"id":"madihg/oulipo/oulipo-brand","name":"oulipo-brand","description":{"zh":"oulipo-brand 是一个实验性的计算机诗歌平台，利用AI智能创作创新诗歌","ja":"oulipo-brandは、実験的コンピュータ詩のためのホームです","ko":"oulipo-brand는 실험적 컴퓨터 시를 위한 플랫폼입니다","es":"Oulipo Brand es el hogar de la poesía computacional experimental, donde la creatividad y la tecnología se unen","fr":"Oulipo Brand est le berceau de la poésie computationnelle expérimentale, où la créativité et la technologie se rencontrent","de":"Oulipo Brand ist die Heimat der experimentellen computergenerierten Poesie, wo Kreativität und Technologie sich vereinen","pt":"Oulipo-Brand é uma plataforma experimental de poesia computacional para desenvolvedores, permitindo a criação de poemas inovadores.","ru":"Oulipo-Brand - это экспериментальная платформа компьютерной поэзии для разработчиков, позволяющая создавать инновационные произведения.","ar":"Oulipo-Brand هي منصة شعر حاسوبي تجريبية للمطورين، تمكن من إنشاء القصائد المبتكرة.","en":"Home of experimental computational poetry"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"oulipo-brand AI智能诗歌实验","ja":"oulipo-brand AIエージェントによる実験的コンピュータ詩","ko":"oulipo-brand AI 에이전트 실험적 컴퓨터 시","es":"Herramientas de poesía computacional experimental - Oulip...","fr":"Outils de poésie computationnelle expérimentale - Oulipo ...","de":"Experimentelle computergenerierte Poesie-Tools - Oulipo B...","pt":"Ferramentas de Poesia Computacional Oulipo-Brand","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Экспериментальная Поэзия Oulipo-Brand","ar":"أدوات الشعر الحاسوبي التجريبية Oulipo-Brand","en":"oulipo-brand"},"description":{"zh":"oulipo-brand 是一个实验性的计算机诗歌平台，利用AI智能创作创新诗歌","ja":"oulipo-brandは、実験的コンピュータ詩のためのホームです","ko":"oulipo-brand는 실험적 컴퓨터 시를 위한 플랫폼입니다","es":"Oulipo Brand es el hogar de la poesía computacional experimental, donde la creatividad y la tecnología se unen","fr":"Oulipo Brand est le berceau de la poésie computationnelle expérimentale, où la créativité et la technologie se rencontrent","de":"Oulipo Brand ist die Heimat der experimentellen computergenerierten Poesie, wo Kreativität und Technologie sich vereinen","pt":"Oulipo-Brand é uma plataforma experimental de poesia computacional para desenvolvedores, permitindo a criação de poemas inovadores.","ru":"Oulipo-Brand - это экспериментальная платформа компьютерной поэзии для разработчиков, позволяющая создавать инновационные произведения.","ar":"Oulipo-Brand هي منصة شعر حاسوبي تجريبية للمطورين، تمكن من إنشاء القصائد المبتكرة.","en":"Home of experimental computational poetry"},"definition":{"en":"Home of experimental computational poetry"},"features":{"zh":["AI智能诗歌创作","实验性的计算机诗歌","创新诗歌形式","Python和Node.js集成","CLI工具支持"],"ja":["AIエージェントによる詩歌創作","実験的コンピュータ詩","革新的詩歌形式","PythonとNode.jsの統合","CLIツールのサポート"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용한 시 창작","실험적 컴퓨터 시","혁신적인 시 형식","Python과 Node.js 통합","CLI 툴 지원"],"es":["Generación de poesía automática con Python","Integración con Node.js para aplicaciones web","Uso de CLI para ejecutar comandos de poesía","Compatibilidad con React para interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Acceso a una comunidad de desarrolladores de poesía computacional"],"fr":["Génération de poésie automatique avec Python","Intégration avec Node.js pour des applications web","Utilisation de CLI pour exécuter des commandes de poésie","Compatibilité avec React pour des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Accès à une communauté de développeurs de poésie computationnelle"],"de":["Automatische Gedichtgenerierung mit Python","Integration mit Node.js für Webanwendungen","Verwendung von CLI für die Ausführung von Gedicht-Befehlen","Kompatibilität mit React für benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","Zugang zu einer Community von Entwicklern für computergenerierte Poesie"],"pt":["Criação de poemas inovadores","Experimentação com linguagem natural","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Desenvolvimento de algoritmos poéticos","Comunidade de desenvolvedores de poesia computacional"],"ru":["Создание инновационных произведений","Эксперименты с естественным языком","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Разработка поэтических алгоритмов","Сообщество разработчиков компьютерной поэзии"],"ar":["إنشاء القصائد المبتكرة","التجارب مع اللغة الطبيعية","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الخوارزميات الشعرية","مجتمع المطورين للشعر الحاسوبي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用oulipo-brand","什么是计算机诗歌","oulipo-brand替代品","oulipo-brand vs 其他AI工具","oulipo-brand安装","oulipo-brand设置指南","AI智能诗歌创作","实验性计算机诗歌"],"ja":["oulipo-brandの使い方","コンピュータ詩とは","oulipo-brandの代替","oulipo-brand vs 他のAIツール","oulipo-brandのインストール","oulipo-brandの設定ガイド","AIエージェントによる詩歌創作","実験的コンピュータ詩"],"ko":["oulipo-brand 사용법","컴퓨터 시란 무엇인가","oulipo-brand 대안","oulipo-brand vs 다른 AI 툴","oulipo-brand 설치","oulipo-brand 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트를 사용한 시 창작","실험적 컴퓨터 시"],"es":["herramientas de poesía computacional","poesía generativa con Python","alternativas a Oulipo Brand","Oulipo Brand vs otros herramientas de poesía","cómo instalar Oulipo Brand","guía de configuración de Oulipo Brand","poesía computacional experimental","desarrollo de aplicaciones de poesía"],"fr":["outils de poésie computationnelle","poésie générative avec Python","alternatives à Oulipo Brand","Oulipo Brand vs autres outils de poésie","comment installer Oulipo Brand","guide de configuration de Oulipo Brand","poésie computationnelle expérimentale","développement d''applications de poésie"],"de":["computergenerierte Poesie-Tools","Gedichtgenerierung mit Python","Alternativen zu Oulipo Brand","Oulipo Brand vs andere Poesie-Tools","wie man Oulipo Brand installiert","Konfigurationsanleitung für Oulipo Brand","experimentelle computergenerierte Poesie","Entwicklung von Poesie-Anwendungen"],"pt":["como usar Oulipo-Brand","o que é poesia computacional","Oulipo-Brand alternativa","Oulipo-Brand vs outras plataformas","instalar Oulipo-Brand","guia de configuração Oulipo-Brand","desenvolvimento de poesia computacional","linguagem natural e IA"],"ru":["как использовать Oulipo-Brand","что такое компьютерная поэзия","ИИ Агенты для поэзии","Oulipo-Brand альтернатива","Oulipo-Brand vs другие платформы","установить Oulipo-Brand","руководство по настройке Oulipo-Brand","разработка компьютерной поэзии","естественный язык и ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Oulipo-Brand","ما هي الشعر الحاسوبي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للشعر","Oulipo-Brand بديل","Oulipo-Brand مقابل منصات أخرى","تثبيت Oulipo-Brand","دليل إعداد Oulipo-Brand","تطوير الشعر الحاسوبي","اللغة الطبيعية والذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"madihg","repo":"oulipo","repoPath":"madihg/oulipo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.008Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"oulipo-brand","description":"Oulipo.xyz brand guidelines and design system. Typography: Standard (body), Terminal Grotesque (h1), Diatype Variable (headings, captions, metadata). Colors: white background, dark text. Use when building or modifying oulipo.xyz pages, components, or related projects.","bodyPreview":"# Oulipo.xyz Brand Guidelines\n\nDesign system and brand guidelines for oulipo.xyz — a laboratory of experimental computational poetry by Halim Madi.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building new pages for oulipo.xyz\n- Modifying existing oulipo components\n- Creating related projects that should match the oulipo aesthetic\n- Reviewing design consistency across the site\n\n---\n\n## Typography\n\n### Font Stack\n\n| Font                      | Usage","body":"# Oulipo.xyz Brand Guidelines\n\nDesign system and brand guidelines for oulipo.xyz — a laboratory of experimental computational poetry by Halim Madi.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building new pages for oulipo.xyz\n- Modifying existing oulipo components\n- Creating related projects that should match the oulipo aesthetic\n- Reviewing design consistency across the site\n\n---\n\n## Typography\n\n### Font Stack\n\n| Font                      | Usage                                             | Weight                 | Source    |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | --------- |\n| **Standard**              | Body text, navigation, hero subtitle              | Book (400), Bold (700) | Cargo CDN |\n| **Terminal Grotesque**    | Main h1 headings only                             | Regular (400)          | Cargo CDN |\n| **Diatype Variable**      | h2 headings                                       | 200-1000 (variable)    | Cargo CDN |\n| **Diatype Mono Variable** | Captions, work titles, metadata (with `''MONO'' 1`) | 200-1000 (variable)    | Cargo CDN |\n\n### Font Face Declarations\n\n```css\n/* Standard - Body Font */\n@font-face {\n  font-display: block;\n  font-family: \"Standard\";\n  src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/Standard-Book.woff\") format(\"woff\");\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: normal;\n}\n@font-face {\n  font-display: block;\n  font-family: \"Standard\";\n  src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/Standard-Bold.woff\") format(\"woff\");\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n/* Terminal Grotesque - Display Font for h1 */\n@font-face {\n  font-display: block;\n  font-family: \"Terminal Grotesque\";\n  src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/TerminalGrotesque.woff\")\n    format(\"woff\");\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: normal;\n}\n\n/* Diatype Variable - h2 Headings (proportional) */\n@font-face {\n  font-display: block;\n  font-family: \"Diatype Variable\";\n  src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/Cargo-DiatypePlusVariable.woff2\")\n    format(\"woff2-variations\");\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 200 1000;\n}\n\n/* Diatype Mono Variable - Captions, Work Titles, Metadata (monospace) */\n@font-face {\n  font-display: block;\n  font-family: \"Diatype Mono Variable\";\n  src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/Cargo-DiatypePlusVariable.woff2\")\n    format(\"woff2-variations\");\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 200 1000;\n}\n```\n\n### Font Variation Settings\n\nThe Diatype Plus Variable font supports axis switching between proportional and monospace:\n\n```css\n/* Proportional (Diatype Variable) */\nfont-variation-settings:\n  \"slnt\" 0,\n  \"MONO\" 0;\n\n/* Monospace (Diatype Mono Variable) - USE THIS FOR CAPTIONS */\nfont-variation-settings:\n  \"slnt\" 0,\n  \"MONO\" 1;\n```\n\n### Typography Specifications\n\n| Element          | Font Family        | Size                            | Weight | Line Height |\n| ---------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- | ------ | ----------- |\n| `body`           | Standard           | 1.3rem                          | 400    | 1.2         |\n| `h1`             | Terminal Grotesque | 7rem (desktop), 4.5rem (mobile) | 400    | 0.9         |\n| `h2`             | Diatype Variable   | 2rem                            | 700    | 1.2         |\n| `.caption`       | Diatype Variable   | 1.2rem                          | 400    | 1.25        |\n| `.work-title`    | Diatype Variable   | 1.1rem                          | 400    | —           |\n| `.work-meta`     | Diatype Variable   | 0.9rem                          | 400    | —           |\n| `.hero-subtitle` | Standard           | 1rem                            | 400    | 1.4         |\n\n---\n\n## Colors\n\n### Core Palette\n\n| Name                | Value                 | Usage              |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------ |\n| **Background**      | `#ffffff`             | Page background    |\n| **Primary Text**    | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85)` | Body text, links   |\n| **Black**           | `#000000`             | Headings, captions |\n| **Muted Text**      | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)`  | Descriptions       |\n| **Subtle Text**     | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)`  | Metadata, dates    |\n| **Subtle Text Alt** | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`  | Section subtitles  |\n| **Border/Divider**  | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75)` | Horizontal rules   |\n| **Overlay**         | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25)` | Menu overlay       |\n\n### CSS Variables (Optional)\n\n```css\n:root {\n  --oulipo-bg: #ffffff;\n  --oulipo-text: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n  --oulipo-text-black: #000000;\n  --oulipo-text-muted: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n  --oulipo-text-subtle: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  --oulipo-border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);\n  --oulipo-overlay: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Layout\n\n### Spacing\n\n| Element           | Value                         |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Page padding      | 4rem (desktop), 2rem (mobile) |\n| Max content width | 1200px                        |\n| Section margin    | 3rem bottom                   |\n| Grid gap          | 2rem                          |\n\n### Grid System\n\n```css\n/* 3-column grid on desktop */\n.grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 2rem;\n}\n\n/* 2-column on tablet (≤900px) */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n\n/* 1-column on mobile (≤600px) */\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Featured Work Layout\n\n```css\n/* Image 2/3, Description 1/3 */\n.work-featured-body {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\n  gap: 2rem;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .work-featured-body {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Components\n\n### Links\n\n```css\na {\n  color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\na:hover {\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n```\n\n### Horizontal Rule\n\n```css\nhr {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);\n  border: 0;\n  height: 1px;\n  margin: 2rem 0;\n}\n```\n\n### Side Menu\n\n- Width: 420px (desktop), 100% (mobile)\n- Background: white\n- Slide in from right\n- Line height for links: 1.15\n\n---\n\n## Site Structure\n\n### Current Sections\n\n1. **Featured Works** (max 3 items) — Highlighted projects with image + description\n2. **Selected Works** — Additional notable works\n3. **Non Human Poets** — AI/machine poetry experiments\n4. **Border/line** — Immigration-themed interactive series\n5. **Somatic Poetry Sandbox** — Experimental interactive pieces\n\n### Navigation\n\n- Top-left: \"Halim Madi\" link (hides on scroll)\n- Top-right: Hamburger menu (hides on scroll)\n- Side drawer with links to halimmadi.com sections\n\n---\n\n## File Organization\n\n```\noulipo/\n├── index.html              # Main landing page\n├── Assets/\n│   ├── screenshots/        # Work screenshots\n│   └── curl-screenshot.png\n├── borderline/             # Border/line series\n├── somatic-poetry-sandbox/ # Interactive experiments\n├── curl/                   # Curl project\n├── becoming-borders/       # Becoming Borders project\n├── case-against-the-son/   # Case Against the Son\n└── unlisted/               # Unlisted/archived works\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Copy-Paste\n\n### Minimal HTML Head\n\n```html\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Page Title — oulipo.xyz</title>\n  <style>\n    @font-face {\n      font-family: \"Standard\";\n      src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/Standard-Book.woff\")\n        format(\"woff\");\n    }\n    @font-face {\n      font-family: \"Terminal Grotesque\";\n      src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/TerminalGrotesque.woff\")\n        format(\"woff\");\n    }\n    @font-face {\n      font-family: \"Diatype Variable\";\n      src: url(\"https://type.cargo.site/files/Cargo-DiatypePlusVariable.woff2\")\n        format(\"woff2-variations\");\n      font-weight: 200 1000;\n    }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 4rem;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n      font-family: Standard, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 1.3rem;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-family: \"Terminal Grotesque\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 7rem;\n      line-height: 0.9;\n    }\n    h2 {\n      font-family: \"Diatype Variable\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Screenshots\n\n### IMPORTANT: Screenshot Border Requirements\n\n**All screenshots on oulipo.xyz MUST have a thin 1px black border.**\n\nWhen adding or updating screenshots:\n\n1. **Take the screenshot** of the work/page\n2. **Add a 1px black border** around the entire image\n3. **Save to** `Assets/screenshots/` with a descriptive name (e.g., `project-name.png`)\n\n### Adding Borders with Python (Pillow)\n\n```python\nfrom PIL import Image\n\ndef add_border(image_path, output_path=None, border_width=1, border_color=(0, 0, 0)):\n    \"\"\"Add a thin black border to a screenshot\"\"\"\n    if output_path is None:\n        output_path = image_path\n\n    img = Image.open(image_path)\n    new_width = img.width + 2 * border_width\n    new_height = img.height + 2 * border_width\n\n    bordered_img = Image.new(''RGB'', (new_width, new_height), border_color)\n    bordered_img.paste(img, (border_width, border_width))\n    bordered_img.save(output_path, quality=95)\n\n# Usage\nadd_border(\"Assets/screenshots/my-project.png\")\n```\n\n### Screenshot Naming Convention\n\n- Use lowercase with hyphens: `project-name.png`\n- Match the work title where possible\n- Store in `Assets/screenshots/`\n\n---\n\n## Brand Voice\n\nOulipo.xyz is described as:\n\n> \"A kitchen laboratory of experimental computational poetry. Non-human poets, anti-gravitational word interfaces, somatic semantics. This is where I break and mend things.\"\n\nKey themes:\n\n- Experimental and playful\n- Code meets poetry\n- Human-machine interaction\n- Border/migration/identity exploration\n- Somatic (body-based) interactions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:07:57.804Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Agents needing experimental computational poetry generation and typography customization.","zh":"非常适合需要实验性计算机诗歌生成和排版自定义的创意代理。","ja":"実験的な計算機詩の生成やタイポグラフィのカスタマイズが必要なクリエイティブエージェントに最適。","ko":"실험적인 계산기 시 생성 및 타이포그래피 사용자 지정이 필요한 창의적 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Creativos que necesitan generación de poesía computacional experimental y personalización de tipografía.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Créatifs ayant besoin de génération de poésie computationnelle expérimentale et de personnalisation de typographie.","de":"Perfekt für kreative Agenten, die experimentelle computergenerierte Poesie und Typografie-Anpassung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Criativos que precisam de geração de poesia computacional experimental e personalização de tipografia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Креативных Агентов, которым необходима экспериментальная вычислительная поэзия и настройка типографики.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإبداعيين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد شعر حاسوبي تجريبي وتخصيص طباعة الحروف"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create visually stunning computational poetry using custom font stacks and design systems, leveraging typography guidelines for consistent branding across oulipo.xyz projects, including SVG and related file formats.","zh":"赋予代理创建视觉上令人惊叹的计算机诗歌的能力，使用自定义字体栈和设计系统，利用排版指南以实现oulipo.xyz项目（包括SVG和相关文件格式）的一致品牌形象。","ja":"カスタムフォントスタックとデザインシステムを使用して、視覚的に驚くべき計算機詩を作成するエージェントをEmpowerし、oulipo.xyzプロジェクト（SVGや関連ファイル形式を含む）全体で一貫したブランド化を実現するためのタイポグラフィガイドラインを活用する。","ko":"사용자 지정 글꼴 스택 및 디자인 시스템을 사용하여 시각적으로惊くべき 계산기 시를 만들 수 있는 에이전트를 Empower하고, oulipo.xyz 프로젝트(SVG 및 관련 파일 형식 포함) 전체에서 일관된 브랜드 이미지를 구현하기 위한 타이포그래피 가이드 라인을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear poesía computacional visualmente impresionante utilizando pilas de fuentes personalizadas y sistemas de diseño, aprovechando las pautas de tipografía para una marca coherente en proyectos oulipo.xyz, incluyendo SVG y formatos de archivo relacionados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une poésie computationnelle visuellement époustouflante en utilisant des piles de polices personnalisées et des systèmes de conception, en exploitant les directives de typographie pour une marque cohérente sur les projets oulipo.xyz, y compris les formats de fichier SVG et apparentés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, visuell beeindruckende computergenerierte Poesie zu erstellen, indem sie benutzerdefinierte Schriftstapel und Designsysteme verwenden, um die Typografie-Richtlinien für eine konsistente Markenidentität in oulipo.xyz-Projekten, einschließlich SVG und verwandter Dateiformate, zu nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem poesia computacional visualmente deslumbrante usando pilhas de fontes personalizadas e sistemas de design, aproveitando diretrizes de tipografia para consistência de marca em projetos oulipo.xyz, incluindo SVG e formatos de arquivo relacionados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать визуально потрясающую вычислительную поэзию с помощью пользовательских стэков шрифтов и систем дизайна, используя руководства по типографике для последовательного брендинга в проектах oulipo.xyz, включая SVG и связанные форматы файлов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء شعر حاسوبي مرئيًا مبهرًا باستخدام مجموعة من خطوط الحروف المخصصة وأنظمة التصميم، مستفيدًا من إرشادات الطباعة للحفاظ على التماسك العلامي عبر مشاريع oulipo.xyz، بما في ذلك SVG والتنسيقات المتصلة بها."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating experimental computational poetry","Customizing typography for brand consistency","Creating related projects with oulipo aesthetic"],"zh":["生成实验性计算机诗歌","自定义排版以实现品牌一致性","创建具有oulipo美学的相关项目"],"ja":["実験的な計算機詩の生成","ブランド一貫性のためのタイポグラフィのカスタマイズ","oulipoエステティックを使用した関連プロジェクトの作成"],"ko":["실험적인 계산기 시 생성","브랜드 일관성을 위한 타이포그래피 사용자 지정","oulipo 미학을 사용한 관련 프로젝트 생성"],"es":["Generación de poesía computacional experimental","Personalización de tipografía para la coherencia de la marca","Creación de proyectos relacionados con la estética oulipo"],"fr":["Génération de poésie computationnelle expérimentale","Personnalisation de la typographie pour la cohérence de la marque","Création de projets liés à l''esthétique oulipo"],"de":["Erzeugung experimenteller computergenerierter Poesie","Anpassung der Typografie für Markenkonsequenz","Erstellung von Projekten im Zusammenhang mit der oulipo-Ästhetik"],"pt":["Geração de poesia computacional experimental","Personalização de tipografia para consistência de marca","Criação de projetos relacionados com estética oulipo"],"ru":["Генерация экспериментальной вычислительной поэзии","Настройка типографики для последовательности бренда","Создание связанных проектов с эстетикой oulipo"],"ar":["توليد شعر حاسوبي تجريبي","تخصيص طباعة الحروف لاتساق العلامة","إنشاء مشاريع متصلة بتأثير oulipo"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design system knowledge","Specific to oulipo.xyz brand guidelines"],"zh":["需要设计系统知识","仅限oulipo.xyz品牌指南"],"ja":["デザインシステムの知識が必要","oulipo.xyzブランドガイドラインに特有"],"ko":["디자인 시스템 지식이 필요합니다.","oulipo.xyz 브랜드 가이드 라인에 특정"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del sistema de diseño","Específico para las pautas de marca oulipo.xyz"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en système de conception","Spécifique aux directives de marque oulipo.xyz"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Designsystems","Spezifisch für die Markenrichtlinien von oulipo.xyz"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de sistema de design","Específico para diretrizes de marca oulipo.xyz"],"ru":["Требует знания системы дизайна","Конкретно для руководств по бренду oulipo.xyz"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة نظام التصميم","محدد لمرشدي العلامة التجارية oulipo.xyz"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"470a8298d07e143228dd2c2142f5a326017a30d320f95ba0408bffcd10be4b1c","qualityScore":49}');
