"vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.011Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:08:53.541Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud-Native Agents requiring high-performance .NET Core application development with minimal APIs and clean architecture.","zh":"适用于需要高性能的基于云的.NET Core应用程序开发，具有最小API和干净架构的代理。","ja":"高パフォーマンスのクラウドネイティブエージェントが必要な場合に適しています。.NET Coreアプリケーション開発には最小のAPIとクリーンなアーキテクチャが必要です。","ko":"고성능의 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트가 필요한 경우 적합합니다. .NET Core 애플리케이션 개발에는 최소한의 API와 깨끗한 아키텍처가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes nativos de la nube que requieren desarrollo de aplicaciones de alto rendimiento con .NET Core y mínimas API y arquitectura limpia.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents natifs du cloud nécessitant un développement d''applications haute performance .NET Core avec des API minimales et une architecture propre.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Native-Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke .NET Core-Anwendungsentwicklung mit minimalen APIs und sauberer Architektur erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agents de Cloud-Native que exigem desenvolvimento de aplicações de alto desempenho .NET Core com APIs mínimas e arquitetura limpa.","ru":"Идеально для Cloud-Native агентов, требующих разработку высокопроизводительных приложений .NET Core с минимальными API и чистой архитектурой.","ar":"مثالي для وكلاء الحوسبة السحابية الذين يتطلبون تطوير تطبيقات عالية الأداء من نوع .NET Core مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات محدودة وهندسة نظيفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable enterprise applications using .NET 8, modern C#, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns, ensuring compliance with CSS, Seguro Educativo, and ISR regulations.","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的企业应用程序的能力，使用.NET 8、现代C#、Entity Framework Core和基于云的模式，确保遵守CSS、Seguro Educativo和ISR法规。","ja":".NET 8、モダンC#、Entity Framework Core、およびクラウドネイティブパターンを使用して、拡張可能なエンタープライズアプリケーションを構築するエージェントを可能にします。CSS、Seguro Educativo、ISR規制への準拠を保証します。","ko":".NET 8, 최신 C#, Entity Framework Core 및 클라우드 네이티브 패턴을 사용하여 확장 가능한 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. CSS, Seguro Educativo, ISR 규제를 준수하도록 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones empresariales escalables utilizando .NET 8, C# moderno, Entity Framework Core y patrones nativos de la nube, garantizando el cumplimiento de las regulaciones CSS, Seguro Educativo e ISR.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications d''entreprise escalables en utilisant .NET 8, C# moderne, Entity Framework Core et des modèles natifs du cloud, en garantissant la conformité aux réglementations CSS, Seguro Educativo et ISR.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, skalierbare Unternehmensanwendungen mit .NET 8, modernem C#, Entity Framework Core und cloud-nativen Mustern zu erstellen, wodurch die Einhaltung der CSS-, Seguro Educativo- und ISR-Vorschriften gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações empresariais escaláveis usando .NET 8, C# moderno, Entity Framework Core e padrões nativos da nuvem, garantindo conformidade com as regulamentações CSS, Seguro Educativo e ISR.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать масштабируемые корпоративные приложения с использованием .NET 8, современного C#, Entity Framework Core и облачных шаблонов, обеспечивая соответствие требованиям CSS, Seguro Educativo и ISR.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء تطبيقات مؤسسية قابلة للتوسع باستخدام .NET 8 و C# الحديث و Entity Framework Core و أنماط الحوسبة السحابية الأصلية، مما يضمن الامتثال للوائح CSS و Seguro Educativo و ISR."},"useCases":{"en":["Building minimal APIs with .NET 8 for enterprise applications","Developing cloud-native applications with clean architecture and React 19","Implementing high-performance, scalable solutions for payroll management systems"],"zh":["使用.NET 8为企业应用程序构建最小API","使用干净架构和React 19开发基于云的应用程序","为工资管理系统实现高性能、可扩展的解决方案"],"ja":[".NET 8を使用してエンタープライズアプリケーション用の最小APIを構築する","クリーンアーキテクチャとReact 19を使用してクラウドネイティブアプリケーションを開発する","給与管理システム用の高パフォーマンスな可拡張なソリューションを実装する"],"ko":[".NET 8을 사용하여 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션용 최소 API를 구축하는 것","깨끗한 아키텍처와 React 19를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것","급여 관리 시스템을 위한 고성능 확장 가능한 솔루션을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Construcción de API mínimas con .NET 8 para aplicaciones empresariales","Desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de la nube con arquitectura limpia y React 19","Implementación de soluciones escalables y de alto rendimiento para sistemas de gestión de nómina"],"fr":["Conception d''API minimales avec .NET 8 pour des applications d''entreprise","Développement d''applications natives du cloud avec une architecture propre et React 19","Mise en œuvre de solutions escalables et hautes performances pour les systèmes de gestion de la paie"],"de":["Erstellung von minimalen APIs mit .NET 8 für Unternehmensanwendungen","Entwicklung von Cloud-Native-Anwendungen mit sauberer Architektur und React 19","Implementierung von skalierbaren, hochleistungsstarken Lösungen für Lohnverwaltungssysteme"],"pt":["Construir APIs mínimas com .NET 8 para aplicações empresariais","Desenvolver aplicações nativas da nuvem com arquitetura limpa e React 19","Implementar soluções de alto desempenho e escaláveis para sistemas de gestão de salários"],"ru":["Создание минимальных API с помощью .NET 8 для корпоративных приложений","Разработка облачных приложений с чистой архитектурой и React 19","Реализация высокопроизводительных и масштабируемых решений для систем управления зарплатой"],"ar":["بناء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات محدودة باستخدام .NET 8 لتطبيقات المؤسسات","تطوير تطبيقات الحوسبة السحابية الأصلية مع هندسة نظيفة و React 19","تنفيذ حلول عالية الأداء وقابلة للتوسع لأنظمة إدارة الرواتب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .NET 8 and C# 12 expertise","Specific to .NET Core and React 19 ecosystems"],"zh":[".NET 8和C# 12的专业知识是必需的","特定于.NET Core和React 19生态系统"],"ja":[".NET 8とC# 12の専門知識が必要",".NET CoreとReact 19のエコシステムに特化している"],"ko":[".NET 8과 C# 12의 전문 지식이 필요합니다",".NET Core와 React 19의 생태계에 특화되어 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en .NET 8 y C# 12","Específico para los ecosistemas .NET Core y React 19"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en .NET 8 et C# 12","Spécifique aux écosystèmes .NET Core et React 19"],"de":["Benötigt .NET 8- und C#-12-Expertise","Spezifisch für die .NET Core- und React 19-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento em .NET 8 e C# 12","Específico para os ecossistemas .NET Core e React 19"],"ru":["Требует знаний в области .NET 8 и C# 12","Конкретно для экосистем .NET Core и React 19"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بقدرات .NET 8 و C# 12","محدد لأنظمة البيئات .NET Core و React 19"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"16c65b635327beb4a4b71fec45ba3eb5658daa383e4ceba9ce68a40c6f780330","qualityScore":49}');
