tils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","comment utiliser refresh-tarkovdev-schema","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à refresh-tarkovdev-schema","installation de refresh-tarkovdev-schema","guide de configuration de refresh-tarkovdev-schema"],"de":["KI-Tools","wie man refresh-tarkovdev-schema verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu refresh-tarkovdev-schema","installation von refresh-tarkovdev-schema","einrichtungsanleitung für refresh-tarkovdev-schema"],"pt":["ferramenta de cálculo de builds de armas","Escape from Tarkov","AI Agent","como usar refresh-tarkovdev-schema","guia de instalação refresh-tarkovdev-schema","alternativas para refresh-tarkovdev-schema","otimização de builds de armas","desenvolvimento de jogos","técnicas de desenvolvimento avançadas"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для Escape from Tarkov","расчет оптимальных сборок оружия","инструмент для игроков","как использовать refresh-tarkovdev-schema","руководство по установке refresh-tarkovdev-schema","альтернативы refresh-tarkovdev-schema","оптимизация сборок оружия","разработка игр","передовые методы разработки"],"ar":["أداة حساب بناء الأسلحة","Escape from Tarkov","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام refresh-tarkovdev-schema","دليل تركيب refresh-tarkovdev-schema","بديل ل refresh-tarkovdev-schema","تحسين بناء الأسلحة","تطوير الألعاب","تقنيات تطوير متقدمة"]}},"owner":"sjtw","repo":"tarkov-build-optimiser","repoPath":"sjtw/tarkov-build-optimiser","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.023Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"refresh-tarkovdev-schema","description":"Update the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema and regenerate the Go client code","bodyPreview":"# Refresh Tarkov.dev Schema Skill\n\nUse this skill when updating the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema or regenerating the Go client.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Tarkov.dev API has added new fields or types you need\n- GraphQL queries are failing with \"unknown field\" errors\n- You want to use new data that''s available in the API\n- After a major tarkov.dev API update\n- Setting up the project for the first time (if schema is missing)\n\n## Quick Update\n\n```bash\n# Fetch latest schema and regenerate client\ntask tark","body":"# Refresh Tarkov.dev Schema Skill\n\nUse this skill when updating the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema or regenerating the Go client.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Tarkov.dev API has added new fields or types you need\n- GraphQL queries are failing with \"unknown field\" errors\n- You want to use new data that''s available in the API\n- After a major tarkov.dev API update\n- Setting up the project for the first time (if schema is missing)\n\n## Quick Update\n\n```bash\n# Fetch latest schema and regenerate client\ntask tarkovdev\n```\n\nThis runs two steps:\n1. `tarkovdev:get-schema` - Downloads the latest schema from tarkov.dev\n2. `tarkovdev:regenerate` - Regenerates Go code from your queries\n\n## Step-by-Step Process\n\n### Step 1: Fetch Latest Schema\n\n```bash\ntask tarkovdev:get-schema\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Introspects the tarkov.dev GraphQL API at `https://api.tarkov.dev/graphql`\n- Writes the schema to `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql`\n\n**Requirements:**\n- `graphql-inspector` CLI tool (installed via `task deps:install:node`)\n- Internet connection to reach api.tarkov.dev\n\n### Step 2: Update Your Queries (if needed)\n\nIf you want to use new fields, update your queries in:\n\n```\ninternal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql\n```\n\n**Example:** Adding a new field to an existing query\n\n```graphql\nquery GetWeapons {\n  items(type: weapon) {\n    id\n    name\n    # Add new fields here\n    weight\n    basePrice\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Regenerate Go Client\n\n```bash\ntask tarkovdev:regenerate\n```\n\n**What it does:**\n- Runs `genqlient` code generator\n- Reads `genqlient.yaml` configuration\n- Generates Go types and functions in `internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go`\n\n**Configuration file:** `genqlient.yaml`\n\n```yaml\nschema: internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql\noperations:\n  - internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql\ngenerated: internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go\n```\n\n### Step 4: Verify the Changes\n\n```bash\n# Check what changed\ngit diff internal/tarkovdev/\n\n# Ensure it compiles\ngo build ./...\n\n# Run relevant tests\ngo test ./internal/tarkovdev/...\ngo test ./internal/importers/...\n```\n\n## What Gets Generated\n\nAfter regeneration, `internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go` contains:\n\n- **Go structs** for all GraphQL types used in your queries\n- **Query functions** like `GetWeapons(ctx, client)`, `GetMods(ctx, client)`, etc.\n- **Response types** with proper JSON unmarshaling\n\n**Example generated code:**\n\n```go\ntype GetWeaponsResponse struct {\n    Items []GetWeaponsItem `json:\"items\"`\n}\n\ntype GetWeaponsItem struct {\n    Id   string `json:\"id\"`\n    Name string `json:\"name\"`\n    // New fields appear here automatically\n}\n\nfunc GetWeapons(ctx context.Context, client graphql.Client) (*GetWeaponsResponse, error) {\n    // Generated query execution\n}\n```\n\n## Making Query Changes\n\n### Add a New Query\n\n1. Open `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql`\n2. Add your query:\n\n```graphql\nquery GetTraderOffers {\n  traders {\n    id\n    name\n    cashOffers {\n      item {\n        id\n        name\n      }\n      price\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. Regenerate:\n\n```bash\ntask tarkovdev:regenerate\n```\n\n4. Use the generated function:\n\n```go\nimport \"tarkov-build-optimiser/internal/tarkovdev\"\n\nresp, err := tarkovdev.GetTraderOffers(ctx, graphqlClient)\n```\n\n### Modify an Existing Query\n\n1. Edit the query in `queries.graphql`\n2. Regenerate: `task tarkovdev:regenerate`\n3. Update any code using the old structure (compiler will help find it)\n\n### Remove a Query\n\n1. Delete or comment out the query in `queries.graphql`\n2. Regenerate: `task tarkovdev:regenerate`\n3. Remove any code calling the deleted query function\n\n## Understanding the Schema\n\n### View the Schema\n\n```bash\n# Open in your editor\ncode internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql\n```\n\nThe schema shows:\n- Available types (Item, Weapon, Mod, Trader, etc.)\n- Fields on each type\n- Query operations you can use\n- Enums and their values\n\n### Explore Available Fields\n\n```graphql\n# Look for the type you''re interested in\ntype Item {\n  id: ID!\n  name: String\n  weight: Float\n  types: [ItemType!]!\n  # ... many more fields\n}\n```\n\n### Check Query Operations\n\n```graphql\ntype Query {\n  items(type: ItemType): [Item]\n  item(id: ID!): Item\n  traders: [Trader]\n  # ... etc\n}\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Schema fetch fails\n\n**Error:** Can''t connect to api.tarkov.dev\n\n**Solutions:**\n- Check internet connection\n- Verify API is online: `curl https://api.tarkov.dev/graphql`\n- Check if API endpoint changed (update in Taskfile)\n- Try again later (API might be down)\n\n### Code generation fails\n\n**Error:** genqlient errors during regeneration\n\n**Check:**\n- Query syntax is valid GraphQL\n- Field names match the schema exactly (case-sensitive)\n- Types used in queries exist in the schema\n- Required fields are included in queries\n\n**Debug:**\n```bash\n# Validate your queries manually\ncat internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql\n\n# Check genqlient version\ngo list -m github.com/Khan/genqlient\n```\n\n### Generated code has compilation errors\n\n**After regeneration, Go build fails**\n\n**Solutions:**\n- Update code using the changed types\n- Check if field names or types changed in the API\n- Verify your queries match the new schema\n- Look for breaking changes in tarkov.dev API\n\n### New fields not appearing\n\n**You fetched the schema but new fields aren''t available**\n\n**Check:**\n- Did you run `task tarkovdev:get-schema`?\n- Is the field added to your query in `queries.graphql`?\n- Did you run `task tarkovdev:regenerate` after updating queries?\n- Is the field actually in the schema? (Check `schema.graphql`)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### When to Update\n\n- ✅ Before starting work that needs new API fields\n- ✅ When GraphQL errors mention unknown fields\n- ✅ Periodically to stay current with API changes\n- ❌ Not during active development unless needed\n- ❌ Not if your queries are working fine\n\n### After Updating\n\n1. Check the diff to understand what changed\n2. Update your queries if needed\n3. Rebuild and test\n4. Update importers if data structures changed\n5. Commit schema and generated code together\n\n### Query Design\n\n- Request only fields you actually use (performance)\n- Use fragments for reusable field sets\n- Keep queries focused and named clearly\n- Document complex queries with comments\n\n## Files Involved\n\n- **Schema source:** `https://api.tarkov.dev/graphql`\n- **Schema file:** `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/schema.graphql`\n- **Your queries:** `internal/tarkovdev/schemas/queries.graphql`\n- **Generated code:** `internal/tarkovdev/generated-queries.go`\n- **Config:** `genqlient.yaml`\n- **Client wrapper:** `internal/tarkovdev/tarkov-dev.go`\n\n## Dependencies\n\nInstalled via `task deps:install:node`:\n- `graphql-inspector` - For schema introspection\n\nInstalled via `task deps:install:go`:\n- `github.com/Khan/genqlient` - For code generation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:12:49.548Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Gaming Agents needing automated Escape from Tarkov weapon build optimization and GraphQL schema updates.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化逃离塔尔科夫武器构建优化和GraphQL模式更新的游戏代理。","ja":"Escape from Tarkovの武器ビルドの最適化やGraphQLスキーマの更新を自動化する必要があるゲームエージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 탈출 타르코프 무기 빌드 최적화 및 GraphQL 스키마 업데이트가 필요한 게임 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de juegos que necesitan optimización automática de la construcción de armas de Escape from Tarkov y actualizaciones del esquema GraphQL.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de jeux ayant besoin d''une optimisation automatique de la construction d''armes Escape from Tarkov et de mises à jour du schéma GraphQL.","de":"Perfekt für Gaming-Agents, die eine automatisierte Optimierung des Waffenbaus in Escape from Tarkov und GraphQL-Schemataktualisierungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Jogos que necessitam de otimização automática de builds de armas do Escape from Tarkov e atualizações de esquema GraphQL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Игровых Агентов, которым нужна автоматизированная оптимизация сборки оружия Escape from Tarkov и обновления схемы GraphQL.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء اللعبة الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين تلقائي لتركيب السلاح من Escape from Tarkov وتحديث مخطط GraphQL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to regenerate the Go client and update the tarkov.dev GraphQL schema, enabling access to new fields, types, and data through GraphQL queries and the tarkov.dev API.","zh":"赋予代理重新生成Go客户端并更新tarkov.dev GraphQL模式的能力，从而通过GraphQL查询和tarkov.dev API访问新的字段、类型和数据。","ja":"エージェントにGoクライアントを再生成し、tarkov.devのGraphQLスキーマを更新する能力を与え、GraphQLクエリやtarkov.dev API経由で新しいフィールド、タイプ、データにアクセスできます。","ko":"에이전트가 Go 클라이언트를 재생성하고 tarkov.dev GraphQL 스키마를 업데이트할 수 있도록 해주어, GraphQL 쿼리와 tarkov.dev API를 통해 새로운 필드, 유형 및 데이터에 액세스할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a regenerar el cliente de Go y actualizar el esquema GraphQL de tarkov.dev, lo que permite el acceso a nuevos campos, tipos y datos a través de consultas GraphQL y la API de tarkov.dev.","fr":"Permet aux agents de régénérer le client Go et de mettre à jour le schéma GraphQL de tarkov.dev, ce qui permet l''accès à de nouveaux champs, types et données via des requêtes GraphQL et l''API de tarkov.dev.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, den Go-Client zu regenerieren und das GraphQL-Schema von tarkov.dev zu aktualisieren, wodurch der Zugriff auf neue Felder, Typen und Daten über GraphQL-Abfragen und die tarkov.dev-API ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a regenerar o cliente Go e atualizar o esquema GraphQL do tarkov.dev, permitindo o acesso a novos campos, tipos e dados por meio de consultas GraphQL e da API do tarkov.dev.","ru":"Позволяет агентам регенерировать клиент Go и обновить схему GraphQL tarkov.dev, что обеспечивает доступ к новым полям, типам и данным через запросы GraphQL и API tarkov.dev.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إعادة إنشاء العميل Go وتحديث مخطط GraphQL من tarkov.dev، مما يسمح بالوصول إلى حقول جديدة وأنواع وبيانات من خلال استفسارات GraphQL وواجهة برمجة تطبيقات tarkov.dev."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating schema after tarkov.dev API updates","Resolving ''unknown field'' errors in GraphQL queries","Integrating new data from the tarkov.dev API into projects","Setting up projects with the latest schema for the first time"],"zh":["更新tarkov.dev API更新后的模式","解决GraphQL查询中的''未知字段''错误","将tarkov.dev API中的新数据集成到项目中","首次设置项目时使用最新的模式"],"ja":["tarkov.dev APIの更新後にスキーマを更新する","GraphQLクエリの''未知のフィールド''エラーを解決する","tarkov.dev APIから新しいデータをプロジェクトに統合する","初めてプロジェクトを設定するときに最新のスキーマを使用する"],"ko":["tarkov.dev API 업데이트 후 스키마를 업데이트함","GraphQL 쿼리에서 ''알 수 없는 필드'' 오류를 해결함","tarkov.dev API의 새로운 데이터를 프로젝트에 통합함","처음으로 프로젝트를 설정할 때 최신 스키마를 사용함"],"es":["Actualización del esquema después de las actualizaciones de la API de tarkov.dev","Resolución de errores de ''campo desconocido'' en consultas GraphQL","Integración de nuevos datos de la API de tarkov.dev en proyectos","Configuración de proyectos con el esquema más reciente por primera vez"],"fr":["Mise à jour du schéma après les mises à jour de l''API de tarkov.dev","Résolution des erreurs de ''champ inconnu'' dans les requêtes GraphQL","Intégration de nouvelles données de l''API de tarkov.dev dans les projets","Configuration des projets avec le schéma le plus récent pour la première fois"],"de":["Aktualisierung des Schemas nach Updates der tarkov.dev-API","Auflösung von ''unbekanntes Feld''-Fehlern in GraphQL-Abfragen","Integration neuer Daten aus der tarkov.dev-API in Projekte","Einrichtung von Projekten mit dem neuesten Schema zum ersten Mal"],"pt":["Atualizar esquema após atualizações da API do tarkov.dev","Resolver erros de ''campo desconhecido'' em consultas GraphQL","Integrar novos dados da API do tarkov.dev em projetos","Configurar projetos com o esquema mais recente pela primeira vez"],"ru":["Обновление схемы после обновлений API tarkov.dev","Решение ошибок ''неизвестное поле'' в запросах GraphQL","Интеграция новых данных из API tarkov.dev в проекты","Настройка проектов с последней схемой впервые"],"ar":["تحديث المخطط بعد تحديثات واجهة برمجة تطبيقات tarkov.dev","حل أخطاء ''حقل غير معروف'' في استفسارات GraphQL","دمج بيانات جديدة من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات tarkov.dev في المشاريع","تكوين المشاريع بمخطط أحدث لأول مرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the tarkov.dev API","Specific to Escape from Tarkov and its API","Needs task automation with ''task tark'' command"],"zh":["需要访问tarkov.dev API","特定于逃离塔尔科夫及其API","需要使用''task tark''命令进行任务自动化"],"ja":["tarkov.dev APIへのアクセスが必要","Escape from TarkovとそのAPIに特有","タスクの自動化には''task tark''コマンドが必要"],"ko":["tarkov.dev API에 접근할 수 있어야 함","탈출 타르코프及其 API에 특정됨","작업 자동화에는 ''task tark'' 명령어가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de tarkov.dev","Específico para Escape from Tarkov y su API","Necesita automatización de tareas con el comando ''task tark''"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API de tarkov.dev","Spécifique à Escape from Tarkov et son API","Nécessite une automatisation des tâches avec la commande ''task tark''"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die tarkov.dev-API","Spezifisch für Escape from Tarkov und dessen API","Benötigt eine Aufgabenautomatisierung mit dem ''task tark''-Befehl"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do tarkov.dev","Específico para Escape from Tarkov e sua API","Necessita automação de tarefas com o comando ''task tark''"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API tarkov.dev","Специфичен для Escape from Tarkov и его API","Требует автоматизации задач с помощью команды ''task tark''"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات tarkov.dev","محدد لبرنامج Escape from Tarkov وواجهة برمجة تطبيقاته","يحتاج إلى آليّة مهام مع أمر ''task tark''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"