ppement web avec des Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","Intégration avec des outils de développement populaires"],"de":["Inspektion von three.js-Szenen","Fehlersuche in Echtzeit","Leistungsanalyse von Szenen","Unterstützung für die Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit KI-Tools","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklertools"],"pt":["Depuração de cenas Three.js","Perfilamento de desempenho","Análise de renderização","Otimização de recursos","Integração com IAs Ferramentas"],"ru":["Отладка сцен Three.js","Профилирование производительности","Анализ рендеринга","Оптимизация ресурсов","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء مشهد Three.js","تحليل الأداء","تحليل العرض","تحسين الموارد","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["three.js调试","AI工具","开发效率提高","代码优化","错误检测","three.js性能优化","inspector-operations教程","three.js开发工具"],"ja":["three.jsデバッグ","AIエージェント","開発効率の向上","コード最適化","エラーディテクション","three.jsパフォーマンス最適化","inspector-operationsマニュアル","three.js開発ツール"],"ko":["three.js 디버깅","AI 에이전트","개발 효율성 향상","코드 최적화","오류 감지","three.js 성능 최적화","inspector-operations 사용법","three.js 개발 도구"],"es":["cómo usar inspector-operations","qué es three.js","alternativas a inspector-operations","inspector-operations vs chrome devtools","instalación de inspector-operations","guía de configuración de inspector-operations","desarrollo web con Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial"],"fr":["comment utiliser inspector-operations","qu''est-ce que trois.js","alternatives à inspector-operations","inspector-operations vs chrome devtools","installation d''inspector-operations","guide de configuration d''inspector-operations","développement web avec des Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle"],"de":["wie man inspector-operations verwendet","was ist three.js","alternativen zu inspector-operations","inspector-operations vs chrome devtools","installation von inspector-operations","anleitung zur konfiguration von inspector-operations","webentwicklung mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar inspeção de cenas Three.js","o que é inspeção de cenas Three.js","ferramentas de inspeção para Three.js","alternativas para inspeção de cenas Three.js","instalação de inspeção de cenas Three.js","guia de configuração de inspeção de cenas Three.js"],"ru":["как использовать осмотр сцен Three.js","что такое осмотр сцен Three.js","инструменты для осмотра сцен Three.js","альтернативы для осмотра сцен Three.js","установка осмотра сцен Three.js","руководство по настройке осмотра сцен Three.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تفتيش مشهد Three.js","ما هو تفتيش مشهد Three.js","أدوات تفتيش لمشهد Three.js","بديل لتفتيش مشهد Three.js","تثبيت تفتيش مشهد Three.js","دليل إعداد تفتيش مشهد Three.js"]}},"owner":"adriandarian","repo":"3Lens","repoPath":"adriandarian/3Lens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.023Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inspector-operations","description":"Navigate and inspect 3Lens entities including meshes, materials, textures, and shaders. Use when examining specific entities, understanding dependencies, tracing cost attribution, or selecting entities by query.","bodyPreview":"# Inspector Operations\n\nThe Inspector is the spine of 3Lens. All tools route through selection and entity inspection. Use these commands to examine entities in detail.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Examining a specific entity (mesh, material, texture, shader)\n- Understanding entity dependencies and relationships\n- Tracing cost attribution paths\n- Selecting entities programmatically via query\n\n## Commands\n\n### Inspect an Entity\n\n```bash\n# Basic entity inspection\n3lens inspect <entityId>\n\n# Include additiona","body":"# Inspector Operations\n\nThe Inspector is the spine of 3Lens. All tools route through selection and entity inspection. Use these commands to examine entities in detail.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Examining a specific entity (mesh, material, texture, shader)\n- Understanding entity dependencies and relationships\n- Tracing cost attribution paths\n- Selecting entities programmatically via query\n\n## Commands\n\n### Inspect an Entity\n\n```bash\n# Basic entity inspection\n3lens inspect <entityId>\n\n# Include additional data\n3lens inspect <entityId> --include edges,cost,diffs\n\n# Output as JSON\n3lens inspect <entityId> --format json\n```\n\n**Output includes:**\n\n- **Identity**: type, id, origin\n- **Dependencies**: incoming/outgoing edges\n- **Cost attribution**: weighted blame chains\n- **Lifecycle + diffs**: creation, updates, disposal\n\n### Select by Query\n\n```bash\n# Select top GPU cost entities\n3lens inspect --query \"top_gpu_cost\" --limit 5\n\n# Select materials using a specific texture\n3lens inspect --query \"materials_using_texture:tex123\"\n```\n\n## The 5 Inspector Questions\n\nEvery entity inspection should answer:\n\n1. **What is this?** (type, properties, origin)\n2. **What does it depend on?** (incoming edges)\n3. **What depends on it?** (outgoing edges)\n4. **How much does it cost?** (attributed metrics with blame chain)\n5. **How has it changed?** (diffs over time/traces)\n\n## Entity ID Format\n\nEntity IDs follow a stable, namespaced format:\n\n```\n<type>:<namespace>:<identifier>\n\nExamples:\n  mesh:scene:Player_Avatar\n  material:default:PBR_Metal_01\n  texture:loaded:albedo_diffuse.png\n  shader:compiled:StandardPBR_v123\n```\n\n## Agent Use Cases\n\n1. **Root cause analysis**: \"Inspect entity mesh:scene:Player to find why it''s expensive\"\n2. **Dependency tracking**: \"Show all materials that depend on this texture\"\n3. **Cost attribution**: \"Trace the blame chain for this GPU hotspot\"\n4. **Bulk selection**: \"Select all entities matching this query\"\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- For detailed command syntax, see [.cursor/commands/](../../commands/)\n- For Inspector contract, see [.cursor/contracts/inspector.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/inspector.md)\n- For entity graph rules, see [.cursor/contracts/entity-graph.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/entity-graph.md)\n- Inspector is runtime/UI; see addon-inspector for implementation\n- Contract: [attribution.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/attribution.md)\n- Contract: [fidelity.md](../../../.cursor/contracts/fidelity.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:13:18.390Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for 3D Analysis Agents needing advanced scene inspection and debugging capabilities for three.js scenes.","zh":"非常适合需要高级场景检查和调试功能的 3D 分析代理，用于 three.js 场景。","ja":"three.js シーンの詳細なシーンの検査とデバッグ機能が必要な 3D 分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"three.js 씬의 고급 시각 검사 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 3D 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis 3D que necesitan inspección de escena avanzada y capacidades de depuración para escenas de three.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse 3D qui ont besoin d''inspection de scène avancée et de capacités de débogage pour les scènes de three.js.","de":"Perfect für 3D-Analyseagenten, die eine erweiterte Szeneinspektion und Debugging-Kapazitäten für three.js-Szenen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise 3D que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de inspeção e depuração de cenas para cenas three.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов 3D-анализа, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности осмотра и отладки сцен three.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل 3D الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتفحص المشهد وتصحيح الأخطاء لمشاهدات three.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to examine entities in detail, including mesh, material, texture, and shader inspection, using commands like ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' for comprehensive content analysis and debugging.","zh":"能够让代理详细检查实体，包括网格、材质、纹理和着色器检查，使用命令如 ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' 进行全面内容分析和调试。","ja":"エージェントがメッシュ、材質、テクスチャ、シェーダーの検査を含むエンティティを詳細に検査できるようにし、''3lens inspect <entityId>'' のようなコマンドを使用して包括的なコンテンツ分析およびデバッグを行います。","ko":"에이전트가 메쉬, 재질, 텍스처 및 셰이더 검사를 포함하여 엔티티를 자세히 조사할 수 있도록 하며, ''3lens inspect <entityId>''와 같은 명령을 사용하여 종합적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 디버깅을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para examinar entidades en detalle, incluyendo inspección de malla, material, textura y sombreador, usando comandos como ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' para análisis y depuración de contenido exhaustivo.","fr":"Empodera a los agentes para examinar entidades en detalle, incluyendo inspección de malla, material, textura y sombreador, usando comandos como ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' para análisis y depuración de contenido exhaustivo.","de":"Empodera a los agentes para examinar entidades en detalle, incluyendo inspección de malla, material, textura y sombreador, usando comandos como ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' para análisis y depuración de contenido exhaustivo.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a examinar entidades em detalhe, incluindo inspeção de malha, material, textura e shader, usando comandos como ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' para análise e depuração de conteúdo abrangente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью детально осматривать объекты, включая проверку сетки, материала, текстуры и шейдеров, используя команды типа ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' для всестороннего анализа и отладки контента.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على فحص الكائنات بال细节، بما في ذلك فحص الشبكة والمادة والنسيج والشادر، باستخدام أوامر مثل ''3lens inspect <entityId>'' من أجل تحليل المحتوى الشامل وتصحيح الأخطاء."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging three.js scenes with entity dependencies and relationships","Tracing cost attribution paths for optimization","Selecting entities programmatically via query for automated analysis"],"zh":["调试具有实体依赖关系和关系的 three.js 场景","跟踪成本归因路径以进行优化","通过查询以编程方式选择实体以进行自动分析"],"ja":["エンティティの依存関係と関係を持つ three.js シーンのデバッグ","最適化のためのコスト帰属パスのトレース","自動分析のためのプログラムによるエンティティの選択"],"ko":["엔티티 종속성 및 관계가 있는 three.js 씬의 디버깅","최적화를 위한 비용 귀속 경로 추적","자동 분석을 위한 프로그래밍 방식으로 엔티티 선택"],"es":["Depuración de escenas de three.js con dependencias y relaciones de entidades","Rastreo de costos de atribución para optimización","Selección de entidades de forma programática mediante consulta para análisis automatizado"],"fr":["Débogage de scènes de three.js avec des dépendances et des relations d''entités","Rastreo de costos de atribución pour optimisation","Sélection d''entités de manière programmatique via requête pour analyse automatisée"],"de":["Depuración de escenas de three.js con dependencias y relaciones de entidades","Rastreo de costos de atribución para optimización","Selección de entidades de forma programática mediante consulta para análisis automatizado"],"pt":["Depuração de cenas three.js com dependências e relações de entidades","Rastreamento de caminhos de atribuição de custos para otimização","Seleção de entidades programaticamente via consulta para análise automatizada"],"ru":["Отладка сцен three.js с зависимостями и отношениями сущностей","Отслеживание путей атрибуции затрат для оптимизации","Выбор сущностей программно через запрос для автоматического анализа"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء مشاهدات three.js مع التبعيات والعلاقات بين الكائنات","تتبع مسارات تحديد التكاليف من أجل التحسين","تحديد الكائنات برمجيا عن طريق استعلام للتحليل التلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires three.js scene setup","Limited to inspecting entities within the 3Lens ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 three.js 场景设置","仅限于检查 3Lens 生态系统内的实体"],"ja":["three.js シーンの設定が必要","3Lens エコシステム内のエンティティのみを検査する"],"ko":["three.js 씬 설정이 필요","3Lens 에코システム 내의 엔티티만을 검사"],"es":["Requiere configuración de escena de three.js","Limitado a inspeccionar entidades dentro del ecosistema de 3Lens"],"fr":["Requiere configuración de escena de three.js","Limitado a inspeccionar entidades dentro del ecosistema de 3Lens"],"de":["Requiere configuración de escena de three.js","Limitado a inspeccionar entidades dentro del ecosistema de 3Lens"],"pt":["Requer configuração de cena three.js","Limitado à inspeção de entidades dentro do ecossistema 3Lens"],"ru":["Требует настройки сцены three.js","Ограничен осмотром сущностей внутри экосистемы 3Lens"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشهد three.js","محدود بفحص الكائنات داخل نظام 3Lens"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ede01842f52b8da78060e1c1e1f4c104227c9b417b6fed056e55577763cb479b","qualityScore":49}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web/entry-point-analyzer', 'community', 'andrescardonas7', 'salchipapa-web', 'andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web', 'entry-point-analyzer', 0, 0, 49, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.024Z', '2026-03-02T03:14:02.019Z', '30ee63ad5132dbfd760a86d0b5e626299c297100bc6d2fc7ca0a93ce037cbb02', '{"id":"andrescardonas7/salchipapa-web/entry-point-analyzer","name":"entry-point-analyzer","description":{"zh":"entry-point-analyzer是用于分析AI智能代理入口的工具，帮助开发者优化代码","ja":"entry-point-analyzerはAIエージェントのエントリーポイントを分析するツールです","ko":"entry-point-analyzer는 AI 에이전트의 入口점을 분석하는 도구입니다","es":"El analizador de punto de entrada es una herramienta de IA que ayuda a mejorar la votación por la mejor salchipapa","fr":"L''analyseur de point d''entrée est un outil d''IA qui aide à améliorer le vote pour la meilleure salchipapa","de":"Der Eintragspunktanalyzer ist ein KI-Tool, das bei der Verbesserung der Abstimmung für die beste Salchipapa hilft","pt":"O Analisador de Ponto de Entrada é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda desenvolvedores a otimizar seu código. Com ele, você pode melhorar a performance e a segurança do seu aplicativo.","ru":"Анализатор Точки Входа - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает разработчикам оптимизировать свой код. С его помощью вы можете улучшить производительность и безопасность вашего приложения.","ar":"محلل نقطة الدخول هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد المطورين على تحسين كودهم. باستخدامه، يمكنك تحسين أداء وتأمن تطبيقك.","en":"Desafío Salchipapa - Votación por la mejor salchip"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理入口分析器","ja":"AIエージェント エントリーポイント分析ツール","ko":"AI 에이전트 入口점 분석기","es":"Análisis de Punto de Entrada con Herramientas de IA","fr":"Analyseur de Point d''Entrée avec Outils d''IA","de":"Eintragspunktanalyzer mit KI-Tools","pt":"Analisador de Ponto de Entrada - Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Анализатор Точки Входа - ИИ Агенты","ar":"محل