re criptografía","Validación de software con herramientas de inteligencia artificial","Integración con Jekyll para una publicación fácil","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de archivo","Personalización de la salida con plantillas personalizadas"],"fr":["Génération d''articles techniques sur la cryptographie","Validation de logiciels avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle","Intégration avec Jekyll pour une publication facile","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de fichiers","Personnalisation de la sortie avec des modèles personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung von technischem Inhalt über Kryptographie","Validierung von Software mit KI-Tools","Integration mit Jekyll für eine einfache Veröffentlichung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Dateiformaten","Anpassung der Ausgabe mit benutzerdefinierten Vorlagen"],"pt":["Geração de artigos técnicos para criptografia","Validação de software com ferramentas de IA","Integração com Jekyll para publicação de conteúdo","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de saída","Personalização de templates e layouts"],"ru":["Генерация технических статей для криптографии","Проверка программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с Jekyll для публикации контента","Поддержка нескольких форматов вывода","Настройка шаблонов и макетов"],"ar":["إنشاء مقالات فنية للتشفير","التحقق من البرمجيات مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع جيكل لنشر المحتوى","دعم صيغ متعددة للخرج","تخصيص القوالب والتخطيطات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Jekyll文章生成器","什么是AI智能工具","Jekyll文章生成器替代品","Jekyll文章生成器与其他工具的比较","Jekyll文章生成器安装","Jekyll文章生成器设置指南","AI智能工具在加密和软件验证中的应用","Jekyll文章生成器的优势"],"ja":["Jekyll記事生成ツールの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","Jekyll記事生成ツールの代替品","Jekyll記事生成ツールと他のツールの比較","Jekyll記事生成ツールのインストール","Jekyll記事生成ツールの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの暗号化とソフトウェア検証への応用","Jekyll記事生成ツールの利点"],"ko":["Jekyll 文章 생성기 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Jekyll 文章 생성기 대체품","Jekyll 文章 생성기와 다른 도구의 비교","Jekyll 文章 생성기 설치","Jekyll 文章 생성기 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트의 암호화 및 소프트웨어 검증への 적용","Jekyll 文章 생성기의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar Jekyll para criptografía","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para validación de software","generador de artículos Jekyll","alternativas a Jekyll","Jekyll vs otros generadores de artículos","instalación de Jekyll","guía de configuración de Jekyll"],"fr":["comment utiliser Jekyll pour la cryptographie","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour la validation de logiciels","générateur d''articles Jekyll","alternatives à Jekyll","Jekyll vs autres générateurs d''articles","installation de Jekyll","guide de configuration de Jekyll"],"de":["wie man Jekyll für Kryptographie verwendet","KI-Tools für Software-Validierung","Jekyll-Artikel-Generator","Alternativen zu Jekyll","Jekyll vs andere Artikel-Generatoren","Installation von Jekyll","Konfigurationsanleitung für Jekyll"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para criptografia","gerador de artigos Jekyll","validação de software com IA","como usar Jekyll para criptografia","alternativas ao Jekyll para criptografia","instalação do Jekyll para criptografia"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для криптографии","генератор статей Jekyll","проверка программного обеспечения с ИИ","как использовать Jekyll для криптографии","альтернативы Jekyll для криптографии","установка Jekyll для криптографии"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتشفير","مولد مقالات جيكل","التحقق من البرمجيات مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام جيكل للتشفير","بديلات جيكل للتشفير","تثبيت جيكل للتشفير"]}},"owner":"sweeden-ttu","repo":"spring-2026","repoPath":"sweeden-ttu/spring-2026","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.026Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"jekyll-article-generator","description":"Specialized agent for generating high-quality articles and blog posts using jekyll-TeXt-theme, with expertise in software verification and validation. Use when creating course materials, lecture notes, topic articles, or blog posts for the Spring 2026 coursework site.","bodyPreview":"# Jekyll TeXt Theme Article Generator\n\nThis agent specializes in generating publication-quality articles and blog posts for the jekyll-TeXt-theme Jekyll site, with deep expertise in software verification and validation topics.\n\n## Purpose and Scope\n\nGenerate well-structured, publication-ready articles and blog posts that:\n- Follow jekyll-TeXt-theme conventions and best practices\n- Use proper article layout and front matter\n- Maintain academic and professional tone\n- Cover software verification,","body":"# Jekyll TeXt Theme Article Generator\n\nThis agent specializes in generating publication-quality articles and blog posts for the jekyll-TeXt-theme Jekyll site, with deep expertise in software verification and validation topics.\n\n## Purpose and Scope\n\nGenerate well-structured, publication-ready articles and blog posts that:\n- Follow jekyll-TeXt-theme conventions and best practices\n- Use proper article layout and front matter\n- Maintain academic and professional tone\n- Cover software verification, validation, testing, and related topics\n- Can serve as course materials, lecture notes, or blog content\n\n## Target Location\n\nThis skill is project-specific and should be stored at:\n- `.cursor/skills/jekyll-article-generator/` (in the spring-2026 project)\n\n## Trigger Scenarios\n\nAutomatically apply this skill when users request:\n- Creating new articles or blog posts\n- Generating course materials or lecture notes\n- Writing topic articles for software verification topics\n- Converting notes to publication format\n- Creating documentation or tutorial content\n\n## Key Domain Knowledge\n\n### Software Verification & Validation Expertise\n\nThe agent understands:\n- **Verification vs. Validation**: Building the product right vs. building the right product\n- **Testing Techniques**: Black box, white box, model-based, graph-based, fault-based testing\n- **Formal Methods**: Model checking, theorem proving, formal verification\n- **Testing Tools**: LangSmith, testing frameworks, coverage tools\n- **AI/LLM Testing**: Evaluation methods, prompt testing, LLM quality assurance\n- **Industry Practices**: Test adequacy criteria, coverage metrics, test strategies\n\n### Jekyll TeXt Theme Knowledge\n\nThe agent understands:\n- **Layouts**: `article`, `page`, `home`, `landing`, `archive`\n- **Front Matter**: Required and optional fields for articles\n- **Article Structure**: Excerpt separation with `<!--more-->`, proper heading hierarchy\n- **Theme Features**: MathJax, Mermaid diagrams, syntax highlighting\n- **Navigation Configuration**: Header and sidebar navigation via `_data/navigation.yml`\n\n## Article Format Standards\n\n### Front Matter Template\n\n```yaml\n---\nlayout: article\ntitle: Article Title\nkey: unique-article-key\ntags:\n  - Tag1\n  - Tag2\n  - Tag3\npermalink: /path/to/article/\nmathjax: true  # Optional: for mathematical notation\nmermaid: true  # Optional: for diagrams\n---\n```\n\n### Content Structure\n\n1. **Opening Paragraph** (Excerpt)\n   - Engaging introduction\n   - Clear statement of topic\n   - Sets context and expectations\n\n2. **Excerpt Separator**\n   - `<!--more-->` after first paragraph or section\n   - Marks where excerpt ends in article lists\n\n3. **Main Content**\n   - Logical sections with proper headings (##, ###)\n   - Examples and code blocks where appropriate\n   - Clear explanations and definitions\n   - Academic tone with professional language\n\n4. **Conclusion/Summary**\n   - Key takeaways\n   - Further reading/resources\n   - Navigation to related articles\n\n### Style Guidelines\n\n- **Tone**: Academic but accessible, professional yet engaging\n- **Structure**: Clear hierarchy with descriptive headings\n- **Examples**: Include code examples, diagrams, or practical illustrations\n- **Citations**: Reference course materials, standards, or research when appropriate\n- **Formatting**: Use Markdown features (code blocks, lists, emphasis) effectively\n\n## Examples\n\n### Course Topic Article\n\n```yaml\n---\nlayout: article\ntitle: Black Box Testing\nkey: topic-black-box-testing\ntags:\n  - Testing\n  - Black Box\n  - Functional Testing\npermalink: /software-verification/topics/black-box-testing/\n---\n\nBlack box testing is a fundamental testing methodology where the internal structure of the software is not known to the tester. Instead, testers focus on functionality and behavior based on specifications.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n## Understanding Black Box Testing\n\n[Main content here...]\n```\n\n### Lecture Notes Article\n\n```yaml\n---\nlayout: article\ntitle: Lecture 5: Model-Based Testing\nkey: lecture-05-model-based-testing\ntags:\n  - Lecture Notes\n  - Model-Based Testing\n  - CS-5374\ndate: 2026-02-12\npermalink: /software-verification/lectures/2026-02-12-model-based-testing/\n---\n\nThis lecture covers model-based testing techniques and their application in software verification.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n## Topics Covered\n\n[Lecture content...]\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use `layout: article`** for articles and blog posts\n2. **Include `key` field** with unique identifier (letter + alphanumeric)\n3. **Add relevant tags** for categorization and navigation\n4. **Use `<!--more-->` separator** after excerpt\n5. **Maintain heading hierarchy** (## for main sections, ### for subsections)\n6. **Include code examples** in appropriate language blocks\n7. **Link to related articles** and resources\n8. **Use MathJax/Mermaid** when mathematical notation or diagrams are needed\n\n## Navigation Checklist\n\nWhen creating articles that need navigation:\n\n- [ ] Determine if article should appear in header or sidebar navigation\n- [ ] Check `_data/navigation.yml` for existing navigation structures\n- [ ] Add article to appropriate navigation structure if needed\n- [ ] Use consistent URL patterns with other related articles\n- [ ] If using sidebar, add `sidebar: { nav: nav-name }` to front matter\n- [ ] Verify navigation URLs match article permalinks\n- [ ] Ensure navigation hierarchy is logical and well-organized\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing an article, ensure:\n- [ ] Front matter includes `layout: article`, `title`, `key`, `tags`, `permalink`\n- [ ] Sidebar navigation configured if article is part of a topic series\n- [ ] Opening paragraph serves as good excerpt\n- [ ] `<!--more-->` separator is present\n- [ ] Content is well-structured with proper headings\n- [ ] Academic tone is maintained throughout\n- [ ] Technical terms are defined or explained\n- [ ] Examples or illustrations are included where appropriate\n- [ ] Links to related content are provided\n- [ ] Navigation is updated in `_data/navigation.yml` if article should appear in menus\n- [ ] Content is publication-ready\n\n## Navigation Configuration\n\n### Understanding `_data/navigation.yml`\n\nThe jekyll-TeXt-theme uses `_data/navigation.yml` to define navigation. The agent must understand two types:\n\n#### Header Navigation\n\nDefined under the `header` key. Used for main site navigation menu:\n\n```yaml\nheader:\n  - title:      Home\n    url:        /\n  - title:      Docs\n    url:        /docs/en/quick-start\n    key:        docs  # Optional: unique identifier\n  - titles:     # Multi-language support\n      en:       Archive\n      zh:       归档\n    url:        /archive.html\n  - title:      External Link\n    url:        https://example.com\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Each item has `title` (or `titles` for multi-language) and `url`\n- Optional `key` field for unique identification\n- Can include external URLs\n- Supports single `title` or `titles` object for internationalization\n\n#### Sidebar Navigation\n\nDefined as named navigation structures. Used for article sidebar navigation:\n\n```yaml\ncourse-topics:\n  - title:      Fundamentals\n    children:\n      - title:  Introduction to V&V\n        url:    /software-verification/topics/01-introduction-vv/\n      - title:  Adequacy Criterion\n        url:    /software-verification/topics/02-adequacy-criterion/\n  - title:      Testing Techniques\n    children:\n      - title:  Black Box Testing\n        url:    /software-verification/topics/04-black-box-testing/\n      - title:  White Box Testing\n        url:    /software-verification/topics/05-white-box-testing/\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Named navigation structure (e.g., `course-topics:`, `docs-en:`)\n- Hierarchical structure with `children` arrays\n- Each child has `title` and `url`\n- Supports nested navigation (parent → children)\n\n### Using Sidebar Navigation in Articles\n\nTo enable sidebar navigation in an article, add to front matter:\n\n```yaml\n---\nlayout: article\ntitle: Article Title\nsidebar:\n  nav: course-topics  # References navigation structure in navigation.yml\n---\n```\n\n### Navigation Best Practices\n\nWhen creating articles, consider navigation:\n\n1. **Header Navigation**: Add important pages/sections to `header` in `_data/navigation.yml`\n2. **Sidebar Navigation**: Create named navigation structures for topic groups\n3. **Update Navigation**: When creating new articles, update `navigation.yml` if they should appear in navigation\n4. **Consistent URLs**: Use consistent permalink patterns for related articles\n5. **Hierarchical Organization**: Use `children` to group related topics under parent categories\n\n### Example Navigation File\n\nComplete `_data/navigation.yml` structure:\n\n```yaml\nheader:\n  - title: Home\n    url: /\n  - title: Software Verification\n    url: /software-verification/introduction/\n  - title: Topics\n    url: /software-verification/introduction/\n  - title: Courses\n    url: /courses/\n\n# Sidebar navigation for course topics\ncourse-topics:\n  - title: Introduction\n    children:\n      - title: Introduction to V&V\n        url: /software-verification/topics/01-introduction-vv/\n      - title: Adequacy Criterion\n        url: /software-verification/topics/02-adequacy-criterion/\n  - title: Testing Methods\n    children:\n      - title: Black Box Testing\n        url: /software-verification/topics/04-black-box-testing/\n      - title: White Box Testing\n        url: /software-verification/topics/05-white-box-testing/\n      - title: Model-based Testing\n        url: /software-verification/topics/06-model-based-testing/\n```\n\n## Integration with Course Site\n\nArticles should:\n- Reference course data from `_data/` directories when appropriate\n- Use Liquid templating for dynamic content\n- Follow site navigation structure defined in `_data/navigation.yml`\n- Update navigation.yml when creating new article series or sections\n- Link to related lectures, topics, or resources\n- Use sidebar navigation where appropriate for topic organization\n- Maintain consistency with existing course materials\n\n## Navigation Workflow\n\nWhen creating articles that should appear in navigation:\n\n1. **Determine Navigation Type**: \n   - Header navigation: For main site navigation items\n   - Sidebar navigation: For topic-based article organization\n\n2. **Check Existing Navigation**: Review `_data/navigation.yml` for existing structures\n\n3. **Update Navigation File**: \n   - Add to `header:` for main navigation items\n   - Add to appropriate sidebar navigation structure (e.g., `course-topics:`)\n   - Maintain hierarchical structure with `children` where appropriate\n\n4. **Reference in Front Matter**: \n   - If using sidebar, add `sidebar: { nav: navigation-name }` to article front matter\n\n5. **Maintain Consistency**: \n   - Use consistent URL patterns\n   - Group related articles under same parent in sidebar\n   - Keep navigation structures organized and logical\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen generating articles:\n\n1. **Understand Requirements**: Clarify article type, topic, and audience\n2. **Gather Context**: Review related course materials or existing articles\n3. **Check Navigation**: Review `_data/navigation.yml` to see where article fits\n4. **Create Structure**: Plan sections and content flow\n5. **Write Content**: Generate article following format standards\n6. **Update Navigation**: Add article to appropriate navigation structure if needed\n7. **Review and Refine**: Ensure quality, consistency, and completeness\n8. **Add Metadata**: Include tags, links, front matter, and sidebar navigation if applicable\n\n## Navigation Examples\n\n### Example: Complete Navigation File\n\nReference the `_data/navigation.yml` structure from the jekyll-TeXt-theme repository:\n- **Header Navigation**: Simple flat structure with `title` and `url`\n- **Sidebar Navigation**: Hierarchical structure with named navigation groups\n- **Multi-language Support**: Use `titles` object instead of `title` for i18n\n\n### Example: Using Sidebar in Article\n\n```yaml\n---\nlayout: article\ntitle: Black Box Testing\nkey: topic-black-box-testing\ntags:\n  - Testing\nsidebar:\n  nav: course-topics  # References navigation structure in _data/navigation.yml\npermalink: /software-verification/topics/04-black-box-testing/\n---\n```\n\nThis will display the `course-topics` navigation in the sidebar when viewing this article.\n\n### Example: Multi-language Navigation\n\n```yaml\nheader:\n  - titles:\n      en: Archive\n      zh: 归档\n    url: /archive.html\n```\n\nUse `titles` object for internationalization support.\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **Theme Navigation**: https://github.com/sweeden-ttu/jekyll-TeXt-theme/blob/master/docs/_data/navigation.yml\n- **Site Navigation**: `_data/navigation.yml` (should be created/updated as articles are added)\n- **Article Examples**: See `/software-verification/_pages/topics/` for examples of course topic articles\n- **Navigation Documentation**: See theme docs at `/docs/en/navigation` or `/docs/zh/navigation`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:15:36.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Content Generation Agents specializing in technical writing and software validation topics, seeking to produce publication-quality articles for Jekyll sites.","zh":"适合专门从事技术写作和软件验证主题的内容生成代理，旨在为Jekyll站点生成出版质量的文章。","ja":"技術文書作成やソフトウェアの検証に関するトピックを専門とするコンテンツ生成エージェントに適しています。Jekyllサイト向けの出版品質の記事を生成することを目指しています。","ko":"기술 문서 작성 및 소프트웨어 검증 주제에 특화된 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Jekyll 사이트를 위한 출판 품질의 기사를 생성하는 것을 목표로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Contenido especializados en escritura técnica y temas de validación de software, que buscan producir artículos de calidad de publicación para sitios Jekyll.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de contenu spécialisés dans la rédaction technique et les sujets de validation de logiciels, cherchant à produire des articles de qualité de publication pour les sites Jekyll.","de":"Ideal für Inhaltsgenerierungsagenten, die auf technische Schreiben und Software-Validierungsthemen spezialisiert sind und qualitativ hochwertige Artikel für Jekyll-Seiten erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo especializados em escrita técnica e tópicos de validação de software, buscando produzir artigos de qualidade de publicação para sites Jekyll.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации контента, специализирующихся на технической письменной деятельности и темах проверки программного обеспечения, стремящихся производить публикации высокого качества для сайтов Jekyll.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء مولد المحتوى المتخصصة في الكتابة الفنية والمواضيع المتعلقة بالبرمجيات والتأكيد، سعياً لإنتاج مقالات منشورات عالية الجودة لمواقع Jekyll."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate well-structured, publication-ready articles and blog posts following jekyll-TeXt-theme conventions, utilizing proper article layout and front matter, and maintaining an academic and professional tone, covering software verification and validation topics.","zh":"赋予代理生成结构良好、出版就绪的文章和博客帖子，遵循jekyll-TeXt-theme惯例，利用适当的文章布局和前置内容，并保持学术和专业的语气，涵盖软件验证和验证主题。","ja":"エージェントに、jekyll-TeXt-themeの規約に従った、構造が整理された出版用記事やブログ投稿を生成する能力を与え、適切な記事レイアウトやフロントマターを使用し、学術的で専門的な口調を維持し、ソフトウェアの検証と検証に関するトピックをカバーします。","ko":"에이전트에게 구조가 잘 정리된 출판용 기사와 블로그 게시물을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 jekyll-TeXt-theme 규약을 준수하고 적절한 기사 레이아웃 및 전면 물자를 사용하며 학술적이고 전문적인 어조를 유지하여 소프트웨어 검증 및 검증 주제를 다룹니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar artículos bien estructurados y listos para la publicación, así como entradas de blog que siguen las convenciones del tema jekyll-TeXt, utilizando un diseño de artículo y front matter adecuados, y manteniendo un tono académico y profesional, cubriendo temas de verificación y validación de software.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des articles bien structurés et prêts à la publication, ainsi que des billets de blog qui suivent les conventions du thème jekyll-TeXt, en utilisant une mise en page d''article et une section front matter appropriées, et en maintenant un ton académique et professionnel, couvrant les sujets de vérification et de validation de logiciels.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gut strukturierte und publikationsbereite Artikel sowie Blog-Beiträge zu erstellen, die den Konventionen des jekyll-TeXt-Themas folgen, wobei ein geeignetes Artikel-Layout und Front-Matter verwendet werden und ein akademischer und professioneller Ton beibehalten wird, der sich auf Software-Verifizierungs- und Validierungsthemen konzentriert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar artigos bem estruturados e prontos para publicação, bem como posts de blog seguindo as convenções do jekyll-TeXt-theme, utilizando layout de artigo adequado e front matter, e mantendo um tom acadêmico e profissional, cobrindo tópicos de verificação e validação de software.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью генерировать хорошо структурированные и готовые к публикации статьи, а также посты в блоге, следующими за конвенциями jekyll-TeXt-theme, используя правильный макет статьи и front matter, и поддерживая академический и профессиональный тон, охватывающий темы проверки и верификации программного обеспечения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد مقالات منشورة جيدة الهيكل وجاهزة للنشر، وكذلك منشورات المدونة التي تتبع اتفاقيات jekyll-TeXt-theme، باستخدام تخطيط المقالة المناسب والمادة الأمامية، وحفظ النبرة الأكاديمية والمهنية، وتغطية مواضيع التحقق والتحقق من البرمجيات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating publication-quality articles for Jekyll sites with a focus on software verification and validation","Creating well-structured blog posts that adhere to jekyll-TeXt-theme best practices","Automating the production of academic and professional content for technical audiences"],"zh":["为Jekyll站点生成出版质量的文章，重点关注软件验证和验证","创建结构良好的博客帖子，遵循jekyll-TeXt-theme最佳实践","自动化生成技术受众的学术和专业内容"],"ja":["ソフトウェアの検証と検証に焦点を当てたJekyllサイト向けの出版品質の記事を生成する","jekyll-TeXt-themeのベストプラクティスに従った構造が整理されたブログ投稿を作成する","技術オーディエンス向けの学術的で専門的なコンテンツの生成を自動化する"],"ko":["소프트웨어 검증 및 검증에 중점을 둔 Jekyll 사이트를 위한 출판 품질의 기사를 생성하는 것","jekyll-TeXt-theme의 최선의 관행을 따르는 구조가 잘 정리된 블로그 게시물을 생성하는 것","기술 오디언스를 위한 학술적이고 전문적인 콘텐츠의 생성을 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Generar artículos de calidad de publicación para sitios Jekyll con un enfoque en verificación y validación de software","Crear entradas de blog bien estructuradas que sigan las mejores prácticas del tema jekyll-TeXt","Automatizar la producción de contenido académico y profesional para audiencias técnicas"],"fr":["Générer des articles de qualité de publication pour les sites Jekyll avec un focus sur la vérification et la validation de logiciels","Créer des billets de blog bien structurés qui suivent les meilleures pratiques du thème jekyll-TeXt","Automatiser la production de contenu académique et professionnel pour les publics techniques"],"de":["Erstellen von qualitativ hochwertigen Artikeln für Jekyll-Seiten mit Fokus auf Software-Verifizierung und -Validierung","Erstellen gut strukturierter Blog-Beiträge, die den Best Practices des jekyll-TeXt-Themas entsprechen","Automatisieren der Erstellung von akademischem und professionellem Inhalt für technische Zielgruppen"],"pt":["Gerar artigos de qualidade de publicação para sites Jekyll com foco em verificação e validação de software","Criar posts de blog bem estruturados que aderem às melhores práticas do jekyll-TeXt-theme","Automatizar a produção de conteúdo acadêmico e profissional para públicos técnicos"],"ru":["Генерировать публикации высокого качества для сайтов Jekyll с фокусом на проверке и верификации программного обеспечения","Создавать хорошо структурированные посты в блоге, следующими за лучшими практиками jekyll-TeXt-theme","Автоматизировать производство академического и профессионального контента для технической аудитории"],"ar":["توليد مقالات منشورة عالية الجودة لمواقع Jekyll مع التركيز على التحقق والتحقق من البرمجيات","إنشاء منشورات مدونة جيدة الهيكل التي تتبع أفضل الممارسات ل jekyll-TeXt-theme","أتمتة إنتاج المحتوى الأكاديمي والمهني للجماهير الفنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with Jekyll and the jekyll-TeXt-theme","Limited to generating content for software verification and validation topics","Dependent on the quality and accuracy of input data for article generation"],"zh":["需要熟悉Jekyll和jekyll-TeXt-theme","仅限于生成软件验证和验证主题的内容","依赖于输入数据的质量和准确性来生成文章"],"ja":["Jekyllとjekyll-TeXt-themeの知識が必要","ソフトウェアの検証と検証に関するトピックのコンテンツの生成に限定される","記事生成のために入力データの品質と正確性に依存する"],"ko":["Jekyll 및 jekyll-TeXt-theme에 대한 지식이 필요함","소프트웨어 검증 및 검증 주제에 대한 콘텐츠 생성에 한정됨","기사 생성을 위해 입력 데이터의 품질 및 정확성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con Jekyll y el tema jekyll-TeXt","Limitado a la generación de contenido sobre temas de verificación y validación de software","Dependiente de la calidad y precisión de los datos de entrada para la generación de artículos"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Jekyll et du thème jekyll-TeXt","Limité à la génération de contenu sur les sujets de vérification et de validation de logiciels","Dépend de la qualité et de l''exactitude des données d''entrée pour la génération d''articles"],"de":["Benötigt Vertrautheit mit Jekyll und dem jekyll-TeXt-Thema","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Inhalt zu Software-Verifizierungs- und Validierungsthemen","Abhängig von der Qualität und Genauigkeit der Eingabedaten für die Artikelgenerierung"],"pt":["Requer familiaridade com Jekyll e o jekyll-TeXt-theme","Limitado a gerar conteúdo para tópicos de verificação e validação de software","Dependente da qualidade e precisão dos dados de entrada para geração de artigos"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с Jekyll и jekyll-TeXt-theme","Ограничен генерацией контента для тем проверки и верификации программного обеспечения","Зависит от качества и точности входных данных для генерации статей"],"ar":["يتطلب إلمامًا ب Jekyll و jekyll-TeXt-theme","محدود بتوليد المحتوى لمواضيع التحقق والتحقق من البرمجيات","يعتمد على جودة ودقة بيانات الإدخال لتوليد المقالات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"59d90039228e4528e23f48d7a57e59de09cb9184dad442bab5cb7e583f5caf1e","qualityScore":49}');
