ения Сборки Gradle","ar":"أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين أداء بناء جرادل","en":"gradle-build-performance"},"description":{"zh":"使用Kotlin Jetpack Compose构建Locket Clone App，优化Gradle构建性能，提高开发效率","ja":"Kotlin Jetpack ComposeでLocket Clone Appを構築し、Gradleビルドパフォーマンスを最適化して開発効率を向上","ko":"Kotlin Jetpack Compose로 Locket Clone App를 구축하고 Gradle 빌드 성능을 최적화하여 개발 효율을 개선","es":"La aplicación Locket Clone utiliza Kotlin y Jetpack Compose para mejorar el rendimiento de construcción de Gradle","fr":"L''application Locket Clone utilise Kotlin et Jetpack Compose pour améliorer les performances de construction de Gradle","de":"Die Locket-Clone-App verwendet Kotlin und Jetpack Compose, um die Gradle-Build-Performance zu verbessern","pt":"A ferramenta de IA para Gradle melhora o desempenho de build do seu projeto. Aprenda a utilizar a Locket Clone App com Kotlin Jetpack compose","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Gradle улучшают производительность сборки вашего проекта. Узнайте, как использовать Locket Clone App с Kotlin Jetpack compose","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للجرادل تحسّن أداء بناء مشروعك. تعرّف على كيفية استخدام تطبيق Locket Clone مع Kotlin Jetpack compose","en":"Locket Clone App using Kotlin Jetpack compose"},"definition":{"en":"Locket Clone App using Kotlin Jetpack compose"},"features":{"zh":["使用Kotlin Jetpack Compose构建Locket Clone App","优化Gradle构建性能","提高开发效率","支持Android App开发","提供详细的构建日志"],"ja":["Kotlin Jetpack ComposeでLocket Clone Appを構築","Gradleビルドパフォーマンスを最適化","開発効率を向上","Androidアプリ開発をサポート","詳細なビルドログを提供"],"ko":["Kotlin Jetpack Compose로 Locket Clone App를 구축","Gradle 빌드 성능을 최적화","개발 효율을 개선","Android 앱 개발을 지원","詳細한 빌드 로그를 제공"],"es":["Optimización de Gradle con Kotlin","Mejora del rendimiento de construcción","Uso de Jetpack Compose","Desarrollo de aplicaciones Android","Integración con herramientas de AI"],"fr":["Amélioration des performances de construction de Gradle avec Kotlin","Optimisation de la construction","Utilisation de Jetpack Compose","Développement d''applications Android","Intégration avec des outils d''IA"],"de":["Optimierung von Gradle mit Kotlin","Verbesserung der Build-Performance","Verwendung von Jetpack Compose","Entwicklung von Android-Apps","Integration mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho de build","Integração com Kotlin Jetpack compose","Melhoria da configuração do Gradle","Utilização de IA para melhorar a eficiência","Suporte à Locket Clone App"],"ru":["Ускорение сборки","Интеграция с Kotlin Jetpack compose","Оптимизация настроек Gradle","Использование ИИ для повышения эффективности","Поддержка Locket Clone App"],"ar":["تحسين أداء البناء","التكامل مع Kotlin Jetpack compose","تحسين إعدادات الجرادل","استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الكفاءة","دعم تطبيق Locket Clone"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Gradle构建性能优化","Kotlin Jetpack Compose","Locket Clone App","Android App开发","如何优化Gradle构建","Gradle构建性能优化工具","Kotlin开发","Jetpack Compose开发","Android开发最佳实践"],"ja":["Gradleビルドパフォーマンス","Kotlin Jetpack Compose","Locket Clone App","Androidアプリ開発","Gradleビルドを最適化する方法","Gradleビルドパフォーマンス最適化ツール","Kotlin開発","Jetpack Compose開発","Android開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Gradle 빌드 성능","Kotlin Jetpack Compose","Locket Clone App","Android 앱 개발","Gradle 빌드를 최적화하는 방법","Gradle 빌드 성능 최적화 도구","Kotlin 개발","Jetpack Compose 개발","Android 개발最佳实践"],"es":["cómo usar Gradle","qué es Kotlin","herramientas de AI para Android","alternativas a Gradle","Guía de instalación de Gradle","configuración de Jetpack Compose"],"fr":["comment utiliser Gradle","quoi est Kotlin","outils d''IA pour Android","alternatives à Gradle","Guide d''installation de Gradle","configuration de Jetpack Compose"],"de":["wie man Gradle verwendet","was ist Kotlin","KI-Tools für Android","Alternativen zu Gradle","Installationsanleitung für Gradle","Konfiguration von Jetpack Compose"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho de build gradle","ferramentas de ia para gradle","kotlin jetpack compose","locket clone app","como usar gradle","guia de configuração do gradle","alternativas ao gradle","gradle vs maven"],"ru":["ускорение сборки градла","ИИ Агенты для градла","kotlin jetpack compose","locket clone app","как использовать градл","руководство по настройке градла","альтернативы градлу","градл vs мавен"],"ar":["تحسين أداء بناء الجرادل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للجرادل","kotlin jetpack compose","تطبيق Locket Clone","كيفية استخدام الجرادل","دليل إعدادات الجرادل","بديلات الجرادل","الجرادل مقابل مافن"]}},"owner":"thinhtt264","repo":"SnapletApp","repoPath":"thinhtt264/SnapletApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.027Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gradle-build-performance","description":"Debug and optimize Android/Gradle build performance. Use when builds are slow, investigating CI/CD performance, analyzing build scans, or identifying compilation bottlenecks.","bodyPreview":"# Gradle Build Performance\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Build times are slow (clean or incremental)\n- Investigating build performance regressions\n- Analyzing Gradle Build Scans\n- Identifying configuration vs execution bottlenecks\n- Optimizing CI/CD build times\n- Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache\n- Reducing unnecessary recompilation\n- Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- \"My builds are slow, how can I speed them up?\"\n- \"How do I analyze a Gradle build scan?\"\n- \"Why is configura","body":"# Gradle Build Performance\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Build times are slow (clean or incremental)\n- Investigating build performance regressions\n- Analyzing Gradle Build Scans\n- Identifying configuration vs execution bottlenecks\n- Optimizing CI/CD build times\n- Enabling Gradle Configuration Cache\n- Reducing unnecessary recompilation\n- Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing\n\n## Example Prompts\n\n- \"My builds are slow, how can I speed them up?\"\n- \"How do I analyze a Gradle build scan?\"\n- \"Why is configuration taking so long?\"\n- \"Why does my project always recompile everything?\"\n- \"How do I enable configuration cache?\"\n- \"Why is kapt so slow?\"\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Measure Baseline** — Clean build + incremental build times\n2. **Generate Build Scan** — `./gradlew assembleDebug --scan`\n3. **Identify Phase** — Configuration? Execution? Dependency resolution?\n4. **Apply ONE optimization** — Don''t batch changes\n5. **Measure Improvement** — Compare against baseline\n6. **Verify in Build Scan** — Visual confirmation\n\n---\n\n## Quick Diagnostics\n\n### Generate Build Scan\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --scan\n```\n\n### Profile Build Locally\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --profile\n# Opens report in build/reports/profile/\n```\n\n### Build Timing Summary\n\n```bash\n./gradlew assembleDebug --info | grep -E \"^\\:.*\"\n# Or view in Android Studio: Build > Analyze APK Build\n```\n\n---\n\n## Build Phases\n\n| Phase | What Happens | Common Issues |\n|-------|--------------|---------------|\n| **Initialization** | `settings.gradle.kts` evaluated | Too many `include()` statements |\n| **Configuration** | All `build.gradle.kts` files evaluated | Expensive plugins, eager task creation |\n| **Execution** | Tasks run based on inputs/outputs | Cache misses, non-incremental tasks |\n\n### Identify the Bottleneck\n\n```\nBuild scan → Performance → Build timeline\n```\n\n- **Long configuration phase**: Focus on plugin and buildscript optimization\n- **Long execution phase**: Focus on task caching and parallelization\n- **Dependency resolution slow**: Focus on repository configuration\n\n---\n\n## 12 Optimization Patterns\n\n### 1. Enable Configuration Cache\n\nCaches configuration phase across builds (AGP 8.0+):\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.configuration-cache=true\norg.gradle.configuration-cache.problems=warn\n```\n\n### 2. Enable Build Cache\n\nReuses task outputs across builds and machines:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.caching=true\n```\n\n### 3. Enable Parallel Execution\n\nBuild independent modules simultaneously:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.parallel=true\n```\n\n### 4. Increase JVM Heap\n\nAllocate more memory for large projects:\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\norg.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx4g -XX:+UseParallelGC\n```\n\n### 5. Use Non-Transitive R Classes\n\nReduces R class size and compilation (AGP 8.0+ default):\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\nandroid.nonTransitiveRClass=true\n```\n\n### 6. Migrate kapt to KSP\n\nKSP is 2x faster than kapt for Kotlin:\n\n```kotlin\n// Before (slow)\nkapt(\"com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler:2.51.1\")\n\n// After (fast)\nksp(\"com.google.dagger:hilt-compiler:2.51.1\")\n```\n\n### 7. Avoid Dynamic Dependencies\n\nPin dependency versions:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Forces resolution every build\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:+\")\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:1.0.+\")\n\n// GOOD: Fixed version\nimplementation(\"com.example:lib:1.2.3\")\n```\n\n### 8. Optimize Repository Order\n\nPut most-used repositories first:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\ndependencyResolutionManagement {\n    repositories {\n        google()      // First: Android dependencies\n        mavenCentral() // Second: Most libraries\n        // Third-party repos last\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 9. Use includeBuild for Local Modules\n\nComposite builds are faster than `project()` for large monorepos:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nincludeBuild(\"shared-library\") {\n    dependencySubstitution {\n        substitute(module(\"com.example:shared\")).using(project(\":\"))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 10. Enable Incremental Annotation Processing\n\n```properties\n# gradle.properties\nkapt.incremental.apt=true\nkapt.use.worker.api=true\n```\n\n### 11. Avoid Configuration-Time I/O\n\nDon''t read files or make network calls during configuration:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Runs during configuration\nval version = file(\"version.txt\").readText()\n\n// GOOD: Defer to execution\nval version = providers.fileContents(file(\"version.txt\")).asText\n```\n\n### 12. Use Lazy Task Configuration\n\nAvoid `create()`, use `register()`:\n\n```kotlin\n// BAD: Eagerly configured\ntasks.create(\"myTask\") { ... }\n\n// GOOD: Lazily configured\ntasks.register(\"myTask\") { ... }\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Bottleneck Analysis\n\n### Slow Configuration Phase\n\n**Symptoms**: Build scan shows long \"Configuring build\" time\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Eager task creation | Use `tasks.register()` instead of `tasks.create()` |\n| buildSrc with many dependencies | Migrate to Convention Plugins with `includeBuild` |\n| File I/O in build scripts | Use `providers.fileContents()` |\n| Network calls in plugins | Cache results or use offline mode |\n\n### Slow Compilation\n\n**Symptoms**: `:app:compileDebugKotlin` takes too long\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Non-incremental changes | Avoid `build.gradle.kts` changes that invalidate cache |\n| Large modules | Break into smaller feature modules |\n| Excessive kapt usage | Migrate to KSP |\n| Kotlin compiler memory | Increase `kotlin.daemon.jvmargs` |\n\n### Cache Misses\n\n**Symptoms**: Tasks always rerun despite no changes\n\n**Causes & Fixes**:\n| Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Unstable task inputs | Use `@PathSensitive`, `@NormalizeLineEndings` |\n| Absolute paths in outputs | Use relative paths |\n| Missing `@CacheableTask` | Add annotation to custom tasks |\n| Different JDK versions | Standardize JDK across environments |\n\n---\n\n## CI/CD Optimizations\n\n### Remote Build Cache\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nbuildCache {\n    local { isEnabled = true }\n    remote<HttpBuildCache> {\n        url = uri(\"https://cache.example.com/\")\n        isPush = System.getenv(\"CI\") == \"true\"\n        credentials {\n            username = System.getenv(\"CACHE_USER\")\n            password = System.getenv(\"CACHE_PASS\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Gradle Enterprise / Develocity\n\nFor advanced build analytics:\n\n```kotlin\n// settings.gradle.kts\nplugins {\n    id(\"com.gradle.develocity\") version \"3.17\"\n}\n\ndevelocity {\n    buildScan {\n        termsOfUseUrl.set(\"https://gradle.com/help/legal-terms-of-use\")\n        termsOfUseAgree.set(\"yes\")\n        publishing.onlyIf { System.getenv(\"CI\") != null }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Skip Unnecessary Tasks in CI\n\n```bash\n# Skip tests for UI-only changes\n./gradlew assembleDebug -x test -x lint\n\n# Only run affected module tests\n./gradlew :feature:login:test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Android Studio Settings\n\n### File → Settings → Build → Gradle\n\n- **Gradle JDK**: Match your project''s JDK\n- **Build and run using**: Gradle (not IntelliJ)\n- **Run tests using**: Gradle\n\n### File → Settings → Build → Compiler\n\n- **Compile independent modules in parallel**: ✅ Enabled\n- **Configure on demand**: ❌ Disabled (deprecated)\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nAfter optimizations, verify:\n\n- [ ] Configuration cache enabled and working\n- [ ] Build cache hit rate > 80% (check build scan)\n- [ ] No dynamic dependency versions\n- [ ] KSP used instead of kapt where possible\n- [ ] Parallel execution enabled\n- [ ] JVM memory tuned appropriately\n- [ ] CI remote cache configured\n- [ ] No configuration-time I/O\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Optimize Build Speed](https://developer.android.com/build/optimize-your-build)\n- [Gradle Configuration Cache](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/configuration_cache.html)\n- [Gradle Build Cache](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/build_cache.html)\n- [Migrate from kapt to KSP](https://developer.android.com/build/migrate-to-ksp)\n- [Gradle Build Scans](https://scans.gradle.com/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:16:48.049Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Android Development Agents focused on optimizing Kotlin Jetpack Compose projects with enhanced Gradle build performance capabilities.","zh":"适合专注于优化Kotlin Jetpack Compose项目并具有增强的Gradle构建性能能力的Android开发代理。","ja":"Kotlin Jetpack Composeプロジェクトを最適化し、Gradleビルドのパフォーマンスを向上させるAndroid開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Kotlin Jetpack Compose 프로젝트를 최적화하고 Gradle 빌드 성능을 향상시키는 안드로이드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de Android centrados en optimizar proyectos de Kotlin Jetpack Compose con capacidades de rendimiento de compilación de Gradle mejoradas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Android axés sur l''optimisation des projets Kotlin Jetpack Compose avec des capacités de performances de construction Gradle améliorées.","de":"Ideal für Android-Entwicklungsagenten, die auf die Optimierung von Kotlin-Jetpack-Compose-Projekten mit verbesserten Gradle-Build-Leistungsmerkmalen ausgerichtet sind.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de desenvolvimento Android focados na otimização de projetos Kotlin Jetpack Compose com capacidades de desempenho de build do Gradle aprimoradas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Android, ориентированных на оптимизацию проектов Kotlin Jetpack Compose с улучшенными возможностями построения Gradle.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير Android الذين يركزون على تحسين مشاريع Kotlin Jetpack Compose بقدرات أداء بناء Gradle محسنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and optimize Gradle build scans, identify configuration versus execution bottlenecks, and enable Gradle Configuration Cache for reduced build times, leveraging Kotlin and Gradle-specific features like kapt/KSP annotation processing.","zh":"赋予代理分析和优化Gradle构建扫描、识别配置与执行瓶颈，并启用Gradle配置缓存以减少构建时间的能力，利用Kotlin和Gradle特有的功能，如kapt/KSP注解处理。","ja":"エージェントがGradleビルドのスキャンを分析して最適化し、構成と実行のボトルネックを特定し、Gradle設定キャッシュを有効にしてビルド時間を短縮することを可能にします。KotlinとGradle固有の機能、たとえばkapt/KSPの注釈処理を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Gradle 빌드 스캔을 분석 및 최적화하고, 구성 및 실행 병목 현상을 식별하며, Gradle 구성 캐시를 활성화하여 빌드 시간을 단축할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. Kotlin 및 Gradle 고유의 기능을 활용합니다. 예를 들어, kapt/KSP 주석 처리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar y optimizar los análisis de compilación de Gradle, identificar cuellos de botella de configuración versus ejecución y habilitar la caché de configuración de Gradle para tiempos de compilación reducidos, aprovechando características específicas de Kotlin y Gradle como el procesamiento de anotaciones kapt/KSP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et d''optimiser les analyses de construction Gradle, d''identifier les goulots d''étranglement de configuration par rapport à l''exécution et d''activer le cache de configuration Gradle pour des temps de construction réduits, en exploitant des fonctionnalités spécifiques à Kotlin et Gradle comme le traitement d''annotations kapt/KSP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Gradle-Build-Scans zu analysieren und zu optimieren, Konfigurations- versus Ausführungsengpässe zu identifizieren und den Gradle-Konfigurationscache für verkürzte Buildzeiten zu aktivieren, indem es Kotlin- und Gradle-spezifische Funktionen wie kapt/KSP-Annotationsverarbeitung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e otimizar análises de build do Gradle, identificar gargalos de configuração versus execução e habilitar o cache de configuração do Gradle para tempos de build reduzidos, aproveitando recursos específicos do Kotlin e do Gradle, como o processamento de anotações kapt/KSP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и оптимизировать сканирование сборок Gradle, выявлять конфигурационные против выполнения узких мест и включать кэш конфигурации Gradle для уменьшения времени сборки, используя особенности Kotlin и Gradle, такие как обработка аннотаций kapt/KSP.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل وضبط مسح بناء Gradle، وتحديد عُقبات التكوين مقابل عُقبات التنفيذ، وتمكين ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة لتكوين Gradle من أجل أوقات بناء مخفضة، مستفيدة من ميزات Kotlin وGradle المحددة مثل معالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Gradle build scans for performance regressions","Optimizing CI/CD build times through Gradle configuration adjustments","Debugging kapt/KSP annotation processing issues in Kotlin projects"],"zh":["分析Gradle构建扫描以查找性能回归","通过Gradle配置调整优化CI/CD构建时间","调试Kotlin项目中的kapt/KSP注解处理问题"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの後退を検出するためのGradleビルドのスキャン分析","Gradleの設定調整によるCI/CDビルド時間の最適化","Kotlinプロジェクトのkapt/KSP注釈処理の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["성능 회귀를 찾기 위한 Gradle 빌드 스캔 분석","Gradle 구성 조정을 통한 CI/CD 빌드 시간 최적화","Kotlin 프로젝트의 kapt/KSP 주석 처리 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Análisis de análisis de compilación de Gradle para regresiones de rendimiento","Optimización de los tiempos de compilación de CI/CD mediante ajustes de configuración de Gradle","Depuración de problemas de procesamiento de anotaciones kapt/KSP en proyectos Kotlin"],"fr":["Analyse des analyses de construction Gradle pour les régressions de performances","Optimisation des temps de construction CI/CD via des ajustements de configuration Gradle","Débogage des problèmes de traitement d''annotations kapt/KSP dans les projets Kotlin"],"de":["Analyse von Gradle-Build-Scans für Leistungsregressionen","Optimierung von CI/CD-Buildzeiten durch Anpassung der Gradle-Konfiguration","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen mit der kapt/KSP-Annotationsverarbeitung in Kotlin-Projekten"],"pt":["Analisar análises de build do Gradle para regressões de desempenho","Otimizar tempos de build de CI/CD por meio de ajustes de configuração do Gradle","Depurar problemas de processamento de anotações kapt/KSP em projetos Kotlin"],"ru":["Анализировать сканирование сборок Gradle для регрессий производительности","Оптимизировать время сборки CI/CD путем корректировки конфигурации Gradle","Отлаживать проблемы обработки аннотаций kapt/KSP в проектах Kotlin"],"ar":["تحليل مسح بناء Gradle لانحدارات الأداء","تحسين أوقات بناء CI/CD من خلال ضبط تكوين Gradle","تصحيح مشاكل معالجة التعليقات kapt/KSP في مشاريع Kotlin"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gradle build environment","Kotlin and Jetpack Compose project compatibility necessary","Gradle Configuration Cache support needed for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要Gradle构建环境","需要Kotlin和Jetpack Compose项目兼容性","需要Gradle配置缓存支持以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["Gradleビルド環境が必要","KotlinとJetpack Composeプロジェクトの互換性が必要","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するためにGradle設定キャッシュのサポートが必要"],"ko":["Gradle 빌드 환경이 필요합니다.","Kotlin 및 Jetpack Compose 프로젝트와의 호환성이 필요합니다.","최적의 성능을 달성하려면 Gradle 구성 캐시 지원이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de compilación de Gradle","Compatibilidad de proyectos Kotlin y Jetpack Compose necesaria","Se requiere soporte de caché de configuración de Gradle para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de construction Gradle","Compatibilité des projets Kotlin et Jetpack Compose nécessaire","Prise en charge du cache de configuration Gradle nécessaire pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Benötigt Gradle-Build-Umgebung","Kompatibilität von Kotlin- und Jetpack-Compose-Projekten erforderlich","Gradle-Konfigurationscache-Unterstützung erforderlich für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de build do Gradle","Compatibilidade de projeto Kotlin e Jetpack Compose necessária","Suporte ao cache de configuração do Gradle necessário para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует среды сборки Gradle","Необходима совместимость проектов Kotlin и Jetpack Compose","Необходима поддержка кэша конфигурации Gradle для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بناء Gradle","التوافق مع مشاريع Kotlin وJetpack Compose ضروري","دعم ذاكرة التخزين المؤقتة لتكوين Gradle ضروري لأداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5927653840ff397c0c87f85a0382759b4e35d2bb5d681a3c06a774eb3af70f3f","qualityScore":49}');
