Node.js","Desarrollo de interfaces de usuario para Agentes de IA","Implementación de la lógica de negocio para Agentes de IA"],"fr":["Développement d''AtlasMemory avec des compétences Cursor","Mise en œuvre de sous-agents pour outils d''IA","Planification de l''architecture d''outils d''IA","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Node.js","Développement d''interfaces utilisateur pour outils d''IA","Mise en œuvre de la logique métier pour outils d''IA"],"de":["Entwicklung von AtlasMemory mit Cursor-Fähigkeiten","Implementierung von Subagents für KI-Agents","Planung der Architektur von KI-Agents","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen für KI-Agents","Implementierung der Geschäftslogik für KI-Agents"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de AtlasMemory com habilidades de cursor e subagentes","Integração de Ferramentas de IA para melhorar a eficiência do desenvolvimento","Planejamento de implementação personalizado para soluções específicas","Suporte a React, Python, Node.js e CLI","Integração com Agent para automação de tarefas"],"ru":["Разработка AtlasMemory с навыками курсора и субагентов","Интеграция ИИ Агентов для повышения эффективности разработки","Планирование реализации под индивидуальные решения","Поддержка React, Python, Node.js и CLI","Интеграция с Agent для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["إنشاء AtlasMemory باستخدام مهارات Cursor و SubAgents","دمج أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين كفاءة التطوير","تخطيط التنفيذ المخصص لحلول محددة","دعم React و Python و Node.js و CLI","دمج مع Agent لأتمتة المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","实施规划","AtlasMemory","Cursor Skills & SubAgents","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理的优势","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","実装計画","AtlasMemory","Cursor Skills & SubAgents","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの利点","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","구현 계획","AtlasMemory","Cursor Skills & SubAgents","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트의 장점","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es la planificación de implementación de Agentes de IA","Agentes de IA alternativos","Agentes de IA vs herramientas de automatización","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA","desarrollo de Agentes de IA con Python","integración de Agentes de IA con CLI"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","quoi est la planification de la mise en œuvre d''outils d''IA","outils d''IA alternatifs","outils d''IA vs outils d''automatisation","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration d''outils d''IA","développement d''outils d''IA avec Python","intégration d''outils d''IA avec CLI"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist die Implementierungsplanung für KI-Agents","KI-Agents-Alternativen","KI-Agents vs Automatisierungstools","Installation von KI-Agents","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Agents","Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit Python","Integration von KI-Agents mit CLI"],"pt":["como usar Ferramentas de IA","o que é planejamento de implementação","Ferramentas de IA alternative","Ferramentas de IA vs outros","instalar Ferramentas de IA","guia de configuração de Ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de AtlasMemory","habilidades de cursor e subagentes"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое планирование реализации","ИИ Агенты alternative","ИИ Агенты vs другие","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","разработка AtlasMemory","навыки курсора и субагентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تخطيط التنفيذ","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي بديلة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء AtlasMemory","مهارات Cursor و SubAgents"]}},"owner":"Atlas-Memory-Framework","repo":"AtlasMemory-Cursor-Tools","repoPath":"Atlas-Memory-Framework/AtlasMemory-Cursor-Tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.039Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implementation-planning","description":"Produce the execution plan in the current plan artifact including file deltas, workstreams, phases, and gates. Use during /plan Implementation stage.","bodyPreview":"# /implementation-planning\n\n## Purpose\nCreate the Implementation Plan section for build execution. Run as a sub-agent and return a draft section to the orchestrator; do not write the plan artifact directly.\n\n## Required outputs\n- Exhaustive file deltas with change type, explicit owner (existing agent/WS), and rationale.\n- Workstreams with dependencies, merge points, and explicitly owned files.\n- An integration / merge points checklist (what gets integrated, how, and what gates run).\n- Enforce th","body":"# /implementation-planning\n\n## Purpose\nCreate the Implementation Plan section for build execution. Run as a sub-agent and return a draft section to the orchestrator; do not write the plan artifact directly.\n\n## Required outputs\n- Exhaustive file deltas with change type, explicit owner (existing agent/WS), and rationale.\n- Workstreams with dependencies, merge points, and explicitly owned files.\n- An integration / merge points checklist (what gets integrated, how, and what gates run).\n- Enforce the workstream file-ownership rule: each file delta is owned by exactly one workstream until an explicit merge point.\n- Phases and tasks mapped to workstreams/owners.\n- Evidence-based exit criteria per phase.\n- Build-time gates for each phase.\n- Test Plan including at least a minimal test matrix (risk -> test type -> where it runs).\n- Rollout/Deployment steps (even minimal) and an explicit rollback trigger + rollback steps.\n - Draft section content for `## Implementation Plan`\n\n## Anti-placeholder rule (hard rule)\n- Do not use placeholder language like “run smoke tests” or “add gates” without naming:\n  - the gate name(s),\n  - where they run (CI vs local vs deployed), and\n  - the entrypoint/command (or test runner/target) and what “green” means.\n- If specifics are truly unknown, convert them into either:\n  - an explicit Decision boundary (A/B/C) with a recommended default, OR\n  - a DR-backed Defer with an explicit trigger.\n\n## Q/A wrapper\n- The orchestrator must run the inline Q/A loop to confirm user understanding and agreement on scope, ownership, and gates.\n\n## Ownership policy\n- Prefer existing agents from the plan''s `## Context Snapshot` or the user-provided roster.\n- If no roster is available, return `Questions` asking for the available agents/owners before assigning work.\n- Do not default all ownership to the user unless the user explicitly requests it.\n\n## Parallel workstreams / multi-agent contract (hard rule)\n- If the user requests multiple agents or parallel workstreams:\n  - Ensure the draft includes an explicit **agent roster** (names/handles) and assigns ownership for each workstream and file-delta cluster.\n  - If the roster is missing, ask a single focused question to obtain it (do not guess).\n  - The orchestrator should mirror this roster into `## Context Snapshot` (call this out explicitly in `Notes` if needed).\n\n## Sub-agent output contract\nReturn a single block in this shape:\n\n```md\nDraftSection:\n<exact section content for ## Implementation Plan (must include the section header)>\n\nChecklist:\n- <criterion>: Pass | Fail\n\nQuestions:\n- <if blocked>\n\nNotes:\n- <optional risks/assumptions/tests updates>\n```\n\n## Malformed output handling\n- If you cannot produce the exact section header or required fields, return `Questions` explaining what is missing and leave `DraftSection` as `N/A`.\n\n## User experience rule (no \"go read the plan\")\n- When asking the user to confirm plan readiness, paste the key parts directly in the chat response:\n  - File deltas (owned)\n  - Workstreams + owned files + merge points\n  - Phase list with exit criteria\n  - Test matrix + rollback\n\n## Output template (required for PlanTier: Full)\nUse this exact structure so the `/plan` validator can deterministically check executability:\n\n```md\n## Implementation Plan\n### Agent roster (required for PlanTier: Full)\n- <agent/owner>: <responsibilities>\n\n### File Deltas (exhaustive) + rationale\n- path/to/file.ext - change type (create/modify/delete) - owner (WSx / agent) - rationale\n\n### Workstreams + merge points\n- WS1: <name>\n  - Owner:\n  - Depends on:\n  - Review gates (named):\n    - G-...\n  - Owns files:\n    - path/to/file.ext\n  - Merge point / integration step:\n\n### Phases + tasks + exit criteria\n#### Phase 1: <name>\n- Owner(s):\n- Depends on:\n- Tasks (by owner):\n  - Owner: <agent>\n    - [ ] Task\n- Exit criteria (evidence):\n- Gates (named):\n  - G-...\n\n### Review gates (named + definitions)\n- G-...:\n  - Where it runs: CI | Local | Deployed\n  - Entry point / command:\n  - Green means:\n\n### Merge points -> required gates\n- MP1: <merge point>\n  - Blocks on:\n    - G-...\n\n### Test Matrix\n- Area/component - risk - test type - where it runs\n\n### Test plan (CI vs deployed)\n- CI:\n  - ...\n- Deployed environment:\n  - ...\n\n### Rollout / Rollback\n- Rollout:\n- Rollback trigger:\n- Rollback steps:\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:22:02.149Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents requiring detailed implementation planning and execution capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要详细实施计划和执行能力的项目管理代理。","ja":"詳細な実装計画と実行機能を必要とするプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"詳細한 구현 계획 및 실행 기능이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que requieren una planificación y ejecución de implementación detalladas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une planification et une exécution de mise en œuvre détaillées.","de":"Ideal für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine detaillierte Implementierungsplanung und -ausführung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que requerem planejamento de implementação detalhado e capacidades de execução.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, требующих детального планирования реализации и возможностей выполнения.","ar":"مثالي لعميلة إدارة المشاريع التي تتطلب تخطيط تنفيذ مفصل وقدرات تنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate exhaustive file deltas with change type and rationale, create workstreams with dependencies, and enforce integration checkpoints using explicit owner assignments and merge points.","zh":"使代理能够生成详细的文件差异、创建带有依赖关系的工作流，并使用明确的所有者分配和合并点强制执行集成检查点。","ja":"エージェントが詳細なファイルの差分を作成し、依存関係を持つワークフローを作成し、明確な所有者割り当てとマージポイントを使用して統合チェックポイントを適用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 자세한 파일 차이점을 생성하고 의존성을 갖는 워크플ローを作成하며, 명확한 소유자 할당 및 병합 점을 사용하여 통합 검사점을 적용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar deltas de archivos exhaustivos con tipo de cambio y justificación, crear flujos de trabajo con dependencias y hacer cumplir puntos de integración utilizando asignaciones de propietarios explícitos y puntos de fusión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des deltas de fichiers exhaustifs avec type de modification et justification, de créer des flux de travail avec des dépendances et de faire respecter les points d''intégration en utilisant des affectations de propriétaires explicites et des points de fusion.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Dateideltas mit Änderungsart und Begründung zu generieren, Arbeitsabläufe mit Abhängigkeiten zu erstellen und Integrationsprüfpunkte unter Verwendung expliziter Besitzerzuweisungen und Merge-Punkte durchzusetzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar deltas de arquivos exaustivos com tipo de alteração e justificativa, criar fluxos de trabalho com dependências e aplicar pontos de verificação de integração usando atribuições de proprietário explícitas e pontos de mesclagem.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать исчерпывающие изменения файлов с типом изменения и обоснованием, создавать рабочие потоки с зависимостями и обеспечивать контрольные точки интеграции с помощью явного назначения владельца и точек слияния.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توليد فروق ملفات شاملة مع نوع التغيير والأساس المنطقي، وإنشاء تيارات عمل بالاعتماد على بعضها البعض وتطبيق نقاط فحص للتكامل باستخدام تعيينات ملكية صريحة ونقاط دمج."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating implementation plan generation for complex projects","Generating workstream dependencies and merge points for large-scale development","Creating integration checklists with gates and explicit ownership"],"zh":["复杂项目的实施计划生成自动化","大规模开发的工作流依存关系和合并点生成","创建带有关卡和明确所有权的集成清单"],"ja":["複雑なプロジェクトの実装計画生成の自動化","大規模開発のワークフロー依存関係とマージポイントの生成","ゲートと明確な所有権を持つ統合チェックリストの作成"],"ko":["복잡한 프로젝트의 구현 계획 생성 자동화","대규모 개발의 워크플ロー 의존성 및 병합점 생성","게이트 및 명확한 소유권을 갖는 통합 체크리스트 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de planes de implementación para proyectos complejos","Generación de dependencias de flujos de trabajo y puntos de fusión para desarrollo a gran escala","Creación de listas de verificación de integración con puertas y propiedad explícita"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de plans de mise en œuvre pour les projets complexes","Génération de dépendances de flux de travail et de points de fusion pour le développement à grande échelle","Création de listes de vérification d''intégration avec des portes et une propriété explicite"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Implementierungsplänen für komplexe Projekte","Generierung von Arbeitsablauf-Abhängigkeiten und Merge-Punkten für groß angelegte Entwicklung","Erstellung von Integrations-Checklisten mit Toren und explizitem Eigentum"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de planos de implementação para projetos complexos","Gerar dependências de fluxos de trabalho e pontos de mesclagem para desenvolvimento em larga escala","Criar listas de verificação de integração com portões e propriedade explícita"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию планов реализации для сложных проектов","Генерировать зависимости рабочих потоков и точки слияния для крупномасштабного развития","Создавать контрольные списки интеграции с воротами и явной собственностью"],"ar":["توفير تخطيط تنفيذ آلي للمشاريع المعقدة","توليد التبعيات لتدفقات العمل ونقاط الدمج لتطوير واسع النطاق","إنشاء قوائم مراجعة للتكامل مع بوابات وملكية صريحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires sub-agent orchestration capabilities","Needs explicit owner assignment for files and workstreams","Limited to build execution and implementation planning scope"],"zh":["需要子代理编排功能","需要文件和工作流的明确所有者分配","仅限构建执行和实施计划范围"],"ja":["サブエージェントのオーケストレーション機能が必要","ファイルとワークフローに明確な所有者割り当てが必要","ビルド実行と実装計画の範囲のみ"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 오케스트레이션 기능이 필요합니다","파일 및 워크플로우에 대한 명확한 소유자 할당 필요","빌드 실행 및 구현 계획 범위에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de orquestación de subagentes","Necesita asignación de propietario explícito para archivos y flujos de trabajo","Limitado al ámbito de ejecución de compilación y planificación de implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''orchestration de sous-agents","Nécessite une affectation de propriétaire explicite pour les fichiers et les flux de travail","Limité à la portée de l''exécution de build et de la planification de mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Subagenten-Orchestrierungsfähigkeiten","Benötigt explizite Besitzerzuweisung für Dateien und Arbeitsabläufe","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Build-Ausführung und der Implementierungsplanung"],"pt":["Requer capacidades de orquestração de sub-agentes","Necessita de atribuição de proprietário explícita para arquivos e fluxos de trabalho","Limitado ao escopo de execução de compilação e planejamento de implementação"],"ru":["Требует возможностей оркестровки субагентов","Требует явного назначения владельца для файлов и рабочих потоков","Ограничен объемом выполнения сборки и планирования реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب إمكانيات إدارة الوكيل الفرعي","يحتاج إلى تعيين ملكية صريحة للملفات وتيارات العمل","محدود بنطاق تنفيذ البناء وتخطيط التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"33236a776b0e2e1ef7cb0b72103a154eb1d25caf90a0348ab813126e684559f6","qualityScore":49}');
