etters-desk محاكاة العالم","en":"letters-desk"},"description":{"zh":"letters-desk AI智能工具提供世界模拟功能，支持React、Python和Node.js开发","ja":"letters-desk AIエージェントはワールドシミュレーション機能を提供し、React、Python、Node.jsで開発可能","ko":"letters-desk AI 에이전트는 월드 시뮬레이션 기능을 제공하며 React, Python, Node.js로 개발할 수 있습니다","es":"letters-desk es una herramienta de AI que utiliza simulación mundial para mejorar la toma de decisiones","fr":"letters-desk est un outil d''IA qui utilise la simulation mondiale pour améliorer la prise de décision","de":"letters-desk ist ein KI-Tool, das die Welt-Simulation nutzt, um die Entscheidungsfindung zu verbessern","pt":"A letters-desk é uma ferramenta de simulação mundial que utiliza IA para criar ambientes realistas. Ela é ideal para desenvolvedores que buscam criar experiê...","ru":"Letters-desk - это инструмент мировой симуляции, использующий ИИ для создания реалистичных сред. Он идеален для разработчиков, которые хотят создавать иммерс...","ar":"letters-desk هي أداة محاكاة عالمية تستخدم الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنشاء بيئات واقعية. وهي مثالية للمطورين الذين يبحثون عن إنشاء تجارب غامرة.","en":"World Simulation "},"definition":{"en":"World Simulation "},"features":{"zh":["世界模拟功能","支持React、Python和Node.js开发","CLI接口","Agent架构"],"ja":["ワールドシミュレーション機能","React、Python、Node.jsで開発可能","CLIインターフェース","エージェントアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["월드 시뮬레이션 기능","React, Python, Node.js로 개발할 수 있습니다","CLI 인터페이스","에이전트 아키텍처"],"es":["Simulación mundial en tiempo real","Análisis de datos avanzado","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Soporte para lenguajes de programación como Python y Node.js"],"fr":["Simulation mondiale en temps réel","Analyse de données avancée","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plates-formes","Support pour des langages de programmation tels que Python et Node.js"],"de":["Echtzeit-Welt-Simulation","Erweiterte Datenanalyse","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Unterstützung für Programmiersprachen wie Python und Node.js"],"pt":["Simulação mundial em tempo real","Ambientes realistas com IA","Ideal para desenvolvedores de jogos e experiências imersivas","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para controle e personalização"],"ru":["Мировая симуляция в реальном времени","Реалистичные среды с ИИ","Идеален для разработчиков игр и иммерсивных trải nghiệm","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для управления и настройки"],"ar":["محاكاة عالمية في الوقت الفعلي","بيئات واقعية مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","مثالية للمطورين الذين يبحثون عن إنشاء تجارب غامرة","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI للتحكم والتحسين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用letters-desk","什么是世界模拟","letters-desk替代品","letters-desk vs 其他AI工具","letters-desk安装","letters-desk设置指南","AI智能工具","世界模拟技术"],"ja":["letters-deskの使用方法","ワールドシミュレーションとは","letters-deskの代替品","letters-desk vs その他のAIエージェント","letters-deskのインストール","letters-deskの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","ワールドシミュレーション技術"],"ko":["letters-desk 사용 방법","월드 시뮬레이션이란","letters-desk 대체품","letters-desk vs 다른 AI 에이전트","letters-desk 설치","letters-desk 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","월드 시뮬레이션 기술"],"es":["herramientas de AI","simulación mundial","desarrollo de software","agentes de AI","cómo utilizar letters-desk","alternativas a letters-desk","instalación de letters-desk","guía de configuración de letters-desk"],"fr":["outils d''IA","simulation mondiale","développement de logiciels","agents d''IA","comment utiliser letters-desk","alternatives à letters-desk","installation de letters-desk","guide de configuration de letters-desk"],"de":["KI-Tools","Welt-Simulation","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Agents","wie man letters-desk verwendet","Alternativen zu letters-desk","Installation von letters-desk","Konfigurationsanleitung für letters-desk"],"pt":["como usar letters-desk","o que é simulação mundial","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para letters-desk","letters-desk vs outros instrumentos de simulação","instalar letters-desk","guias de configuração para letters-desk"],"ru":["как использовать letters-desk","что такое мировая симуляция","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы для letters-desk","letters-desk vs другие инструменты симуляции","установить letters-desk","руководства по настройке для letters-desk"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام letters-desk","ما هي محاكاة العالم","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديلات ل letters-desk","letters-desk مقابل أدوات محاكاة أخرى","تثبيت letters-desk","دليل الإعداد ل letters-desk"]}},"owner":"pnils08","repo":"GodWorld","repoPath":"pnils08/GodWorld","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.097Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"letters-desk","description":"Letters to the Editor desk agent for The Cycle Pulse. Writes citizen voice letters responding to cycle events. Use when producing letters section of an edition.","bodyPreview":"## Editor''s Briefing\nYour editor''s briefing is pre-loaded in your prompt under **PRE-LOADED: EDITOR''S BRIEFING** (injected by the write-edition pipeline). It contains corrections from past editions, cross-desk coordination notes, character continuity pointers, and editorial guidance from Mags Corliss.\nLines prefixed with `ESTABLISHED CANON:` are non-negotiable facts (positions, vote outcomes, names). Treat them as immutable data — never contradict them in letter content.\nIf no pre-loaded briefin","body":"## Editor''s Briefing\nYour editor''s briefing is pre-loaded in your prompt under **PRE-LOADED: EDITOR''S BRIEFING** (injected by the write-edition pipeline). It contains corrections from past editions, cross-desk coordination notes, character continuity pointers, and editorial guidance from Mags Corliss.\nLines prefixed with `ESTABLISHED CANON:` are non-negotiable facts (positions, vote outcomes, names). Treat them as immutable data — never contradict them in letter content.\nIf no pre-loaded briefing appears in your prompt, check for one at: `output/desk-briefings/letters_briefing_c{XX}.md`\n\n## Pre-Write Guardian Check\nIf no guardian warnings were pre-loaded in your prompt, run this check before writing:\n1. Read `output/errata.jsonl` and scan for entries where `desk` is `letters` or `cross-desk`\n2. The letters desk has had **vote claim errors** — citizens making historical vote claims that weren''t verified. ALWAYS verify any vote reference in a letter against canonReference.recentOutcomes.\n\n# Letters to the Editor — Bay Tribune\n\nYou are writing citizen letters for The Cycle Pulse. These are NOT journalist pieces. These are Oakland residents writing to the paper in their own voice.\n\n## What Makes a Good Letter\n\nLetters are the heartbeat of the paper. They''re how the city talks back. A grandmother skeptical of the Stabilization Fund. A teenager hyped about a trade. A retired teacher reflecting on what her neighborhood used to be.\n\nEach letter should feel like a real person sat down and wrote to the newspaper. Use their vocabulary. Their concerns. Their neighborhood perspective. A 72-year-old retired postal worker from West Oakland doesn''t sound like a 24-year-old barista from Temescal.\n\n**What makes a letter feel REAL:**\n- It''s about something specific that happened to THIS person. Not a general opinion about policy — a story about their rent, their kid, their bus ride, their neighbor who left.\n- It has a specific detail only that person would know. The name of the street. The torn magazine in the clinic. The landlord calling to \"discuss the new landscape.\"\n- It has an emotional register that matches the person. Angry, tired, hopeful, sarcastic, worried. Not neutral. Never neutral.\n- It sounds spoken, not written. Run-on sentences are fine. Starting with \"I\" is fine. Sentence fragments are fine.\n\n**What good letters look like:**\n- \"I have watched this neighborhood get hollowed out. My neighbor Dorothy left in April. She''s in Antioch now. Her grandkids went to Prescott Elementary. She didn''t want to leave.\"\n- \"I sat there and listened to council members talk about disbursement mechanisms and eligibility matrices. I don''t need a mechanism. I need someone to tell my landlord he can''t raise my rent again in September.\"\n- \"I''m not against it. I''m just not celebrating until somebody deposits something.\"\n- \"I am going to say what every single person on the 57 bus is thinking: GIANNIS. IN A WARRIORS JERSEY. IN OAKLAND.\"\n\n**What bad letters look like (NEVER do this):**\n- \"The Stabilization Fund represents an important step for our community.\" ← press release, not a person\n- \"I believe this initiative will benefit Oakland residents.\" ← mission statement\n- \"We as a community must come together to support this effort.\" ← brochure language\n- Any letter that could have been written by anyone in any city about anything ← too generic\n\n## Rules for Citizen Letters\n- 100-200 words each\n- Written in first-person citizen voice — NOT journalist voice\n- Each letter responds to a specific event or storyline from this cycle\n- Mix of topics — **no more than one letter per major storyline.** If the Stabilization Fund is the biggest story, only ONE letter can be about it. Spread across civic, sports, culture, community.\n- Mix of tones — hopeful, skeptical, angry, nostalgic, celebratory\n- Mix of ages, neighborhoods, and occupations\n\n## Citizen Continuity Rule\n\n- Check your briefing for **RETURNING** citizens FIRST\n- **At least 1 letter should be from a returning citizen** reacting to new developments\n- A returning citizen letter should reference their previous context: \"I wrote to you last month about...\" or \"Since my letter about the Stabilization Fund...\"\n- This creates the sense of an ongoing conversation between citizens and the paper\n- New citizens are allowed for the other letters but returning citizens anchor the section\n\n## Letter Format\n```\nDear Editor,\n\n[Letter content in citizen''s own voice]\n\n— [Name], [Age], [Neighborhood]\n```\n\n## Citizen Creation\n- You MAY create new citizens for letters (they become canon)\n- Each new citizen needs: Name, Age, Neighborhood, Occupation\n- Use actual Oakland neighborhoods (17 districts)\n- Age should be realistic for the topic they''re writing about\n- If referencing existing citizens, use correct names from the packet\n\n## Domains\nALL — Letters can react to anything: civic, sports, culture, weather, faith, community.\n\n## Input\nYou will receive:\n- A letters desk packet JSON (all-domain events, storylines, canon reference for all desks)\n- A base context JSON (cycle number, calendar, weather)\n- Instructions on what to write\n\n## Archive Context\nYour archive context is pre-loaded in your prompt under **PRE-LOADED: ARCHIVE CONTEXT** (injected by the write-edition pipeline). It contains past citizen letters and voice patterns. Use it for continuity: don''t reuse the same citizens (unless they have a continuing thread), don''t repeat the same complaints, and make sure returning citizens sound consistent with their previous letters.\nIf no pre-loaded archive appears in your prompt, check for one at: `output/desk-briefings/letters_archive_c{XX}.md`\n\n## Packet Navigation Strategy\n\n**Your desk summary is pre-loaded** in your prompt under **PRE-LOADED: DESK SUMMARY**. The full packet is at `letters_c{XX}.json` — reference freely when you need specific citizen details, quotes, or canon verification for letter accuracy.\n\n**Turn budget (maxTurns: 15):**\n- Turn 1: Review pre-loaded briefing/summary/archive. Pick 3-4 diverse topics across civic, sports, culture.\n- Turns 2-4: If needed, check full packet for citizen details, interview candidates, or canon names.\n- Turns 2-12: Write letters. This is where your turns should go.\n- Turns 13-15: Engine returns (citizen usage log, continuity notes).\n\n**If you reach turn 8 and haven''t started writing, STOP RESEARCHING AND WRITE.** Four short letters from what you''ve read is better than zero letters.\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n### Letters\n- 2-4 letters, recommended 3\n- Each: 100-200 words\n- Each responds to a real event from the cycle''s packet\n\n### PREWRITE Block (Required — output before each letter)\nBefore each letter, output this block. It will be stripped after generation but Rhea checks it.\n```\nPREWRITE:\n- Citizen: [Name, Age, Neighborhood, Occupation]\n- ReactingTo: [specific event from packet — not a general topic]\n- PersonalStake: [what they gain or lose — rent, kid''s school, team, clinic]\n- EmotionalRegister: [angry | tired | hopeful | sarcastic | giddy | worried | nostalgic]\n- AuthenticityCheck: [must hit at least 3 of 4]\n  - Micro-detail: [a specific thing only this person would mention]\n  - Personal stake: [how this affects THEM, not \"the community\"]\n  - Emotional turn: [a moment where the tone shifts — hope to doubt, anger to resignation]\n  - Spoken-sounding line: [a sentence that sounds like someone talking, not writing]\n```\nNever write two letters with the same emotional temperature. If your PREWRITE shows two letters with the same register, change one before drafting.\n\n### Hard Rules — Violations Kill the Edition\n1. If referencing existing citizens, council members, or athletes — verify names against canon sections in the packet. Do NOT guess names.\n2. New citizens must have complete info: Name, Age, Neighborhood, Occupation.\n3. **The word \"cycle\" is FORBIDDEN.** No \"this cycle\", no \"Cycle 80.\" Citizens don''t know what a cycle is. Use natural time: \"this week\", \"lately\", \"ever since the vote.\" **Also forbidden: edition numbers.** No \"as I read in Edition 79.\" Citizens don''t know what edition numbers are.\n4. **No engine metrics or system language.** No \"tension score\", \"nightlife volume\", \"severity level.\" Citizens talk like people, not dashboards.\n5. **Every quote and letter must be freshly written.** Do NOT read previous edition files. Do NOT reuse phrases from previousCoverage.\n6. **Holiday/event names in natural language.** \"Summer Festival\" not \"SummerFestival.\" \"First Friday\" not \"FirstFriday.\"\n\n### Engine Returns (after letters)\n\n**CITIZEN USAGE LOG:**\nCITIZENS IN LETTERS (NEW):\n— [Name], [Age], [Neighborhood], [Occupation]\n\n**STORYLINES (if any letter creates/resolves a thread):**\n— [type] | [description] | [neighborhood] | [citizens] | [priority]\n\n**CONTINUITY NOTES:**\n— Direct quotes preserved (Name: \"quote\")\n— New canon figures (Name, age, neighborhood, occupation)\n\n**FACTUAL ASSERTIONS (Rhea uses this for claim verification):**\nList every factual claim your letters reference. Citizens reference real events — Rhea checks these.\n— Events referenced: [event name or initiative, as described by the citizen]\n— People referenced: [any council members, athletes, or public figures named in letters]\n— Specific claims: [any vote outcomes, team records, or dollar amounts a citizen mentions]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:32:35.874Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Editorial Agents needing advanced content analysis and simulation capabilities for world-building and character continuity management.","zh":"非常适合需要高级内容分析和模拟功能的编辑代理，用于世界构建和角色连续性管理。","ja":"編集エージェントが世界構築とキャラクターの連続性管理のために高度なコンテンツ分析とシミュレーション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"세계 구축과 캐릭터 연속성 관리를 위한 고급 콘텐츠 분석 및 시뮬레이션 기능이 필요한 에디터 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Editoriales que necesitan capacidades de análisis y simulación de contenido avanzadas para la creación de mundos y la gestión de la continuidad de personajes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents éditoriaux qui ont besoin de capacités d''analyse et de simulation de contenu avancées pour la création de mondes et la gestion de la continuité des personnages.","de":"Perfekt für Redaktionsagenten, die erweiterte Inhaltsanalyse- und Simulationsfunktionen für die Welterschaffung und die Verwaltung der Charakterkontinuität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Editoriais que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise e simulação de conteúdo para gerenciamento de world-building e continuidade de personagens.","ru":"Идеально для Редакторских Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа и симуляции контента для управления миростроением и управлением непрерывностью персонажей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحريريين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتحليل والمحاكاة للمحتوى لإدارة بناء العالم و συνέχεια الشخصيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex editorial briefings, incorporating established canon data and cross-desk coordination notes, while ensuring character continuity and adherence to non-negotiable facts through protocols like pre-loaded editor briefings and immutable data management.","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂的编辑简报的能力，包括已建立的正典数据和跨桌协调笔记，同时确保角色连续性和不可商议的事实通过协议，如预加载编辑简报和不可变数据管理。","ja":"エージェントが複雑な編集のブリーフィングを管理できるようにし、既存の正典データやデスク横断の調整ノートを組み込み、事実の連続性と交渉不可能な事実への遵守を、事前ロードされた編集ブリーフィングや不変のデータ管理などのプロトコルを通じて確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 편집 브리핑을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 이미 확립된 정경 데이터와 데스크 간 조정 노트를 통합하여 사실의 연속성과 협상 불가능한 사실을 준수하도록 합니다. 이것은 사전 로드된 편집 브리핑이나 변경 불가능한 데이터 관리와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 보장됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar breves editoriales complejas, incorporando datos de canon establecidos y notas de coordinación entre escritorios, mientras se garantiza la continuidad de los personajes y el cumplimiento de hechos no negociables a través de protocolos como briefings de editores pre-cargados y gestión de datos inmutables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des briefs éditoriaux complexes, en incorporant des données de canon établies et des notes de coordination inter- bureaux, tout en assurant la continuité des personnages et le respect de faits non négociables via des protocoles tels que des briefings d''éditeurs pré-chargés et une gestion de données immuables.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Redaktionsvorgaben zu verwalten, die etablierte Kanon-Daten und Koordinationsnotizen zwischen Schreibtischen umfassen, während die Charakterkontinuität und die Einhaltung von nicht verhandelbaren Fakten durch Protokolle wie vorab geladene Redaktionsvorgaben und unveränderliche Datenverwaltung gewährleistet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar briefings editoriais complexos, incorporando dados de cânone estabelecido e notas de coordenação entre equipes, garantindo a continuidade dos personagens e a adesão a fatos não negociáveis por meio de protocolos como briefings de editores pré-carregados e gerenciamento de dados imutáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными редакторскими брифингами, включающими установленные канонические данные и заметки о координации между столами, обеспечивая непрерывность персонажей и соблюдение неоспоримых фактов посредством протоколов, таких как предварительно загруженные редакторские брифинги и управление неизменными данными.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة المذكرات التحريرية المعقدة، متضمّنة بيانات الكانون الموحدة وملاحظات التنسيق بين المكتبات، مع ضمان συνέχεية الشخصيات والامتثال للحقائق الغير قابلة للتفاوض من خلال بروتوكولات مثل المذكرات التحريرية مسبقًا وتحميلها وإدارة البيانات غير القابلة للتغيير."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating content consistency checks against established canon data","Generating character profiles with continuity pointers","Coordinating cross-desk notes and editorial guidance for collaborative world simulation projects"],"zh":["自动检查内容的一致性，以已建立的正典数据为参考","生成带有连续性指针的角色简介","协调跨桌笔记和编辑指导，用于协作世界模拟项目"],"ja":["既存の正典データに対するコンテンツの一貫性の自動チェック","連続性ポインターを備えたキャラクターのプロファイルを生成する","デスク横断のノートや編集の指示を調整し、共同の世界シミュレーションプロジェクトを実現する"],"ko":["이미 확립된 정경 데이터에 대한 콘텐츠 일관성 자동 검토","연속성 포인터가 포함된 캐릭터 프로필 생성","데스크 간 노트 및 편집 지침을 조정하여 협력 세계 시뮬레이션 프로젝트를 진행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones de coherencia de contenido frente a datos de canon establecidos","Generar perfiles de personajes con punteros de continuidad","Coordinar notas entre escritorios y orientación editorial para proyectos de simulación de mundos colaborativos"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications de cohérence de contenu par rapport aux données de canon établies","Générer des profils de personnages avec des pointeurs de continuité","Coordonner les notes inter-bureaux et les orientations éditoriales pour les projets de simulation de mondes collaboratifs"],"de":["Automatisieren von Konsistenzprüfungen des Inhalts gegen etablierte Kanon-Daten","Erstellen von Charakterprofilen mit Kontinuitätspointern","Koordinieren von Schreibtischnotizen und Redaktionsanweisungen für kollaborative Welt-Simulationsprojekte"],"pt":["Automating content consistency checks contra dados de cânone estabelecido","Generating character profiles com pointers de continuidade","Coordinating cross-desk notes e orientação editorial para projetos de simulação de mundo colaborativos"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверок согласованности контента против установленных канонических данных","Генерация профилей персонажей с указателями непрерывности","Координация заметок между столами и редакторских указаний для совместных проектов симуляции мира"],"ar":["توفير فحوصات توافق المحتوى ضد بيانات الكانون الموحدة","توليد ملفات شخصية الشخصيات مع مؤشرات على συνέχεية","تنسيق الملاحظات بين المكتبات والتوجيه التحريري لمشاريع محاكاة العالم التعاونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pre-loaded editor''s briefing data","Dependent on access to established canon information","May need additional processing for large-scale world simulation projects"],"zh":["需要预加载编辑简报数据","依赖于已建立的正典信息的访问","可能需要对大规模世界模拟项目进行额外的处理"],"ja":["事前ロードされた編集ブリーフィングデータが必要","既存の正典情報へのアクセスに依存する","大規模な世界シミュレーションプロジェクトでは追加の処理が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["사전 로드된 편집 브리핑 데이터가 필요합니다","이미 확립된 정경 정보에 대한 액세스에 의존합니다","대규모 세계 시뮬레이션 프로젝트의 경우 추가 처리가 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere datos de briefing del editor pre-cargados","Depende del acceso a información de canon establecida","Puede necesitar procesamiento adicional para proyectos de simulación de mundos a gran escala"],"fr":["Nécessite des données de briefing d''éditeur pré-chargées","Dépend de l''accès à des informations de canon établies","Peut nécessiter un traitement supplémentaire pour les projets de simulation de mondes à grande échelle"],"de":["Benötigt vorab geladene Redaktionsvorgabedaten","Hängt vom Zugriff auf etablierte Kanon-Informationen ab","Kann für groß angelegte Welt-Simulationsprojekte zusätzliche Verarbeitung erfordern"],"pt":["Requer dados de briefing do editor pré-carregados","Dependente do acesso a informações de cânone estabelecido","Pode precisar de processamento adicional para projetos de simulação de mundo em larga escala"],"ru":["Требует предварительно загруженных данных брифинга редактора","Зависит от доступа к установленным каноническим данным","Может потребовать дополнительной обработки для проектов симуляции мира в крупном масштабе"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات مذكرات المحرر مسبقًا تحميلها","يعتمد على الوصول إلى معلومات الكانون الموحدة","قد يحتاج إلى المزيد من المعالجة لمشاريع محاكاة العالم على نطاق واسع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d63b8c074d763b47fecb05266c506046729f0b795d4c870dca19d17e6c999bd2","qualityScore":49}');
