d con CLI para una mayor flexibilidad"],"fr":["Amélioration des performances des Agents d''IA","Optimisation de prompts pour des tâches spécifiques","Collection de prompts utiles pour divers cas d''utilisation","Intégration avec des technologies comme React, Python et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI pour une plus grande flexibilité"],"de":["Leistungsverbesserung von AI-Agenten","Optimierung von Prompts für spezifische Aufgaben","Sammlung von nützlichen Prompts für verschiedene Use Cases","Integration mit Technologien wie React, Python und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI für eine größere Flexibilität"],"pt":["Coleção de prompts de IA para tarefas variadas","Otimização de perfis para melhorar a eficiência","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares","Suporte a múltiplos casos de uso","Documentação detalhada para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Коллекция полезных запросов ИИ для различных задач","Профилирование и оптимизация для повышения эффективности","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки","Поддержка множества случаев использования","Дetailed документация для разработчиков"],"ar":["مجموعة من محفزات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمهام المختلفة","تحسين Профايلات لتحسين الكفاءة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة","دعم للحالات المتعددة","توثيق مفصل للطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI优化工具","什么是Profiling Optimization","AI优化工具安装","Profiling Optimization设置指南","AI优化工具替代品","React优化","Python优化","Node.js优化"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","プロファイリング最適化とは","AIエージェントのインストール","プロファイリング最適化の設定ガイド","AIエージェントの代替品","Reactの最適化","Pythonの最適化","Node.jsの最適化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","프로파일링 최적화란","AI 에이전트 설치","프로파일링 최적화 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 대체품","React 최적화","Python 최적화","Node.js 최적화"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es el perfilado de optimización","Herramientas de IA alternativas","Agentes de IA vs herramientas de machine learning","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce que le profilage d''optimisation","Outils d''IA alternatifs","Agents d''IA vs outils de machine learning","installation d''Agents d''IA","guide de configuration d''Agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man AI-Agenten verwendet","was ist das Profiling-Optimierung","AI-Tools-Alternativen","AI-Agenten vs Machine-Learning-Tools","Installation von AI-Agenten","Konfigurationshandbuch für AI-Agenten"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","otimização de perfis","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para otimização de perfis","guia de instalação de ferramentas de IA","configuração de ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de software com IA","melhorias de desempenho com IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","профилирование и оптимизация","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","альтернативы для профилирования и оптимизации","руководство по установке ИИ Агентов","настройка ИИ Агентов","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ","улучшение производительности с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين Профايلات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للطورين","بديل لتحسين Профايلات","دليل تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"aj-geddes","repo":"useful-ai-prompts","repoPath":"aj-geddes/useful-ai-prompts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.148Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"profiling-optimization","description":"Profile application performance, identify bottlenecks, and optimize hot paths using CPU profiling, flame graphs, and benchmarking. Use when investigating performance issues or optimizing critical code paths.","bodyPreview":"# Profiling & Optimization\n\n## Overview\n\nProfile code execution to identify performance bottlenecks and optimize critical paths using data-driven approaches.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Performance optimization\n- Identifying CPU bottlenecks\n- Optimizing hot paths\n- Investigating slow requests\n- Reducing latency\n- Improving throughput\n\n## Implementation Examples\n\n### 1. **Node.js Profiling**\n\n```typescript\nimport { performance, PerformanceObserver } from \"perf_hooks\";\n\nclass Profiler {\n  private marks = n","body":"# Profiling & Optimization\n\n## Overview\n\nProfile code execution to identify performance bottlenecks and optimize critical paths using data-driven approaches.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Performance optimization\n- Identifying CPU bottlenecks\n- Optimizing hot paths\n- Investigating slow requests\n- Reducing latency\n- Improving throughput\n\n## Implementation Examples\n\n### 1. **Node.js Profiling**\n\n```typescript\nimport { performance, PerformanceObserver } from \"perf_hooks\";\n\nclass Profiler {\n  private marks = new Map<string, number>();\n\n  mark(name: string): void {\n    this.marks.set(name, performance.now());\n  }\n\n  measure(name: string, startMark: string): number {\n    const start = this.marks.get(startMark);\n    if (!start) throw new Error(`Mark ${startMark} not found`);\n\n    const duration = performance.now() - start;\n    console.log(`${name}: ${duration.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n\n    return duration;\n  }\n\n  async profile<T>(name: string, fn: () => Promise<T>): Promise<T> {\n    const start = performance.now();\n\n    try {\n      return await fn();\n    } finally {\n      const duration = performance.now() - start;\n      console.log(`${name}: ${duration.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst profiler = new Profiler();\n\napp.get(\"/api/users\", async (req, res) => {\n  profiler.mark(\"request-start\");\n\n  const users = await profiler.profile(\"fetch-users\", async () => {\n    return await db.query(\"SELECT * FROM users\");\n  });\n\n  profiler.measure(\"total-request-time\", \"request-start\");\n\n  res.json(users);\n});\n```\n\n### 2. **Chrome DevTools CPU Profile**\n\n```typescript\nimport inspector from \"inspector\";\nimport fs from \"fs\";\n\nclass CPUProfiler {\n  private session: inspector.Session | null = null;\n\n  start(): void {\n    this.session = new inspector.Session();\n    this.session.connect();\n\n    this.session.post(\"Profiler.enable\");\n    this.session.post(\"Profiler.start\");\n\n    console.log(\"CPU profiling started\");\n  }\n\n  async stop(outputFile: string): Promise<void> {\n    if (!this.session) return;\n\n    this.session.post(\"Profiler.stop\", (err, { profile }) => {\n      if (err) {\n        console.error(\"Profiling error:\", err);\n        return;\n      }\n\n      fs.writeFileSync(outputFile, JSON.stringify(profile));\n      console.log(`Profile saved to ${outputFile}`);\n\n      this.session!.disconnect();\n      this.session = null;\n    });\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst cpuProfiler = new CPUProfiler();\n\n// Start profiling\ncpuProfiler.start();\n\n// Run code to profile\nawait runExpensiveOperation();\n\n// Stop and save\nawait cpuProfiler.stop(\"./profile.cpuprofile\");\n```\n\n### 3. **Python cProfile**\n\n```python\nimport cProfile\nimport pstats\nfrom pstats import SortKey\nimport io\n\nclass Profiler:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.profiler = cProfile.Profile()\n\n    def __enter__(self):\n        self.profiler.enable()\n        return self\n\n    def __exit__(self, *args):\n        self.profiler.disable()\n\n    def print_stats(self, sort_by: str = ''cumulative''):\n        \"\"\"Print profiling statistics.\"\"\"\n        s = io.StringIO()\n        ps = pstats.Stats(self.profiler, stream=s)\n\n        if sort_by == ''time'':\n            ps.sort_stats(SortKey.TIME)\n        elif sort_by == ''cumulative'':\n            ps.sort_stats(SortKey.CUMULATIVE)\n        elif sort_by == ''calls'':\n            ps.sort_stats(SortKey.CALLS)\n\n        ps.print_stats(20)  # Top 20\n        print(s.getvalue())\n\n    def save_stats(self, filename: str):\n        \"\"\"Save profiling data.\"\"\"\n        self.profiler.dump_stats(filename)\n\n# Usage\nwith Profiler() as prof:\n    # Code to profile\n    result = expensive_function()\n\nprof.print_stats(''cumulative'')\nprof.save_stats(''profile.prof'')\n```\n\n### 4. **Benchmarking**\n\n```typescript\nclass Benchmark {\n  async run(\n    name: string,\n    fn: () => Promise<any>,\n    iterations: number = 1000,\n  ): Promise<void> {\n    console.log(`\\nBenchmarking: ${name}`);\n\n    const times: number[] = [];\n\n    // Warmup\n    for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n      await fn();\n    }\n\n    // Actual benchmark\n    for (let i = 0; i < iterations; i++) {\n      const start = performance.now();\n      await fn();\n      times.push(performance.now() - start);\n    }\n\n    // Statistics\n    const sorted = times.sort((a, b) => a - b);\n    const min = sorted[0];\n    const max = sorted[sorted.length - 1];\n    const avg = times.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / times.length;\n    const p50 = sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length * 0.5)];\n    const p95 = sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length * 0.95)];\n    const p99 = sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length * 0.99)];\n\n    console.log(`  Iterations: ${iterations}`);\n    console.log(`  Min: ${min.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n    console.log(`  Max: ${max.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n    console.log(`  Avg: ${avg.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n    console.log(`  P50: ${p50.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n    console.log(`  P95: ${p95.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n    console.log(`  P99: ${p99.toFixed(2)}ms`);\n  }\n\n  async compare(\n    implementations: Array<{ name: string; fn: () => Promise<any> }>,\n    iterations: number = 1000,\n  ): Promise<void> {\n    for (const impl of implementations) {\n      await this.run(impl.name, impl.fn, iterations);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst bench = new Benchmark();\n\nawait bench.compare([\n  {\n    name: \"Array.filter + map\",\n    fn: async () => {\n      const arr = Array.from({ length: 1000 }, (_, i) => i);\n      return arr.filter((x) => x % 2 === 0).map((x) => x * 2);\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    name: \"Single loop\",\n    fn: async () => {\n      const arr = Array.from({ length: 1000 }, (_, i) => i);\n      const result = [];\n      for (const x of arr) {\n        if (x % 2 === 0) {\n          result.push(x * 2);\n        }\n      }\n      return result;\n    },\n  },\n]);\n```\n\n### 5. **Database Query Profiling**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Pool } from \"pg\";\n\nclass QueryProfiler {\n  constructor(private pool: Pool) {}\n\n  async profileQuery(\n    query: string,\n    params: any[] = [],\n  ): Promise<{\n    result: any;\n    planningTime: number;\n    executionTime: number;\n    plan: any;\n  }> {\n    // Enable timing\n    await this.pool.query(\"SET track_io_timing = ON\");\n\n    // Get query plan\n    const explainResult = await this.pool.query(\n      `EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS, FORMAT JSON) ${query}`,\n      params,\n    );\n\n    const plan = explainResult.rows[0][\"QUERY PLAN\"][0];\n\n    // Execute actual query\n    const start = performance.now();\n    const result = await this.pool.query(query, params);\n    const duration = performance.now() - start;\n\n    return {\n      result: result.rows,\n      planningTime: plan[\"Planning Time\"],\n      executionTime: plan[\"Execution Time\"],\n      plan,\n    };\n  }\n\n  formatPlan(plan: any): string {\n    let output = \"Query Plan:\\n\";\n    output += `Planning Time: ${plan[\"Planning Time\"]}ms\\n`;\n    output += `Execution Time: ${plan[\"Execution Time\"]}ms\\n\\n`;\n\n    const formatNode = (node: any, indent: number = 0) => {\n      const prefix = \"  \".repeat(indent);\n      output += `${prefix}${node[\"Node Type\"]}\\n`;\n      output += `${prefix}  Cost: ${node[\"Total Cost\"]}\\n`;\n      output += `${prefix}  Rows: ${node[\"Actual Rows\"]}\\n`;\n      output += `${prefix}  Time: ${node[\"Actual Total Time\"]}ms\\n`;\n\n      if (node.Plans) {\n        node.Plans.forEach((child: any) => formatNode(child, indent + 1));\n      }\n    };\n\n    formatNode(plan.Plan);\n    return output;\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst profiler = new QueryProfiler(pool);\n\nconst { result, planningTime, executionTime, plan } =\n  await profiler.profileQuery(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE age > $1\", [25]);\n\nconsole.log(profiler.formatPlan(plan));\n```\n\n### 6. **Flame Graph Generation**\n\n```bash\n# Generate flame graph using 0x\nnpx 0x -o flamegraph.html node server.js\n\n# Or using clinic.js\nnpx clinic doctor --on-port ''autocannon localhost:3000'' -- node server.js\nnpx clinic flame --on-port ''autocannon localhost:3000'' -- node server.js\n```\n\n## Optimization Techniques\n\n### 1. **Caching**\n\n```typescript\nclass LRUCache<K, V> {\n  private cache = new Map<K, V>();\n  private maxSize: number;\n\n  constructor(maxSize: number = 100) {\n    this.maxSize = maxSize;\n  }\n\n  get(key: K): V | undefined {\n    if (!this.cache.has(key)) return undefined;\n\n    // Move to end (most recently used)\n    const value = this.cache.get(key)!;\n    this.cache.delete(key);\n    this.cache.set(key, value);\n\n    return value;\n  }\n\n  set(key: K, value: V): void {\n    // Remove if exists\n    if (this.cache.has(key)) {\n      this.cache.delete(key);\n    }\n\n    // Add to end\n    this.cache.set(key, value);\n\n    // Evict oldest if over capacity\n    if (this.cache.size > this.maxSize) {\n      const oldest = this.cache.keys().next().value;\n      this.cache.delete(oldest);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. **Lazy Loading**\n\n```typescript\nclass LazyValue<T> {\n  private value?: T;\n  private loaded = false;\n\n  constructor(private loader: () => T) {}\n\n  get(): T {\n    if (!this.loaded) {\n      this.value = this.loader();\n      this.loaded = true;\n    }\n    return this.value!;\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst expensive = new LazyValue(() => {\n  console.log(\"Computing expensive value...\");\n  return computeExpensiveValue();\n});\n\n// Only computed when first accessed\nconst value = expensive.get();\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n\n- Profile before optimizing\n- Focus on hot paths\n- Measure impact of changes\n- Use production-like data\n- Consider memory vs speed tradeoffs\n- Document optimization rationale\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n\n- Optimize without profiling\n- Ignore readability for minor gains\n- Skip benchmarking\n- Optimize cold paths\n- Make changes without measurement\n\n## Tools\n\n- **Node.js**: 0x, clinic.js, node --prof\n- **Python**: cProfile, py-spy, memory_profiler\n- **Visualization**: Flame graphs, Chrome DevTools\n- **Database**: EXPLAIN ANALYZE, pg_stat_statements\n\n## Resources\n\n- [0x Flame Graph Profiler](https://github.com/davidmarkclements/0x)\n- [Chrome DevTools Profiling](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/devtools/performance/)\n- [Python cProfile](https://docs.python.org/3/library/profile.html)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:26.935Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Performance Optimization Agents needing advanced code execution analysis and bottleneck identification.","zh":"适用于需要高级代码执行分析和瓶颈识别的性能优化代理。","ja":"パフォーマンス最適化エージェントが高度なコード実行分析とボトルネック識別を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"고급 코드 실행 분석 및 병목 현상 식별이 필요한 성능 최적화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Optimización de Rendimiento que necesitan un análisis de ejecución de código avanzado e identificación de cuellos de botella.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Optimisation de Performance nécessitant une analyse d''exécution de code avancée et une identification de goulets d''étranglement.","de":"Ideal für Performance-Optimierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Code-Ausführungsanalyse und Engpassidentifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que necessitam de análise avançada de execução de código e identificação de gargalos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов оптимизации производительности, которым необходима продвинутая анализ выполнения кода и выявление узких мест.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين الأداء الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لتشغيل التعليمات البرمجية وتحديد العوائق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to profile code execution, identify CPU bottlenecks, and optimize critical paths using data-driven approaches with libraries like ''perf_hooks'' and protocols for reducing latency and improving throughput.","zh":"赋予代理以分析代码执行、识别CPU瓶颈、使用类似''perf_hooks''的库和协议来优化关键路径、减少延迟、提高吞吐量的能力。","ja":"エージェントにコード実行を分析し、CPUボトルネックを識別し、''perf_hooks''などのライブラリとプロトコルを使用して重要なパスを最適化し、待ち時間を短縮し、スループットを向上させるデータ駆動型アプローチを使用する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에게 코드 실행을 분석하고 CPU 병목 현상을 식별하며 ''perf_hooks''와 같은 라이브러리와 프로토콜을 사용하여 중요한 경로를 최적화하고 지연을 줄이고 처리량을 개선하는 데이터 주도 접근 방식을 사용하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a perfilar la ejecución de código, identificar cuellos de botella de CPU y optimizar caminos críticos utilizando enfoques basados en datos con bibliotecas como ''perf_hooks'' y protocolos para reducir la latencia y mejorar el rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de profiler l''exécution de code, d''identifier les goulets d''étranglement de la CPU et d''optimiser les chemins critiques en utilisant des approches basées sur les données avec des bibliothèques comme ''perf_hooks'' et des protocoles pour réduire la latence et améliorer le débit.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Code-Ausführung zu profilieren, CPU-Engpässe zu identifizieren und kritische Pfade mit datengetriebenen Ansätzen mit Bibliotheken wie ''perf_hooks'' und Protokollen zur Latenzreduzierung und Leistungsverbesserung zu optimieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes perfilam a execução do código, identifiquem gargalos de CPU e otimizem caminhos críticos usando abordagens baseadas em dados com bibliotecas como ''perf_hooks'' e protocolos para reduzir a latência e melhorar a taxa de transferência.","ru":"Позволяет агентам профилировать выполнение кода, выявлять узкие места CPU и оптимизировать критические пути с помощью подходов, основанных на данных, с использованием библиотек, таких как ''perf_hooks'' и протоколов для уменьшения задержки и повышения пропускной способности.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تحليل تشغيل التعليمات البرمجية وتحديد عوائق وحدة المعالجة المركزية وضبط المسارات الحرجة باستخدام منهجيات قائمة على البيانات مع مكتبات مثل ''perf_hooks'' وبروتوكولات لتقليل التأخير وتحسين معدل نقل البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating performance optimization for Node.js applications","Debugging slow requests and identifying hot paths","Investigating and resolving CPU bottlenecks in critical code sections"],"zh":["为Node.js应用程序自动执行性能优化","调试缓慢的请求并识别热路径","调查并解决关键代码段中的CPU瓶颈"],"ja":["Node.jsアプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化を自動化する","遅いリクエストをデバッグしてホットパスを識別する","重要なコードセクションのCPUボトルネックを調査して解決する"],"ko":["Node.js 애플리케이션의 성능 최적화를 자동화하는 것","느린 요청을 디버깅하고 핫 경로를 식별하는 것","중요한 코드 섹션의 CPU 병목 현상을 조사하고 해결하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la optimización del rendimiento para aplicaciones Node.js","Depurar solicitudes lentas e identificar caminos calientes","Investigar y resolver cuellos de botella de CPU en secciones críticas de código"],"fr":["Automatiser l''optimisation des performances pour les applications Node.js","Déboguer les requêtes lentes et identifier les chemins chauds","Enquêter et résoudre les goulets d''étranglement de la CPU dans les sections critiques de code"],"de":["Automatisieren der Leistungsoptimierung für Node.js-Anwendungen","Fehlerbehebung bei langsamen Anfragen und Identifizierung von Hotspots","Untersuchung und Behebung von CPU-Engpässen in kritischen Codeabschnitten"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de desempenho para aplicações Node.js","Depurar solicitações lentas e identificar caminhos quentes","Investigar e resolver gargalos de CPU em seções críticas de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию производительности для приложений Node.js","Отлаживать медленные запросы и выявлять горячие пути","Изучать и решать узкие места CPU в критических секциях кода"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيقات Node.js تلقائيًا","تصحيح الطلبات البطيئة وتحديد المسارات الساخنة","تحقيق العوائق في وحدة المعالجة المركزية في أقسام التعليمات البرمجية الحرجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Limited to JavaScript-based applications","Needs performance monitoring tools like PerformanceObserver"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","仅限于基于JavaScript的应用程序","需要PerformanceObserver等性能监控工具"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","JavaScriptベースのアプリケーションに限定される","PerformanceObserverなどのパフォーマンス監視ツールが必要"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다","JavaScript 기반 애플리케이션으로 제한됩니다","PerformanceObserver와 같은 성능 모니터링 도구가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno Node.js","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en JavaScript","Necesita herramientas de monitoreo de rendimiento como PerformanceObserver"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Limité aux applications basées sur JavaScript","Nécessite des outils de surveillance des performances comme PerformanceObserver"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf JavaScript-basierte Anwendungen","Benötigt Leistungsüberwachungstools wie PerformanceObserver"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em JavaScript","Necessita de ferramentas de monitoramento de desempenho como PerformanceObserver"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Ограничен для приложений на основе JavaScript","Требует инструментов мониторинга производительности, таких как PerformanceObserver"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدود لتطبيقات اللغة البرمجية JavaScript","يحتاج إلى أدوات مراقبة الأداء مثل PerformanceObserver"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4b4442fb735df6c047a65eb1a6d7e8eb5dc1c5d8f62a7baef068b4840ffc8ea1","qualityScore":49}');
