on Cricket","Integration mit React und Node.js","CLI-Funktionen für Entwickler","Kompatibilität mit Python","Ressourcen für die Erstellung von Cricket-Anwendungen","Detaillierte Dokumentation für Entwickler"],"pt":["Análise de desempenho de esportes","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas","Suporte para múltiplos esportes","Análise de dados em tempo real"],"ru":["Анализ спортивных результатов","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Разработка индивидуальных решений","Поддержка нескольких видов спорта","Анализ данных в режиме реального времени"],"ar":["تحليل أداء الرياضة","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير حلول مخصصة","دعم رياضات متعددة","تحليل البيانات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用clarify技能","什么是AI智能代理","clarify技能安装","Cricket运动表现分析工具","AI智能代理与clarify技能的比较","clarify技能设置指南","Cricket运动数据分析"],"ja":["clarifyスキルの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","clarifyスキルのインストール","Cricketのパフォーマンス分析ツール","AIエージェントとclarifyスキルの比較","clarifyスキルの設定ガイド","Cricketのデータ分析"],"ko":["clarify 기능 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","clarify 기능 설치","크리켓 운동 성능 분석 도구","AI 에이전트와 clarify 기능의 비교","clarify 기능 설정 가이드","크리켓 운동 데이터 분석"],"es":["herramientas de AI para cricket","cómo usar Clarify","qué es Clarify","alternativas a Clarify","Clarify vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de Clarify","guía de configuración de Clarify","desarrollo de aplicaciones de cricket","integración de funcionalidades de cricket"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le cricket","comment utiliser Clarify","qu''est-ce que Clarify","alternatives à Clarify","Clarify vs autres outils d''IA","installation de Clarify","guide de configuration de Clarify","développement d''applications de cricket","intégration de fonctionnalités de cricket"],"de":["KI-Tools für Cricket","wie man Clarify verwendet","was ist Clarify","Alternativen zu Clarify","Clarify vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von Clarify","Konfigurationsanleitung für Clarify","Entwicklung von Cricket-Anwendungen","Integration von Cricket-Funktionen"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para esportes","como usar clarify","o que é clarify","clarify vs competidores","instalar clarify","guia de configuração do clarify","desenvolvimento de soluções esportivas","análise de dados esportivos"],"ru":["инструменты ии для спорта","как использовать clarify","что такое clarify","clarify vs конкуренты","установить clarify","руководство по настройке clarify","разработка спортивных решений","анализ спортивных данных"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للرياضة","كيفية استخدام برنامج clarify","ما هو برنامج clarify","برنامج clarify مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت برنامج clarify","دليل إعداد برنامج clarify","تطوير حلول رياضية","تحليل بيانات رياضية"]}},"owner":"percy-main","repo":"web","repoPath":"percy-main/web","stars":1,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T16:52:52Z","topics":["cricket","sport"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clarify","description":"Reads a triaged GitHub issue and interactively walks through its open questions with the user, updating the ticket as answers are resolved.","tags":"github, issues, triage, clarification","bodyPreview":"# Clarify\n\nInteractively resolve open questions on a triaged GitHub issue.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to:\n\n- Work through open questions on a triaged issue before starting development\n- Clarify requirements or approach for a specific ticket\n\n## Arguments\n\nThis skill takes a single argument: the issue number (e.g. `/clarify 42`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Read the issue\n\nFetch the issue including all comments:\n\n```bash\ngh issue view <number> --json number,title,body,comme","body":"# Clarify\n\nInteractively resolve open questions on a triaged GitHub issue.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when the user wants to:\n\n- Work through open questions on a triaged issue before starting development\n- Clarify requirements or approach for a specific ticket\n\n## Arguments\n\nThis skill takes a single argument: the issue number (e.g. `/clarify 42`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Read the issue\n\nFetch the issue including all comments:\n\n```bash\ngh issue view <number> --json number,title,body,comments,labels\n```\n\nIf the issue is not triaged, report that back to the user and stop:\n\n> Issue #42 is not triaged. Please triage it first with /triage\n\n### Step 2: Find open questions\n\nLook through the issue comments for a triage comment (marked with `*Triaged by Claude*`). Extract any open questions — these are checkbox items under the `### Open questions` heading:\n\n```markdown\n- [ ] Unanswered question\n- [x] Already answered question\n```\n\nIf there is no triage comment, or there are no open questions (all checked or section absent), report that back to the user and stop:\n\n> No open questions on #42. This issue is ready for development.\n\n### Step 3: Walk through each question\n\nFor each unanswered question (`- [ ]`), present it to the user one at a time using `AskUserQuestion`. Provide options where you can infer sensible choices from the codebase, and always allow a free-text \"Other\" response.\n\nBefore presenting each question, briefly explore the codebase if it helps you offer better options. For example, if the question is about where to place a component, check the existing component structure first.\n\n### Step 4: Update the issue\n\nOnce all questions are resolved, post a new comment on the issue summarising the decisions:\n\n```markdown\n## Clarifications\n\n| Question | Decision |\n|----------|----------|\n| Should X use approach A or B? | Approach A — because ... |\n| ... | ... |\n\n---\n*Clarified by Claude*\n```\n\nThen update the triage comment to check off the resolved questions. Use `gh api` to edit the existing triage comment:\n\n1. Find the triage comment ID from the comments JSON\n2. For each resolved question, replace `- [ ]` with `- [x]` in the comment body\n3. Update the comment:\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/comments/{comment_id} -X PATCH -f body=''...''\n```\n\nAdd the `ready for dev` label to the issue:\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"ready for dev\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Report\n\nTell the user the issue is now clarified and ready for development, or note if any questions remain unresolved.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:25:05.775Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub Integration Agents requiring issue resolution and requirement clarification capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要问题解决和需求澄清能力的GitHub集成代理。","ja":"GitHubの問題解決と要件の明確化能力が必要なGitHub統合エージェントに適しています。","ko":"문제 해결 및 요구사항 명확화 기능이 필요한 GitHub 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Integración de GitHub que requieren capacidades de resolución de problemas y aclaración de requisitos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''intégration GitHub nécessitant des capacités de résolution de problèmes et de clarification des exigences.","de":"Ideal für GitHub-Integration-Agents, die Problembehandlung und Anforderungsklärungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Integração do GitHub que requerem capacidades de resolução de problemas e clarificação de requisitos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов интеграции GitHub, требующих возможностей разрешения проблем и уточнения требований.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تكنولوجيا المعلومات الذي يتطلب قدرات حل المشكلات و توضيح المتطلبات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interactively resolve open questions on triaged GitHub issues using gh issue view commands and JSON data, facilitating clearer requirements and approaches for specific tickets.","zh":"使代理能够使用gh问题查看命令和JSON数据交互式地解决已分类的GitHub问题上的开放性问题，从而为特定票据提供更清晰的需求和方法。","ja":"エージェントがgh issue viewコマンドとJSONデータを使用して、分類されたGitHubの問題のオープンな質問を対話的に解決することを可能にし、特定のチケットの要件とアプローチを明確にする。","ko":"에이전트가 gh 이슈 보기 명령 및 JSON 데이터를 사용하여 분류된 GitHub 이슈의开放형 질문을 상호작용형으로 해결하여 특정 티켓의 요구사항 및 접근 방식을 더 명확하게 하는 것을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver interactivamente preguntas abiertas sobre problemas de GitHub clasificados utilizando comandos de vista de problema de gh y datos JSON, lo que facilita requisitos y enfoques más claros para tickets específicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre de manière interactive les questions ouvertes sur les problèmes GitHub classés en utilisant les commandes de vue de problème gh et les données JSON, facilitant ainsi des exigences et des approches plus claires pour les tickets spécifiques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, offene Fragen zu klassifizierten GitHub-Problemen interaktiv zu lösen, indem sie gh-Problemmeldungsanzeigebefehle und JSON-Daten verwenden, was klarere Anforderungen und Ansätze für bestimmte Tickets erleichtert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes resolvam interativamente perguntas abertas em problemas triados do GitHub usando comandos de visualização de problemas gh e dados JSON, facilitando requisitos e abordagens mais claros para tickets específicos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интерактивно решать открытые вопросы по от triaged проблемам GitHub с помощью команд просмотра проблем gh и данных JSON, облегчая более ясные требования и подходы для конкретных тикетов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بحل الأسئلة المفتوحة بشكل تفاعلي في قضايا GitHub المصنفة باستخدام أوامر العرض القضايا gh وبيانات JSON، مما يسهل متطلباتات وأساليب أوضح لطوابع محددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Resolving open questions on triaged issues","Clarifying requirements for development tickets","Fetching issue details including comments"],"zh":["解决已分类问题上的开放性问题","为开发票据澄清需求","获取问题详细信息，包括评论"],"ja":["分類された問題のオープンな質問を解決する","開発チケットの要件を明確にする","問題の詳細、コメントを含むを取得する"],"ko":["분류된 문제의开放형 질문을 해결하는 것","개발 티켓의 요구사항을 명확히 하는 것","이슈 세부 정보를 가져오는 것, 댓글 포함"],"es":["Resolver preguntas abiertas sobre problemas clasificados","Aclarar requisitos para tickets de desarrollo","Recuperar detalles de problemas, incluidos comentarios"],"fr":["Résoudre les questions ouvertes sur les problèmes classés","Clarifier les exigences pour les tickets de développement","Récupérer les détails des problèmes, y compris les commentaires"],"de":["Offene Fragen zu klassifizierten Problemen lösen","Anforderungen für Entwicklungstickets klären","Problemdetails einschließlich Kommentare abrufen"],"pt":["Resolver perguntas abertas em problemas triados","Esclarecer requisitos para tickets de desenvolvimento","Buscar detalhes do problema, incluindo comentários"],"ru":["Решить открытые вопросы по от triaged проблемам","Уточнить требования для тикетов разработки","Получить подробности проблемы, включая комментарии"],"ar":["حل الأسئلة المفتوحة في قضايا المصنفة","توضيح المتطلبات لتذاكر التطوير","استرجاع تفاصيل المشكلة، بما في ذلك التعليقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub issue number as an argument","Needs gh command-line tool for issue viewing"],"zh":["需要GitHub问题编号作为参数","需要gh命令行工具进行问题查看"],"ja":["GitHubの問題番号を引数として必要","問題の表示にghコマンドラインツールが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 이슈 번호를 인수로 필요","gh 명령줄 도구가 이슈 보기 필요"],"es":["Requiere el número de problema de GitHub como argumento","Necesita la herramienta de línea de comandos gh para ver problemas"],"fr":["Nécessite le numéro de problème GitHub comme argument","A besoin de l''outil de ligne de commande gh pour afficher les problèmes"],"de":["Benötigt die GitHub-Problemmeldenummer als Argument","Benötigt das gh-Befehlszeilentool zum Anzeigen von Problemen"],"pt":["Exige o número do problema do GitHub como argumento","Necessita da ferramenta de linha de comando gh para visualizar problemas"],"ru":["Требует номера проблемы GitHub как аргумента","Нуждается в инструменте командной строки gh для просмотра проблем"],"ar":["يتطلب رقم مشكلة GitHub كمعامل","يحتاج إلى أداة سطر الأوامر gh لعرض المشكلات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a4efe9aaacecc9aab2a0c60711178846fbde5442cfad82819c9b26a6e574fbf3","qualityScore":48}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SynkraAI/aios-core/aios-sm', 'community', 'SynkraAI', 'aios-core', 'SynkraAI/aios-core', 'aios-sm', 1899, 655, 48, '2026-02-28T12:35:32Z', '2026-02-28T12:48:04.363Z', 'f340516e649f508f4ed9fb832a1517f42955849f9b3dad760ad1fbcc1f3df382', '{"id":"SynkraAI/aios-core/aios-sm","name":"aios-sm","description":{"zh":"Synkra AIOS v4.0是一个AI编排系统框架，专为全栈开发设计。它使用Node.js和TypeScript构建，提供AI代理自动化、CLI工具集成和开发工作流优化，支持与Claude AI等模型的集成。","ja":"Synkra AIOS v4.0は、フルスタック開発向けに設計されたAIオーケストレーションシステムフレームワークです。Node.jsとTypeScriptで構築され、AIエージェントの自動化、CLIツール統合、開発ワークフロー最適化を提供し、Claude AIなどのモデルと連携します。","ko":"Synkra AIOS v4.0은 풀스택 개발을 위해 설계된 AI 오케스트레이션 시스템 프레임워크입니다. Node.js와 TypeScript로 구축되었으며, AI 에이전트 자동화, CLI 도구 통합 및 개발 워크플로우 최적화를 제공하고 Claude AI 등의 모델과 연동합니다.","es":"Synkra AIOS es un framework de orquestación de agentes IA para desarrollo full stack. Proporciona herramientas para automatizar tareas de desarrollo, integrar con modelos como Claude y optimizar flujos de trabajo con Node.js y TypeScript.","fr":"Synkra AIOS est un framework d''orchestration d''outils IA pour le développement full stack. Il offre des outils pour automatiser les tâches de développement, intégrer des modèles comme Claude et optimiser les flux de travail avec Node.js et TypeScript.","de":"Synkra AIOS ist ein KI-Agenten Orchestrierungs-Framework für die Full-Stack Entwicklung. Es bietet Tools zur Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben, Integration mit Modellen wie Claude und Optimierung von Workflows mit Node.js und TypeScript.","pt":"Synkra AIOS é um framework de orquestração de agentes IA para desenvolvimento full stack em Node.js e TypeScript. Automatiza fluxos de trabalho complexos com CLI integrado e arquitetura modular para equipes de desenvolvimento.","ru":"Synkra AIOS - это фреймворк оркестрации ИИ агентов для full stack разработки на Node.js и TypeScript. Автом