Morphing Icons para Interfaces Melhoradas","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Morphing Icons для Лучших Интерфейсов","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Morphing Icons لتحسين الواجهات","en":"morphing-icons"},"description":{"zh":"morphing-icons是一个用于创建动态图标的AI工具，帮助开发者打造更好的界面","ja":"morphing-iconsは、インターフェース設計を向上させるためのAIエージェントです","ko":"모핑 아이콘은 개발자가 더 나은 인터페이스를 만들 수 있는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Morphing-icons es una guía viva para crear mejores interfaces. Aprende a integrar Agentes de IA en tus proyectos para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Morphing-icons est un manuel vivant pour créer de meilleures interfaces. Apprenez à intégrer les Outils d''IA dans vos projets pour améliorer l''expérience uti...","de":"Morphing-icons ist ein lebendiges Handbuch für die Erstellung besserer Interfaces. Lernen Sie, KI-Agents in Ihre Projekte zu integrieren, um die Benutzererfa...","pt":"O Morphing Icons é uma ferramenta de IA para criar interfaces mais intuitivas e atraentes, com React, Python e Node.js","ru":"Morphing Icons - это ИИ Агент для создания более интуитивных и привлекательных интерфейсов с использованием React, Python и Node.js","ar":"Morphing Icons هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء واجهات أكثر直觉 وجاذبية باستخدام React و Python و Node.js","en":"A Living Manual for Better Interfaces"},"definition":{"en":"A Living Manual for Better Interfaces"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种图标格式","AI智能变形技术","简单易用的开发接口","高性能渲染引擎","支持React、Python、Node.js等开发框架"],"ja":["多種のアイコン形式をサポート","AIエージェントを使用した変形技術","簡単で使いやすい開発インターフェース","高性能レンダリングエンジン","React、Python、Node.jsなどの開発フレームワークをサポート"],"ko":["다양한 아이콘 형식을 지원","AI 에이전트를 사용한 변형 기술","간단하고 사용하기 쉬운 개발 인터페이스","고성능 렌더링 엔진","React, Python, Node.js 등의 개발 프레임워크를 지원"],"es":["Integración con Agentes de IA","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Creación de interfaces personalizadas","Compatibilidad con React y Node.js","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Intégration avec les Outils d''IA","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Création d''interfaces personnalisées","Compatibilité avec React et Node.js","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Integration mit KI-Agents","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Erstellung von personalisierten Interfaces","Kompatibilität mit React und Node.js","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Criação de ícones personalizados com Morphing","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Documentação completa e prática","Suporte a CLI para desenvolvedores","Melhoria da experiência do usuário com interfaces intuitivas"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских иконок с помощью Morphing","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Полная и практическая документация","Поддержка CLI для разработчиков","Улучшение пользовательского опыта с помощью интуитивных интерфейсов"],"ar":["إنشاء أيقونات مخصصة باستخدام Morphing","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","وثائق شاملة وعملية","دعم CLI للمطورين","تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع واجهات直觉ية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用morphing-icons","AI智能图标变形工具","morphing-icons安装指南","morphing-icons开发教程","morphing-icons替代品","morphing-icons和Iconify的比较"],"ja":["morphing-iconsの使い方","AIエージェントを使用したアイコン変形","morphing-iconsのインストール方法","morphing-iconsの開発ガイド","morphing-iconsの代替","morphing-iconsとIconifyの比較"],"ko":["모핑 아이콘 사용법","AI 에이전트를 사용한 아이콘 변형","모핑 아이콘 설치 가이드","모핑 아이콘 개발 튜토리얼","모핑 아이콘 대체품","모핑 아이콘과 Iconify의 비교"],"es":["cómo usar morphing-icons","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a morphing-icons","morphing-icons vs competidores","instalación de morphing-icons","guía de configuración de morphing-icons"],"fr":["comment utiliser des morphing-icons","quoi est un Outil d''IA","alternatives à morphing-icons","morphing-icons vs concurrents","installation de morphing-icons","guide de configuration de morphing-icons"],"de":["wie man Morphing-Icons verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Morphing-Icons","Morphing-Icons vs Konkurrenten","Installation von Morphing-Icons","Konfigurationsanleitung für Morphing-Icons"],"pt":["como usar Morphing Icons","o que é Morphing Icons","Morphing Icons alternativa","Morphing Icons vs outros ferramentas de IA","instalar Morphing Icons","guia de configuração do Morphing Icons","desenvolvimento de interfaces com Morphing Icons","ferramentas de IA para design de interfaces"],"ru":["как использовать Morphing Icons","что такое Morphing Icons","Morphing Icons альтернатива","Morphing Icons vs другие ИИ Агенты","установить Morphing Icons","руководство по настройке Morphing Icons","разработка интерфейсов с помощью Morphing Icons","ИИ Агенты для дизайна интерфейсов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Morphing Icons","ما هو Morphing Icons","بديل Morphing Icons","Morphing Icons مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت Morphing Icons","دليل إعداد Morphing Icons","تطوير الواجهات باستخدام Morphing Icons","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتصميم الواجهات"]}},"owner":"raphaelsalaja","repo":"userinterface-wiki","repoPath":"raphaelsalaja/userinterface-wiki","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.888Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"morphing-icons","description":"Build icon components where any icon morphs into any other through SVG line transformation. Use when asked to create morphing icons, build icon transitions, animate between icons, or transform icons.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Morphing Icons\n\nBuild icons that transform through actual shape transformation, not crossfades. Any icon can morph into any other because they share the same underlying 3-line structure.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nEvery icon is composed of exactly **three SVG lines**. Icons that need fewer lines collapse the extras to invisible center points. This constraint enables seamless morphing between any two icons.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### 1. Line Definition\n\nEach line has coordinates and optional opacity:\n\n```ts","body":"# Morphing Icons\n\nBuild icons that transform through actual shape transformation, not crossfades. Any icon can morph into any other because they share the same underlying 3-line structure.\n\n## Core Concept\n\nEvery icon is composed of exactly **three SVG lines**. Icons that need fewer lines collapse the extras to invisible center points. This constraint enables seamless morphing between any two icons.\n\n## Architecture\n\n### 1. Line Definition\n\nEach line has coordinates and optional opacity:\n\n```ts\ninterface IconLine {\n  x1: number;\n  y1: number;\n  x2: number;\n  y2: number;\n  opacity?: number;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Collapsed Lines\n\nIcons needing fewer than 3 lines use collapsed lines—zero-length lines at the center:\n\n```ts\nconst CENTER = 7; // Center of 14x14 viewbox\n\nconst collapsed: IconLine = {\n  x1: CENTER,\n  y1: CENTER,\n  x2: CENTER,\n  y2: CENTER,\n  opacity: 0,\n};\n```\n\n### 3. Icon Definition\n\nEach icon has exactly 3 lines, optional rotation, and optional group:\n\n```ts\ninterface IconDefinition {\n  lines: [IconLine, IconLine, IconLine];\n  rotation?: number;\n  group?: string;\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Rotation Groups\n\nIcons sharing a `group` animate rotation when transitioning between them. Icons without matching groups jump to the new rotation instantly:\n\n```ts\n// These rotate smoothly between each other\n{ lines: plusLines, rotation: 0, group: \"plus-cross\" }   // plus\n{ lines: plusLines, rotation: 45, group: \"plus-cross\" }  // cross\n\n// These rotate smoothly between each other\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: 0, group: \"arrow\" }       // arrow-right\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: 90, group: \"arrow\" }      // arrow-down\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: 180, group: \"arrow\" }     // arrow-left\n{ lines: arrowLines, rotation: -90, group: \"arrow\" }     // arrow-up\n```\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n### `morphing-three-lines`\nEvery icon MUST use exactly 3 lines. No more, no fewer.\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\nconst checkIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7.5, x2: 5.5, y2: 11 },\n    { x1: 5.5, y1: 11, x2: 12, y2: 3 },\n  ], // Only 2 lines\n};\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst checkIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7.5, x2: 5.5, y2: 11 },\n    { x1: 5.5, y1: 11, x2: 12, y2: 3 },\n    collapsed, // Third line collapsed\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### `morphing-use-collapsed`\nUnused lines must use the collapsed constant, not omission or null.\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\nconst minusIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n    null,\n    null,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst minusIcon = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n    collapsed,\n    collapsed,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### `morphing-consistent-viewbox`\nAll icons must use the same viewBox (14x14 recommended).\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\n// Mixing viewbox scales\nconst icon1 = { lines: [{ x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 }, ...] }; // 14x14\nconst icon2 = { lines: [{ x1: 4, y1: 14, x2: 24, y2: 14 }, ...] }; // 28x28\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst VIEWBOX_SIZE = 14;\nconst CENTER = 7;\n// All coordinates within 0-14 range\n```\n\n### `morphing-group-variants`\nIcons that are rotational variants MUST share the same group and base lines.\n\n**Fail:**\n```ts\n// Different line definitions for arrows\nconst arrowRight = { lines: [{ x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 }, ...] };\nconst arrowDown = { lines: [{ x1: 7, y1: 2, x2: 7, y2: 12 }, ...] }; // Different!\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```ts\nconst arrowLines: [IconLine, IconLine, IconLine] = [\n  { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n  { x1: 7.5, y1: 2.5, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n  { x1: 7.5, y1: 11.5, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n];\n\nconst icons = {\n  \"arrow-right\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: 0, group: \"arrow\" },\n  \"arrow-down\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: 90, group: \"arrow\" },\n  \"arrow-left\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: 180, group: \"arrow\" },\n  \"arrow-up\": { lines: arrowLines, rotation: -90, group: \"arrow\" },\n};\n```\n\n### `morphing-spring-rotation`\nRotation between grouped icons should use spring physics for natural motion.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n<motion.g animate={{ rotate: rotation }} transition={{ duration: 0.3 }} />\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\nconst rotation = useSpring(definition.rotation ?? 0, activeTransition);\n\n<motion.g style={{ rotate: rotation, transformOrigin: \"center\" }} />\n```\n\n### `morphing-reduced-motion`\nRespect `prefers-reduced-motion` by disabling animations.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\nfunction MorphingIcon({ icon }: Props) {\n  return <motion.line animate={...} transition={{ duration: 0.4 }} />;\n}\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\nfunction MorphingIcon({ icon }: Props) {\n  const reducedMotion = useReducedMotion() ?? false;\n  const activeTransition = reducedMotion ? { duration: 0 } : transition;\n  \n  return <motion.line animate={...} transition={activeTransition} />;\n}\n```\n\n### `morphing-jump-non-grouped`\nWhen transitioning between icons NOT in the same group, rotation should jump instantly.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n// Always animating rotation regardless of group\nuseEffect(() => {\n  rotation.set(definition.rotation ?? 0);\n}, [definition]);\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (shouldRotate) {\n    rotation.set(definition.rotation ?? 0); // Animate\n  } else {\n    rotation.jump(definition.rotation ?? 0); // Instant\n  }\n}, [definition, shouldRotate]);\n```\n\n### `morphing-strokelinecap-round`\nLines should use `strokeLinecap=\"round\"` for polished endpoints.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n<motion.line strokeLinecap=\"butt\" />\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\n<motion.line strokeLinecap=\"round\" />\n```\n\n### `morphing-aria-hidden`\nIcon SVGs should be `aria-hidden` since they''re decorative.\n\n**Fail:**\n```tsx\n<svg width={size} height={size}>...</svg>\n```\n\n**Pass:**\n```tsx\n<svg width={size} height={size} aria-hidden=\"true\">...</svg>\n```\n\n## Common Icon Patterns\n\n### Two-Line Icons (check, minus, equals, chevron)\nUse one or two collapsed lines:\n\n```ts\nconst check = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7.5, x2: 5.5, y2: 11 },\n    { x1: 5.5, y1: 11, x2: 12, y2: 3 },\n    collapsed,\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Three-Line Icons (menu, asterisk, play)\nUse all three lines:\n\n```ts\nconst menu = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 2, y1: 3.5, x2: 12, y2: 3.5 },\n    { x1: 2, y1: 7, x2: 12, y2: 7 },\n    { x1: 2, y1: 10.5, x2: 12, y2: 10.5 },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n### Point Icons (more, grip)\nUse zero-length lines as dots:\n\n```ts\nconst more = {\n  lines: [\n    { x1: 3, y1: 7, x2: 3, y2: 7 },\n    { x1: 7, y1: 7, x2: 7, y2: 7 },\n    { x1: 11, y1: 7, x2: 11, y2: 7 },\n  ],\n};\n```\n\n## Recommended Transition\n\nUse exponential ease-out for smooth morphing:\n\n```ts\nconst defaultTransition: Transition = {\n  ease: [0.19, 1, 0.22, 1],\n  duration: 0.4,\n};\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen auditing morphing icon implementations, output findings as:\n\n```\nfile:line - [rule-id] description of issue\n\nExample:\ncomponents/icon/index.tsx:45 - [morphing-three-lines] Icon \"check\" has only 2 lines, needs collapsed third\ncomponents/icon/index.tsx:78 - [morphing-group-variants] arrow-down uses different line definitions than arrow-right\n```\n\n## Summary Table\n\nAfter findings, output a summary:\n\n| Rule | Count | Severity |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| `morphing-three-lines` | 2 | HIGH |\n| `morphing-group-variants` | 1 | HIGH |\n| `morphing-reduced-motion` | 1 | MEDIUM |\n\n## References\n\n- [Benji''s experiments with Claude](https://benji.org/morphing-icons-with-claude)\n- [Motion useSpring](https://motion.dev/docs/react-use-spring)\n- [SVG Line Element](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/line)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:04.013Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced SVG icon morphing capabilities for dynamic interfaces.","zh":"适合需要高级SVG图标形态变化功能的前端代理，用于动态接口。","ja":"動的インターフェイスに高度なSVGアイコンの形態変化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"동적인 인터페이스에 고급 SVG 아이콘 형태 변경 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de morfismo de iconos SVG para interfaces dinámicas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées de morphisme d''icônes SVG pour des interfaces dynamiques.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte SVG-Icon-Morphing-Funktionen für dynamische Schnittstellen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de morfagem de ícones SVG para interfaces dinâmicas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности морфирования SVG-иконок для динамических интерфейсов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحويل الأيقونات SVG ل_interfaces الديناميكية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate seamless icon transformations using three-line SVG structures, enabling morphing between any two icons with deterministic results, leveraging SVG lines with coordinates and optional opacity.","zh":"赋予代理生成无缝图标转换的能力，使用三行SVG结构，使得任何两个图标之间的形态变换具有确定的结果，利用SVG线和坐标以及可选的不透明度。","ja":"エージェントにシームレスなアイコン変換を生成する能力を与え、三行SVG構造を使用して、任意の2つのアイコン間の形態変換に決定的な結果をもたらすことで、SVG線と座標およびオプションの不透明度を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 무결점 아이コン 변환을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 3행 SVG 구조를 사용하고, 두 개의 아이콘이나 그 이상의 형태 변환에 결정적 결과를 제공하며, SVG 라인 및 좌표 및 선택적 불투명도를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar transformaciones de iconos sin problemas utilizando estructuras SVG de tres líneas, lo que permite la morfología entre dos iconos cualesquiera con resultados deterministas, aprovechando las líneas SVG con coordenadas y opacidad opcional.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des transformations d''icônes sans interruption en utilisant des structures SVG à trois lignes, permettant la morphologie entre deux icônes quelconques avec des résultats déterministes, en exploitant les lignes SVG avec des coordonnées et une opacité facultative.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, nahtlose Ikonen-Transformationen zu generieren, indem sie drei-Line-SVG-Strukturen verwenden, wodurch die Morphologie zwischen zwei beliebigen Icons mit deterministischen Ergebnissen ermöglicht wird, indem SVG-Linien mit Koordinaten und optionaler Opazität genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar transformações de ícones sem interrupção usando estruturas SVG de três linhas, permitindo a morfagem entre qualquer dois ícones com resultados determinísticos, utilizando linhas SVG com coordenadas e opacidade opcional.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать бесперебойные преобразования иконок, используя трехлинейные SVG-структуры, что позволяет осуществлять морфирование между любыми двумя иконками с детерминированными результатами, используя SVG-линии с координатами и опциональной непрозрачностью.","ar":"يتيح للوكلاء توليد تحويلات أيقونات دون انقطاع باستخدام هياكل SVG ثلاثية الخطوط، مما يمكّن من تحويل الشكل بين أيقونتين مع نتائج محددة، باستخدام خطوط SVG مع إحداثيات و-opacity اختياري."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating morphing icons for interactive web applications","Creating dynamic SVG graphics for data visualization","Enhancing user interface with shape-transforming icons"],"zh":["为交互式Web应用程序生成形态变化图标","创建动态SVG图形用于数据可视化","使用形态变化图标增强用户界面"],"ja":["インタラクティブなWebアプリケーション用の形態変化アイコンの生成","データ可視化用の動的SVGグラフィックスの作成","形態変化アイコンを使用したユーザーインターフェイスの強化"],"ko":["인터랙티브 웹 애플리케이션을 위한 형태 변경 아이콘이나 그래픽 생성","데이터 시각화를 위한 동적 SVG 그래픽스 생성","형태 변경 아이콘이나 그래픽으로 사용자 인터페이스를 강화하는こと"],"es":["Generar iconos morfables para aplicaciones web interactivas","Crear gráficos SVG dinámicos para visualización de datos","Mejorar la interfaz de usuario con iconos que se transforman en formas"],"fr":["Générer des icônes morphables pour des applications Web interactives","Créer des graphiques SVG dynamiques pour la visualisation de données","Améliorer l''interface utilisateur avec des icônes qui se transforment en formes"],"de":["Generieren von morphbaren Icons für interaktive Webanwendungen","Erstellen von dynamischen SVG-Grafiken für die Datenvisualisierung","Verbessern der Benutzeroberfläche mit formverändernden Icons"],"pt":["Gerar ícones de morfagem para aplicações web interativas","Criar gráficos SVG dinâmicos para visualização de dados","Melhorar a interface do usuário com ícones que se transformam em formas"],"ru":["Генерировать морфирующие иконки для интерактивных веб-приложений","Создавать динамические SVG-графики для визуализации данных","Улучшать пользовательский интерфейс с помощью иконок, меняющих форму"],"ar":["توليد أيقونات متغيرة الشكل لبرامج الويب التفاعلية","إنشاء رسومات SVG الديناميكية لتصوير البيانات","تحسين واجهة المستخدم مع الأيقونات التي تتغير إلى أشكال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Icons must be composed of exactly three SVG lines","Collapsing extra lines to invisible center points for icons needing fewer lines"],"zh":["图标必须由恰好三行SVG线组成","将额外的线折叠到不可见的中心点以适应需要较少线的图标"],"ja":["アイコンは正確に3行のSVG線で構成されなければならない","必要な線が少ないアイコンに対応するために、余分な線を不可視の中心点に折り畳む"],"ko":["아이콘이나 그래픽은 정확히 3개의 SVG 라인으로 구성되어야 합니다","필요한 라인이 적은 아이콘이나 그래픽에 대응하기 위해, 추가 라인을 보이지 않는 중심점으로折り畳む"],"es":["Los iconos deben estar compuestos por exactamente tres líneas SVG","Colapsar líneas extra a puntos centrales invisibles para iconos que necesitan menos líneas"],"fr":["Les icônes doivent être composées d''exactement trois lignes SVG","Réduire les lignes supplémentaires à des points centraux invisibles pour les icônes qui nécessitent moins de lignes"],"de":["Die Icons müssen aus genau drei SVG-Linien bestehen","Zusätzliche Linien zu unsichtbaren Mittelpunkten für Icons zusammenbrechen, die weniger Linien benötigen"],"pt":["Os ícones devem ser compostos por exatamente três linhas SVG","Colapsar linhas extras para pontos centrais invisíveis para ícones que necessitam de menos linhas"],"ru":["Иконки должны состоять ровно из трех SVG-линий","Сворачивать лишние линии в невидимые центральные точки для иконок, которым требуется меньше линий"],"ar":["يجب أن تتكون الأيقونات من ثلاثة خطوط SVG بالضبط","تجميع خطوط إضافية إلى نقاط مركزية غير مرئية لأيقونات تحتاج إلى أقل من خطوط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"690cb3ebe7860f77b4fedd6f951aba6aff129faa84a98849489de4338c88f97f","qualityScore":48}');
