 Manager Alternative","Benchmark Manager vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von Benchmark Manager","Konfigurationsanleitung für Benchmark Manager","Entwicklung von KI-Agents mit Benchmark Manager"],"pt":["como usar o Gerenciador de Benchmark","o que é Gerenciador de Benchmark","Ferramentas de IA alternative","Gerenciador de Benchmark vs Ferramentas de IA","instalar Gerenciador de Benchmark","guia de configuração do Gerenciador de Benchmark","otimização de desempenho de Ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de soluções de Inteligência Artificial"],"ru":["как использовать Менеджер бенчмарков","что такое Менеджер бенчмарков","ИИ Агенты alternative","Менеджер бенчмарков vs ИИ Агенты","установка Менеджера бенчмарков","руководство по настройке Менеджера бенчмарков","оптимизация производительности ИИ Агентов","разработка решений ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مدير اختبار الأداء","ما هو مدير اختبار الأداء","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بديلة","مدير اختبار الأداء مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت مدير اختبار الأداء","دليل إعداد مدير اختبار الأداء","تحسين أداء وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"sunholo-data","repo":"ailang","repoPath":"sunholo-data/ailang","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.896Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Benchmark Manager","description":"Create and manage AILANG eval benchmarks. Use when user asks to create benchmarks, fix benchmark issues, debug failing benchmarks, or analyze benchmark results.","bodyPreview":"# Benchmark Manager\n\nManage AILANG evaluation benchmarks with correct prompt integration, debugging workflows, and best practices learned from real benchmark failures.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Debugging a failing benchmark:**\n```bash\n# 1. Show the full prompt that models see\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh json_parse\n\n# 2. Test a benchmark with a specific model\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks json_parse\n\n# 3. Check benchmark YAML for common issues","body":"# Benchmark Manager\n\nManage AILANG evaluation benchmarks with correct prompt integration, debugging workflows, and best practices learned from real benchmark failures.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Debugging a failing benchmark:**\n```bash\n# 1. Show the full prompt that models see\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh json_parse\n\n# 2. Test a benchmark with a specific model\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks json_parse\n\n# 3. Check benchmark YAML for common issues\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/check_benchmark.sh benchmarks/json_parse.yml\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- User asks to create a new benchmark\n- User asks to debug/fix a failing benchmark\n- User wants to understand why models generate wrong code\n- User asks about benchmark YAML format\n- Benchmarks show 0% pass rate despite language support\n\n## CRITICAL: prompt vs task_prompt\n\n**This is the most important concept for benchmark management.**\n\n### The Problem (v0.4.8 Discovery)\n\nBenchmarks have TWO different prompt fields with VERY different behavior:\n\n| Field | Behavior | Use When |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| `prompt:` | **REPLACES** the teaching prompt entirely | Testing raw model capability (rare) |\n| `task_prompt:` | **APPENDS** to teaching prompt | Normal benchmarks (99% of cases) |\n\n### Why This Matters\n\n```yaml\n# BAD - Model never sees AILANG syntax!\nprompt: |\n  Write a program that prints \"Hello\"\n\n# GOOD - Model sees teaching prompt + task\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write a program that prints \"Hello\"\n```\n\nWith `prompt:`, models generate Python/pseudo-code because they never learn AILANG syntax.\n\n### How Prompts Combine\n\nFrom `internal/eval_harness/spec.go` (lines 91-93):\n```go\nfullPrompt := basePrompt  // Teaching prompt from prompts/v0.4.x.md\nif s.TaskPrompt != \"\" {\n    fullPrompt = fullPrompt + \"\\n\\n## Task\\n\\n\" + s.TaskPrompt\n}\n```\n\nThe teaching prompt teaches AILANG syntax; `task_prompt` adds the specific task.\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n### `scripts/show_full_prompt.sh`\n\nShows the complete prompt that models receive for a benchmark.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh <benchmark_id>\n\n# Example:\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh json_parse\n```\n\n### `scripts/check_benchmark.sh`\n\nValidates a benchmark YAML file for common issues.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/check_benchmark.sh benchmarks/<name>.yml\n```\n\n**Checks for:**\n- Using `prompt:` instead of `task_prompt:` (warning)\n- Missing required fields\n- Invalid capability names\n- Syntax errors in YAML\n\n### `scripts/test_benchmark.sh`\n\nRuns a quick single-model test of a benchmark.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/test_benchmark.sh <benchmark_id> [model]\n\n# Examples:\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/test_benchmark.sh json_parse\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/test_benchmark.sh json_parse claude-haiku-4-5\n```\n\n## Benchmark YAML Format\n\n### Required Fields\n\n```yaml\nid: my_benchmark              # Unique identifier (snake_case)\ndescription: \"Short description of what this tests\"\nlanguages: [\"python\", \"ailang\"]\nentrypoint: \"main\"            # Function to call\ncaps: [\"IO\"]                  # Required capabilities\ndifficulty: \"easy|medium|hard\"\nexpected_gain: \"low|medium|high\"\ntask_prompt: |                # ALWAYS use task_prompt, not prompt!\n  Write a program in <LANG> that:\n  1. Does something\n  2. Prints the result\n\n  Output only the code, no explanations.\nexpected_stdout: |            # Exact expected output\n  expected output here\n```\n\n### Capability Names\n\nValid capabilities: `IO`, `FS`, `Clock`, `Net`\n\n```yaml\n# File I/O\ncaps: [\"IO\"]\n\n# HTTP requests\ncaps: [\"Net\", \"IO\"]\n\n# File system operations\ncaps: [\"FS\", \"IO\"]\n```\n\n## Creating New Benchmarks\n\n### Step 1: Determine Requirements\n\n- What language feature/capability is being tested?\n- Can models solve this with just the teaching prompt?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### Step 2: Write the Benchmark\n\n```yaml\nid: my_new_benchmark\ndescription: \"Test feature X capability\"\nlanguages: [\"python\", \"ailang\"]\nentrypoint: \"main\"\ncaps: [\"IO\"]\ndifficulty: \"medium\"\nexpected_gain: \"medium\"\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write a program in <LANG> that:\n  1. Clear description of task\n  2. Another step\n  3. Print the result\n\n  Output only the code, no explanations.\nexpected_stdout: |\n  exact expected output\n```\n\n### Step 3: Validate and Test\n\n```bash\n# Check for issues\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/check_benchmark.sh benchmarks/my_new_benchmark.yml\n\n# Test with cheap model first\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks my_new_benchmark\n```\n\n## Debugging Failing Benchmarks\n\n### Symptom: 0% Pass Rate Despite Language Support\n\n**Check 1: Is it using `task_prompt:`?**\n```bash\ngrep -E \"^prompt:\" benchmarks/failing_benchmark.yml\n# If this returns a match, change to task_prompt:\n```\n\n**Check 2: What prompt do models see?**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/benchmark-manager/scripts/show_full_prompt.sh failing_benchmark\n```\n\n**Check 3: Is the teaching prompt up to date?**\n```bash\n# After editing prompts/v0.x.x.md, you MUST rebuild:\nmake quick-install\n```\n\n### Symptom: Models Copy Template Instead of Solving Task\n\nThe teaching prompt includes a template structure. If models copy it verbatim:\n\n1. Make sure task is clearly different from examples in teaching prompt\n2. Check that `task_prompt` explicitly describes what to do\n3. Consider if the task description is ambiguous\n\n### Symptom: compile_error on Valid Syntax\n\nCommon AILANG-specific issues models get wrong:\n\n| Wrong | Correct | Notes |\n|-------|---------|-------|\n| `print(42)` | `print(show(42))` | print expects string |\n| `a % b` | `mod_Int(a, b)` | No % operator |\n| `def main()` | `export func main()` | Wrong keyword |\n| `for x in xs` | `match xs { ... }` | No for loops |\n\nIf models consistently make these mistakes, the teaching prompt needs improvement (use prompt-manager skill).\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n### 1. Using `prompt:` Instead of `task_prompt:`\n\n```yaml\n# WRONG - Models never see AILANG syntax\nprompt: |\n  Write code that...\n\n# CORRECT - Teaching prompt + task\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write code that...\n```\n\n### 2. Forgetting to Rebuild After Prompt Changes\n\n```bash\n# After editing prompts/v0.x.x.md:\nmake quick-install  # REQUIRED!\n```\n\n### 3. Putting Hints in Benchmarks\n\n```yaml\n# WRONG - Hints in benchmark\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write code that prints 42.\n  Hint: Use print(show(42)) in AILANG.\n\n# CORRECT - No hints; if models fail, fix the teaching prompt\ntask_prompt: |\n  Write code that prints 42.\n```\n\nIf models need AILANG-specific hints, the teaching prompt is incomplete. Use the prompt-manager skill to fix it.\n\n### 4. Testing Too Many Models at Once\n\n```bash\n# WRONG - Expensive and slow for debugging\nailang eval-suite --full --benchmarks my_test\n\n# CORRECT - Use one cheap model first\nailang eval-suite --models claude-haiku-4-5 --benchmarks my_test\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n### Reference Guide\nSee [`resources/reference.md`](resources/reference.md) for:\n- Complete list of valid benchmark fields\n- Capability reference\n- Example benchmarks\n\n### Related Skills\n- **prompt-manager**: When benchmark failures indicate teaching prompt issues\n- **eval-analyzer**: For analyzing results across many benchmarks\n- **use-ailang**: For writing correct AILANG code\n\n## Notes\n\n- Benchmarks live in `benchmarks/` directory\n- Eval results go to `eval_results/` directory\n- Teaching prompt is embedded in binary - rebuild after changes\n- Use `<LANG>` placeholder in task_prompt - it''s replaced with \"AILANG\" or \"Python\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:42.739Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced AILANG evaluation benchmark management with correct prompt integration and debugging workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要高级AILANG评估基准管理的AI代理，具有正确的提示集成和调试工作流程。","ja":"高度なAILANG評価ベンチマーク管理が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。正しいプロンプト統合とデバッグワークフローを備えています。","ko":"고급 AILANG 평가 벤치마크 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 올바른 프로ンプ트 통합 및 디버깅 워크플로를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una gestión avanzada de benchmark de evaluación de AILANG con integración correcta de prompts y flujos de trabajo de depuración.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée de benchmark d''évaluation AILANG avec une intégration correcte de prompts et de flux de travail de débogage.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Verwaltung von AILANG-Evaluierungsbenchmarks mit korrekter Promptintegration und Debugging-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de gestão avançada de benchmark de avaliação AILANG com integração correta de prompt e fluxos de trabalho de depuração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая оценкаbenchmark AILANG с правильной интеграцией подсказок и отладкой рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إيه آي الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة تقييم متقدمة لبرنامج AILANG مع دمج صحيح لاستكشاف الأخطاء وتدفقات العمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage AILANG evaluation benchmarks with features like debugging workflows, testing with specific models, and checking benchmark YAML for common issues, utilizing scripts like show_full_prompt.sh and commands like ailang eval-suite.","zh":"赋予代理管理AILANG评估基准的能力，具有调试工作流、使用特定模型进行测试和检查基准YAML以查找常见问题等功能，利用诸如show_full_prompt.sh的脚本和ailang eval-suite的命令。","ja":"エージェントがAILANG評価ベンチマークを管理できるようにします。デバッグワークフロー、特定のモデルを使用したテスト、ベンチマークYAMLの一般的な問題のチェックなどの機能を提供します。show_full_prompt.shなどのスクリプトやailang eval-suiteなどのコマンドを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 AILANG 평가 벤치마크를 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 디버깅 워크플로, 특정 모델을 사용한 테스트, 벤치마크 YAML의 일반적인 문제를 확인하는 기능을 제공합니다. show_full_prompt.sh와 같은 스크립트와 ailang eval-suite와 같은 명령어를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar benchmarks de evaluación de AILANG con características como flujos de trabajo de depuración, pruebas con modelos específicos y verificación de benchmark YAML para problemas comunes, utilizando scripts como show_full_prompt.sh y comandos como ailang eval-suite.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les benchmarks d''évaluation AILANG avec des fonctionnalités telles que des flux de travail de débogage, des tests avec des modèles spécifiques et une vérification de benchmark YAML pour les problèmes courants, en utilisant des scripts tels que show_full_prompt.sh et des commandes telles que ailang eval-suite.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, AILANG-Evaluierungsbenchmarks mit Funktionen wie Debugging-Workflows, Tests mit spezifischen Modellen und Überprüfung von Benchmark-YAML auf gängige Probleme zu verwalten, indem Skripte wie show_full_prompt.sh und Befehle wie ailang eval-suite verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar benchmarks de avaliação AILANG com recursos como fluxos de trabalho de depuração, testes com modelos específicos e verificação de benchmark YAML para problemas comuns, utilizando scripts como show_full_prompt.sh e comandos como ailang eval-suite.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять оценкойbenchmark AILANG с функциями, такими как отладка рабочих процессов, тестирование с определенными моделями и проверка benchmark YAML на общие проблемы, используя скрипты, такие как show_full_prompt.sh и команды, такие как ailang eval-suite.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إدارة تقييم برنامج AILANG مع ميزات مثل تدفقات العمل لاستكشاف الأخطاء واختبار النماذج المحددة وفحص برنامج YAML للتقييم للقضايا الشائعة، باستخدام سكريبتات مثل show_full_prompt.sh وأوامر مثل ailang eval-suite."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging failing benchmarks with show_full_prompt.sh","Testing benchmarks with specific models like claude-haiku-4-5","Checking benchmark YAML for common issues to ensure best practices"],"zh":["使用show_full_prompt.sh调试失败的基准","使用claude-haiku-4-5等特定模型测试基准","检查基准YAML以确保最佳实践"],"ja":["show_full_prompt.shを使用して失敗したベンチマークをデバッグする","claude-haiku-4-5などの特定のモデルを使用してベンチマークをテストする","ベンチマークYAMLをチェックしてベストプラクティスを確保する"],"ko":["show_full_prompt.sh를 사용하여 실패한 벤치마크를 디버깅한다","claude-haiku-4-5와 같은 특정 모델을 사용하여 벤치마크를 테스트한다","베ンチ마크 YAML을 확인하여 최선의 관행을 보장한다"],"es":["Depuración de benchmarks con errores con show_full_prompt.sh","Pruebas de benchmarks con modelos específicos como claude-haiku-4-5","Verificación de benchmark YAML para problemas comunes para asegurar las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Débogage de benchmarks défaillants avec show_full_prompt.sh","Tests de benchmarks avec des modèles spécifiques comme claude-haiku-4-5","Vérification de benchmark YAML pour les problèmes courants pour assurer les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Fehlerhafte Benchmarks mit show_full_prompt.sh debuggen","Benchmarks mit spezifischen Modellen wie claude-haiku-4-5 testen","Benchmark-YAML auf gängige Probleme überprüfen, um die besten Praktiken sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Depuração de benchmarks com falha com show_full_prompt.sh","Testar benchmarks com modelos específicos como claude-haiku-4-5","Verificar benchmark YAML para problemas comuns para garantir as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Отладка неудавшихся оценок с помощью show_full_prompt.sh","Тестирование оценок с определенными моделями, такими как claude-haiku-4-5","Проверка benchmark YAML на общие проблемы, чтобы обеспечить лучшие практики"],"ar":["استكشاف الأخطاء في تقييمات الفشل مع show_full_prompt.sh","اختبار تقييمات مع نماذج محددة مثل claude-haiku-4-5","فحص تقييم YAML للقضايا الشائعة لضمان أفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AILANG evaluation benchmarks setup","Limited to specific models like claude-haiku-4-5 for testing"],"zh":["需要AILANG评估基准设置","仅限于claude-haiku-4-5等特定模型进行测试"],"ja":["AILANG評価ベンチマークの設定が必要","テストはclaude-haiku-4-5などの特定のモデルに限定される"],"ko":["AILANG 평가 벤치마크 설정이 필요하다","테스트는 claude-haiku-4-5와 같은 특정 모델로 제한된다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de benchmarks de evaluación de AILANG","Limitado a modelos específicos como claude-haiku-4-5 para pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de benchmarks d''évaluation AILANG","Limité à des modèles spécifiques comme claude-haiku-4-5 pour les tests"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von AILANG-Evaluierungsbenchmarks","Begrenzt auf spezifische Modelle wie claude-haiku-4-5 für Tests"],"pt":["Requer configuração de benchmarks de avaliação AILANG","Limitado a modelos específicos como claude-haiku-4-5 para testes"],"ru":["Требует настройки оценкиbenchmark AILANG","Ограничен определенными моделями, такими как claude-haiku-4-5, для тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تقييم برنامج AILANG","محدود بنماذج محددة مثل claude-haiku-4-5 للاختبار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"80c84d94abd5dd3a14c219e4ecb955a6dd5aa25e2626fbd5b4e8a4001174a5f8","qualityScore":48}');
