":["Comunicación ROS 2 sin entorno ROS2","SDK de Python para ROS 2","Integración con Zenoh","Uso efectivo de ROS 2","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Communication ROS 2 sans environnement ROS2","SDK Python pour ROS 2","Intégration avec Zenoh","Utilisation efficace de ROS 2","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Kommunikation ROS 2 ohne ROS2-Umgebung","Python-SDK für ROS 2","Integration mit Zenoh","Effektive Verwendung von ROS 2","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações ROS 2 sem ambiente ROS2","Utilização do Python SDK via Zenoh","Criação de exemplos e projetos com ROS 2","Integração com outros frameworks e bibliotecas","Suporte a múltiplos sistemas operacionais"],"ru":["Разработка приложений ROS 2 без среды ROS2","Использование Python SDK через Zenoh","Создание примеров и проектов с ROS 2","Интеграция с другими фреймворками и библиотеками","Поддержка нескольких операционных систем"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات ROS 2 بدون بيئة ROS2","استخدام SDK بايثون عبر Zenoh","إنشاء أمثلة ومشاريع مع ROS 2","التكامل مع إطارات عمل وиблиوتيكات أخرى","دعم أنظمة تشغيل متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Create Example","什么是ROS 2通信","Create Example安装","Create Example设置指南","ROS 2通信教程","Python SDK使用","Zenoh数据传输","Create Example替代品","Create Example vs ROS2"],"ja":["Create Exampleの使用方法","ROS 2通信とは","Create Exampleのインストール","Create Exampleの設定ガイド","ROS 2通信チュートリアル","Python SDKの使用","Zenohデータ転送","Create Exampleの代替","Create Example vs ROS2"],"ko":["Create Example 사용 방법","ROS 2 통신이란","Create Example 설치","Create Example 설정 가이드","ROS 2 통신 튜토리얼","Python SDK 사용","Zenoh 데이터 전송","Create Example 대체","Create Example vs ROS2"],"es":["ROS 2","Zenoh","SDK de Python","Agente de inteligencia artificial","Cómo utilizar ROS 2","ROS 2 vs ROS","Instalación de ROS 2","Guía de configuración de ROS 2"],"fr":["ROS 2","Zenoh","SDK Python","Agent IA","Comment utiliser ROS 2","ROS 2 vs ROS","Installation de ROS 2","Guide de configuration de ROS 2"],"de":["ROS 2","Zenoh","Python-SDK","KI-Agent","Wie man ROS 2 verwendet","ROS 2 vs ROS","Installation von ROS 2","Konfigurationsanleitung für ROS 2"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","python sdk para ros 2","desenvolvimento de aplicações ros 2","zenoh","ros 2 sem ambiente ros2","criar exemplos com python","guias de instalação do python sdk","alternativas ao ros2"],"ru":["ии агенты","python sdk для ros 2","разработка приложений ros 2","zenoh","ros 2 без среды ros2","создание примеров с python","руководства по установке python sdk","альтернативы ros2"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","python sdk لros 2","تطوير تطبيقات ros 2","zenoh","ros 2 بدون بيئة ros2","إنشاء أمثلة باستخدام بايثون","دلائل تركيب python sdk","بديلات ros2"]}},"owner":"ROBOTIS-GIT","repo":"zenoh_ros2_sdk","repoPath":"ROBOTIS-GIT/zenoh_ros2_sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.936Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-example","description":"Create new publish/subscribe examples for ROS2 message types. Use when the user wants to add a new example, create pub/sub for a new message type, or add trajectory/sensor/geometry message examples.","bodyPreview":"# Create Example\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new example for a message type\n- User wants to create publisher/subscriber for a new ROS2 message\n- Adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, or other message types\n\n## Project Structure\n\nExamples are in `examples/` with numbered filenames:\n- Odd numbers: publishers (e.g., `11_publish_*.py`)\n- Even numbers: subscribers (e.g., `12_subscribe_","body":"# Create Example\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new example for a message type\n- User wants to create publisher/subscriber for a new ROS2 message\n- Adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, or other message types\n\n## Project Structure\n\nExamples are in `examples/` with numbered filenames:\n- Odd numbers: publishers (e.g., `11_publish_*.py`)\n- Even numbers: subscribers (e.g., `12_subscribe_*.py`)\n\n## 1. Determine Next Example Numbers\n\nCheck existing examples in `examples/` directory. Use the next available odd number for publisher, next even for subscriber.\n\n## 2. Look Up Message Definition\n\nFind the ROS2 message definition. Key resources:\n- https://docs.ros2.org/foxy/api/{package}/msg/{MessageName}.html\n- Common packages: `std_msgs`, `geometry_msgs`, `sensor_msgs`, `trajectory_msgs`, `nav_msgs`\n\n## 3. Publisher Template\n\nCreate `examples/{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n{NN} - Publish {MessageName} Messages\n\nDemonstrates how to publish {package}/msg/{MessageName} messages to a ROS2 topic.\n{Brief description of what this message type is used for.}\n\"\"\"\nimport time\nimport numpy as np\n\nfrom zenoh_ros2_sdk import ROS2Publisher, get_message_class\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"{NN} - Publish {MessageName} Messages\")\n    print(\"Publishing to /{topic_name} topic...\\n\")\n\n    # Get message classes for easy object creation\n    Header = get_message_class(\"std_msgs/msg/Header\")\n    Time = get_message_class(\"builtin_interfaces/msg/Time\")\n    {MessageName} = get_message_class(\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\")\n    # Add nested message classes as needed\n\n    if not all([Header, Time, {MessageName}]):\n        print(\"Error: Failed to get message classes\")\n        return\n\n    # Create publisher\n    pub = ROS2Publisher(\n        topic=\"/{topic_name}\",\n        msg_type=\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\"\n    )\n\n    try:\n        print(\"Publishing {MessageName} messages...\")\n        print(\"Press Ctrl+C to stop\\n\")\n\n        counter = 0\n        while True:\n            # Get current time\n            now = time.time()\n            sec = int(now)\n            nanosec = int((now - sec) * 1e9)\n\n            # Create header with timestamp\n            header = Header(\n                stamp=Time(sec=sec, nanosec=nanosec),\n                frame_id=\"base_link\"\n            )\n\n            # Create and populate message fields\n            # Note: Arrays need to be numpy arrays for proper serialization\n\n            # Publish message - pass fields as kwargs matching message structure\n            pub.publish(\n                header=header,\n                # ... other fields\n            )\n\n            print(f\"Published {MessageName} {counter}\")\n            counter += 1\n            time.sleep(0.1)  # 10 Hz\n\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nInterrupted by user\")\n    finally:\n        pub.close()\n        print(\"Publisher closed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 4. Subscriber Template\n\nCreate `examples/{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n{NN+1} - Subscribe to {MessageName} Messages\n\nDemonstrates how to subscribe to a ROS2 topic and receive {package}/msg/{MessageName} messages.\n{Brief description of what this message type is used for.}\n\"\"\"\nimport time\n\nfrom zenoh_ros2_sdk import ROS2Subscriber\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"{NN+1} - Subscribe to {MessageName} Messages\")\n    print(\"Subscribing to /{topic_name} topic...\\n\")\n\n    message_count = [0]  # Use list to allow modification in nested function\n\n    def on_message(msg):\n        \"\"\"Callback function called when a {MessageName} message is received.\"\"\"\n        message_count[0] += 1\n\n        # Extract information from the message\n        timestamp = msg.header.stamp\n        frame_id = msg.header.frame_id\n        # ... extract other fields\n\n        # Display received data\n        print(f\"\\n--- {MessageName} Message #{message_count[0]} ---\")\n        print(f\"Timestamp: {timestamp.sec}.{timestamp.nanosec:09d}\")\n        print(f\"Frame ID: {frame_id}\")\n        # ... print other fields\n\n    # Create subscriber\n    sub = ROS2Subscriber(\n        topic=\"/{topic_name}\",\n        msg_type=\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\",\n        callback=on_message\n    )\n\n    try:\n        print(\"Waiting for {MessageName} messages... Press Ctrl+C to stop\")\n        while True:\n            time.sleep(0.1)\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nInterrupted by user\")\n    finally:\n        sub.close()\n        print(\"Subscriber closed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 5. Update README\n\nAdd entries to `examples/README.md`:\n\n```markdown\n### [`{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py`]({NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py)\nDemonstrates how to publish `{package}/msg/{MessageName}` messages. {Description}.\n\n**Usage:**\n\\```bash\npython3 examples/{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py\n\\```\n\n### [`{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py`]({NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py)\nDemonstrates how to subscribe to `{package}/msg/{MessageName}` messages. {Description}.\n\n**Usage:**\n\\```bash\npython3 examples/{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py\n\\```\n```\n\n## 6. Key Patterns\n\n### Arrays\nUse numpy arrays for proper CDR serialization:\n```python\npositions = np.array([0.0, 0.1, 0.2], dtype=np.float64)\n```\n\n### Nested Messages\nGet nested message classes and construct them:\n```python\nPoint = get_message_class(\"trajectory_msgs/msg/JointTrajectoryPoint\")\nDuration = get_message_class(\"builtin_interfaces/msg/Duration\")\n\npoint = Point(\n    positions=np.array([0.0, 0.1], dtype=np.float64),\n    time_from_start=Duration(sec=1, nanosec=0)\n)\n```\n\n### Common Topic Names\n- `/joint_states` - JointState\n- `/cmd_vel` - Twist\n- `/joint_trajectory` - JointTrajectory\n- `/odom` - Odometry\n- `/tf` - TransformStamped\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:34:52.284Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for ROS 2 Development Agents needing seamless Zenoh communication via Python SDK","zh":"非常适合需要通过Python SDK实现ROS 2开发代理与Zenoh无缝通信的场景","ja":"ROS 2開発エージェントがPython SDKを介してZenohとシームレスに通信する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"Python SDK를 통해 Zenoh와의無縫 통신이 필요한 ROS 2 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de ROS 2 que necesitan una comunicación Zenoh sin problemas a través de Python SDK","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ROS 2 nécessitant une communication Zenoh transparente via Python SDK","de":"Perfekt für ROS 2-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Zenoh-Kommunikation über Python SDK benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do ROS 2 que precisam de uma comunicação Zenoh sem problemas via Python SDK","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки ROS 2, которым требуется бесперебойная связь Zenoh через Python SDK","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية ROS 2 الذين يحتاجون إلى اتصال Zenoh بدون مشاكل عبر Python SDK"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create publish/subscribe examples for various ROS2 message types, including trajectory, sensor, and geometry, using the zenoh-ros2-sdk, facilitating efficient communication without a ROS2 environment","zh":"赋予代理创建各种ROS2消息类型（包括轨迹、传感器和几何）的发布/订阅示例的能力，使用zenoh-ros2-sdk，无需ROS2环境即可实现高效的通信","ja":"エージェントがzenoh-ros2-sdkを使用して、トラジェクトリ、センサー、幾何学などのさまざまなROS2メッセージタイプのパブリッシュ/サブスクライブの例を作成できるようにし、ROS2環境を必要とせずに効率的な通信を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 zenoh-ros2-sdk를 사용하여 다양한 ROS2 메시지 유형(트라젝토리, 센서, 기하학 등)의 发布/订阅 예를 만들 수 있도록 하여, ROS2 환경 없이 효율적인 통신을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ejemplos de publicación/suscripción para varios tipos de mensajes ROS2, incluyendo trayectoria, sensor y geometría, utilizando el zenoh-ros2-sdk, lo que facilita una comunicación eficiente sin un entorno ROS2","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des exemples de publication/abonnement pour différents types de messages ROS2, notamment la trajectoire, le capteur et la géométrie, en utilisant le zenoh-ros2-sdk, ce qui facilite une communication efficace sans environnement ROS2","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Veröffentlichungs-/Abonnentenbeispiele für verschiedene ROS2-Nachrichtentypen zu erstellen, einschließlich Traektorie, Sensor und Geometrie, unter Verwendung des zenoh-ros2-sdk, was eine effiziente Kommunikation ohne ROS2-Umgebung erleichtert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar exemplos de publicação/assinatura para vários tipos de mensagens ROS2, incluindo trajetória, sensor e geometria, usando o zenoh-ros2-sdk, facilitando a comunicação eficiente sem um ambiente ROS2","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать примеры публикации/подписки для различных типов сообщений ROS2, включая траекторию, датчик и геометрию, используя zenoh-ros2-sdk, обеспечивая эффективную связь без среды ROS2","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء أمثلة لنشر/اشتراك لمختلف أنواع رسائل ROS2، بما في ذلك المسار والمتحسس والهندسة، باستخدام zenoh-ros2-sdk، وتسهيل الاتصال الفعال دون بيئة ROS2"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating publisher/subscriber examples for custom ROS2 messages","Adding support for new message types","Generating numbered example files for organized project structure"],"zh":["为自定义ROS2消息创建发布者/订阅者示例","添加对新消息类型的支持","为有组织的项目结构生成编号示例文件"],"ja":["カスタムROS2メッセージのパブリッシュ/サブスクライブの例を作成する","新しいメッセージタイプをサポートする","整理されたプロジェクト構造のために番号付きの例ファイルを生成する"],"ko":["사용자 정의 ROS2 메시지에 대한 발행자/구독자 예제 생성","새로운 메시지 유형 지원 추가","조직화된 프로젝트 구조를 위한 번호가 붙은 예제 파일 생성"],"es":["Crear ejemplos de publicador/suscriptor para mensajes personalizados de ROS2","Agregar soporte para nuevos tipos de mensajes","Generar archivos de ejemplo numerados para una estructura de proyecto organizada"],"fr":["Créer des exemples d''éditeur/abonné pour des messages ROS2 personnalisés","Ajouter une prise en charge de nouveaux types de messages","Générer des fichiers d''exemple numérotés pour une structure de projet organisée"],"de":["Erstellen von Veröffentlichungs-/Abonnentenbeispielen für benutzerdefinierte ROS2-Nachrichten","Hinzufügen von Unterstützung für neue Nachrichtentypen","Erzeugen von nummerierten Beispieldateien für eine organisierte Projektstruktur"],"pt":["Criar exemplos de publicador/assinante para mensagens ROS2 personalizadas","Adicionar suporte para novos tipos de mensagens","Gerar arquivos de exemplo numerados para estrutura de projeto organizada"],"ru":["Создание примеров издателя/подписчика для пользовательских сообщений ROS2","Добавление поддержки новых типов сообщений","Генерация пронумерованных файлов примеров для организованной структуры проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء أمثلة لمشترك/ناشر لرسائل ROS2 مخصصة","إضافة دعم لأنواع رسائل جديدة","توليد ملفات مثال مرقمة لهيكل مشروع منظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python SDK for ROS 2 communication via Zenoh","Limited to ROS2 message types"],"zh":["需要Python SDK才能通过Zenoh实现ROS 2通信","仅限ROS2消息类型"],"ja":["Zenohを介してROS 2と通信するにはPython SDKが必要","ROS2メッセージタイプのみ"],"ko":["Zenoh를 통해 ROS 2와 통신하려면 Python SDK가 필요","ROS2 메시지 유형만"],"es":["Requiere Python SDK para la comunicación ROS 2 a través de Zenoh","Limitado a los tipos de mensajes ROS2"],"fr":["Nécessite Python SDK pour la communication ROS 2 via Zenoh","Limité aux types de messages ROS2"],"de":["Benötigt Python SDK für die ROS 2-Kommunikation über Zenoh","Begrenzt auf ROS2-Nachrichtentypen"],"pt":["Exige Python SDK para comunicação ROS 2 via Zenoh","Limitado a tipos de mensagens ROS2"],"ru":["Требует Python SDK для связи ROS 2 через Zenoh","Ограничен типами сообщений ROS2"],"ar":["يتطلب Python SDK للاتصال ROS 2 عبر Zenoh","محدود لأنواع رسائل ROS2"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"86ee95f45eb3c0c3f5b272e3116ec47660514ef689939c5054d8cff255be9e30","qualityScore":48}');
