r les performances","Intégration avec des outils de développement comme React et Node.js","Interface de ligne de commande (CLI) pour une gestion plus rapide"],"de":["Lebenszyklus-Unterstützung für AI-Tools","Kontexttrennung für eine effizientere Verwaltung","Evolutionäres Lernen für verbesserte Leistung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) für eine schnellere Verwaltung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de habilidades de AI","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Aprendizado evolutivo","Separação de contexto"],"ru":["Управление навыками и разработкой приложений","ИИ Агент для управления навыками","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Эволюционное обучение","Контекстное разделение"],"ar":["اداة إدارة الأعضاء الذكية","دعم للمطورين","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","التعلم التطوري","التقسيم السياسي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","项目日志管理","生命周期管理","上下文隔离","进化学习","如何使用项目日志器","项目日志器安装","项目日志器设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","プロジェクトログ管理","ライフサイクル管理","コンテキスト分離","進化的学習","プロジェクトロガーの使い方","プロジェクトロガーインストール","プロジェクトロガー設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프로젝트 로그 관리","라이프사이클 관리","컨텍스트 분리","진화학습","프로젝트 로거 사용법","프로젝트 로거 설치","프로젝트 로거 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar project-logger","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a project-logger","project-logger vs otros Agentes de IA","instalación de project-logger","guía de configuración de project-logger","desarrollo de habilidades de Agentes de IA","gestión de ciclo de vida de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser project-logger","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent IA","alternatives à project-logger","project-logger vs autres Agents IA","installation de project-logger","guide de configuration de project-logger","développement de compétences d''Agents IA","gestion de cycle de vie d''Agents IA"],"de":["wie man project-logger verwendet","was ist ein AI-Tool","alternativen zu project-logger","project-logger vs andere AI-Tools","installation von project-logger","konfigurationsanleitung für project-logger","entwicklung von AI-Tools","lebenszyklus-verwaltung von AI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar o project logger","o que é o project logger","project logger alternative","project logger vs outras ferramentas","instalar o project logger","guia de setup do project logger"],"ru":["как использовать project logger","что такое project logger","project logger alternative","project logger vs другие инструменты","установить project logger","руководство по настройке project logger"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Project Logger","ما هو Project Logger","Project Logger alternative","Project Logger vs الأخرى","تثبيت Project Logger","دليل إعداد Project Logger"]}},"owner":"dudusoar","repo":"skillOS","repoPath":"dudusoar/skillOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.940Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-logger","description":"Manages project progress tracking and maintains a chronological log of completed tasks, decisions, and updates. Use when completing milestones, making architectural decisions, or documenting project evolution. Creates and updates LOG.md file based on CLAUDE.md context.","bodyPreview":"# Project Logger\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill maintains a structured project log (LOG.md) that tracks progress, completed tasks, decisions, and important updates. It reads CLAUDE.md to understand project context and creates timestamped entries documenting the project''s evolution.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Completing a significant task or milestone\n- Making important architectural or technical decisions\n- Encountering and resolving issues\n- Adding new features or capabilities","body":"# Project Logger\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill maintains a structured project log (LOG.md) that tracks progress, completed tasks, decisions, and important updates. It reads CLAUDE.md to understand project context and creates timestamped entries documenting the project''s evolution.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Completing a significant task or milestone\n- Making important architectural or technical decisions\n- Encountering and resolving issues\n- Adding new features or capabilities\n- Updating project dependencies or configuration\n- Need to review project history\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Locate CLAUDE.md\n\nFind and read the project''s CLAUDE.md file to understand:\n- Project name and goals\n- Current phase and milestones\n- Technical architecture\n- Known issues\n\nDefault location: `./.claude/CLAUDE.md`\n\n### Step 2: Determine Log Entry Type\n\nIdentify what type of entry to create:\n\n**Task Completion:**\n- Feature implemented\n- Bug fixed\n- Refactoring completed\n- Tests added\n\n**Decision:**\n- Architectural choice made\n- Technology/library selected\n- Design pattern adopted\n- Convention established\n\n**Update:**\n- Dependency upgraded\n- Configuration changed\n- Documentation updated\n- Milestone reached\n\n**Issue:**\n- Problem encountered\n- Workaround applied\n- Known limitation documented\n\n### Step 3: Create or Update LOG.md\n\nCheck if LOG.md exists in `.claude/` directory:\n\n**If LOG.md doesn''t exist:**\n- Create it using the template in `references/log_template.md`\n- Add project header with name from CLAUDE.md\n- Create first entry\n\n**If LOG.md exists:**\n- Read existing content\n- Add new entry at the top (reverse chronological order)\n- Preserve existing entries\n\n### Step 4: Format Log Entry\n\nEach entry should include:\n\n```markdown\n## YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\n\n### [TYPE] Title\n\n**Context:** Brief explanation of why this happened\n\n**What Changed:**\n- Specific change 1\n- Specific change 2\n- Specific change 3\n\n**Impact:**\n- How this affects the project\n- Any breaking changes\n- Follow-up actions needed\n\n**Related:**\n- Links to commits, PRs, or issues (if applicable)\n- References to relevant files or documentation\n```\n\n**Entry Types:**\n- `[FEAT]` - New feature\n- `[FIX]` - Bug fix\n- `[DECISION]` - Architectural/technical decision\n- `[REFACTOR]` - Code refactoring\n- `[DOCS]` - Documentation update\n- `[DEPS]` - Dependency update\n- `[CONFIG]` - Configuration change\n- `[MILESTONE]` - Milestone reached\n- `[ISSUE]` - Problem or limitation\n\n### Step 5: Add Entry Example\n\n**Good entry:**\n```markdown\n## 2025-12-30 15:30\n\n### [FEAT] Added skill-analyzer meta-skill\n\n**Context:** Need automated skill selection when starting projects. Manual skill\ndiscovery is time-consuming and error-prone.\n\n**What Changed:**\n- Created skill-analyzer meta-skill in `.claude/skills/`\n- Implemented workflow to scan SkillOS library\n- Added skill matching heuristics based on project context\n- Updates CLAUDE.md sections 5 (Available Skills) and 6 (Missing Skills)\n\n**Impact:**\n- Automates skill selection for new projects\n- Identifies gaps requiring project-specific skills\n- Completes the project setup workflow (works with project-context-generator)\n\n**Related:**\n- Commit: b27c2ea\n- Files: `.claude/skills/skill-analyzer/SKILL.md`\n```\n\n**Avoid vague entries:**\n```markdown\n## 2025-12-30\n\nUpdated some files.\n```\n\n### Step 6: Update Maintenance Notes in CLAUDE.md\n\nAfter logging, optionally update the \"Maintenance Notes\" section in CLAUDE.md:\n- Update \"Last Updated\" date\n- Add entry to \"Recent Changes\"\n- Update \"Known Issues\" if relevant\n\n## Log Organization\n\n### Reverse Chronological Order\n\nMost recent entries appear first:\n```markdown\n# Project Log: SkillOS\n\n## 2025-12-30 16:00\n[Most recent]\n\n## 2025-12-30 14:00\n\n## 2025-12-29 10:00\n[Oldest at bottom]\n```\n\n### Grouping by Date\n\nFor multiple entries on the same day, use subheadings:\n```markdown\n## 2025-12-30\n\n### 16:00 - [FEAT] Added feature X\n...\n\n### 14:00 - [FIX] Fixed bug Y\n...\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Be Specific\n\n- Include file paths, function names, or specific components\n- Mention exact version numbers for dependencies\n- Reference commits, PRs, or issues\n\n### Explain \"Why\"\n\n- Document the rationale behind decisions\n- Explain trade-offs considered\n- Note what alternatives were rejected\n\n### Track Impact\n\n- Note what breaks (breaking changes)\n- Identify follow-up work needed\n- Update known issues\n\n### Regular Updates\n\n- Log after completing significant work\n- Don''t batch too many changes into one entry\n- Update while details are fresh\n\n## Example LOG.md Structure\n\nSee `references/log_template.md` for the complete template and examples.\n\n## Resources\n\n### references/log_template.md\n\nTemplate for creating LOG.md files with:\n- Header structure\n- Entry format examples\n- Best practices\n- Sample entries for different types\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:37:42.602Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing structured project management and logging capabilities.","zh":"适合需要结构化项目管理和日志记录功能的AI代理，如Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの構造化されたプロジェクト管理とログ記録機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 구조화된 프로젝트 관리 및 로깅 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan gestión de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de registro.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une gestion de projet structurée et de fonctionnalités de journalisation.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine strukturierte Projektverwaltung und Protokollfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de gestão de projetos estruturada e capacidades de registro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы структурированное управление проектами и возможности ведения журнала.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مشروع منظمة وقدرات تسجيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a comprehensive project log, utilizing context separation and evolutionary learning by reading CLAUDE.md files and creating timestamped entries in LOG.md, thereby enhancing project transparency and accountability through Markdown-based documentation.","zh":"赋予代理维护综合项目日志的能力，利用上下文分离和进化学习，通过读取CLAUDE.md文件并在LOG.md中创建时间戳条目，从而通过基于Markdown的文档提高项目透明度和责任感。","ja":"エージェントに包括的なプロジェクトログを維持する機能を提供し、コンテキストの分離と進化的な学習を利用して、CLAUDE.mdファイルを読み取り、LOG.mdにタイムスタンプ付きのエントリを作成することで、Markdownベースのドキュメントを介してプロジェクトの透明性と説明責任を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 프로젝트 로그를 유지하도록 하는 기능을 제공하며, 문脈 분리 및 진화적 학습을 통해 CLAUDE.md 파일을 읽고 LOG.md에 타임스탬프가 있는 항목을 생성하여 마크다운 기반 문서를 통해 프로젝트 투명성 및 책임성을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes mantener un registro de proyecto integral, utilizando la separación de contexto y el aprendizaje evolutivo mediante la lectura de archivos CLAUDE.md y la creación de entradas con marca de tiempo en LOG.md, mejorando así la transparencia y la responsabilidad del proyecto a través de la documentación basada en Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir un journal de projet complet, en utilisant la séparation de contexte et l''apprentissage évolutif en lisant les fichiers CLAUDE.md et en créant des entrées avec horodatage dans LOG.md, améliorant ainsi la transparence et la responsabilité du projet grâce à la documentation basée sur Markdown.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, ein umfassendes Projektprotokoll zu führen, indem es Kontexttrennung und evolutionäres Lernen durch das Lesen von CLAUDE.md-Dateien und das Erstellen von Zeitstempel-Einträgen in LOG.md nutzt, wodurch die Projekttransparenz und -verantwortung durch Markdown-basierte Dokumentation verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter um registro de projeto abrangente, utilizando separação de contexto e aprendizado evolutivo por meio da leitura de arquivos CLAUDE.md e criação de entradas com carimbo de data/hora em LOG.md, melhorando assim a transparência e a responsabilidade do projeto por meio da documentação baseada em Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вести всесторонний журнал проекта, используя разделение контекста и эволюционное обучение путем чтения файлов CLAUDE.md и создания помеченных временными метками записей в LOG.md, тем самым повышая прозрачность и подотчетность проекта посредством документации на основе Markdown.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من الحفاظ على سجل مشروع شامل، باستخدام فصل السياق والتعلم التطوري عن طريق قراءة ملفات CLAUDE.md وإنشاء إدخالات مع توقيع زمني في LOG.md، مما يعزز من خلال ذلك شفافية المشروع ومسؤوليته من خلال توثيق يعتمد على Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting significant task completions","Recording architectural decisions and updates","Tracking issue resolutions and new feature additions"],"zh":["记录重要任务的完成情况","记录架构决策和更新","跟踪问题解决和新功能添加"],"ja":["重要なタスクの完了をドキュメント化する","アーキテクチャの決定と更新を記録する","問題の解決と新機能の追加を追跡する"],"ko":["중요한 작업 완료를 문서화하는 것","아키텍처 결정 및 업데이트를 기록하는 것","문제 해결 및 새로운 기능 추가를 추적하는 것"],"es":["Documentar la finalización de tareas significativas","Registrar decisiones arquitectónicas y actualizaciones","Seguir la resolución de problemas y la adición de nuevas características"],"fr":["Documenter l''achèvement de tâches importantes","Enregistrer les décisions architecturales et les mises à jour","Suivre la résolution des problèmes et l''ajout de nouvelles fonctionnalités"],"de":["Die Fertigstellung wichtiger Aufgaben dokumentieren","Architekturentscheidungen und -aktualisierungen aufzeichnen","Die Lösung von Problemen und die Hinzufügung neuer Funktionen verfolgen"],"pt":["Documentar conclusões de tarefas significativas","Registrar decisões arquiteturais e atualizações","Acompanhar resoluções de problemas e adições de novos recursos"],"ru":["Документировать значимые завершения задач","Записывать архитектурные решения и обновления","Отслеживать решения проблем и добавления новых функций"],"ar":["توثيق إكمال المهام المهمة","تسجيل قرارات التصميم المعماري والتحديثات","تتبع حلول المشكلات وإضافات الميزات الجديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to CLAUDE.md and LOG.md files","Dependent on agent''s ability to read and write Markdown files"],"zh":["需要访问CLAUDE.md和LOG.md文件","依赖于代理的Markdown文件读写能力"],"ja":["CLAUDE.mdおよびLOG.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","エージェントのMarkdownファイルの読み書き能力に依存する"],"ko":["CLAUDE.md 및 LOG.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","에이전트의 마크다운 파일 읽기/쓰기 능력에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos CLAUDE.md y LOG.md","Depende de la capacidad del agente para leer y escribir archivos Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers CLAUDE.md et LOG.md","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à lire et écrire des fichiers Markdown"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf die Dateien CLAUDE.md und LOG.md","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, Markdown-Dateien zu lesen und zu schreiben"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos CLAUDE.md e LOG.md","Depende da capacidade do agente de ler e escrever arquivos Markdown"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам CLAUDE.md и LOG.md","Зависит от способности агента читать и записывать файлы Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات CLAUDE.md و LOG.md","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على قراءة وكتابة ملفات Markdown"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a92d3fb70b0a7cc0206e858848e714e4f61764c3448105b6ef00d4fd7e07d7a4","qualityScore":48}');
