 verwendet","was ist ein KI-Tool","add-helm-chart Alternative","SignalBeam Edge vs Wettbewerber","Installation von add-helm-chart","Einrichtungsanleitung für add-helm-chart"],"pt":["como usar SignalBeam Edge","o que é add-helm-chart","SignalBeam Edge alternativa","SignalBeam Edge vs competitors","instalar SignalBeam Edge","guia de configuração SignalBeam Edge","adicionar gráficos Helm","dispositivos de edge","contêineres"],"ru":["как использовать SignalBeam Edge","что такое добавление графика Helm","SignalBeam Edge альтернатива","SignalBeam Edge vs конкуренты - ИИ Агенты","установить SignalBeam Edge","руководство по настройке SignalBeam Edge","добавить графики Helm","устройства Edge","контейнеры"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام SignalBeam Edge","ما هو إضافة مخطط Helm","SignalBeam Edge بديل","SignalBeam Edge مقابل المنافسين - أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت SignalBeam Edge","دليل إعداد SignalBeam Edge","إضافة مخططات Helm","أجهزة الحافة","الحاويات"]}},"owner":"signalbeam-io","repo":"signalbeam-edge","repoPath":"signalbeam-io/signalbeam-edge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.979Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-helm-chart","description":"Scaffold a new Helm chart with standard templates and values","bodyPreview":"# Add Helm Chart\n\nScaffold a new Helm chart following project conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `{chart-name}` — Name of the chart (required, e.g., `signalbeam-platform`, `device-manager`)\n\n## Process\n\n1. Create the chart directory structure under `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/`:\n\n```\ndeploy/charts/{chart-name}/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   ├── configmap.yaml\n│   ├── ingress.yaml\n│   └── hpa.yaml\n```\n\n2. Read `.clau","body":"# Add Helm Chart\n\nScaffold a new Helm chart following project conventions.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `{chart-name}` — Name of the chart (required, e.g., `signalbeam-platform`, `device-manager`)\n\n## Process\n\n1. Create the chart directory structure under `deploy/charts/{chart-name}/`:\n\n```\ndeploy/charts/{chart-name}/\n├── Chart.yaml\n├── values.yaml\n├── templates/\n│   ├── _helpers.tpl\n│   ├── deployment.yaml\n│   ├── service.yaml\n│   ├── configmap.yaml\n│   ├── ingress.yaml\n│   └── hpa.yaml\n```\n\n2. Read `.claude/rules/helm-charts.md` for project conventions.\n\n3. Generate files following these conventions:\n   - Namespace: `signalbeam`\n   - Standard Kubernetes labels: `app.kubernetes.io/name`, `app.kubernetes.io/instance`, `app.kubernetes.io/version`\n   - Health check paths: `/health/live` (liveness), `/health/ready` (readiness)\n   - Resource limits and requests with sensible defaults\n   - HPA with min 1, max 3 replicas\n\n4. **Chart.yaml** template:\n```yaml\napiVersion: v2\nname: {chart-name}\ndescription: {description}\ntype: application\nversion: 0.1.0\nappVersion: \"0.1.0\"\n```\n\n5. **values.yaml** — Include configurable values for:\n   - `image.repository`, `image.tag`, `image.pullPolicy`\n   - `replicaCount`\n   - `resources.requests` and `resources.limits`\n   - `service.type`, `service.port`\n   - `ingress.enabled`, `ingress.hosts`\n   - `env` (environment variables as key-value map)\n\n6. Validate the chart:\n```bash\nhelm lint deploy/charts/{chart-name}\nhelm template test deploy/charts/{chart-name} > /dev/null\n```\n\n## After Scaffolding\n\nReport what was created and remind to:\n- Customize `values.yaml` for the specific service\n- Add environment-specific value overrides if needed\n- Update any umbrella chart dependencies if applicable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:56:06.432Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents needing streamlined Helm chart creation and management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Helm图表创建和管理的Kubernetes专注的AI代理。","ja":"Kubernetesに特化したAIエージェントがHelmチャートの作成と管理を簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Kubernetes에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 Helm 차트 생성 및 관리를 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en Kubernetes que necesitan crear y administrar gráficos de Helm de forma simplificada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur Kubernetes nécessitant une création et une gestion de graphiques Helm rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für kubernetes-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Helm-Chart-Erstellung und -Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA focados em Kubernetes que necessitam de criação e gestão de gráficos Helm simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Kubernetes, которым необходима упрощенная создание и управление диаграммами Helm.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتمحور حول كوبيرنتس الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء مخططات هلم وتحكم مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to scaffold new Helm charts following project conventions, leveraging YAML templates and directory structures for efficient deployment and management of edge devices, such as those running on Raspberry Pis with containers, utilizing protocols like SSH and file formats including Chart.yaml and values.yaml.","zh":"赋予代理人创建新的Helm图表的能力，遵循项目约定，利用YAML模板和目录结构，实现边缘设备（如在Raspberry Pis上运行的容器）的高效部署和管理，使用像SSH这样的协议和包括Chart.yaml和values.yaml在内的文件格式。","ja":"プロジェクトの規約に従って新しいHelmチャートを作成するエージェントを可能にします。YAMLテンプレートとディレクトリ構造を使用して、Raspberry Pisで実行されているコンテナなどのエッジデバイスを効率的にデプロイして管理します。SSHなどのプロトコルと、Chart.yamlおよびvalues.yamlを含むファイル形式を使用します。","ko":"프로젝트 규약을 따라 새로운 Helm 차트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. YAML 템플릿과 디렉토리 구조를 사용하여 Raspberry Pis에서 실행되는 컨테이너와 같은 에지 디바이스를 효율적으로 배포하고 관리합니다. SSH와 같은 프로토콜 및 Chart.yaml 및 values.yaml를 포함한 파일 형식을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para crear nuevos gráficos de Helm siguiendo las convenciones del proyecto, aprovechando plantillas YAML y estructuras de directorios para una implementación y gestión eficientes de dispositivos periféricos, como aquellos que se ejecutan en Raspberry Pis con contenedores, utilizando protocolos como SSH y formatos de archivo que incluyen Chart.yaml y values.yaml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux graphiques Helm en suivant les conventions du projet, en exploitant des modèles YAML et des structures de répertoires pour un déploiement et une gestion efficaces des appareils périphériques, tels que ceux qui s''exécutent sur des Raspberry Pis avec des conteneurs, en utilisant des protocoles comme SSH et des formats de fichiers tels que Chart.yaml et values.yaml.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, neue Helm-Chart-Vorlagen nach Projektübereinstimmungen zu erstellen, indem YAML-Vorlagen und Verzeichnisstrukturen für eine effiziente Bereitstellung und Verwaltung von Edge-Geräten wie Raspberry Pis mit Containern genutzt werden, die Protokolle wie SSH und Dateiformate einschließlich Chart.yaml und values.yaml verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos gráficos Helm seguindo as convenções do projeto, utilizando modelos YAML e estruturas de diretório para implantação e gerenciamento eficientes de dispositivos de bordo, como aqueles que executam em Raspberry Pis com contêineres, utilizando protocolos como SSH e formatos de arquivo, incluindo Chart.yaml e values.yaml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые диаграммы Helm, следуя проектным конвенциям, используя шаблоны YAML и структуры каталогов для эффективного развертывания и управления устройствами края, такими как те, которые работают на Raspberry Pi с контейнерами, используя протоколы, такие как SSH, и форматы файлов, включая Chart.yaml и values.yaml.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء مخططات هلم جديدة متبعة للاتفاقيات المشروع، باستخدام قوالب YAML وهياكل الدليل لتحكم فعال في الأجهزة الحدية، مثل تلك التي تعمل على أجهزة راسبي باي مع حاويات، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل SSH وتنسيقات الملفات، بما في ذلك Chart.yaml و values.yaml."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Helm charts for edge device fleets","Automating Helm chart directory structure creation under deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Generating templated YAML files for deployment, service, and ingress configurations"],"zh":["为边缘设备群创建新的Helm图表","在deploy/charts/{chart-name}/下自动创建Helm图表目录结构","为部署、服务和入口配置生成模板化的YAML文件"],"ja":["エッジデバイスのフリート用に新しいHelmチャートを作成する","deploy/charts/{chart-name}/以下にHelmチャートのディレクトリ構造を自動的に作成する","デプロイ、サービス、イングレス構成用にテンプレート化されたYAMLファイルを生成する"],"ko":["에지 디바이스 그룹을 위한 새로운 Helm 차트 생성","deploy/charts/{chart-name}/以下에 Helm 차트 디렉토리 구조를 자동으로 생성","배포, 서비스, 인그레스 구성 등을 위한 템플릿화된 YAML 파일 생성"],"es":["Creación de nuevos gráficos de Helm para flotas de dispositivos periféricos","Automatización de la creación de la estructura de directorios de gráficos de Helm en deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Generación de archivos YAML con plantillas para configuraciones de implementación, servicio y entrada"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux graphiques Helm pour des flottes d''appareils périphériques","Automatisation de la création de la structure de répertoire de graphiques Helm dans deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Génération de fichiers YAML avec des modèles pour les configurations de déploiement, de service et d''entrée"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Helm-Chart-Vorlagen für Edge-Geräte-Flotten","Automatisierung der Erstellung der Helm-Chart-Verzeichnisstruktur unter deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Generierung von YAML-Dateien mit Vorlagen für Bereitstellungs-, Dienst- und Eingabe-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Criação de novos gráficos Helm para frotas de dispositivos de bordo","Automação da criação da estrutura de diretório do gráfico Helm em deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Geração de arquivos YAML modelados para configurações de implantação, serviço e entrada"],"ru":["Создание новых диаграмм Helm для флотов устройств края","Автоматизация создания структуры каталога диаграммы Helm в deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","Генерация шаблонных файлов YAML для конфигураций развертывания, службы и входа"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات هلم جديدة لأساطيل الأجهزة الحدية","أتمتة إنشاء هيكل دليل مخطط هلم في deploy/charts/{chart-name}/","توليد ملفات YAML القابلة للتحديث لتهيئة التوزيع والخدمة والمدخل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific chart name input ({chart-name})","Limited to Helm chart creation, not management or updates","Assumes familiarity with Kubernetes and Helm chart conventions"],"zh":["需要特定的图表名称输入({chart-name})","仅限Helm图表创建，不包括管理或更新","假设熟悉Kubernetes和Helm图表约定"],"ja":["特定のチャート名の入力({chart-name})が必要","Helmチャートの作成のみに限定され、管理や更新は含まれない","KubernetesおよびHelmチャートの規約の知識を前提としている"],"ko":["특정 차트 이름 입력({chart-name})이 필요","Helm 차트 생성만으로 제한되며, 관리 또는 업데이트 포함하지 않음","Kubernetes 및 Helm 차트 규약의 지식을 전제로 함"],"es":["Requiere una entrada de nombre de gráfico específico ({chart-name})","Limitado a la creación de gráficos de Helm, no a la administración o actualizaciones","Supone familiaridad con las convenciones de Kubernetes y Helm"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de nom de graphique spécifique ({chart-name})","Limité à la création de graphiques Helm, et non à la gestion ou aux mises à jour","Suppose une familiarité avec les conventions de Kubernetes et Helm"],"de":["Erfordert eine spezifische Chart-Nameneingabe ({chart-name})","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von Helm-Charts, nicht auf die Verwaltung oder Updates","Geht von der Vertrautheit mit Kubernetes- und Helm-Chart-Übereinstimmungen aus"],"pt":["Exige entrada de nome de gráfico específico ({chart-name})","Limitado à criação de gráficos Helm, não ao gerenciamento ou atualizações","Pressupõe familiaridade com convenções de Kubernetes e gráficos Helm"],"ru":["Требует ввода конкретного имени диаграммы ({chart-name})","Ограничен созданием диаграмм Helm, не их управлением или обновлениями","Предполагает знакомство с конвенциями Kubernetes и диаграммами Helm"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال اسم مخطط معين ({chart-name})","محدود بإنشاء مخططات هلم، وليس بإدارتها أو تحديثها","يفترض دراية بالاتفاقيات كوبيرنتس ومخططات هلم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5ed803b043efe64c05eea2a32ff0367551793db6a5a7a6b4548389748a3518d2","qualityScore":48}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ruvnet/agentic-flow/V3 Core Implementation', 'community', 'ruvnet', 'agentic-flow', 'ruvnet/agentic-flow', 'V3 Core Implementation', 0, 0, 48, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.004Z', '2026-03-02T03:06:29.113Z', 'b860599154fd2c1061cffec75fae01d2c0db1d01aa4bba8d2d4420053c28a83b', '{"id":"ruvnet/agentic-flow/V3 Core Implementation","name":"V3 Core Implementation","description":{"zh":"V3 Core实现允许您轻松切换低成本AI模型，并使用Claude Code和Agent SDK部署实用AI代理","ja":"V3 Core実装は低コストのAIモデルを簡単に切り替え、Claude CodeとAgent SDKを使用して実用的AIエージェントをデプロイ","ko":"V3 Core 구현은 저비용 AI 모델을 쉽게 전환하고 Claude Code 및 Agent SDK를 사용하여 실용적인 AI 에이전트를 배포","es":"La implementación de V3 Core permite cambiar fácilmente entre modelos de IA de bajo costo en Claude Code/Agent SDK","fr":"La mise en œuvre du noyau V3 permet de basculer facilement entre les modèles d''IA à faible coût dans Claude Code/Agent SDK","de":"Die Implementierung von V3 Core ermöglicht es, einfach zwischen KI-Modellen mit geringen Kosten in Claude Code/Agent SDK zu wechseln","pt":"A Implementação V3 Core permite a troca fácil entre modelos de IA de baixo custo no Claude Code/Agent SDK, para implantação de agentes hospedados para fins comerciais","ru":"V3 Core Реализация позволяет легко переключаться между альтернативными низкозатратными моделями ИИ в Claude Code/Agent SDK для развертывания полностью хостинговых агентов для реальных бизнес-целей","ar":"تنفيذ V3 Core يسمح بالتبديل السهل بين نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي منخفضة التكلفة في Claude Code/Agent SDK لنشر وكلاء مستضافين لأغراض تجارية حقيقية","en":"Easily switch between alternative low-cost AI models in Claude Code/Agent SDK. For those comfortable using Claude agents and commands, it lets you take what you''ve created and deploy fully hosted agents for real business purposes. Use Claude Code to get the agent working, then deploy it in your f..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理V3 Core实现","ja":"AIエージェントV3 Core実装","ko":"AI 에이전트 V3 Core 구현","es":"Implementación de V3 Core: Herramientas de Agentes de IA","fr":"Mise en œuvre du noyau V3: Outils d''agents d''IA","de":"V3-Core-Implementierung: KI-Agenten-Tools","pt":"Implementação V3 Core: Ferramentas de IA Agentes","ru":"V3 Core Реализация: ИИ Агенты для бизнеса","ar":"تنفيذ V3 Core: أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"V3 Core Implementation"},"description":{"zh":"V3 Core实现允许您轻松切换低成本AI模型，并使用Claude Code和Agent SDK部署实用AI代理","ja":"V3 Core実装は低コストのAIモデルを簡単に切り替え、Claude CodeとAgent SDKを使用して実用的AIエージェントをデプロイ","ko":"V3 Core 구현은 저비용 AI 모델을 쉽게 전환하고 Claude Code 및 Agent SDK를 사용하여 실용적인 AI 에이전트를 배포","es":"La implementación de V3 Core permite cambiar fácilmente entre modelos de IA de bajo costo en Claude Code/Agent SDK","fr":"La mise en œuvre du noyau V3 permet de basculer facilement entre les modèles d''IA à faible coût dans Claude Code/Agent SDK","de":"Die Implementierung von V3 Core ermöglicht es, einfach zwischen KI-Modellen mit geringen Kosten in Claude Code/Agent SDK zu wechseln","pt":"A Implementação V3 Core permite a troca fácil entre modelos de IA de baixo custo no Claude Code/Agent SDK, para implantação de agentes hospedados para fins c...","ru":"V3 Core Реализация позволяет легко переключаться между альтернативными низкозатратными моделями ИИ в Claude Code/Agent SDK для развертывания полностью хостин...","ar":"تنفيذ V3 Core يسمح بالتبديل السهل بين نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي منخفضة التكلفة في Claude Code/Agent SDK لنشر وكلاء مستضافين لأغراض تجارية حقيقية","en":"Easily switch between alternative low-cost AI models in Claude Code/Agent SDK. For those comfortable using Claude agents and commands, it lets you take what ..."},"definition":{"en":"Easily switch between alternative low-cost AI models in Claude Code/Agent SDK. For those comfortable using Claude agents and commands, it lets you take what you''ve created and deploy fully hosted agents for real business purposes. Use Claude Code to get the agent working, then deploy it in your favorite cloud."},"features":{"zh":["轻松切换低成本AI模型","使用Claude Code和Agent SDK部署实用AI代理","支持多云部署","简化AI模型管理","提高开发效率"],"ja":["低コストのAIモデルを簡単に切り替え","Claude CodeとAgent SDKを使用して実用的AIエージェントをデプロイ","マルチクラウドデプロイをサポート","AIモデル管理を簡素化","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["저비용 AI 모델을 쉽게 전환","Claude Code 및 Agent SDK를 사용하여 실용적인 AI 에이전트를 배포","다중 클라우드 배포를 지원","AI 모델 관리를 단순화","개발 효율성을 향상"],"es":["Cambio fácil entre modelos de IA de bajo costo","Despliegue de agentes de IA de manera sencilla","Integración con Claude Code y Agent SDK","Compatibilidad con diferentes nubes","Implementación de agentes de IA para fines comerciales"],"fr":["Basculage facile entre les modèles d''IA à faible coût","Déploiement d''agents d''IA de manière simple","Intégration avec Claude Code et Agent SDK","Compatibilité avec différents clouds","Mise en œuvre d''agents d''IA pour des fins commerciales"],"de":["Einfaches Wechseln zwischen KI-Modellen mit geringen Kosten","Bereitstellung von KI-Agents in einfacher Weise","Integration mit Claude Code und Agent SDK","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Clouds","Implementierung von KI-Agents für Geschäftszwecke"],"pt":["Troca fácil entre modelos de IA de baixo custo","Implantação de agentes hospedados para fins comerciais","Uso do Claude Code para criar e implantar agentes","Suporte a implantação em nuvem","Integração com o Agent SDK","Flexibilidade na escolha de modelos de IA"],"ru":["Легкое переключение между альтернативными низкозатратными моделями ИИ","Развертывание полностью хостинговых агентов для реальных бизнес-целей","Использование Claude Code для создания и развертывания агентов","Поддержка развертывания в облаке","Интеграция с Agent SDK","Гибкость в выборе моделей ИИ"],"ar":["تبديل سهل بين نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي منخفضة التكلفة","نشر وكلاء مستضافين لأغراض تجارية حقيقية","استخدام Claude Code لإنشاء ونشر وكلاء","دعم نشر في السحابة","التكامل مع وكلاء SDK","مرونة في اختيار نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","V3 Core实现","Claude Code","Agent SDK","低成本AI模型","实用AI代理","AI模型管理","开发效率","多云部署"],"ja":["AIエージェント","V3 Core実装","Claude Code","Agent SDK","低コストのAIモデル","実用的AIエージェント","AIモデル管理","開発効率","マルチクラウドデプロイ"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","V3 Core 구현","Claude Code","Agent SDK","저비용 AI 모델","실용적인 AI 에이전트","AI 모델 관리","개발 효율성","다중 클라우드 배포"],"es":["Herramientas de agentes de IA","Implementación de V3 Core","Claude Code","Agent SDK","Modelos de IA de bajo costo","Despliegue de agentes de IA","Guía de instalación de Claude Code","Configuración de Agent SDK"],"fr":["Outils d''agents d''IA","Mise en œuvre du noyau V3","Claude Code","Agent SDK","Modèles d''IA à faible coût","Déploiement d''agents d''IA","Guide d''installation de Claude Code","Configuration de Agent SDK"],"de":["KI-Agenten-Tools","V3-Core-Implementierung","Claude Code","Agent SDK","KI-Modelle mit geringen Kosten","Bereitstellung von KI-Agents","Installationsanleitung für Claude Code","Konfiguration von Agent SDK"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é implementação V3 Core","ferramentas de IA agentes alternative","Claude Code tutorial","implantação de agentes hospedados","modelos de IA de baixo custo","desenvolvimento de agentes de IA","ferramentas de IA para negócios","Claude Agent SDK","implantação em nuvem"],"ru":["как использовать инструменты ИИ","что такое V3 Core Реализация","инструменты ИИ Агенты альтернативные","Claude Code учебник","развертывание полностью хостинговых агентов","модели ИИ низкозатратные","разработка агентов ИИ","инструменты ИИ для бизнеса","Claude Agent SDK","развертывание в облаке"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تنفيذ V3 Core","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي البديلة","دورة Claude Code","نشر وكلاء مستضافين","نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي منخفضة التكلفة","تطوير وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للأعمال","وكلاء SDK Claude","نشر في السحابة"]}},"owner":"ruvnet","repo":"agentic-flow","repoPath":"ruvnet/agentic-flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.004Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"V3 Core Implementation","description":"Core module implementation for claude-flow v3. Implements DDD domains, clean architecture patterns, dependency injection, and modular TypeScript codebase with comprehensive testing.","bodyPreview":"# V3 Core Implementation\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nImplements the core TypeScript modules for claude-flow v3 following Domain-Driven Design principles, clean architecture patterns, and modern TypeScript best practices with comprehensive test coverage.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Initialize core implementation\nTask(\"Core foundation\", \"Set up DDD domain structure and base classes\", \"core-implementer\")\n\n# Domain implementation (parallel)\nTask(\"Task domain\", \"Implement task management domain with ent","body":"# V3 Core Implementation\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nImplements the core TypeScript modules for claude-flow v3 following Domain-Driven Design principles, clean architecture patterns, and modern TypeScript best practices with comprehensive test coverage.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Initialize core implementation\nTask(\"Core foundation\", \"Set up DDD domain structure and base classes\", \"core-implementer\")\n\n# Domain implementation (parallel)\nTask(\"Task domain\", \"Implement task management domain with entities and services\", \"core-implementer\")\nTask(\"Session domain\", \"Implement session management domain\", \"core-implementer\")\nTask(\"Health domain\", \"Implement health monitoring domain\", \"core-implementer\")\n```\n\n## Core Implementation Architecture\n\n### Domain Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n├── core/\n│   ├── kernel/                     # Microkernel pattern\n│   │   ├── claude-flow-kernel.ts\n│   │   ├── domain-registry.ts\n│   │   └── plugin-loader.ts\n│   │\n│   ├── domains/                    # DDD Bounded Contexts\n│   │   ├── task-management/\n│   │   │   ├── entities/\n│   │   │   ├── value-objects/\n│   │   │   ├── services/\n│   │   │   ├── repositories/\n│   │   │   └── events/\n│   │   │\n│   │   ├── session-management/\n│   │   ├── health-monitoring/\n│   │   ├── lifecycle-management/\n│   │   └── event-coordination/\n│   │\n│   ├── shared/                     # Shared kernel\n│   │   ├── domain/\n│   │   │   ├── entity.ts\n│   │   │   ├── value-object.ts\n│   │   │   ├── domain-event.ts\n│   │   │   └── aggregate-root.ts\n│   │   │\n│   │   ├── infrastructure/\n│   │   │   ├── event-bus.ts\n│   │   │   ├── dependency-container.ts\n│   │   │   └── logger.ts\n│   │   │\n│   │   └── types/\n│   │       ├── common.ts\n│   │       ├── errors.ts\n│   │       └── interfaces.ts\n│   │\n│   └── application/                # Application services\n│       ├── use-cases/\n│       ├── commands/\n│       ├── queries/\n│       └── handlers/\n```\n\n## Base Domain Classes\n\n### Entity Base Class\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/domain/entity.ts\nexport abstract class Entity<T> {\n  protected readonly _id: T;\n  private _domainEvents: DomainEvent[] = [];\n\n  constructor(id: T) {\n    this._id = id;\n  }\n\n  get id(): T {\n    return this._id;\n  }\n\n  public equals(object?: Entity<T>): boolean {\n    if (object == null || object == undefined) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    if (this === object) {\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    if (!(object instanceof Entity)) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    return this._id === object._id;\n  }\n\n  protected addDomainEvent(domainEvent: DomainEvent): void {\n    this._domainEvents.push(domainEvent);\n  }\n\n  public getUncommittedEvents(): DomainEvent[] {\n    return this._domainEvents;\n  }\n\n  public markEventsAsCommitted(): void {\n    this._domainEvents = [];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Value Object Base Class\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/domain/value-object.ts\nexport abstract class ValueObject<T> {\n  protected readonly props: T;\n\n  constructor(props: T) {\n    this.props = Object.freeze(props);\n  }\n\n  public equals(object?: ValueObject<T>): boolean {\n    if (object == null || object == undefined) {\n      return false;\n    }\n\n    if (this === object) {\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    return JSON.stringify(this.props) === JSON.stringify(object.props);\n  }\n\n  get value(): T {\n    return this.props;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Aggregate Root\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/domain/aggregate-root.ts\nexport abstract class AggregateRoot<T> extends Entity<T> {\n  private _version: number = 0;\n\n  get version(): number {\n    return this._version;\n  }\n\n  protected incrementVersion(): void {\n    this._version++;\n  }\n\n  public applyEvent(event: DomainEvent): void {\n    this.addDomainEvent(event);\n    this.incrementVersion();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Task Management Domain Implementation\n\n### Task Entity\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/entities/task.entity.ts\nimport { AggregateRoot } from \"../../../shared/domain/aggregate-root\";\nimport { TaskId } from \"../value-objects/task-id.vo\";\nimport { TaskStatus } from \"../value-objects/task-status.vo\";\nimport { Priority } from \"../value-objects/priority.vo\";\nimport { TaskAssignedEvent } from \"../events/task-assigned.event\";\n\ninterface TaskProps {\n  id: TaskId;\n  description: string;\n  priority: Priority;\n  status: TaskStatus;\n  assignedAgentId?: string;\n  createdAt: Date;\n  updatedAt: Date;\n}\n\nexport class Task extends AggregateRoot<TaskId> {\n  private props: TaskProps;\n\n  private constructor(props: TaskProps) {\n    super(props.id);\n    this.props = props;\n  }\n\n  static create(description: string, priority: Priority): Task {\n    const task = new Task({\n      id: TaskId.create(),\n      description,\n      priority,\n      status: TaskStatus.pending(),\n      createdAt: new Date(),\n      updatedAt: new Date(),\n    });\n\n    return task;\n  }\n\n  static reconstitute(props: TaskProps): Task {\n    return new Task(props);\n  }\n\n  public assignTo(agentId: string): void {\n    if (this.props.status.equals(TaskStatus.completed())) {\n      throw new Error(\"Cannot assign completed task\");\n    }\n\n    this.props.assignedAgentId = agentId;\n    this.props.status = TaskStatus.assigned();\n    this.props.updatedAt = new Date();\n\n    this.applyEvent(\n      new TaskAssignedEvent(this.id.value, agentId, this.props.priority),\n    );\n  }\n\n  public complete(result: TaskResult): void {\n    if (!this.props.assignedAgentId) {\n      throw new Error(\"Cannot complete unassigned task\");\n    }\n\n    this.props.status = TaskStatus.completed();\n    this.props.updatedAt = new Date();\n\n    this.applyEvent(\n      new TaskCompletedEvent(this.id.value, result, this.calculateDuration()),\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Getters\n  get description(): string {\n    return this.props.description;\n  }\n  get priority(): Priority {\n    return this.props.priority;\n  }\n  get status(): TaskStatus {\n    return this.props.status;\n  }\n  get assignedAgentId(): string | undefined {\n    return this.props.assignedAgentId;\n  }\n  get createdAt(): Date {\n    return this.props.createdAt;\n  }\n  get updatedAt(): Date {\n    return this.props.updatedAt;\n  }\n\n  private calculateDuration(): number {\n    return this.props.updatedAt.getTime() - this.props.createdAt.getTime();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Task Value Objects\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/value-objects/task-id.vo.ts\nexport class TaskId extends ValueObject<string> {\n  private constructor(value: string) {\n    super({ value });\n  }\n\n  static create(): TaskId {\n    return new TaskId(crypto.randomUUID());\n  }\n\n  static fromString(id: string): TaskId {\n    if (!id || id.length === 0) {\n      throw new Error(\"TaskId cannot be empty\");\n    }\n    return new TaskId(id);\n  }\n\n  get value(): string {\n    return this.props.value;\n  }\n}\n\n// src/core/domains/task-management/value-objects/task-status.vo.ts\ntype TaskStatusType =\n  | \"pending\"\n  | \"assigned\"\n  | \"in_progress\"\n  | \"completed\"\n  | \"failed\";\n\nexport class TaskStatus extends ValueObject<TaskStatusType> {\n  private constructor(status: TaskStatusType) {\n    super({ value: status });\n  }\n\n  static pending(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"pending\");\n  }\n  static assigned(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"assigned\");\n  }\n  static inProgress(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"in_progress\");\n  }\n  static completed(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"completed\");\n  }\n  static failed(): TaskStatus {\n    return new TaskStatus(\"failed\");\n  }\n\n  get value(): TaskStatusType {\n    return this.props.value;\n  }\n\n  public isPending(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"pending\";\n  }\n  public isAssigned(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"assigned\";\n  }\n  public isInProgress(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"in_progress\";\n  }\n  public isCompleted(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"completed\";\n  }\n  public isFailed(): boolean {\n    return this.value === \"failed\";\n  }\n}\n\n// src/core/domains/task-management/value-objects/priority.vo.ts\ntype PriorityLevel = \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\" | \"critical\";\n\nexport class Priority extends ValueObject<PriorityLevel> {\n  private constructor(level: PriorityLevel) {\n    super({ value: level });\n  }\n\n  static low(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"low\");\n  }\n  static medium(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"medium\");\n  }\n  static high(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"high\");\n  }\n  static critical(): Priority {\n    return new Priority(\"critical\");\n  }\n\n  get value(): PriorityLevel {\n    return this.props.value;\n  }\n\n  public getNumericValue(): number {\n    const priorities = { low: 1, medium: 2, high: 3, critical: 4 };\n    return priorities[this.value];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Domain Services\n\n### Task Scheduling Service\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/services/task-scheduling.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from \"../../../shared/infrastructure/dependency-container\";\nimport { Task } from \"../entities/task.entity\";\nimport { Priority } from \"../value-objects/priority.vo\";\n\n@Injectable()\nexport class TaskSchedulingService {\n  public prioritizeTasks(tasks: Task[]): Task[] {\n    return tasks.sort(\n      (a, b) => b.priority.getNumericValue() - a.priority.getNumericValue(),\n    );\n  }\n\n  public canSchedule(task: Task, agentCapacity: number): boolean {\n    if (agentCapacity <= 0) return false;\n\n    // Critical tasks always schedulable\n    if (task.priority.equals(Priority.critical())) return true;\n\n    // Other logic based on capacity\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  public calculateEstimatedDuration(task: Task): number {\n    // Simple heuristic - would use ML in real implementation\n    const baseTime = 300000; // 5 minutes\n    const priorityMultiplier = {\n      low: 0.5,\n      medium: 1.0,\n      high: 1.5,\n      critical: 2.0,\n    };\n\n    return baseTime * priorityMultiplier[task.priority.value];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Repository Interfaces & Implementations\n\n### Task Repository Interface\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/repositories/task.repository.ts\nexport interface ITaskRepository {\n  save(task: Task): Promise<void>;\n  findById(id: TaskId): Promise<Task | null>;\n  findByAgentId(agentId: string): Promise<Task[]>;\n  findByStatus(status: TaskStatus): Promise<Task[]>;\n  findPendingTasks(): Promise<Task[]>;\n  delete(id: TaskId): Promise<void>;\n}\n```\n\n### SQLite Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/repositories/sqlite-task.repository.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class SqliteTaskRepository implements ITaskRepository {\n  constructor(\n    @Inject(\"Database\") private db: Database,\n    @Inject(\"Logger\") private logger: ILogger,\n  ) {}\n\n  async save(task: Task): Promise<void> {\n    const sql = `\n      INSERT OR REPLACE INTO tasks (\n        id, description, priority, status, assigned_agent_id, created_at, updated_at\n      ) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)\n    `;\n\n    await this.db.run(sql, [\n      task.id.value,\n      task.description,\n      task.priority.value,\n      task.status.value,\n      task.assignedAgentId,\n      task.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      task.updatedAt.toISOString(),\n    ]);\n\n    this.logger.debug(`Task saved: ${task.id.value}`);\n  }\n\n  async findById(id: TaskId): Promise<Task | null> {\n    const sql = \"SELECT * FROM tasks WHERE id = ?\";\n    const row = await this.db.get(sql, [id.value]);\n\n    return row ? this.mapRowToTask(row) : null;\n  }\n\n  async findPendingTasks(): Promise<Task[]> {\n    const sql =\n      \"SELECT * FROM tasks WHERE status = ? ORDER BY priority DESC, created_at ASC\";\n    const rows = await this.db.all(sql, [\"pending\"]);\n\n    return rows.map((row) => this.mapRowToTask(row));\n  }\n\n  private mapRowToTask(row: any): Task {\n    return Task.reconstitute({\n      id: TaskId.fromString(row.id),\n      description: row.description,\n      priority: Priority.fromString(row.priority),\n      status: TaskStatus.fromString(row.status),\n      assignedAgentId: row.assigned_agent_id,\n      createdAt: new Date(row.created_at),\n      updatedAt: new Date(row.updated_at),\n    });\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Application Layer\n\n### Use Case Implementation\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/application/use-cases/assign-task.use-case.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class AssignTaskUseCase {\n  constructor(\n    @Inject(\"TaskRepository\") private taskRepository: ITaskRepository,\n    @Inject(\"AgentRepository\") private agentRepository: IAgentRepository,\n    @Inject(\"DomainEventBus\") private eventBus: DomainEventBus,\n    @Inject(\"Logger\") private logger: ILogger,\n  ) {}\n\n  async execute(command: AssignTaskCommand): Promise<AssignTaskResult> {\n    try {\n      // 1. Validate command\n      await this.validateCommand(command);\n\n      // 2. Load aggregates\n      const task = await this.taskRepository.findById(command.taskId);\n      if (!task) {\n        throw new TaskNotFoundError(command.taskId);\n      }\n\n      const agent = await this.agentRepository.findById(command.agentId);\n      if (!agent) {\n        throw new AgentNotFoundError(command.agentId);\n      }\n\n      // 3. Business logic\n      if (!agent.canAcceptTask(task)) {\n        throw new AgentCannotAcceptTaskError(command.agentId, command.taskId);\n      }\n\n      task.assignTo(command.agentId);\n      agent.acceptTask(task.id);\n\n      // 4. Persist changes\n      await Promise.all([\n        this.taskRepository.save(task),\n        this.agentRepository.save(agent),\n      ]);\n\n      // 5. Publish domain events\n      const events = [\n        ...task.getUncommittedEvents(),\n        ...agent.getUncommittedEvents(),\n      ];\n\n      for (const event of events) {\n        await this.eventBus.publish(event);\n      }\n\n      task.markEventsAsCommitted();\n      agent.markEventsAsCommitted();\n\n      // 6. Return result\n      this.logger.info(\n        `Task ${command.taskId.value} assigned to agent ${command.agentId}`,\n      );\n\n      return AssignTaskResult.success({\n        taskId: task.id,\n        agentId: command.agentId,\n        assignedAt: new Date(),\n      });\n    } catch (error) {\n      this.logger.error(\n        `Failed to assign task ${command.taskId.value}:`,\n        error,\n      );\n      return AssignTaskResult.failure(error);\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async validateCommand(command: AssignTaskCommand): Promise<void> {\n    if (!command.taskId) {\n      throw new ValidationError(\"Task ID is required\");\n    }\n    if (!command.agentId) {\n      throw new ValidationError(\"Agent ID is required\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Injection Setup\n\n### Container Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/infrastructure/dependency-container.ts\nimport { Container } from \"inversify\";\nimport { TYPES } from \"./types\";\n\nexport class DependencyContainer {\n  private container: Container;\n\n  constructor() {\n    this.container = new Container();\n    this.setupBindings();\n  }\n\n  private setupBindings(): void {\n    // Repositories\n    this.container\n      .bind<ITaskRepository>(TYPES.TaskRepository)\n      .to(SqliteTaskRepository)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    this.container\n      .bind<IAgentRepository>(TYPES.AgentRepository)\n      .to(SqliteAgentRepository)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    // Services\n    this.container\n      .bind<TaskSchedulingService>(TYPES.TaskSchedulingService)\n      .to(TaskSchedulingService)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    // Use Cases\n    this.container\n      .bind<AssignTaskUseCase>(TYPES.AssignTaskUseCase)\n      .to(AssignTaskUseCase)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    // Infrastructure\n    this.container\n      .bind<ILogger>(TYPES.Logger)\n      .to(ConsoleLogger)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n\n    this.container\n      .bind<DomainEventBus>(TYPES.DomainEventBus)\n      .to(InMemoryDomainEventBus)\n      .inSingletonScope();\n  }\n\n  get<T>(serviceIdentifier: symbol): T {\n    return this.container.get<T>(serviceIdentifier);\n  }\n\n  bind<T>(serviceIdentifier: symbol): BindingToSyntax<T> {\n    return this.container.bind<T>(serviceIdentifier);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Modern TypeScript Configuration\n\n### Strict TypeScript Setup\n\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\"],\n    \"module\": \"NodeNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"NodeNext\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"./dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"exactOptionalPropertyTypes\": true,\n    \"noImplicitReturns\": true,\n    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true,\n    \"noImplicitOverride\": true,\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"emitDecoratorMetadata\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"forceConsistentCasingInFileNames\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"allowSyntheticDefaultImports\": true,\n    \"baseUrl\": \".\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\"src/*\"],\n      \"@core/*\": [\"src/core/*\"],\n      \"@shared/*\": [\"src/core/shared/*\"],\n      \"@domains/*\": [\"src/core/domains/*\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\", \"**/*.test.ts\", \"**/*.spec.ts\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Implementation\n\n### Domain Unit Tests\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/__tests__/entities/task.entity.test.ts\ndescribe(\"Task Entity\", () => {\n  let task: Task;\n\n  beforeEach(() => {\n    task = Task.create(\"Test task\", Priority.medium());\n  });\n\n  describe(\"creation\", () => {\n    it(\"should create task with pending status\", () => {\n      expect(task.status.isPending()).toBe(true);\n      expect(task.description).toBe(\"Test task\");\n      expect(task.priority.equals(Priority.medium())).toBe(true);\n    });\n\n    it(\"should generate unique ID\", () => {\n      const task1 = Task.create(\"Task 1\", Priority.low());\n      const task2 = Task.create(\"Task 2\", Priority.low());\n\n      expect(task1.id.equals(task2.id)).toBe(false);\n    });\n  });\n\n  describe(\"assignment\", () => {\n    it(\"should assign to agent and change status\", () => {\n      const agentId = \"agent-123\";\n\n      task.assignTo(agentId);\n\n      expect(task.assignedAgentId).toBe(agentId);\n      expect(task.status.isAssigned()).toBe(true);\n    });\n\n    it(\"should emit TaskAssignedEvent when assigned\", () => {\n      const agentId = \"agent-123\";\n\n      task.assignTo(agentId);\n\n      const events = task.getUncommittedEvents();\n      expect(events).toHaveLength(1);\n      expect(events[0]).toBeInstanceOf(TaskAssignedEvent);\n    });\n\n    it(\"should not allow assignment of completed task\", () => {\n      task.assignTo(\"agent-123\");\n      task.complete(TaskResult.success(\"done\"));\n\n      expect(() => task.assignTo(\"agent-456\")).toThrow(\n        \"Cannot assign completed task\",\n      );\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Integration Tests\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/domains/task-management/__tests__/integration/task-repository.integration.test.ts\ndescribe(\"TaskRepository Integration\", () => {\n  let repository: SqliteTaskRepository;\n  let db: Database;\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    db = new Database(\":memory:\");\n    await setupTasksTable(db);\n    repository = new SqliteTaskRepository(db, new ConsoleLogger());\n  });\n\n  afterEach(async () => {\n    await db.close();\n  });\n\n  it(\"should save and retrieve task\", async () => {\n    const task = Task.create(\"Test task\", Priority.high());\n\n    await repository.save(task);\n    const retrieved = await repository.findById(task.id);\n\n    expect(retrieved).toBeDefined();\n    expect(retrieved!.id.equals(task.id)).toBe(true);\n    expect(retrieved!.description).toBe(\"Test task\");\n    expect(retrieved!.priority.equals(Priority.high())).toBe(true);\n  });\n\n  it(\"should find pending tasks ordered by priority\", async () => {\n    const lowTask = Task.create(\"Low priority\", Priority.low());\n    const highTask = Task.create(\"High priority\", Priority.high());\n\n    await repository.save(lowTask);\n    await repository.save(highTask);\n\n    const pending = await repository.findPendingTasks();\n\n    expect(pending).toHaveLength(2);\n    expect(pending[0].id.equals(highTask.id)).toBe(true); // High priority first\n    expect(pending[1].id.equals(lowTask.id)).toBe(true);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Performance Optimizations\n\n### Entity Caching\n\n```typescript\n// src/core/shared/infrastructure/entity-cache.ts\n@Injectable()\nexport class EntityCache<T extends Entity<any>> {\n  private cache = new Map<string, { entity: T; timestamp: number }>();\n  private readonly ttl: number = 300000; // 5 minutes\n\n  set(id: string, entity: T): void {\n    this.cache.set(id, { entity, timestamp: Date.now() });\n  }\n\n  get(id: string): T | null {\n    const cached = this.cache.get(id);\n    if (!cached) return null;\n\n    // Check TTL\n    if (Date.now() - cached.timestamp > this.ttl) {\n      this.cache.delete(id);\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    return cached.entity;\n  }\n\n  invalidate(id: string): void {\n    this.cache.delete(id);\n  }\n\n  clear(): void {\n    this.cache.clear();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- [ ] **Domain Isolation**: 100% clean dependency boundaries\n- [ ] **Test Coverage**: >90% unit test coverage for domain logic\n- [ ] **Type Safety**: Strict TypeScript compilation with zero any types\n- [ ] **Performance**: <50ms average use case execution time\n- [ ] **Memory Efficiency**: <100MB heap usage for core domains\n- [ ] **Plugin Architecture**: Modular domain loading capability\n\n## Related V3 Skills\n\n- `v3-ddd-architecture` - DDD architectural design\n- `v3-mcp-optimization` - MCP server integration\n- `v3-memory-unification` - AgentDB repository integration\n- `v3-swarm-coordination` - Swarm domain implementation\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Complete Core Implementation\n\n```bash\n# Full core module implementation\nTask(\"Core implementation\",\n     \"Implement all core domains with DDD patterns and comprehensive testing\",\n     \"core-implementer\")\n```\n\n### Domain-Specific Implementation\n\n```bash\n# Single domain implementation\nTask(\"Task domain implementation\",\n     \"Implement task management domain with entities, services, and repositories\",\n     \"core-implementer\")\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:06:29.113Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring scalable and maintainable architecture with Domain-Driven Design principles","zh":"适用于需要可扩展和可维护架构的TypeScript-based AI Agents，并遵循Domain-Driven Design原则","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントに適しており、スケーラブルでメンテナンス可能なアーキテクチャとDomain-Driven Design原則が必要","ko":"확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 아키텍처와 Domain-Driven Design 원칙이 필요한 TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que requieren una arquitectura escalable y mantenible con principios de diseño de dominio","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une architecture évolutuve et maintenable avec des principes de conception de domaine","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agenten, die eine skalierbare und wartbare Architektur mit Domain-Driven-Design-Prinzipien erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que exigem arquitetura escalável e mantida com princípios de Domain-Driven Design","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, требующих масштабируемой и поддерживаемой архитектуры с принципами Domain-Driven Design","ar":"مثالي لعميل ذكاء اصطناعي يستند إلى TypeScript الذي يتطلب هيكلاً معمارية قابلة للتوسعة والصيانة مع مبادئ Domain-Driven Design"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement core modules following clean architecture patterns and modern TypeScript best practices, with comprehensive test coverage using claude-flow v3, enabling seamless deployment of fully hosted agents for real business purposes","zh":"赋予代理实现核心模块以遵循清晰的架构模式和现代TypeScript最佳实践，使用claude-flow v3进行全面的测试覆盖，从而能够无缝地部署完全托管的代理以用于真实业务目的","ja":"エージェントにクリーンなアーキテクチャパターンとモダンなTypeScriptのベストプラクティスに従ってコアモジュールを実装する力を与え、claude-flow v3を使用した包括的なテストカバレッジにより、完全にホストされたエージェントをリアルビジネス目的でシームレスにデプロイできる","ko":"에이전트가 클린 아키텍처 패턴과 최신 TypeScript 최선의 실践을 따르며 핵심 모듈을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 claude-flow v3를 사용한 완전한 테스트 커버리지로 실제 비즈니스 목적으로 완전히 호스팅된 에이전트를 무縫으로 배포할 수 있도록 한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar módulos básicos siguiendo patrones de arquitectura limpia y mejores prácticas de TypeScript modernas, con una cobertura de prueba integral utilizando claude-flow v3, lo que permite una implementación sin problemas de agentes completamente alojados para fines empresariales reales","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des modules de base suivant des modèles d''architecture propres et de meilleures pratiques de TypeScript modernes, avec une couverture de test complète utilisant claude-flow v3, permettant un déploiement sans heurts d''agents entièrement hébergés pour de véritables fins commerciales","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Kernmodule gemäß sauberen Architekturmuster und modernen TypeScript-Best-Practices zu implementieren, mit umfassender Testabdeckung unter Verwendung von claude-flow v3, was eine reibungslose Bereitstellung von vollständig gehosteten Agenten für echte Geschäftszwecke ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar módulos principais seguindo padrões de arquitetura limpa e as melhores práticas modernas do TypeScript, com cobertura de teste abrangente usando claude-flow v3, permitindo a implantação sem problemas de agentes completamente hospedados para fins comerciais reais","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать основные модули, следуя шаблонам чистой архитектуры и современным лучшим практикам TypeScript, с полным покрытием тестов с помощью claude-flow v3, что позволяет развертывать полностью хостированные агенты для реальных бизнес-целей без проблем","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ الوحدات الرئيسية اتباعًا لانماطج القوالب المعمارية النظيفة وأفضل الممارسات الحديثة في TypeScript، مع تغطية اختبار شاملة باستخدام claude-flow v3، وتمكين النشر السلس لعميل полностью مستضاف لغرض تجاري حقيقي"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing task management domains with entity relationships","Deploying fully hosted agents for business purposes using Claude Code","Setting up DDD domain structures and base classes for scalable architecture"],"zh":["实现具有实体关系的任务管理域","使用Claude Code部署完全托管的代理以用于商业目的","设置DDD域结构和基类以实现可扩展的架构"],"ja":["エンティティ関係を持つタスク管理ドメインの実装","Claude Codeを使用してビジネス目的の完全にホストされたエージェントをデプロイ","スケーラブルなアーキテクチャを実現するためのDDDドメイン構造とベースクラスの設定"],"ko":["엔티티 관계가 있는 태스크 관리 도메인 구현","클라우드 코드를 사용하여 비즈니스 목적을 위한 완전히 호스팅된 에이전트 배포","확장 가능한 아키텍처를 구현하기 위한 DDD 도메인 구조 및 기본 클래스 설정"],"es":["Implementar dominios de gestión de tareas con relaciones