onnées avec Python","Intégration avec des bibliothèques scientifiques","Flexibilité et personnalisation","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["Verarbeitung polarisierter resonanter Reflexionsdaten","Analyse von Daten mit Python","Integration mit wissenschaftlichen Bibliotheken","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Processamento de dados de reflectividade resonante polarizada","Análise de dados em Python","Ferramenta de IA para análise de dados","Suporte à bibliotecas de análise de dados","Integração com outras ferramentas de análise de dados"],"ru":["Обработка данных поляризованной резонансной рефлектометрии","Анализ данных на Python","ИИ инструмент для анализа данных","Поддержка библиотек анализа данных","Интеграция с другими инструментами анализа данных"],"ar":["معالجة بيانات الانعكاسrezonant المتقطع","تحليل البيانات bằng بايثون","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتحليل البيانات","دعم المكتبات لتحليل البيانات","التكامل مع أدوات تحليل البيانات الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Polars 专家工具","Python 数据处理","Polarized Resonant Reflectivity 数据分析","AI智能数据分析","如何使用 Polars","Polars 与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["Polars エキスパート","Python データ処理","Polarized Resonant Reflectivity データ分析","AIエージェントによるデータ分析","Polars の使い方","Polars と他のツールの比較"],"ko":["Polars 전문가 도구","Python 데이터 처리","Polarized Resonant Reflectivity 데이터 분석","AI 에이전트 데이터 분석","Polars 사용 방법","Polars와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de análisis de datos","polars-expertise","reflectividad resonante polarizada","Python para análisis de datos","cómo usar polars-expertise","alternativas a polars-expertise","instalación de polars-expertise","guía de configuración de polars-expertise"],"fr":["outils d''analyse de données","polars-expertise","réflectivité résonante polarisée","Python pour l''analyse de données","comment utiliser polars-expertise","alternatives à polars-expertise","installation de polars-expertise","guide de configuration de polars-expertise"],"de":["Datenanalyse-Tools","Polars-Expertise","polarisierte resonante Reflexionsdaten","Python für Datenanalyse","wie man Polars-Expertise verwendet","Alternativen zu Polars-Expertise","Installation von Polars-Expertise","Konfigurationsanleitung für Polars-Expertise"],"pt":["como usar polars expertise","o que é polars expertise","ferramentas de ia para análise de dados","polars expertise vs outras ferramentas","instalar polars expertise","guia de configuração do polars expertise"],"ru":["как использовать polars expertise","что такое polars expertise","инструменты ИИ для обработки данных","polars expertise vs другие инструменты","установка polars expertise","руководство по настройке polars expertise"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام خبير بولارس","ما هو خبير بولارس","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحليل البيانات","خبير بولارس مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت خبير بولارس","دليل إعداد خبير بولارس"]}},"owner":"WSU-Carbon-Lab","repo":"pyref","repoPath":"WSU-Carbon-Lab/pyref","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.037Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"polars-expertise","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Polars\n\nHigh-performance DataFrame library built on Apache Arrow. Supports Python and Rust with expression-based API, lazy evaluation, and automatic parallelization.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Python\n\n```bash\nuv pip install polars\n# GPU support: uv pip install polars[gpu]\n```\n\n```python\nimport polars as pl\n\n# Eager: immediate execution\ndf = pl.DataFrame({\"symbol\": [\"AAPL\", \"GOOG\"], \"price\": [150.0, 140.0]})\ndf.filter(pl.col(\"price\") > 145).select(\"symbol\", \"price\")\n\n# Lazy: optimized execution (pref","body":"# Polars\n\nHigh-performance DataFrame library built on Apache Arrow. Supports Python and Rust with expression-based API, lazy evaluation, and automatic parallelization.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Python\n\n```bash\nuv pip install polars\n# GPU support: uv pip install polars[gpu]\n```\n\n```python\nimport polars as pl\n\n# Eager: immediate execution\ndf = pl.DataFrame({\"symbol\": [\"AAPL\", \"GOOG\"], \"price\": [150.0, 140.0]})\ndf.filter(pl.col(\"price\") > 145).select(\"symbol\", \"price\")\n\n# Lazy: optimized execution (preferred for large data)\nlf = pl.scan_parquet(\"trades.parquet\")\nresult = lf.filter(pl.col(\"volume\") > 1000).group_by(\"symbol\").agg(\n    pl.col(\"price\").mean().alias(\"avg_price\")\n).collect()\n```\n\n### Rust\n\n```toml\n# Cargo.toml - select features you need\n[dependencies]\npolars = { version = \"0.46\", features = [\"lazy\", \"parquet\", \"temporal\"] }\n```\n\n```rust\nuse polars::prelude::*;\n\nfn main() -> PolarsResult<()> {\n    // Eager\n    let df = df![\n        \"symbol\" => [\"AAPL\", \"GOOG\"],\n        \"price\" => [150.0, 140.0]\n    ]?;\n\n    // Lazy (preferred)\n    let lf = LazyFrame::scan_parquet(\"trades.parquet\", Default::default())?;\n    let result = lf\n        .filter(col(\"volume\").gt(lit(1000)))\n        .group_by([col(\"symbol\")])\n        .agg([col(\"price\").mean().alias(\"avg_price\")])\n        .collect()?;\n    Ok(())\n}\n```\n\n## Core Pattern: Expressions\n\nEverything in Polars is an expression. Expressions are composable, lazy, and parallelized.\n\n```python\n# Expression building blocks\npl.col(\"price\")                      # column reference\npl.col(\"price\") * pl.col(\"volume\")   # arithmetic\npl.col(\"price\").mean().over(\"symbol\") # window function\npl.when(cond).then(a).otherwise(b)   # conditional\n```\n\nExpressions execute in contexts: `select()`, `with_columns()`, `filter()`, `group_by().agg()`\n\n## When to Use Lazy\n\n| Use Lazy (`scan_*`, `.lazy()`) | Use Eager (`read_*`) |\n|-------------------------------|----------------------|\n| Large files (> RAM) | Small data, exploration |\n| Complex pipelines | Simple one-off ops |\n| Need query optimization | Interactive notebooks |\n| Streaming required | Immediate feedback |\n\nLazy benefits: predicate pushdown, projection pushdown, parallel execution, streaming.\n\n## Style: Use `.alias()` for Column Naming\n\nAlways use `.alias(\"name\")` instead of `name=expr` kwargs:\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Explicit .alias() - works everywhere, composable\ndf.with_columns(\n    (pl.col(\"price\") * pl.col(\"volume\")).alias(\"value\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").mean().over(\"symbol\").alias(\"avg_price\")\n)\n\n# AVOID: Kwarg style - less flexible, doesn''t chain\ndf.with_columns(\n    value=pl.col(\"price\") * pl.col(\"volume\"),  # avoid\n    avg_price=pl.col(\"price\").mean().over(\"symbol\")  # avoid\n)\n```\n\n`.alias()` is explicit, chains with other methods, and works consistently in all contexts.\n\n## Anti-Patterns - AVOID\n\n```python\n# BAD: Python functions kill parallelization\ndf.with_columns(pl.col(\"x\").map_elements(lambda x: x * 2))  # SLOW\n\n# GOOD: Native expressions are parallel\ndf.with_columns((pl.col(\"x\") * 2).alias(\"x\"))  # FAST\n\n# BAD: Row iteration\nfor row in df.iter_rows():  # SLOW\n    process(row)\n\n# GOOD: Columnar operations\ndf.with_columns(process_expr)  # FAST\n\n# BAD: Late projection\nlf.filter(...).collect().select(\"a\", \"b\")  # reads all columns\n\n# GOOD: Early projection\nlf.select(\"a\", \"b\").filter(...).collect()  # reads only needed columns\n```\n\n## Performance Checklist\n\n- [ ] Using `scan_*` (lazy) for large files?\n- [ ] Projecting columns early in pipeline?\n- [ ] Using native expressions (no `map_elements`)?\n- [ ] Categorical dtype for low-cardinality strings?\n- [ ] Appropriate integer sizes (i32 vs i64)?\n- [ ] Streaming for out-of-memory data? (`collect(engine=\"streaming\")`)\n\n## Reference Navigator\n\n### Python References\n\n| Topic | File | When to Load |\n|-------|------|--------------|\n| Expressions, types, lazy/eager | [python/core_concepts.md](references/python/core_concepts.md) | Understanding fundamentals |\n| Select, filter, group_by, window | [python/operations.md](references/python/operations.md) | Common operations |\n| CSV, Parquet, streaming I/O | [python/io_guide.md](references/python/io_guide.md) | Reading/writing data |\n| Joins, pivots, reshaping | [python/transformations.md](references/python/transformations.md) | Combining/reshaping data |\n| Performance, patterns | [python/best_practices.md](references/python/best_practices.md) | Optimization |\n\n### Rust References\n\n| Topic | File | When to Load |\n|-------|------|--------------|\n| DataFrame, Series, ChunkedArray | [rust/core_concepts.md](references/rust/core_concepts.md) | Rust API fundamentals |\n| Expression API in Rust | [rust/operations.md](references/rust/operations.md) | Operations syntax |\n| Readers, writers, streaming | [rust/io_guide.md](references/rust/io_guide.md) | I/O operations |\n| Feature flags, crates | [rust/features.md](references/rust/features.md) | Cargo setup |\n| Allocators, SIMD, nightly | [rust/performance.md](references/rust/performance.md) | Performance tuning |\n| Zero-copy, FFI, Arrow | [rust/arrow_interop.md](references/rust/arrow_interop.md) | Arrow integration |\n\n### Shared References\n\n| Topic | File | When to Load |\n|-------|------|--------------|\n| SQL queries on DataFrames | [sql_interface.md](references/sql_interface.md) | SQL syntax needed |\n| Query optimization, streaming | [lazy_deep_dive.md](references/lazy_deep_dive.md) | Understanding lazy engine |\n| NVIDIA GPU acceleration | [gpu_support.md](references/gpu_support.md) | GPU setup/usage |\n\n### Migration Guides\n\n| From | File | When to Load |\n|------|------|--------------|\n| pandas | [migration_pandas.md](references/migration_pandas.md) | Converting pandas code |\n| PySpark | [migration_spark.md](references/migration_spark.md) | Converting Spark code |\n| q/kdb+ | [migration_qkdb.md](references/migration_qkdb.md) | Converting kdb code |\n\n## Time Series / Financial Data Quick Patterns\n\n```python\n# OHLCV resampling\ndf.group_by_dynamic(\"timestamp\", every=\"1m\").agg(\n    pl.col(\"price\").first().alias(\"open\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").max().alias(\"high\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").min().alias(\"low\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").last().alias(\"close\"),\n    pl.col(\"volume\").sum()\n)\n\n# Rolling statistics\ndf.with_columns(\n    pl.col(\"price\").rolling_mean(window_size=20).alias(\"sma_20\"),\n    pl.col(\"price\").rolling_std(window_size=20).alias(\"volatility\")\n)\n\n# As-of join for market data alignment\ntrades.join_asof(quotes, on=\"timestamp\", by=\"symbol\", strategy=\"backward\")\n```\n\nLoad [python/best_practices.md](references/python/best_practices.md) for comprehensive time series patterns.\n\n## Runnable Examples\n\n| Example | File | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| Financial OHLCV | [examples/financial_ohlcv.py](examples/financial_ohlcv.py) | OHLCV resampling, rolling stats, VWAP |\n| Pandas Migration | [examples/pandas_migration.py](examples/pandas_migration.py) | Side-by-side pandas vs polars |\n| Streaming Large Files | [examples/streaming_large_file.py](examples/streaming_large_file.py) | Out-of-memory processing patterns |\n\n## Development Tips\n\nUse LSP for navigating Polars code:\n- **Python**: Pyright/Pylance provides excellent type inference for Polars expressions\n- **Rust**: rust-analyzer understands Polars types and expression chains\n\nLSP operations like `goToDefinition` and `hover` help explore Polars API without leaving the editor.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:21:06.719Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing high-performance DataFrame processing with Apache Arrow and Python.","zh":"适用于需要使用 Apache Arrow 和 Python 进行高性能 DataFrame 处理的数据分析代理。","ja":"Apache Arrow と Python を使用した高性能 DataFrame 処理を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Apache Arrow와 Python을 사용한 고성능 DataFrame 처리가 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan un procesamiento de DataFrame de alto rendimiento con Apache Arrow y Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant un traitement de DataFrame haute performance avec Apache Arrow et Python.","de":"Perfekt für Data Analysis Agents, die ein hochleistungsfaehiges DataFrame-Verarbeiten mit Apache Arrow und Python benoetigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de processamento de DataFrame de alto desempenho com Apache Arrow e Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, требующих высокопроизводной обработки DataFrame с помощью Apache Arrow и Python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة DataFrame أداء عالي مع Apache Arrow و Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently process and analyze large datasets with expression-based API, lazy evaluation, and automatic parallelization using Polars, supporting both CPU and GPU acceleration.","zh":"赋予代理高效处理和分析大型数据集的能力，使用基于表达式的 API、惰性评估和自动并行化，支持 Polars，并且支持 CPU 和 GPU 加速。","ja":"エージェントに大規模なデータセットを効率的に処理および分析する能力を付与します。式ベースの API、遅延評価、自動並列化を使用し、Polars をサポートし、CPU と GPU の両方のアクセラレーションをサポートします。","ko":"대리자가 효율적으로 대규모 데이터 세트를 처리 및 분석할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 표현식 기반 API, 느린 평가, 자동 병렬화를 사용하며 Polars를 지원하며 CPU 및 GPU 가속을 모두 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar y analizar conjuntos de datos grandes de manera eficiente con una API basada en expresiones, evaluación diferida y paralelización automática utilizando Polars, que admite aceleración tanto de CPU como de GPU.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter et d''analyser efficacement de grands ensembles de données avec une API basée sur des expressions, une évaluation différée et une parallélisation automatique à l''aide de Polars, prenant en charge à la fois l''accélération CPU et GPU.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, große Datensätze effizient zu verarbeiten und zu analysieren mit einer ausdrucksbasierten API, Lazy-Evaluation und automatischer Parallelisierung unter Verwendung von Polars, das sowohl CPU- als auch GPU-Beschleunigung unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar e analisar grandes conjuntos de dados de forma eficiente com API baseada em expressões, avaliação preguiçosa e paralelização automática usando Polars, suportando aceleração de CPU e GPU.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно обрабатывать и анализировать большие наборы данных с помощью API на основе выражений, ленивой оценки и автоматической параллелизации с помощью Polars, поддерживая ускорение CPU и GPU.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من معالجة وتحليل مجموعات بيانات كبيرة بفعالية باستخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات القائمة على التعبير ، والتقييم الكسول ، والتوازي التلقائي باستخدام Polars ، ودعم تسريع CPU و GPU."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing Polarized Resonant Reflectivity Data with high-performance DataFrames","Optimizing data processing workflows with lazy evaluation and automatic parallelization","Building scalable data analysis pipelines with Python and Rust support"],"zh":["使用高性能 DataFrame 分析偏振共振反射数据","使用惰性评估和自动并行化优化数据处理工作流","使用 Python 和 Rust 支持构建可扩展的数据分析管道"],"ja":["高性能 DataFrame を使用して偏振共鳴反射データを分析する","遅延評価と自動並列化を使用してデータ処理ワークフローを最適化する","Python と Rust のサポートを使用してスケーラブルなデータ分析パイプラインを構築する"],"ko":["고성능 DataFrame를 사용하여 편광 공진 반사 데이터를 분석하는こと","느린 평가 및 자동 병렬화를 사용하여 데이터 처리 워크플ロー 최적화","Python 및 Rust 지원을 사용하여 확장 가능한 데이터 분석 파이프라인을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Análisis de datos de reflectividad resonante polarizada con DataFrames de alto rendimiento","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de procesamiento de datos con evaluación diferida y paralelización automática","Creación de canalizaciones de análisis de datos escalables con soporte para Python y Rust"],"fr":["Analyse de données de réflectivité résonante polarisée avec des DataFrames haute performance","Optimisation des flux de travail de traitement de données avec évaluation différée et parallélisation automatique","Création de pipelines d''analyse de données évolutifs avec prise en charge de Python et Rust"],"de":["Analyse von Daten der polarisierten resonanten Reflexivität mit hochleistungsfaehigen DataFrames","Optimierung von Datenverarbeitungs-Workflows mit Lazy-Evaluation und automatischer Parallelisierung","Erstellung von skalierbaren Datenanalyse-Pipelines mit Unterstützung für Python und Rust"],"pt":["Analisar dados de reflectividade ressonante polarizada com DataFrames de alto desempenho","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de processamento de dados com avaliação preguiçosa e paralelização automática","Construir pipelines de análise de dados escaláveis com suporte a Python e Rust"],"ru":["Анализировать поляризованную резонансную рефлективность данных с помощью DataFrame высокого производительности","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы обработки данных с помощью ленивой оценки и автоматической параллелизации","Создавать масштабируемые конвейеры анализа данных с поддержкой Python и Rust"],"ar":["تحليل بيانات انعكاسية رنانة ممغنطة مع DataFrames أداء عالي","تحسين تدفقات العمل لمعالجة البيانات مع التقييم الكسول والتوازي التلقائي","بناء خطوط أنابيب تحليل البيانات القابلة للتوسيع مع دعم Python و Rust"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python or Rust programming knowledge","Dependent on Apache Arrow for high-performance capabilities","GPU support requires additional installation step"],"zh":["需要 Python 或 Rust 编程知识","依赖 Apache Arrow 实现高性能功能","GPU 支持需要额外的安装步骤"],"ja":["Python または Rust のプログラミング知識が必要","Apache Arrow に依存して高性能機能を実現","GPU サポートには追加のインストール手順が必要"],"ko":["Python 또는 Rust 프로그래밍 지식이 필요합니다","Apache Arrow에 의존하여 고성능 기능을 구현합니다","GPU 지원에는 추가 설치 단계가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación en Python o Rust","Depende de Apache Arrow para capacidades de alto rendimiento","El soporte de GPU requiere un paso de instalación adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Python ou Rust","Dépend de Apache Arrow pour les capacités haute performance","Le support GPU nécessite une étape d''installation supplémentaire"],"de":["Benötigt Programmierkenntnisse in Python oder Rust","Hängt von Apache Arrow für hochleistungsfaehige Funktionen ab","GPU-Unterstützung erfordert einen zusätzlichen Installationschritt"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação em Python ou Rust","Dependente do Apache Arrow para capacidades d